import Mathlib
set_option maxHeartbeats 4000000

/-!
# The Riemannian positive mass theorem in dimension three

This file contains **only the statement** of Theorem 1.1 of

> H. L. Bray, D. P. Kazaras, M. A. Khuri, D. L. Stern,
> *Harmonic functions and the mass of 3-dimensional asymptotically flat Riemannian manifolds*,
> J. Geom. Anal. (2022), arXiv:1911.06754,

(originally due to Schoen–Yau, 1979), with the proof left as `sorry`.

## Informal statement (BKKS, §1)

> Let `(M, g)` be a smooth connected 3-dimensional Riemannian manifold. It is *asymptotically
> flat* if there is a compact set `K ⊂ M` such that `M \ K = ⋃ₖ M_endᵏ`, where the ends
> `M_endᵏ` are finitely many, pairwise disjoint and diffeomorphic to the complement of a ball in
> `ℝ³`, and in each end there is a coordinate system with
> `|∂ˡ (g_ij - δ_ij)(x)| = O(|x|^(-q-l))`, `l = 0, 1, 2`, for some `q > 1/2`.
> The scalar curvature is assumed integrable, `R_g ∈ L¹(M)`, so that the ADM mass of each end
> `m = lim_{r→∞} (1/16π) ∫_{S_r} ∑_{i,j} (g_ij,i - g_ii,j) υ^j dA`
> is well defined (`υ` the unit outer normal of the coordinate sphere `S_r`, `dA` its area
> element).
>
> **Theorem 1.1.** If `(M, g)` is complete and asymptotically flat with nonnegative scalar
> curvature then `m ≥ 0`, and `m = 0` if and only if `(M, g) ≅ (ℝ³, δ)`.

## Why the ingredients have to be built here

Mathlib (as of the pinned version) has smooth manifolds, `mfderiv`, partial diffeomorphisms,
diffeomorphisms and the surface measure `Measure.toSphere` on the unit sphere, but it has **no**
Levi-Civita connection, curvature tensors, scalar curvature, asymptotically flat manifolds or ADM
mass. We therefore define the needed notions below, directly and transparently, in local
coordinates — exactly as in any textbook treatment.

## Conventions

* `E3 = EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin 3)` is the model space `ℝ³`; `M` is a smooth (`C^∞`) manifold
  modelled on `E3` (`IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M`), Hausdorff and connected.
* Following Mathlib, the tangent space at `x : M` is `TangentSpace 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x`, which is by
  definition `E3`, identified with the tangent space via the preferred chart `chartAt E3 x`.
  A Riemannian metric is therefore a family `g x : E3 →L[ℝ] E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ` of symmetric positive
  definite bilinear forms (in the coordinates of `chartAt E3 x`). Its coefficient matrix in any
  local parametrisation `φ : E3 → M` is
  `g_ij(y) = g (φ y) (dφ_y eᵢ) (dφ_y eⱼ)`, where `dφ_y = mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ,E3) 𝓘(ℝ,E3) φ y`
  (see `coeffMatrix`). Smoothness of `g` means smoothness of all these coefficients in all charts.
* The scalar curvature is computed from the coefficient matrix by the classical formulas
  `Γᵏᵢⱼ = ½ gᵏˡ (∂ᵢ gⱼₗ + ∂ⱼ gᵢₗ - ∂ₗ gᵢⱼ)`,
  `Rⱼₖ = ∂ᵢ Γⁱⱼₖ - ∂ⱼ Γⁱᵢₖ + Γⁱᵢₚ Γᵖⱼₖ - Γⁱⱼₚ Γᵖᵢₖ`,
  `R = gʲᵏ Rⱼₖ` (summation convention), in the preferred chart `chartAt E3 p` at `p`.
  (This is chart-independent; with this sign convention the round sphere has `R > 0`.)
* **Ends.** An end chart is a partial diffeomorphism `Φ : E3 → M` with source `{x : 1 < ‖x‖}`
  (the asymptotic coordinate system). Asymptotic flatness asks for finitely many end charts with
  pairwise disjoint images such that `M \ ⋃ₖ Φₖ({‖x‖ > 2})` is compact; this is the compact set
  `K` of the paper, and each `Φₖ({‖x‖ > 2})` is an end diffeomorphic to `ℝ³ \ B̄₂`.
  (Requiring the coordinates to extend a bit inside, to `{‖x‖ > 1}`, encodes that the paper's ends
  are diffeomorphic to the complement of an *open* ball, i.e. they include their boundary sphere;
  this rules out e.g. an extra cylindrical end hidden near the inner boundary of a chart.)
* **Decay.** `|∂ˡ (g_ij - δ_ij)(x)| = O(|x|^(-q-l))` as `|x| → ∞` for `l = 0, 1, 2`, expressed
  with `iteratedFDeriv` and `Asymptotics.IsBigO` along `Bornology.cobounded E3`.
* **Integrability of `R_g`.** Since `M \ ⋃ₖ Φₖ({‖x‖ > 2})` is compact and `R_g` is continuous,
  `R_g ∈ L¹(M, dV_g)` is equivalent to integrability of `R_g ∘ Φₖ · √(det g_ij)` over
  `{‖x‖ > 2}` (Lebesgue measure) for each end; this is how it is stated.
* **ADM mass.** With `∂ᵢ` the coordinate partial derivatives in the end, `υ = x/|x|` and
  `dA` the Euclidean area element of the coordinate sphere `S_r = {|x| = r}` (as in (1.2) of the
  paper), the flux is
  `(1/16π) ∫_{S_r} ∑_{i,j} (∂ᵢ g_ij - ∂ⱼ g_ii) υ^j dA
     = (1/16π) r² ∫_{S²} ∑_{i,j} (∂ᵢ g_ij - ∂ⱼ g_ii)(r ω) ω^j dσ(ω)`,
  where `σ = volume.toSphere` is the standard surface measure on the unit sphere `S² ⊂ ℝ³`
  (total mass `3 · vol(B₁) = 4π`). The mass is the limit as `r → ∞`. The theorem asserts in
  particular that this limit exists (Bartnik's well-definedness theorem).
  Sanity check: for `g = (1 + m/2r)⁴ δ` the flux tends to `m`.
* **Completeness** of `(M, g)` is a hypothesis of Theorem 1.1 and is stated explicitly. To this
  end the Riemannian distance is defined:
  - the speed of a `C¹` curve `γ : ℝ → M` at `t` is `|γ'(t)|_g = √(g_{γ t}(γ'(t), γ'(t)))`, where
    `γ'(t) = mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ,ℝ) 𝓘(ℝ,E3) γ t 1` (in the coordinates of `chartAt E3 (γ t)`, matching
    the convention for `g`);
  - the length of `γ` on `[0, 1]` is `L_g(γ) = ∫₀¹ |γ'(t)|_g dt` (see `curveLength`);
  - `d_g(p, q) = inf { L_g(γ) | γ : ℝ → M is C¹, γ 0 = p, γ 1 = q }` (see `riemannianDist`).
    Taking `C¹` curves rather than piecewise `C¹` ones gives the same infimum: a piecewise `C¹`
    path can be reparametrised, without changing its length, so that its velocity vanishes at
    the corners and at the endpoints, and then extended by constants outside `[0, 1]`.
  `(M, g)` is complete if `(M, d_g)` is a complete metric space, i.e. every `d_g`-Cauchy sequence
  `d_g`-converges (see `IsCompleteRiemannian`). By Hopf–Rinow this is the same as geodesic
  completeness. (With the definition of asymptotic flatness used here, completeness would actually
  follow from the other hypotheses; it is nevertheless stated, as in the paper.)
* **`(M, g) ≅ (ℝ³, δ)`** means there is a smooth diffeomorphism `F : M → ℝ³` with
  `g_p(v, w) = ⟪dF_p v, dF_p w⟫` for all `p, v, w`.
* The rigidity statement is per end: for every end `k` with mass `mₖ`, `mₖ = 0` iff
  `(M, g) ≅ (ℝ³, δ)`.
-/

noncomputable section

open Manifold Filter Topology MeasureTheory Metric
open scoped ContDiff

namespace PositiveMass

/-- The model space `ℝ³`. -/
abbrev E3 : Type := EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin 3)

/-- The `i`-th standard basis vector of `ℝ³`. -/
abbrev e (i : Fin 3) : E3 := EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : ℝ)

/-- The coordinate partial derivative `∂ᵢ f (y)` of a function `f : ℝ³ → ℝ`. -/
def partialDeriv (i : Fin 3) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ f y (e i)

/-! ### Curvature of a metric given by its coefficient matrix in local coordinates -/

section LocalCoordinates

/-- Christoffel symbols `Γᵏᵢⱼ = ½ ∑ₗ gᵏˡ (∂ᵢ gⱼₗ + ∂ⱼ gᵢₗ - ∂ₗ gᵢⱼ)` of a metric whose coefficient
matrix in local coordinates is `G : ℝ³ → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ`. -/
def christoffel (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (k i j : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ k l *
    (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) y + partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) y
      - partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) y)

/-- Ricci tensor `Rⱼₖ = ∂ᵢ Γⁱⱼₖ - ∂ⱼ Γⁱᵢₖ + Γⁱᵢₚ Γᵖⱼₖ - Γⁱⱼₚ Γᵖᵢₖ` in local coordinates. -/
def ricci (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (j k : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, (partialDeriv i (christoffel G i j k) y - partialDeriv j (christoffel G i i k) y)
    + ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3,
        (christoffel G i i p y * christoffel G p j k y
          - christoffel G i j p y * christoffel G p i k y)

/-- Scalar curvature `R = ∑ⱼₖ gʲᵏ Rⱼₖ` in local coordinates. -/
def scalarCurvatureLocal (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ j k * ricci G j k y

end LocalCoordinates

/-! ### Riemannian metrics on a 3-manifold -/

variable {M : Type*} [TopologicalSpace M] [ChartedSpace E3 M]

/-- The coefficient matrix `g_ij(y) = g (φ y) (dφ_y eᵢ) (dφ_y eⱼ)` of a field of bilinear forms
`g` (in Mathlib's tangent-space convention) with respect to a local parametrisation `φ : ℝ³ → M`. -/
def coeffMatrix (g : M → E3 →L[ℝ] E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) (φ : E3 → M) (y : E3) :
    Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
  fun i j => g (φ y) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) φ y (e i))
    (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) φ y (e j))

/-- A smooth Riemannian metric on the 3-manifold `M`. At each point `x`, `g x` is a bilinear form on
`T_x M = E3` (expressed in the coordinates of `chartAt E3 x`, as in Mathlib's convention for tangent
spaces). -/
structure RiemannianMetric3 (M : Type*) [TopologicalSpace M] [ChartedSpace E3 M] where
  /-- The metric tensor. -/
  g : M → E3 →L[ℝ] E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ
  /-- Symmetry. -/
  symm : ∀ x v w, g x v w = g x w v
  /-- Positive definiteness. -/
  posDef : ∀ x v, v ≠ 0 → 0 < g x v v
  /-- Smoothness: the coefficients in every chart are `C^∞` on the chart's target. -/
  smooth : ∀ x₀ : M, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => coeffMatrix g (chartAt E3 x₀).symm y i j) (chartAt E3 x₀).target

namespace RiemannianMetric3

/-- The coefficient matrix of the metric in a local parametrisation `φ : ℝ³ → M`. -/
def coeff (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (φ : E3 → M) : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
  coeffMatrix g.g φ

/-- The scalar curvature `R_g(p)`, computed in the preferred chart at `p`. -/
def scalarCurvature (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (p : M) : ℝ :=
  scalarCurvatureLocal (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm) (chartAt E3 p p)

end RiemannianMetric3

/-! ### The Riemannian distance and completeness -/

namespace RiemannianMetric3

/-- The velocity `γ'(t) ∈ T_{γ t} M` of a curve `γ : ℝ → M`, i.e. `dγ_t (1)`. -/
def velocity (γ : ℝ → M) (t : ℝ) : E3 :=
  mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) γ t (1 : ℝ)

/-- The `g`-length `L_g(γ) = ∫₀¹ √(g_{γ t}(γ'(t), γ'(t))) dt` of a curve `γ` on `[0, 1]`. -/
def curveLength (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (γ : ℝ → M) : ℝ :=
  ∫ t in (0 : ℝ)..1, Real.sqrt (g.g (γ t) (velocity γ t) (velocity γ t))

/-- The Riemannian distance `d_g(p, q)`: the infimum of the `g`-lengths of the `C¹` curves
`γ : ℝ → M` with `γ 0 = p` and `γ 1 = q`. -/
def riemannianDist (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (p q : M) : ℝ :=
  ⨅ (γ : {γ : ℝ → M // ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 1 γ ∧ γ 0 = p ∧ γ 1 = q}),
    g.curveLength γ.1

/-- `(M, g)` is complete: `(M, d_g)` is a complete metric space, i.e. every `d_g`-Cauchy sequence
converges with respect to `d_g`. -/
def IsCompleteRiemannian (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) : Prop :=
  ∀ u : ℕ → M,
    (∀ ε > 0, ∃ N : ℕ, ∀ m ≥ N, ∀ n ≥ N, g.riemannianDist (u m) (u n) < ε) →
      ∃ p : M, Tendsto (fun n => g.riemannianDist (u n) p) atTop (𝓝 0)

end RiemannianMetric3

/-! ### Asymptotically flat ends and the ADM mass -/

/-- An end chart: an asymptotic coordinate system `Φ : {x ∈ ℝ³ : ‖x‖ > 1} → M`, i.e. a smooth
partial diffeomorphism with source `{x | 1 < ‖x‖}`. -/
structure EndChart (M : Type*) [TopologicalSpace M] [ChartedSpace E3 M] where
  /-- The coordinate parametrisation of the end. -/
  Φ : PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞
  /-- It is defined exactly on the complement of the closed unit ball. -/
  source_eq : Φ.source = {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖}

/-- The ADM flux through the coordinate sphere of radius `r` in an end:
`(1/16π) ∫_{S_r} ∑_{i,j} (∂ᵢ g_ij - ∂ⱼ g_ii) υ^j dA`, written as
`(1/16π) r² ∫_{S²} ∑_{i,j} (∂ᵢ g_ij - ∂ⱼ g_ii)(r θ) θ^j dσ(θ)`. -/
def admFlux (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (Φ : EndChart M) (r : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r ^ 2 *
    ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1),
      ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
        (partialDeriv i (fun x => g.coeff Φ.Φ x i j) (r • (θ : E3))
          - partialDeriv j (fun x => g.coeff Φ.Φ x i i) (r • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j
      ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere

/-- `(M, g)` is asymptotically flat (BKKS (1.1)), with integrable scalar curvature. -/
structure AsymptoticallyFlat (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) where
  /-- The number of ends. -/
  numEnds : ℕ
  /-- The asymptotic coordinate systems of the ends. -/
  ends : Fin numEnds → EndChart M
  /-- The decay rate. -/
  q : ℝ
  q_gt : 1 / 2 < q
  /-- The ends are pairwise disjoint. -/
  disjoint : Pairwise fun k l => Disjoint (ends k).Φ.target (ends l).Φ.target
  /-- Outside the ends `{‖x‖ > 2}`, the manifold is compact: this is the compact set `K`. -/
  isCompact_core : IsCompact (⋃ k, (ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖})ᶜ
  /-- `|∂ˡ (g_ij - δ_ij)(x)| = O(|x|^(-q-l))` as `|x| → ∞`, for `l = 0, 1, 2`. -/
  decay : ∀ k, ∀ i j : Fin 3, ∀ l : ℕ, l ≤ 2 →
    (fun x : E3 => ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l
        (fun y => g.coeff (ends k).Φ y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖)
      =O[Bornology.cobounded E3] fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (-q - (l : ℝ))
  /-- The scalar curvature is integrable, `R_g ∈ L¹(M, dV_g)` (stated end by end; on the compact
  core integrability is automatic). -/
  integrable_scalarCurvature : ∀ k,
    IntegrableOn
      (fun x : E3 => g.scalarCurvature ((ends k).Φ x) * Real.sqrt (g.coeff (ends k).Φ x).det)
      {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖}

/-- `(M, g)` is isometric to Euclidean space `(ℝ³, δ)`. -/
def IsometricToEuclidean [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) : Prop :=
  ∃ F : Diffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) M E3 ∞,
    ∀ (p : M) (v w : E3),
      g.g p v w = @inner ℝ E3 _ (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) F p v)
        (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) F p w)

/-- **Positive mass theorem** (BKKS, Theorem 1.1; Schoen–Yau). Let `(M, g)` be a smooth connected
complete asymptotically flat Riemannian 3-manifold with nonnegative scalar curvature. Then for every
end the ADM mass `m` exists and satisfies `m ≥ 0`, and `m = 0` if and only if `(M, g)` is isometric
to `(ℝ³, δ)`. -/
def fluxLocal (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (r : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r ^ 2 *
    ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1),
      ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
        (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r • (θ : E3))
          - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j
      ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere


def fluxDivLocal (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (x : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
    (partialDeriv j (fun y => partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y) x
      - partialDeriv j (fun y => partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y) x)
def cylPt (t a b : ℝ) : E3 := t • e 0 + a • e 1 + b • e 2


def pullbackMetric (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Y : E3 → E3) (x : E3) :
    Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
  fun a b => ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
    (fderiv ℝ Y x (e a)) i * G (Y x) i j * (fderiv ℝ Y x (e b)) j


def admVec (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (x : E3) : Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  fun j => ∑ i : Fin 3, (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) x - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) x)


def gradVec (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (x : E3) : Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  fun k => Real.sqrt (G x).det *
    ∑ l : Fin 3, (G x)⁻¹ k l * partialDeriv l (fun z => Real.sqrt ((G z)⁻¹ 0 0)) x


def capFlux (V : E3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (L : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ ρ in (0 : ℝ)..L, ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..(2 * Real.pi),
    (V (cylPt L (ρ * Real.cos s) (ρ * Real.sin s)) 0
      - V (cylPt (-L) (ρ * Real.cos s) (ρ * Real.sin s)) 0) * ρ


def sideFlux (V : E3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (L : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ t in (-L)..L, ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..(2 * Real.pi),
    (V (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)) 1 * Real.cos s
      + V (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)) 2 * Real.sin s) * L


def cylFlux (V : E3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (L : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  capFlux V L + sideFlux V L


def curvIntegrand (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (t L s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  let P : E3 := cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)
  let γ : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ := fun a b => G P a.succ b.succ
  let γi : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ := γ⁻¹
  let Γ : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ := fun a b c => (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ d : Fin 2, γi a d *
    (partialDeriv b.succ (fun z => G z c.succ d.succ) P
      + partialDeriv c.succ (fun z => G z b.succ d.succ) P
      - partialDeriv d.succ (fun z => G z b.succ c.succ) P)
  let n : Fin 2 → ℝ := ![Real.cos s, Real.sin s]
  let v : Fin 2 → ℝ := ![-(L * Real.sin s), L * Real.cos s]
  (L - ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, n a * Γ a b c * v b * v c) /
    (Real.sqrt (∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, γi a b * n a * n b) *
      Real.sqrt (∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, γ a b * v a * v b))


def curvTerm (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (L : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ t in (-L)..L, ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..(2 * Real.pi), curvIntegrand G t L s


def sternBoundary (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (L : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  4 * Real.pi * L - curvTerm G L + cylFlux (gradVec G) L


def P1 (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (L : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * capFlux (admVec G) L + (1 / 2 : ℝ) *
    ∫ t in (-L)..L, ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..(2 * Real.pi),
      (Real.cos s * (partialDeriv 0 (fun z => G z 1 0) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s))
          - partialDeriv 1 (fun z => G z 0 0) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)))
        + Real.sin s * (partialDeriv 0 (fun z => G z 2 0) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s))
          - partialDeriv 2 (fun z => G z 0 0) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)))) * L


def P2 (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (L : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  4 * Real.pi * L + (1 / 2 : ℝ) *
    ∫ t in (-L)..L, ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..(2 * Real.pi),
      (Real.cos s * (partialDeriv 1 (fun z => G z 2 2) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s))
          - partialDeriv 2 (fun z => G z 1 2) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)))
        + Real.sin s * (partialDeriv 2 (fun z => G z 1 1) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s))
          - partialDeriv 1 (fun z => G z 2 1) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)))) * L


def Dec1 (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (q R C : ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ x : E3, R < ‖x‖ → ∀ i j : Fin 3,
    |G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q) ∧
    ∀ k : Fin 3, |partialDeriv k (fun y => G y i j) x| ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 1)


def CoordChange (X Y : E3 → E3) (q R₀ R₁ C : ℝ) : Prop :=
  2 ≤ R₀ ∧ R₀ ≤ R₁ ∧ 0 < C ∧
  ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ X {y : E3 | R₀ < ‖y‖} ∧ ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ Y {x : E3 | R₁ < ‖x‖} ∧
  (∀ x : E3, R₁ < ‖x‖ → R₀ < ‖Y x‖ ∧ X (Y x) = x) ∧
  Set.InjOn X {y : E3 | R₀ < ‖y‖} ∧
  (∀ y : E3, R₀ < ‖y‖ →
    ‖X y - y‖ ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (1 - q) ∧
    (∀ i a : Fin 3,
      |partialDeriv i (fun z => X z a) y - (if i = a then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-q)) ∧
    (∀ i j a : Fin 3,
      |partialDeriv i (fun z => partialDeriv j (fun w => X w a) z) y| ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-q - 1)))
def riemannLocal (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (l i j k : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  partialDeriv i (christoffel G l j k) y - partialDeriv j (christoffel G l i k) y
    + ∑ p : Fin 3, (christoffel G l i p y * christoffel G p j k y
        - christoffel G l j p y * christoffel G p i k y)
def hessLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (i j : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j f) y - ∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel G k i j y * partialDeriv k f y


def lapLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i j * hessLoc G f i j y


def staticLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (i j : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  f y * ricci G i j y - hessLoc G f i j y + lapLoc G f y * G y i j


def staticSymLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (i j : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  (staticLoc G f i j y + staticLoc G f j i y) / 2


def RiemannianMetric3.lapM (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (u : M → ℝ) (p : M) : ℝ :=
  lapLoc (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm) (fun y => u ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)) (chartAt E3 p p)
def lapLocal (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (u : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i j *
    (partialDeriv i (fun z => partialDeriv j u z) y -
      ∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel G k i j y * partialDeriv k u y)


def lapM (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (f : M → ℝ) (p : M) : ℝ :=
  lapLocal (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm) (f ∘ (chartAt E3 p).symm) (chartAt E3 p p)


def farPot (δ : ℝ) (x : E3) : ℝ := ‖x‖⁻¹ + ‖x‖ ^ (-1 - δ)


def smax1 (u : ℝ) : ℝ := ∫ t in (-1 : ℝ)..u, Real.smoothTransition ((t + 1) / 2)
def RiemannianMetric3.gradInner (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (u w : M → ℝ) (p : M) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
    (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm (chartAt E3 p p))⁻¹ i j *
      partialDeriv i (fun y => u ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)) (chartAt E3 p p) *
      partialDeriv j (fun y => w ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)) (chartAt E3 p p)


def RiemannianMetric3.levelMeanCurv (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (w : M → ℝ) (p : M) : ℝ :=
  let G := g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm
  let f : E3 → ℝ := fun y => w ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)
  let y := chartAt E3 p p
  let N := Real.sqrt (g.gradInner w w p)
  lapLoc G f y / N -
    (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
      (G y)⁻¹ i a * partialDeriv a f y * ((G y)⁻¹ j b * partialDeriv b f y) * hessLoc G f i j y)
      / N ^ 3


def IsExteriorDomain (Φ : EndChart M) (β : M → ℝ) (Re : ℝ) : Prop :=
  ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ β ∧
  (∀ p : M, β p = 0 → mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) β p ≠ 0) ∧
  2 ≤ Re ∧
  (∀ y : E3, Re < ‖y‖ → 0 < β (Φ.Φ y)) ∧
  IsCompact ({p : M | 0 ≤ β p} \ Φ.Φ '' {y : E3 | Re < ‖y‖})


def SeparatesLevelComponents (β : M → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ (w : M → ℝ) (t : ℝ) (p₀ : M), ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ w →
    p₀ ∈ {p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ w ⁻¹' {t} →
    IsCompact (connectedComponentIn ({p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ w ⁻¹' {t}) p₀) →
    (∀ p ∈ connectedComponentIn ({p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ w ⁻¹' {t}) p₀, ∃ ξ : E3,
      mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) w p ξ ≠ 0 ∧
        (β p = 0 → mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) β p ξ = 0)) →
    ∃ K : Set M, IsCompact K ∧
      connectedComponentIn ({p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ w ⁻¹' {t}) p₀ ⊆ K ∧
      K ⊆ {p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∧
      frontier K ⊆ connectedComponentIn ({p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ w ⁻¹' {t}) p₀ ∪ {p : M | β p = 0} ∧
      IsConnected (K \ connectedComponentIn ({p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ w ⁻¹' {t}) p₀) ∧
      K ⊆ closure (interior K)


def NoCompactRegularLevel (β u : M → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ (t : ℝ) (p₀ : M), p₀ ∈ {p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} →
    IsCompact (connectedComponentIn ({p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ u ⁻¹' {t}) p₀) →
    ∃ p ∈ connectedComponentIn ({p : M | 0 ≤ β p} ∩ u ⁻¹' {t}) p₀,
      mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) u p = 0
def cylGam (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (t L s : ℝ) : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ :=
  fun a b => G (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)) a.succ b.succ


def cylDG (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (t L s : ℝ) : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ :=
  fun c a b => partialDeriv c.succ (fun z => G z a.succ b.succ)
    (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s))


def curvKappa (γ γi : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (d : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (L s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  let Γ : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ := fun a b c => (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ f : Fin 2, γi a f *
    (d b c f + d c b f - d f b c)
  let n : Fin 2 → ℝ := ![Real.cos s, Real.sin s]
  let v : Fin 2 → ℝ := ![-(L * Real.sin s), L * Real.cos s]
  (L - ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, n a * Γ a b c * v b * v c) /
    (Real.sqrt (∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, γi a b * n a * n b) *
      Real.sqrt (∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, γ a b * v a * v b))


def curvLinAlg (γ : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (d : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (L s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  let k : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ := fun a b => γ a b - (if a = b then (1 : ℝ) else 0)
  let n : Fin 2 → ℝ := ![Real.cos s, Real.sin s]
  let τ : Fin 2 → ℝ := ![-Real.sin s, Real.cos s]
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, k a b * n a * n b
      - ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, k a b * τ a * τ b)
    - L * ∑ c : Fin 2, ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, τ c * τ a * n b * d c a b
    + L / 2 * ∑ c : Fin 2, ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, n c * τ a * τ b * d c a b


def curvWAlg (γ : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (d : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (L s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  let k : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ := fun a b => γ a b - (if a = b then (1 : ℝ) else 0)
  let n : Fin 2 → ℝ := ![Real.cos s, Real.sin s]
  let τ : Fin 2 → ℝ := ![-Real.sin s, Real.cos s]
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, k a b * n a * n b
      - ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, k a b * τ a * τ b)
    - L / 2 * ∑ c : Fin 2, ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, τ c * τ a * n b * d c a b


def cylQ (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (t L s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  Real.cos s * (partialDeriv 1 (fun z => G z 2 2) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s))
      - partialDeriv 2 (fun z => G z 1 2) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)))
    + Real.sin s * (partialDeriv 2 (fun z => G z 1 1) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s))
      - partialDeriv 1 (fun z => G z 2 1) (cylPt t (L * Real.cos s) (L * Real.sin s)))
def jacMat (Y : E3 → E3) (x : E3) : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
  Matrix.of fun i a => (fderiv ℝ Y x (e a)) i


def piolaVec (Y : E3 → E3) (U : E3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (x : E3) : Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  fun a => ∑ i : Fin 3, (jacMat Y x).adjugate a i * U (Y x) i


def jacCurlVec (Y : E3 → E3) (x : E3) : Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  fun b => ∑ a : Fin 3,
    partialDeriv a (fun z => (fderiv ℝ Y z (e a)) b - (fderiv ℝ Y z (e b)) a) x


def cutoffPiolaField (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Y : E3 → E3) (R₁ c : ℝ) (x : E3) :
    Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  fun a => if R₁ < ‖x‖ then
    ∑ i : Fin 3, (jacMat Y x).adjugate a i *
      (Real.smoothTransition (‖Y x‖ - c) * admVec G (Y x) i) else 0
structure ExteriorCover.{uX} {N : Type uX} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 N) (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) (k : Fin hAF.numEnds) where
  carrier : Type uX
  [instTop : TopologicalSpace carrier]
  [instChart : ChartedSpace E3 carrier]
  [instT2 : T2Space carrier]
  [instMfd : IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ carrier]
  metric : RiemannianMetric3 carrier
  af : AsymptoticallyFlat metric
  endIdx : Fin af.numEnds
  q_eq : af.q = hAF.q
  coeff_eq : ∀ y : E3, 1 < ‖y‖ →
    metric.coeff (af.ends endIdx).Φ y = g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ y
  scal_nonneg : ∀ p : carrier, 0 ≤ metric.scalarCurvature p
  β : carrier → ℝ
  Re : ℝ
  exterior : IsExteriorDomain (af.ends endIdx) β Re
  minimal : ∀ p : carrier, β p = 0 → metric.levelMeanCurv β p = 0
  separates : SeparatesLevelComponents β

instance ExteriorCover.instTopCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g} {k : Fin hAF.numEnds}
    (D : ExteriorCover g hAF k) : TopologicalSpace D.carrier := D.instTop

instance ExteriorCover.instChartCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g} {k : Fin hAF.numEnds}
    (D : ExteriorCover g hAF k) : ChartedSpace E3 D.carrier := D.instChart

instance ExteriorCover.instT2Carrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g} {k : Fin hAF.numEnds}
    (D : ExteriorCover g hAF k) : T2Space D.carrier := D.instT2

instance ExteriorCover.instMfdCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g} {k : Fin hAF.numEnds}
    (D : ExteriorCover g hAF k) : IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ D.carrier := D.instMfd
def sternPsi (Φ : EndChart M) (Y : E3 → E3) (x : E3) : M := Φ.Φ (Y x)


def sternOuter (Φ : EndChart M) (Y : E3 → E3) (L : ℝ) : Set M :=
  sternPsi Φ Y '' {x : E3 | ¬ (|x 0| ≤ L ∧ (x 1) ^ 2 + (x 2) ^ 2 ≤ L ^ 2)}


def sternOuterClosed (Φ : EndChart M) (Y : E3 → E3) (L : ℝ) : Set M :=
  sternPsi Φ Y '' {x : E3 | ¬ (|x 0| < L ∧ (x 1) ^ 2 + (x 2) ^ 2 < L ^ 2)}


def sternDomain (Φ : EndChart M) (β : M → ℝ) (Y : E3 → E3) (L : ℝ) : Set M :=
  {p : M | 0 ≤ β p} \ sternOuter Φ Y L


def sternSide (Φ : EndChart M) (Y : E3 → E3) (L : ℝ) : Set M :=
  sternPsi Φ Y '' {x : E3 | |x 0| < L ∧ (x 1) ^ 2 + (x 2) ^ 2 = L ^ 2}
def IsMinimalFrontierChart (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (U V : Set M) (f : M → ℝ) (p : M) : Prop :=
  IsOpen V ∧ p ∈ V ∧ ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ f ∧
  (∀ x ∈ V, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f x ≠ 0) ∧
  V ∩ frontier U = V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} ∧
  (∀ x ∈ V, f x = 0 → g.levelMeanCurv f x = 0) ∧
  IsPreconnected (V ∩ {x | 0 < f x}) ∧ IsPreconnected (V ∩ {x | f x < 0}) ∧
  (V ∩ U = V ∩ {x | 0 < f x} ∨ V ∩ U = V ∩ {x | f x ≠ 0})


def HasMinimalFrontier (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (U : Set M) : Prop :=
  ∀ p ∈ frontier U, ∀ O ∈ 𝓝 p, ∃ (V : Set M) (f : M → ℝ), V ⊆ O ∧ IsMinimalFrontierChart g U V f p


def HasOneSidedMinimalFrontier (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (U : Set M) : Prop :=
  ∀ p ∈ frontier U, ∃ (V : Set M) (f : M → ℝ),
    IsMinimalFrontierChart g U V f p ∧ V ∩ U = V ∩ {x | 0 < f x}


def CircleLiftable (U : Set M) : Prop :=
  ∀ θ : C(U, Circle), ∃ φ : C(U, ℝ), ∀ x : U, θ x = Circle.exp (φ x)


structure RegionCover.{uX} {N : Type uX} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 N) (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) (k : Fin hAF.numEnds) (U : Set N) where
  carrier : Type uX
  [instTop : TopologicalSpace carrier]
  [instChart : ChartedSpace E3 carrier]
  [instT2 : T2Space carrier]
  [instMfd : IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ carrier]
  metric : RiemannianMetric3 carrier
  af : AsymptoticallyFlat metric
  endIdx : Fin af.numEnds
  q_eq : af.q = hAF.q
  coeff_eq : ∀ y : E3, 1 < ‖y‖ →
    metric.coeff (af.ends endIdx).Φ y = g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ y
  scal_nonneg : ∀ p : carrier, 0 ≤ metric.scalarCurvature p
  W : Set carrier
  ρ : ℝ
  W_open : IsOpen W
  W_conn : IsConnected W
  ρ_ge : 2 ≤ ρ
  far_sub : ∀ y : E3, ρ < ‖y‖ → (af.ends endIdx).Φ y ∈ W
  compact : IsCompact (closure W \ (af.ends endIdx).Φ '' {y : E3 | ρ < ‖y‖})
  frontier_min : HasOneSidedMinimalFrontier metric W
  homeo : Nonempty (W ≃ₜ U)

instance RegionCover.instTopCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g} {k : Fin hAF.numEnds} {U : Set N}
    (D : RegionCover g hAF k U) : TopologicalSpace D.carrier := D.instTop

instance RegionCover.instChartCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g} {k : Fin hAF.numEnds} {U : Set N}
    (D : RegionCover g hAF k U) : ChartedSpace E3 D.carrier := D.instChart

instance RegionCover.instT2Carrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g} {k : Fin hAF.numEnds} {U : Set N}
    (D : RegionCover g hAF k U) : T2Space D.carrier := D.instT2

instance RegionCover.instMfdCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g} {k : Fin hAF.numEnds} {U : Set N}
    (D : RegionCover g hAF k U) : IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ D.carrier := D.instMfd
def IsMinimalSurfaceSet (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (S : Set M) : Prop :=
  IsClosed S ∧ ∀ p ∈ S, ∀ O ∈ 𝓝 p, ∃ (V : Set M) (f : M → ℝ), V ⊆ O ∧ IsOpen V ∧ p ∈ V ∧
    ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ f ∧ (∀ x ∈ V, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f x ≠ 0) ∧
    V ∩ S = V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} ∧ (∀ x ∈ V, f x = 0 → g.levelMeanCurv f x = 0) ∧
    IsPreconnected (V ∩ {x | 0 < f x}) ∧ IsPreconnected (V ∩ {x | f x < 0})


def trappedSet (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) : Set M :=
  closure (⋃₀ {S : Set M | IsCompact S ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g S})
structure FlipCoverTop.{uX} {N : Type uX} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 N) (U : Set N) where
  carrier : Type uX
  [instTop : TopologicalSpace carrier]
  [instT2 : T2Space carrier]
  proj : carrier → N
  label : carrier → Bool
  bij : Function.Bijective (fun z : carrier => (proj z, label z))
  covering : IsCoveringMap proj
  label_locConst : ∀ z : carrier, proj z ∈ U → ∀ᶠ w in 𝓝 z, label w = label z
  label_flip : ∀ (V' : Set carrier) (f : N → ℝ) (p : N) (a b : carrier),
    IsOpen V' → Set.InjOn proj V' → p ∈ frontier U →
    IsMinimalFrontierChart g U (proj '' V') f p →
    (proj '' V') ∩ U = (proj '' V') ∩ {x | f x ≠ 0} →
    a ∈ V' → b ∈ V' → 0 < f (proj a) → f (proj b) < 0 → label a ≠ label b

instance FlipCoverTop.instTopCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {U : Set N} (T : FlipCoverTop g U) :
    TopologicalSpace T.carrier := T.instTop

instance FlipCoverTop.instT2Carrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {U : Set N} (T : FlipCoverTop g U) :
    T2Space T.carrier := T.instT2


structure FlipCover.{uX} {N : Type uX} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 N) (U : Set N) where
  carrier : Type uX
  [instTop : TopologicalSpace carrier]
  [instT2 : T2Space carrier]
  [instChart : ChartedSpace E3 carrier]
  [instMfd : IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ carrier]
  proj : carrier → N
  label : carrier → Bool
  bij : Function.Bijective (fun z : carrier => (proj z, label z))
  covering : IsCoveringMap proj
  label_locConst : ∀ z : carrier, proj z ∈ U → ∀ᶠ w in 𝓝 z, label w = label z
  label_flip : ∀ (V' : Set carrier) (f : N → ℝ) (p : N) (a b : carrier),
    IsOpen V' → Set.InjOn proj V' → p ∈ frontier U →
    IsMinimalFrontierChart g U (proj '' V') f p →
    (proj '' V') ∩ U = (proj '' V') ∩ {x | f x ≠ 0} →
    a ∈ V' → b ∈ V' → 0 < f (proj a) → f (proj b) < 0 → label a ≠ label b
  chart_source : ∀ z w : carrier, w ∈ (chartAt E3 z).source →
    proj w ∈ (chartAt E3 (proj z)).source
  chart_eq : ∀ z w : carrier, w ∈ (chartAt E3 z).source →
    chartAt E3 z w = chartAt E3 (proj z) (proj w)

instance FlipCover.instTopCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {U : Set N} (F : FlipCover g U) :
    TopologicalSpace F.carrier := F.instTop

instance FlipCover.instT2Carrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {U : Set N} (F : FlipCover g U) :
    T2Space F.carrier := F.instT2

instance FlipCover.instChartCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {U : Set N} (F : FlipCover g U) :
    ChartedSpace E3 F.carrier := F.instChart

instance FlipCover.instMfdCarrier {N : Type*} [TopologicalSpace N] [ChartedSpace E3 N]
    {g : RiemannianMetric3 N} {U : Set N} (F : FlipCover g U) :
    IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ F.carrier := F.instMfd
def levelMeanCurvCoord (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  lapLoc G f y /
      Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i j * partialDeriv i f y * partialDeriv j f y) -
    (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
      (G y)⁻¹ i a * partialDeriv a f y * ((G y)⁻¹ j b * partialDeriv b f y) * hessLoc G f i j y) /
      Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i j * partialDeriv i f y * partialDeriv j f y) ^ 3
def coordPlaneProj (a : Fin 3) (y : E3) : E3 := y - (y a) • e a


def MinimalSheetsNear (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (p : M) (ρ : ℝ) (L : ℕ) (Λ : ℕ → ℝ)
    (Sig : Set M) : Prop :=
  ∃ (a : Fin 3) (l : ℕ) (u : Fin l → E3 → ℝ), l ≤ L ∧
    (∀ i, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (u i)) ∧
    (∀ i (n : ℕ) (y : E3), ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ n (u i) y‖ ≤ Λ n) ∧
    (∀ i i' : Fin l, i < i' → ∀ y : E3, ‖coordPlaneProj a (y - chartAt E3 p p)‖ < 2 * ρ →
      u i (coordPlaneProj a y) < u i' (coordPlaneProj a y)) ∧
    (∀ (i : Fin l) (y : E3), ‖coordPlaneProj a (y - chartAt E3 p p)‖ < 2 * ρ →
      |u i (coordPlaneProj a y) - (chartAt E3 p p) a| < 8 * ρ ∧
      (chartAt E3 p).symm (coordPlaneProj a y + u i (coordPlaneProj a y) • e a) ∈ Sig ∧
      levelMeanCurvCoord (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm) (fun z => z a - u i (coordPlaneProj a z))
        (coordPlaneProj a y + u i (coordPlaneProj a y) • e a) = 0) ∧
    (∀ x ∈ Sig, x ∈ (chartAt E3 p).source →
      chartAt E3 p x ∈ Metric.ball (chartAt E3 p p) ρ →
      ∃ i : Fin l, (chartAt E3 p x) a = u i (coordPlaneProj a (chartAt E3 p x)))
def sepPlaneProj (a : Fin 3) (y : E3) : E3 := y - (y a) • e a


def sepCyl (a : Fin 3) (c : E3) (r δ : ℝ) : Set E3 :=
  {z : E3 | ‖sepPlaneProj a (z - c)‖ < r ∧ |z a - c a| < δ}


def sepDensDiv (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (X : E3 → E3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, partialDeriv i (fun z => Real.sqrt (G z).det * X z i) y


def sepPerG (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F U : Set E3) : ENNReal :=
  ⨆ (X : E3 → E3) (_ : ContDiff ℝ ∞ X ∧ HasCompactSupport X ∧ tsupport X ⊆ U ∧
      ∀ y, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, G y i j * X y i * X y j ≤ 1),
    ENNReal.ofReal (∫ y in F, sepDensDiv G X y)


def sepIsPerMin (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F U : Set E3) : Prop :=
  MeasurableSet F ∧
  (∀ V : Set E3, IsOpen V → IsCompact (closure V) → closure V ⊆ U → sepPerG G F V < ⊤) ∧
  ∀ F' V K : Set E3, MeasurableSet F' → IsOpen V → IsCompact (closure V) → closure V ⊆ U →
    IsCompact K → K ⊆ V → symmDiff F F' ⊆ K → sepPerG G F V ≤ sepPerG G F' V


def sepChartNull (S : Set M) : Prop :=
  ∀ p : M, volume (chartAt E3 p '' (S ∩ (chartAt E3 p).source)) = 0


def sepChartMeas (S : Set M) : Prop :=
  ∀ p : M, MeasurableSet (chartAt E3 p '' (S ∩ (chartAt E3 p).source))


def sepRiemPer (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (F U : Set M) : ENNReal :=
  ⨆ (n : ℕ) (p : Fin n → M) (W : Fin n → Set M)
    (_ : (∀ k, IsOpen (W k) ∧ W k ⊆ U ∩ (chartAt E3 (p k)).source) ∧
      Pairwise (fun k l => Disjoint (W k) (W l))),
    ∑ k, sepPerG (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (p k)).symm)
      (chartAt E3 (p k) '' (F ∩ (chartAt E3 (p k)).source)) (chartAt E3 (p k) '' W k)
def mcS (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (z : E3) (ξ : Fin 3 → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (G z)⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j


def mcP (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (z : E3) (ξ : Fin 3 → ℝ) (i j : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  (G z)⁻¹ i j / Real.sqrt (mcS G z ξ) -
    (∑ a : Fin 3, (G z)⁻¹ i a * ξ a) * (∑ b : Fin 3, (G z)⁻¹ j b * ξ b) /
      Real.sqrt (mcS G z ξ) ^ 3


def mcR (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (z : E3) (ξ : Fin 3 → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, mcP G z ξ i j * ∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel G k i j z * ξ k
def calPiece (q : M) (φ : M → ℝ) (V : M → E3) : E3 → E3 :=
  Set.indicator (chartAt E3 q).target (fun y =>
    (φ ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) • mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 q)
      ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) (V ((chartAt E3 q).symm y)) : E3))


def calSmoothField (V : M → E3) : Prop :=
  ∀ q : M, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 q)
    ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) (V ((chartAt E3 q).symm y)) : E3)) (chartAt E3 q).target


def calPartition {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M) (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (Ω : Set M) : Prop :=
  (∀ j, ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (φ j)) ∧ (∀ j x, 0 ≤ φ j x) ∧ (∀ x, ∑ j, φ j x ≤ 1) ∧
  ∀ j, IsCompact (tsupport (φ j)) ∧ tsupport (φ j) ⊆ Ω ∩ (chartAt E3 (q j)).source


def calDivSum (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M) (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ)
    (E : Set M) (V : M → E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ j, ∫ y in chartAt E3 (q j) '' (E ∩ (chartAt E3 (q j)).source),
    sepDensDiv (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (q j)).symm) (calPiece (q j) (φ j) V) y


def calVolSum (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M) (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ)
    (E : Set M) (h : M → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ j, ∫ y in chartAt E3 (q j) '' (E ∩ (chartAt E3 (q j)).source),
    φ j ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm y) * h ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm y) *
      Real.sqrt (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (q j)).symm y).det
def RiemannianMetric3.jacobiDeriv (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (w : M → ℝ) (x : M) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
    (g.coeff (chartAt E3 x).symm (chartAt E3 x x))⁻¹ i j *
      partialDeriv i (levelMeanCurvCoord (g.coeff (chartAt E3 x).symm)
        (fun y => w ((chartAt E3 x).symm y))) (chartAt E3 x x) *
      partialDeriv j (fun y => w ((chartAt E3 x).symm y)) (chartAt E3 x x)


def IsStableMinimalSet (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (S : Set M) : Prop :=
  ∃ φ : M → ℝ, ∀ p ∈ S, 0 < φ p ∧ ∃ (V : Set M) (f : M → ℝ), IsOpen V ∧ p ∈ V ∧
    ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ f ∧ (∀ x ∈ V, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f x ≠ 0) ∧
    V ∩ S = V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} ∧
    ∀ x ∈ V ∩ S, Real.sqrt (g.gradInner f f x) * φ x = 1 ∧ 0 ≤ g.jacobiDeriv f x


def secondFundSq (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, ∑ l : Fin 3,
      ((G y)⁻¹ i j - (∑ a : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i a * partialDeriv a f y) *
          (∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ j b * partialDeriv b f y) /
          (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ a b * partialDeriv a f y * partialDeriv b f y)) *
        hessLoc G f j k y *
        ((G y)⁻¹ k l - (∑ a : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ k a * partialDeriv a f y) *
          (∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ l b * partialDeriv b f y) /
          (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ a b * partialDeriv a f y * partialDeriv b f y)) *
        hessLoc G f l i y) /
    (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ a b * partialDeriv a f y * partialDeriv b f y)


def HasCurvatureBound (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (S : Set M) (Λ : ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ p ∈ S, ∃ (V : Set M) (f : M → ℝ), IsOpen V ∧ p ∈ V ∧ ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ f ∧
    (∀ x ∈ V, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f x ≠ 0) ∧ V ∩ S = V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} ∧
    secondFundSq (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm) (fun y => f ((chartAt E3 p).symm y))
      (chartAt E3 p p) ≤ Λ ^ 2


def CoordAreaBound (S : Set M) (A : M → Set E3 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ (q : M) (C : Set E3), IsCompact C → C ⊆ (chartAt E3 q).target →
    MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure 2
        ((chartAt E3 q) '' (S ∩ (chartAt E3 q).source) ∩ C) ≤ ENNReal.ofReal (A q C)
def smthLift (a : Fin 3) (x : Fin 2 → ℝ) (t : ℝ) : E3 :=
  (EuclideanSpace.equiv (Fin 3) ℝ).symm (Fin.insertNth a t x)


def smthHoriz (a : Fin 3) (z : E3) : Fin 2 → ℝ := fun k => z (a.succAbove k)


def smthGrad (v : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (x : Fin 2 → ℝ) : Fin 2 → ℝ :=
  fun k => fderiv ℝ v x (Pi.single k 1)


def smthDisc (a : Fin 3) (c : E3) (ρ : ℝ) : Set (Fin 2 → ℝ) :=
  {x | ∑ k : Fin 2, (x k - c (a.succAbove k)) ^ 2 < ρ ^ 2}


def smthCovec (a : Fin 3) (p : Fin 2 → ℝ) : Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  (Fin.insertNth a (1 : ℝ) (-p) : Fin 3 → ℝ)


def smthLag (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (a : Fin 3)
    (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt (G (smthLift a w.1 w.2.1)).det *
    Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (G (smthLift a w.1 w.2.1))⁻¹ i j *
      smthCovec a w.2.2 i * smthCovec a w.2.2 j)


def smthELop (Λ : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (v : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ)
    (x : Fin 2 → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ Λ (x, v x, smthGrad v x) (0, 1, 0) -
    ∑ k : Fin 2, fderiv ℝ (fun y => fderiv ℝ Λ (y, v y, smthGrad v y) (0, 0, Pi.single k 1)) x
      (Pi.single k 1)
def calTheta (r₁ η t : ℝ) : ℝ := Real.smoothTransition (2 * ((t - r₁) / η) - 1)


def calSigma (ρ : M → ℝ) (r₁ : ℝ) (A : Set M) (x : M) : ℝ :=
  ({p : M | r₁ < ρ p} \ A).indicator (fun _ => (1 : ℝ)) x - A.indicator (fun _ => (1 : ℝ)) x


def calUnitNormal (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) (i : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  (Real.sqrt (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ a b * partialDeriv a f y * partialDeriv b f y))⁻¹ *
    ∑ k : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i k * partialDeriv k f y
abbrev E2 : Type := EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin 2)


abbrev e2 (i : Fin 2) : E2 := EuclideanSpace.single i (1 : ℝ)


def pd2 (i : Fin 2) (w : E2 → ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ := fderiv ℝ w x (e2 i)


def pullMetric2 (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (x : E2) :
    Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ :=
  fun i j => ∑ k : Fin 3, ∑ l : Fin 3,
    (fderiv ℝ F x (e2 i)) k * G (F x) k l * (fderiv ℝ F x (e2 j)) l


def christoffel2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (k i j : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 2, (h x)⁻¹ k l *
    (pd2 i (fun z => h z j l) x + pd2 j (fun z => h z i l) x - pd2 l (fun z => h z i j) x)


def ricci2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (j k : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 2, (pd2 i (christoffel2 h i j k) x - pd2 j (christoffel2 h i i k) x)
    + ∑ i : Fin 2, ∑ p : Fin 2,
        (christoffel2 h i i p x * christoffel2 h p j k x
          - christoffel2 h i j p x * christoffel2 h p i k x)


def gaussCurv2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ j : Fin 2, ∑ k : Fin 2, (h x)⁻¹ j k * ricci2 h j k x


def lap2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (w : E2 → ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 2, ∑ j : Fin 2, (h x)⁻¹ i j *
    (pd2 i (pd2 j w) x - ∑ k : Fin 2, christoffel2 h k i j x * pd2 k w x)


def IsSurfA2At (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (S : Set M) (κ : OpenPartialHomeomorph M E3) (p : M)
    (t : ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ (V : Set M) (f : M → ℝ), IsOpen V → p ∈ V → V ⊆ κ.source →
    ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ f → (∀ x ∈ V, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f x ≠ 0) →
    V ∩ S = V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} →
    secondFundSq (g.coeff κ.symm) (fun y => f (κ.symm y)) (κ p) = t
def hullPerG (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F U Kc : Set E3) : ENNReal :=
  ⨆ (X : E3 → E3) (_ : (∀ y, y ∉ Kc → ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ X y) ∧ HasCompactSupport X ∧
      tsupport X ⊆ U ∧ (∀ y, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, G y i j * X y i * X y j ≤ 1) ∧
      ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ y, |sepDensDiv G X y| ≤ C),
    ENNReal.ofReal (∫ y in F, sepDensDiv G X y)


def hullRiemPer (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (F U K : Set M) : ENNReal :=
  ⨆ (n : ℕ) (p : Fin n → M) (W : Fin n → Set M)
    (_ : (∀ k, IsOpen (W k) ∧ W k ⊆ U ∩ (chartAt E3 (p k)).source) ∧
      Pairwise (fun k l => Disjoint (W k) (W l))),
    ∑ k, hullPerG (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (p k)).symm)
      (chartAt E3 (p k) '' (F ∩ (chartAt E3 (p k)).source)) (chartAt E3 (p k) '' W k)
      (chartAt E3 (p k) '' (K ∩ (chartAt E3 (p k)).source))
def hpProj (z : E3) : E2 := (EuclideanSpace.equiv (Fin 2) ℝ).symm ![z 1, z 2]


def hpLift (t : ℝ) (x : E2) : E3 := cylPt t (x 0) (x 1)


def hpCyl (ρ h : ℝ) : Set E3 := {z : E3 | z 1 ^ 2 + z 2 ^ 2 < ρ ^ 2 ∧ |z 0| < h}


def hpSliceJumps (F : Set E3) (ℓ υ : E2 → ℝ) (x : E2) : Prop :=
  volume {t : ℝ | t ∈ Set.Ioo (-(1 / 4)) (ℓ x) ∧ hpLift t x ∉ F} = 0 ∧
  volume {t : ℝ | t ∈ Set.Ioo (υ x) (1 / 4) ∧ hpLift t x ∈ F} = 0 ∧
  (∀ s : ℝ, 0 < s → volume {t : ℝ | t ∈ Set.Ioo (ℓ x) (ℓ x + s) ∧ hpLift t x ∉ F} ≠ 0) ∧
  (∀ s : ℝ, 0 < s → volume {t : ℝ | t ∈ Set.Ioo (υ x - s) (υ x) ∧ hpLift t x ∈ F} ≠ 0)


def hpSuperSol (v : E2 → ℝ) (Λ₀ β₀ : ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ φ : E2 → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ φ → ∀ x₀ ∈ Metric.ball (0 : E2) (1 / 2),
    (∀ᶠ x in 𝓝 x₀, φ x ≤ v x) → φ x₀ = v x₀ → ‖fderiv ℝ φ x₀‖ ≤ Λ₀ →
    ∑ i : Fin 2, fderiv ℝ (fun y => fderiv ℝ φ y (e2 i)) x₀ (e2 i) ≤
      β₀ * (1 + ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ φ) x₀‖)


def hpHarnNorm (δ c : ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F U : Set E3) (a b : ℝ),
    IsOpen U → (∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun z => G z i j) U) →
    (∀ (z : E3) (i j : Fin 3), G z i j = G z j i) → (∀ z ∈ U, (G z).PosDef) →
    sepIsPerMin G F U → Metric.closedBall (0 : E3) 1 ⊆ U → a ≤ b → b - a ≤ δ →
    (∀ z ∈ Metric.ball (0 : E3) 1, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
       |G z i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ δ ∧
       ‖fderiv ℝ (fun w => G w i j) z‖ ≤ δ * (b - a)) →
    (∀ N ∈ 𝓝 (0 : E3), volume (N ∩ F) ≠ 0 ∧ volume (N \ F) ≠ 0) →
    (∀ z ∈ Metric.ball (0 : E3) 1, (∀ N ∈ 𝓝 z, volume (N ∩ F) ≠ 0 ∧ volume (N \ F) ≠ 0) →
       a ≤ z 0 ∧ z 0 ≤ b) →
    volume ((Metric.ball (0 : E3) 1 ∩ {z | z 0 < a}) \ F) = 0 →
    volume (Metric.ball (0 : E3) 1 ∩ {z | b < z 0} ∩ F) = 0 →
    ∃ a' b' : ℝ, a ≤ a' ∧ a' ≤ b' ∧ b' ≤ b ∧ b' - a' ≤ (1 - c) * (b - a) ∧
      ∀ z ∈ Metric.ball (0 : E3) (1 / 8),
        (∀ N ∈ 𝓝 z, volume (N ∩ F) ≠ 0 ∧ volume (N \ F) ≠ 0) → a' ≤ z 0 ∧ z 0 ≤ b'
def hpUp (α β t : ℝ) : ℝ := Real.smoothTransition ((t - α) / (β - α))


def hpProf0 (t : ℝ) : ℝ := hpUp (-(6 / 25)) (-(3 / 16)) t - hpUp (3 / 16) (6 / 25) t


def hpProf (α₁ α₂ α₃ α₄ t : ℝ) : ℝ := hpProf0 t - 2 * hpUp α₁ α₂ t + 2 * hpUp α₃ α₄ t


def hpSliceInt (S : Set ℝ) (φ : ℝ → ℝ) : ℝ := ∫ t, S.indicator (fun _ => (1 : ℝ)) t * deriv φ t
def sepGGApx (f : E3 → ℝ) (φ : ℕ → E3 → ℝ) (R : ℝ) : Prop :=
  0 < R ∧ (∀ n, ContDiff ℝ ∞ (φ n)) ∧ (∀ n, HasCompactSupport (φ n)) ∧
    (∀ n, tsupport (φ n) ⊆ Metric.closedBall 0 R) ∧
    (∀ ε : ℝ, 0 < ε → ∃ N : ℕ, ∀ n, N ≤ n → ∀ y, |φ n y - f y| ≤ ε)
def smthDQ (u : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (m : Fin 2) (h : ℝ) : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ :=
  fun x => (u (x + h • (Pi.single m (1 : ℝ) : Fin 2 → ℝ)) - u x) / h


def smthHolC : ℕ → ((Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) → Set (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Prop
  | 0, u, S => ContinuousOn u S ∧ ∀ x₀ ∈ S, ∃ (ρ : ℝ) (C α : NNReal), 0 < ρ ∧ 0 < α ∧
      Metric.ball x₀ ρ ⊆ S ∧ HolderOnWith C α u (Metric.ball x₀ ρ)
  | k + 1, u, S => (∀ x ∈ S, DifferentiableAt ℝ u x) ∧
      ∀ m : Fin 2, smthHolC k (fun x => smthGrad u x m) S


def smthLinSol (a : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (F : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Fin 2 → ℝ)
    (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (S : Set (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : Prop :=
  ∀ φ : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ φ → HasCompactSupport φ → tsupport φ ⊆ S →
    ∫ x, ∑ i : Fin 2, ∑ j : Fin 2, a x i j * smthGrad w x j * smthGrad φ x i =
      ∫ x, ∑ i : Fin 2, F x i * smthGrad φ x i


def smthSchauderData (lam : ℝ) (K α : NNReal) (a : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ)
    (F : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Fin 2 → ℝ) (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (S : Set (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : Prop :=
  (∀ x ∈ S, ∀ ξ : Fin 2 → ℝ, lam * ∑ i : Fin 2, ξ i ^ 2 ≤ ∑ i : Fin 2, ∑ j : Fin 2, a x i j * ξ i * ξ j) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ S, ∀ i j : Fin 2, |a x i j| ≤ (K : ℝ)) ∧ HolderOnWith K α a S ∧
  (∀ x ∈ S, ∀ i : Fin 2, |F x i| ≤ (K : ℝ)) ∧ HolderOnWith K α F S ∧
  (∀ x ∈ S, |w x| ≤ (K : ℝ)) ∧ ContDiffOn ℝ 1 w S ∧
  (∃ C₀ : NNReal, HolderOnWith C₀ α (smthGrad w) S) ∧ smthLinSol a F w S
def hcrNormalField (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (φ : E3 → ℝ) : E3 → E3 :=
  fun z => (EuclideanSpace.equiv (Fin 3) ℝ).symm (fun i => calUnitNormal G φ z i)
def eigSurfParam (Sig : Set M) (z : M) (W : Set E2) (F : E2 → E3) : Prop :=
  IsOpen W ∧ ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F W ∧ ∀ x ∈ W, F x ∈ (chartAt E3 z).target ∧
    (chartAt E3 z).symm (F x) ∈ Sig ∧ Function.Injective (fderiv ℝ F x)


def eigSmoothAlong (Sig : Set M) (w : M → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ (z : M) (W : Set E2) (F : E2 → E3), eigSurfParam Sig z W F →
    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => w ((chartAt E3 z).symm (F x))) W


def eigGraphChart (Sig : Set M) (p : M) (a : Fin 3) (u : E3 → ℝ) (r δ : ℝ) : Prop :=
  0 < r ∧ 0 < δ ∧ ContDiff ℝ ∞ u ∧
  sepCyl a (chartAt E3 p p) r δ ⊆ (chartAt E3 p).target ∧
  (∀ z : E3, ‖sepPlaneProj a (z - chartAt E3 p p)‖ < r →
    |u (sepPlaneProj a z) - chartAt E3 p p a| < δ) ∧
  ∀ z ∈ sepCyl a (chartAt E3 p p) r δ,
    ((chartAt E3 p).symm z ∈ Sig ↔ z a = u (sepPlaneProj a z))


structure EigPatchedSurface (X : Type*) [TopologicalSpace X] (S : Set X) where
  n : ℕ
  W : Fin n → Set E2
  param : Fin n → E2 → X
  proj : Fin n → X → E2
  O : Fin n → Set X
  h : Fin n → E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ
  W_open : ∀ j, IsOpen (W j)
  O_open : ∀ j, IsOpen (O j)
  param_cont : ∀ j, ContinuousOn (param j) (W j)
  proj_cont : ∀ j, ContinuousOn (proj j) (O j)
  image_eq : ∀ j, param j '' W j = O j ∩ S
  proj_param : ∀ j, ∀ x ∈ W j, proj j (param j x) = x
  cover : S ⊆ ⋃ j, O j
  trans_smooth : ∀ j k, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => proj k (param j x)) (W j ∩ param j ⁻¹' O k)
  h_smooth : ∀ j (a b : Fin 2), ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => h j x a b) (W j)
  h_posDef : ∀ j, ∀ x ∈ W j, (h j x).PosDef
  h_compat : ∀ j k, ∀ x ∈ W j ∩ param j ⁻¹' O k, ∀ a b : Fin 2,
    h j x a b = ∑ c : Fin 2, ∑ d : Fin 2,
      fderiv ℝ (fun x' => proj k (param j x')) x (e2 a) c * h k (proj k (param j x)) c d *
        fderiv ℝ (fun x' => proj k (param j x')) x (e2 b) d
def hspSector (B : Set E3) {k : ℕ} (φ : Fin k → E3 → ℝ) (s : Fin k → Bool) : Set E3 :=
  {z | z ∈ B ∧ ∀ i, 0 < (if s i then (1 : ℝ) else -1) * φ i z}


def hspSectorPer (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (B : Set E3) {k : ℕ}
    (φ : Fin k → E3 → ℝ) (E W : Set E3) : ENNReal :=
  ∑ s : Fin k → Bool, sepPerG G (E ∩ hspSector B φ s) W
def lmcJAgree (a : Fin 3) (y₀ : E3) (F₁ F₂ : E3 → ℝ) (d : ℝ) : Prop :=
  DifferentiableAt ℝ F₁ y₀ ∧ DifferentiableAt ℝ F₂ y₀ ∧ F₁ y₀ = F₂ y₀ ∧
    partialDeriv a F₁ y₀ - partialDeriv a F₂ y₀ = d
def sfrTheta (φ : E3 → ℝ) (τ : ℝ) (z : E3) : ℝ :=
  Real.smoothTransition (2 * (φ z / τ) - 1)


def sfrWall (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (φ χ : E3 → ℝ) (τ : ℝ) (Y : E3 → E3) :
    E3 → E3 :=
  fun z => sfrTheta φ τ z • Y z - ((1 - sfrTheta φ τ z) * χ z) • hcrNormalField G φ z
def ejpS (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i j * partialDeriv i Φ y * partialDeriv j Φ y


def ejpPsi (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  (Real.sqrt (ejpS G Φ y))⁻¹


def ejpN (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) (a : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ a b * partialDeriv b Φ y


def ejpP (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) (a b : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  (G y)⁻¹ a b - ejpN G Φ y a * ejpN G Φ y b / ejpS G Φ y


def ejpRic (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  (∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, ricci G j k y * ejpN G Φ y j * ejpN G Φ y k) / ejpS G Φ y


def ejpJac (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
    (G y)⁻¹ i j * partialDeriv i (levelMeanCurvCoord G Φ) y * partialDeriv j Φ y


def ejpPot (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  secondFundSq G Φ y + ejpRic G Φ y
def epaPlaneEmb (a : Fin 3) (x : E2) : E3 := ∑ k : Fin 2, x k • e (a.succAbove k)


def epaPlaneCoord (a : Fin 3) (z : E3) : E2 := ∑ k : Fin 2, z (a.succAbove k) • e2 k


def epaGraphParam (a : Fin 3) (u : E3 → ℝ) (x : E2) : E3 :=
  epaPlaneEmb a x + u (epaPlaneEmb a x) • e a
def ejpHess3 (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) (a b c : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  partialDeriv c (hessLoc G Φ a b) y
    - ∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel G k c a y * hessLoc G Φ k b y
    - ∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel G k c b y * hessLoc G Φ a k y
def eigWInt {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (ρ : Fin P.n → X → ℝ) (F : Fin P.n → E2 → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ j, ∫ x in P.W j, ρ j (P.param j x) * F j x * Real.sqrt (P.h j x).det

def eigGam {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (u v : X → ℝ) (j : Fin P.n) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, (P.h j x)⁻¹ a b * pd2 b (fun x' => u (P.param j x')) x *
    pd2 a (fun x' => v (P.param j x')) x
def elrSob : ℕ → Set E2 → (E2 → ℝ) → Prop
  | 0, U, v => ∀ L : Set E2, IsCompact L → L ⊆ U → MemLp v 2 (volume.restrict L)
  | k + 1, U, v => (∀ L : Set E2, IsCompact L → L ⊆ U → MemLp v 2 (volume.restrict L)) ∧
      ∃ G : Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ, (∀ ζ : E2 → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ ζ → HasCompactSupport ζ → tsupport ζ ⊆ U →
        ∀ m : Fin 2, ∫ x, v x * pd2 m ζ x = -(∫ x, G m x * ζ x)) ∧ ∀ m : Fin 2, elrSob k U (G m)
def gsTan (F : E2 → E3) (i : Fin 2) (x : E2) : E3 := fderiv ℝ F x (e2 i)


def gsHessF (F : E2 → E3) (i j : Fin 2) (x : E2) : E3 :=
  fderiv ℝ (fun y => fderiv ℝ F y (e2 j)) x (e2 i)


def gsCrossN (F : E2 → E3) (x : E2) : Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  ![gsTan F 0 x 1 * gsTan F 1 x 2 - gsTan F 0 x 2 * gsTan F 1 x 1,
    gsTan F 0 x 2 * gsTan F 1 x 0 - gsTan F 0 x 0 * gsTan F 1 x 2,
    gsTan F 0 x 0 * gsTan F 1 x 1 - gsTan F 0 x 1 * gsTan F 1 x 0]


def gsNormLen (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt (∑ k : Fin 3, ∑ l : Fin 3, (G (F x))⁻¹ k l * gsCrossN F x k * gsCrossN F x l)


def gsCovHess (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (i j : Fin 2) (x : E2)
    (k : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  gsHessF F i j x k + ∑ m : Fin 3, ∑ n : Fin 3,
    christoffel G k m n (F x) * gsTan F i x m * gsTan F j x n


def gsSff (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (i j : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  (∑ k : Fin 3, gsCrossN F x k * gsCovHess G F i j x k) / gsNormLen G F x


def gsInner (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (S T : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 2, ∑ j : Fin 2, ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2,
    (h x)⁻¹ i a * (h x)⁻¹ j b * S i j x * T a b x


def gsTrace (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (S : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 2, ∑ j : Fin 2, (h x)⁻¹ i j * S i j x


def gsSffSq (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  gsInner (pullMetric2 G F) (gsSff G F) (gsSff G F) x


def gsMeanCurv (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  gsTrace (pullMetric2 G F) (gsSff G F) x


def gsAmbPlane (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ l : Fin 3, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, ∑ m : Fin 3,
    G (F x) m l * riemannLocal G l i j k (F x) *
      gsTan F 0 x i * gsTan F 1 x j * gsTan F 1 x k * gsTan F 0 x m


def gsAmbCod (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (k i j : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  (∑ l : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ c : Fin 3,
    gsCrossN F x l * riemannLocal G l a b c (F x) *
      gsTan F k x a * gsTan F i x b * gsTan F j x c) / gsNormLen G F x


def gsCovD1 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (w : Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ) (i j : Fin 2)
    (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  pd2 i (w j) x - ∑ m : Fin 2, christoffel2 h m i j x * w m x


def gsCovD2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (S : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ) (k i j : Fin 2)
    (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  pd2 k (S i j) x - ∑ m : Fin 2, christoffel2 h m k i x * S m j x
    - ∑ m : Fin 2, christoffel2 h m k j x * S i m x


def gsCovD3 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (C : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ)
    (l k i j : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  pd2 l (C k i j) x - ∑ m : Fin 2, christoffel2 h m l k x * C m i j x
    - ∑ m : Fin 2, christoffel2 h m l i x * C k m j x
    - ∑ m : Fin 2, christoffel2 h m l j x * C k i m x


def gsCodazzi (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (S : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ) (k i j : Fin 2)
    (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  gsCovD2 h S k i j x - gsCovD2 h S i k j x


def gsSimonsE (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (C : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ)
    (i j : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  gsCovD1 h (fun j' y => ∑ k : Fin 2, ∑ l : Fin 2, (h y)⁻¹ k l * C k j' l y) i j x
    + ∑ k : Fin 2, ∑ l : Fin 2, (h x)⁻¹ k l * gsCovD3 h C l k i j x
def sprayGam (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y v : E3) : E3 :=
  (EuclideanSpace.equiv (Fin 3) ℝ).symm
    (fun k => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, christoffel G k a b y * v a * v b)



def sprayA (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (Φ : E3 → ℝ) (y v : E3) : E3 :=
  ((∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, hessLoc G Φ i j y * v i * v j) /
      (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ a b * partialDeriv a Φ y * partialDeriv b Φ y)) •
    (EuclideanSpace.equiv (Fin 3) ℝ).symm
      (fun k => ∑ l : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ k l * partialDeriv l Φ y)


def sprayQ (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) {N : ℕ} (Φ ψ : Fin N → E3 → ℝ) (y v : E3) : E3 :=
  -sprayGam G y v - ∑ i : Fin N, ψ i y • sprayA G (Φ i) y v
def ggeGam1 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (m i j : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (pd2 i (fun z => h z j m) x + pd2 j (fun z => h z i m) x - pd2 m (fun z => h z i j) x)


def ggeRiem0110 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  pd2 0 (ggeGam1 h 0 1 1) x - pd2 1 (ggeGam1 h 0 0 1) x
    - ∑ l : Fin 2, ggeGam1 h l 0 0 x * christoffel2 h l 1 1 x
    + ∑ l : Fin 2, ggeGam1 h l 1 0 x * christoffel2 h l 0 1 x
def gcNu (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (x : E2) (l : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  (∑ k : Fin 3, (G (F x))⁻¹ l k * gsCrossN F x k) / gsNormLen G F x



def gcCovAlong (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (V : E2 → Fin 3 → ℝ)
    (k : Fin 2) (x : E2) (l : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  pd2 k (fun y => V y l) x + ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
    christoffel G l a b (F x) * gsTan F k x a * V x b
def gsRiem2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (m l i k : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  pd2 l (christoffel2 h m i k) x - pd2 i (christoffel2 h m l k) x
    + ∑ p : Fin 2, (christoffel2 h m l p x * christoffel2 h p i k x
        - christoffel2 h m i p x * christoffel2 h p l k x)
def gsrF4 (R : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (X Y Z W : Fin 3 → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ c : Fin 3, ∑ m : Fin 3, R a b c m * X a * Y b * Z c * W m

def gsrF5 (D : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (V X Y Z W : Fin 3 → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ r : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ c : Fin 3, ∑ m : Fin 3,
    D r a b c m * V r * X a * Y b * Z c * W m

def gsrRm (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (a b c m : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ l : Fin 3, G y m l * riemannLocal G l a b c y

def gsrDRm (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (r a b c m : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  partialDeriv r (gsrRm G a b c m) y
    - ∑ q : Fin 3, (christoffel G q r a y * gsrRm G q b c m y
      + christoffel G q r b y * gsrRm G a q c m y
      + christoffel G q r c y * gsrRm G a b q m y
      + christoffel G q r m y * gsrRm G a b c q y)

def gsrNu (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (F : E2 → E3) (x : E2) (e : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  (∑ b : Fin 3, (G (F x))⁻¹ e b * gsCrossN F x b) / gsNormLen G F x

def gsrDT (R : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ)
    (DR : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (Fv : Fin 2 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (ν : Fin 3 → ℝ)
    (hi : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (II : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (l k i j : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  gsrF5 DR (Fv l) (Fv k) (Fv i) (Fv j) ν
    + II l k * gsrF4 R ν (Fv i) (Fv j) ν
    + II l i * gsrF4 R (Fv k) ν (Fv j) ν
    + II l j * gsrF4 R (Fv k) (Fv i) ν ν
    - ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, hi a b * II l b * gsrF4 R (Fv k) (Fv i) (Fv j) (Fv a)

def gsrE (R : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ)
    (DR : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (Fv : Fin 2 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (ν : Fin 3 → ℝ)
    (hi : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (II : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (i j : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ k : Fin 2, ∑ l : Fin 2, hi k l *
    (gsrDT R DR Fv ν hi II i k j l + gsrDT R DR Fv ν hi II l k i j)
def mseQC : ℕ → NNReal → ((Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) → Set (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Prop
  | 0, B, f, S => (∀ x ∈ S, |f x| ≤ (B : ℝ)) ∧ HolderOnWith B (1 / 2 : NNReal) f S
  | s + 1, B, f, S => ((∀ x ∈ S, |f x| ≤ (B : ℝ)) ∧ HolderOnWith B (1 / 2 : NNReal) f S) ∧
      ∀ m : Fin 2, mseQC s B (fun x => smthGrad f x m) S

def mseDivSol (a : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (F : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Fin 2 → ℝ)
    (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (S : Set (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : Prop :=
  ∀ x ∈ S, ∑ i : Fin 2, smthGrad (fun y => ∑ j : Fin 2, a y i j * smthGrad w y j - F y i) x i = 0

def mseLp (Λ : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (i : Fin 2)
    (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ Λ w (0, 0, Pi.single i 1)

def mseLz (Λ : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ)
    (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ Λ w (0, 1, 0)

def mseLpp (Λ : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (i j : Fin 2)
    (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ (mseLp Λ i) w (0, 0, Pi.single j 1)

def mseLpx (Λ : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (i m : Fin 2)
    (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ (mseLp Λ i) w (Pi.single m 1, 0, 0)

def mseLpz (Λ : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) (i : Fin 2)
    (w : (Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ)) : ℝ :=
  fderiv ℝ (mseLp Λ i) w (0, 1, 0)

def mseParamSet (a : Fin 3) (c : E3) (ρ : ℝ) : Set ((Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ)) :=
  {w | ∑ k : Fin 2, (w.1 k - c (a.succAbove k)) ^ 2 ≤ (3 * ρ) ^ 2 ∧ |w.2.1 - c a| ≤ 9 * ρ ∧
    ‖w.2.2‖ ≤ 2}

def mseLagDom (a : Fin 3) (Ω : Set E3) : Set ((Fin 2 → ℝ) × ℝ × (Fin 2 → ℝ)) :=
  {w | smthLift a w.1 w.2.1 ∈ Ω}
def IsFlipSection {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] (S : Set X) (σ : X → X → ℝ) (W : Set X)
    (φ : X → Bool) : Prop :=
  ∀ q ∈ W, (q ∉ S → ∀ᶠ x in 𝓝 q, φ x = φ q) ∧
    (q ∈ S → ∀ᶠ x in 𝓝 q, (0 < σ q x → φ x = φ q) ∧ (σ q x < 0 → φ x = !φ q))


def FlipPt (X : Type*) : Type _ := X × Bool
def dualOmega (Ψ : M → ℂ) (p : M) (y : E3) (i : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  (Ψ ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)).re * partialDeriv i (fun z => (Ψ ((chartAt E3 p).symm z)).im) y -
    (Ψ ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)).im * partialDeriv i (fun z => (Ψ ((chartAt E3 p).symm z)).re) y


def dualVarG (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (om : E3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (v : E3 → ℝ)
    (U Kc : Set E3) : ENNReal :=
  (⨆ (_ : ¬ MeasureTheory.LocallyIntegrableOn v U), (⊤ : ENNReal)) ⊔
  ⨆ (X : E3 → E3) (_ : (∀ y, y ∉ Kc → ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ X y) ∧ HasCompactSupport X ∧
      tsupport X ⊆ U ∧ (∀ y, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, G y i j * X y i * X y j ≤ 1) ∧
      ∃ C : ℝ, ∀ y, |sepDensDiv G X y| ≤ C),
    ENNReal.ofReal (∫ y, (v y * sepDensDiv G X y +
      Real.sqrt (G y).det * ∑ i : Fin 3, om y i * X y i))


def dualRiemVar (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (Ψ : M → ℂ) (φ : M → ℝ) (U Kc : Set M) : ENNReal :=
  ⨆ (n : ℕ) (p : Fin n → M) (W : Fin n → Set M)
    (_ : (∀ k, IsOpen (W k) ∧ W k ⊆ U ∩ (chartAt E3 (p k)).source) ∧
      Pairwise (fun k l => Disjoint (W k) (W l))),
    ∑ k, dualVarG (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (p k)).symm) (dualOmega Ψ (p k))
      (fun y => φ ((chartAt E3 (p k)).symm y)) (chartAt E3 (p k) '' W k)
      (chartAt E3 (p k) '' (Kc ∩ (chartAt E3 (p k)).source))


def dualChartMeas (φ : M → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ p : M, Measurable ((chartAt E3 p).target.indicator (fun y => φ ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)))
def EigPatchedSurface.withMetric {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X}
    (P : EigPatchedSurface X S) (h' : Fin P.n → E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ)
    (hs : ∀ j (a b : Fin 2), ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => h' j x a b) (P.W j))
    (hp : ∀ j, ∀ x ∈ P.W j, (h' j x).PosDef)
    (hc : ∀ j k, ∀ x ∈ P.W j ∩ P.param j ⁻¹' P.O k, ∀ a b : Fin 2,
      h' j x a b = ∑ c : Fin 2, ∑ d : Fin 2,
        fderiv ℝ (fun x' => P.proj k (P.param j x')) x (e2 a) c * h' k (P.proj k (P.param j x)) c d *
          fderiv ℝ (fun x' => P.proj k (P.param j x')) x (e2 b) d) :
    EigPatchedSurface X S :=
  { P with h := h', h_smooth := hs, h_posDef := hp, h_compat := hc }
def collarSlabChartAt (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (U : Set M) (φ : M → ℝ) (S : Set M)
    (Ψ : ℝ → M → M) (s₁ : ℝ) (ℓ : M) : Prop :=
  ∃ (W : Set E2) (O : Set M) (pm : E2 → M) (pj : M → E2) (z : M)
    (Φ : PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞),
    IsOpen W ∧ IsOpen O ∧ ℓ ∈ O ∧ ContinuousOn pm W ∧ ContinuousOn pj O ∧
    pm '' W = O ∩ S ∧ (∀ x ∈ W, pj (pm x) = x) ∧
    (∀ s ∈ Set.Ioo (-s₁) s₁, ∀ x ∈ W, hpLift s x ∈ Φ.source ∧
      Φ (hpLift s x) = Ψ s (pm x) ∧ Ψ s (pm x) ∈ (chartAt E3 z).source) ∧
    (∀ x ∈ W, ∀ (V : Set M) (f : M → ℝ), IsOpen V → Ψ 0 (pm x) ∈ V →
      ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ f → (∀ y ∈ V, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f y ≠ 0) →
      V ∩ frontier U = V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} →
      Real.sqrt (g.gradInner f f (Ψ 0 (pm x))) * φ (Ψ 0 (pm x)) = 1 →
      |partialDeriv 0 (fun y => f (Φ y)) (hpLift 0 x)| = 1)
structure BanachScale where
  E : ℕ → Type
  [nE : ∀ k, NormedAddCommGroup (E k)]
  [sE : ∀ k, NormedSpace ℝ (E k)]
  [cE : ∀ k, CompleteSpace (E k)]
  F : ℕ → Type
  [nF : ∀ k, NormedAddCommGroup (F k)]
  [sF : ∀ k, NormedSpace ℝ (F k)]
  [cF : ∀ k, CompleteSpace (F k)]
  ιE : ∀ k, E k →L[ℝ] E 0
  ιF : ∀ k, F k →L[ℝ] F 0

instance BanachScale.instNormedAddCommGroupE (B : BanachScale) (k : ℕ) :
    NormedAddCommGroup (B.E k) := B.nE k

instance BanachScale.instNormedSpaceE (B : BanachScale) (k : ℕ) :
    NormedSpace ℝ (B.E k) := B.sE k

instance BanachScale.instCompleteSpaceE (B : BanachScale) (k : ℕ) :
    CompleteSpace (B.E k) := B.cE k

instance BanachScale.instNormedAddCommGroupF (B : BanachScale) (k : ℕ) :
    NormedAddCommGroup (B.F k) := B.nF k

instance BanachScale.instNormedSpaceF (B : BanachScale) (k : ℕ) :
    NormedSpace ℝ (B.F k) := B.sF k

instance BanachScale.instCompleteSpaceF (B : BanachScale) (k : ℕ) :
    CompleteSpace (B.F k) := B.cF k
def gbW (H : ℝ → E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (t : ℝ) (x : E2) (e : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ b : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, (H t x)⁻¹ b c * deriv (fun s => christoffel2 (H s) e b c x) t -
    ∑ b : Fin 2, (H t x)⁻¹ e b * ∑ c : Fin 2, deriv (fun s => christoffel2 (H s) c c b x) t
def pcrHolLoc (α : ℝ) (m : ℕ) (w : E2 → ℝ) (U : Set E2) : Prop :=
  ContDiffOn ℝ m w U ∧ ∀ x ∈ U, ∃ ρ : ℝ, 0 < ρ ∧ Metric.ball x ρ ⊆ U ∧ ∃ C : ℝ,
    ∀ y ∈ Metric.ball x ρ, ∀ z ∈ Metric.ball x ρ,
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m w y - iteratedFDeriv ℝ m w z‖ ≤ C * dist y z ^ α


def pcrClass {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (α : ℝ) (m : ℕ) (u : X → ℝ) : Prop :=
  (∀ q, q ∉ S → u q = 0) ∧ ∀ j, pcrHolLoc α m (fun x => u (P.param j x)) (P.W j)


def pcrH (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (w : E2 → ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  levelMeanCurvCoord G (fun y => y 0 - w (hpProj y)) (hpLift (w x) x)
def pcrL0A (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y : E3) : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ :=
  fun a b => Real.sqrt (G y).det *
    ((G y)⁻¹ a.succ b.succ / Real.sqrt ((G y)⁻¹ 0 0) -
      (G y)⁻¹ a.succ 0 * (G y)⁻¹ b.succ 0 / Real.sqrt ((G y)⁻¹ 0 0) ^ 3)


def pcrL0Z (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (i : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt (G y).det * (∑ j : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i j * partialDeriv j f y) /
    Real.sqrt (∑ k : Fin 3, ∑ l : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ k l * partialDeriv k f y * partialDeriv l f y)
def pcrHolF (α : NNReal) : ℕ → ((Fin 2 → ℝ) → ℝ) → Set (Fin 2 → ℝ) → Prop
  | 0, u, S => ContinuousOn u S ∧ ∀ x₀ ∈ S, ∃ (ρ : ℝ) (C : NNReal), 0 < ρ ∧
      Metric.ball x₀ ρ ⊆ S ∧ HolderOnWith C α u (Metric.ball x₀ ρ)
  | k + 1, u, S => (∀ x ∈ S, DifferentiableAt ℝ u x) ∧
      ∀ m : Fin 2, pcrHolF α k (fun x => smthGrad u x m) S
structure PcrBalls {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S) where
  N : ℕ
  j : Fin N → Fin P.n
  c : Fin N → E2
  ρ : Fin N → ℝ
  ρ_pos : ∀ i, 0 < ρ i
  sub : ∀ i, Metric.closedBall (c i) (ρ i) ⊆ P.W (j i)
  cover : ∀ q ∈ S, ∃ i, ∃ x ∈ Metric.ball (c i) (ρ i), P.param (j i) x = q


def pcrLocAmb (c : E2) (ρ : ℝ) (m : ℕ) : Type :=
  ∀ l : Fin (m + 1),
    BoundedContinuousFunction (Metric.closedBall c ρ)
        (ContinuousMultilinearMap ℝ (fun _ : Fin l => E2) ℝ) ×
      BoundedContinuousFunction {p : Metric.closedBall c ρ × Metric.closedBall c ρ // p.1 ≠ p.2}
        (ContinuousMultilinearMap ℝ (fun _ : Fin l => E2) ℝ)

instance pcrLocAmb.instNormedAddCommGroup (c : E2) (ρ : ℝ) (m : ℕ) :
    NormedAddCommGroup (pcrLocAmb c ρ m) :=
  Pi.normedAddCommGroup

instance pcrLocAmb.instNormedSpace (c : E2) (ρ : ℝ) (m : ℕ) : NormedSpace ℝ (pcrLocAmb c ρ m) :=
  Pi.normedSpace


def pcrLocRel (c : E2) (ρ α : ℝ) (m : ℕ) (w : E2 → ℝ) (h : pcrLocAmb c ρ m) : Prop :=
  ∀ l : Fin (m + 1),
    (∀ x : Metric.closedBall c ρ, (h l).1 x = iteratedFDeriv ℝ l w x) ∧
    ∀ p : {p : Metric.closedBall c ρ × Metric.closedBall c ρ // p.1 ≠ p.2},
      (h l).2 p = (dist (p.1.1 : E2) (p.1.2 : E2) ^ α)⁻¹ •
        (iteratedFDeriv ℝ l w p.1.1 - iteratedFDeriv ℝ l w p.1.2)


def pcrAmb {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} {P : EigPatchedSurface X S}
    (B : PcrBalls P) (m : ℕ) : Type :=
  ∀ i : Fin B.N, pcrLocAmb (B.c i) (B.ρ i) m

instance pcrAmb.instNormedAddCommGroup {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X}
    {P : EigPatchedSurface X S} (B : PcrBalls P) (m : ℕ) : NormedAddCommGroup (pcrAmb B m) :=
  Pi.normedAddCommGroup

instance pcrAmb.instNormedSpace {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X}
    {P : EigPatchedSurface X S} (B : PcrBalls P) (m : ℕ) : NormedSpace ℝ (pcrAmb B m) :=
  Pi.normedSpace


def pcrSp {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} {P : EigPatchedSurface X S}
    (B : PcrBalls P) (α : ℝ) (m : ℕ) : Submodule ℝ (pcrAmb B m) :=
  Submodule.span ℝ {g | ∃ u : X → ℝ, pcrClass P α m u ∧
    ∀ i, pcrLocRel (B.c i) (B.ρ i) α m (fun x => u (P.param (B.j i) x)) (g i)}


instance pcrLocAmb.instCompleteSpace (c : E2) (ρ : ℝ) (m : ℕ) : CompleteSpace (pcrLocAmb c ρ m) :=
  @Pi.complete _ _ _ (fun _ => inferInstance)


instance pcrAmb.instCompleteSpace {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X}
    {P : EigPatchedSurface X S} (B : PcrBalls P) (m : ℕ) : CompleteSpace (pcrAmb B m) :=
  @Pi.complete _ _ _ (fun _ => inferInstance)


def pcrLevelProj {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} {P : EigPatchedSurface X S}
    (B : PcrBalls P) {m m' : ℕ} (h : m ≤ m') : pcrAmb B m' →L[ℝ] pcrAmb B m where
  toFun g := fun i l => g i (Fin.castLE (Nat.succ_le_succ h) l)
  map_add' _ _ := rfl
  map_smul' _ _ := rfl
  cont := continuous_pi fun i => continuous_pi fun l =>
    (continuous_apply (Fin.castLE (Nat.succ_le_succ h) l)).comp (continuous_apply i)


def pcrEval {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} {P : EigPatchedSurface X S}
    (B : PcrBalls P) (m : ℕ) : pcrAmb B m →ₗ[ℝ] (X → ℝ) where
  toFun g q := by
    classical
    exact if h : ∃ i, ∃ x ∈ Metric.ball (B.c i) (B.ρ i), P.param (B.j i) x = q then
      (g h.choose ⟨0, Nat.succ_pos m⟩).1
        ⟨h.choose_spec.choose, Metric.ball_subset_closedBall h.choose_spec.choose_spec.1⟩
        (fun _ => 0)
    else 0
  map_add' g g' := by
    funext q
    rw [Pi.add_apply]
    split_ifs
    · rfl
    · simp
  map_smul' a g := by
    funext q
    rw [Pi.smul_apply, RingHom.id_apply]
    split_ifs
    · rfl
    · simp
def pcrHolV {G : Type} [NormedAddCommGroup G] [NormedSpace ℝ G]
    (α : ℝ) (m : ℕ) (f : E2 → G) (U : Set E2) : Prop :=
  ContDiffOn ℝ m f U ∧ ∀ x ∈ U, ∃ ρ : ℝ, 0 < ρ ∧ Metric.ball x ρ ⊆ U ∧ ∃ C : ℝ,
    ∀ y ∈ Metric.ball x ρ, ∀ z ∈ Metric.ball x ρ,
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m f y - iteratedFDeriv ℝ m f z‖ ≤ C * dist y z ^ α
def iterPartial {j : ℕ} (σ : Fin j → Fin 3) (v : E3 → ℝ) : E3 → ℝ :=
  List.foldr (fun k w => partialDeriv k w) v (List.ofFn σ)


def ellOp (a : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (b : E3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (w : E3 → ℝ) : E3 → ℝ :=
  fun y => ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, a y i j * partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j w) y
    + ∑ l : Fin 3, b y l * partialDeriv l w y


def sqSum (n : ℕ) (v : E3 → ℝ) : E3 → ℝ :=
  fun y => ∑ σ : Fin n → Fin 3, (iterPartial σ v y) ^ 2
def gradInnerLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f h : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i j * partialDeriv i f y * partialDeriv j h y

def gradSqLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  gradInnerLoc G f f y

def gradUpLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) (i : Fin 3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ a : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i a * partialDeriv a f y

def hessSqLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
    (G y)⁻¹ i a * (G y)⁻¹ j b * hessLoc G f i j y * hessLoc G f a b y

def hessGGLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (h f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, gradUpLoc G f y i * gradUpLoc G f y j * hessLoc G h i j y

def hessGradSqLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
    (G y)⁻¹ i j * (hessLoc G f i a y * gradUpLoc G f y a) * (hessLoc G f j b y * gradUpLoc G f y b)

def ricGradLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, gradUpLoc G f y i * gradUpLoc G f y j * ricci G i j y

def levelGaussLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  let N2 := gradSqLoc G f y
  let hgg := hessGGLoc G f f y
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (scalarCurvatureLocal G y - 2 * ricGradLoc G f y / N2
    + (lapLoc G f y - hgg / N2) ^ 2 / N2
    - (hessSqLoc G f y - 2 * hessGradSqLoc G f y / N2 + hgg ^ 2 / N2 ^ 2) / N2)

def sternPhiLoc (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (ε : ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt (gradSqLoc G f y + ε)
def cdecaySym (f : E3 → ℝ) (m : ℝ) : Prop :=
  ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} ∧ ∀ l : ℕ, l ≤ 2 →
    (fun x : E3 => ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l f x‖) =O[Bornology.cobounded E3]
      fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (m - (l : ℝ))
def sternKappa (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (L t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..(2 * Real.pi), curvIntegrand G t L s


def sternVecEps (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (ε : ℝ) (x : E3) : Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  fun k => Real.sqrt (G x).det *
    ∑ l : Fin 3, (G x)⁻¹ k l * partialDeriv l (fun z => Real.sqrt ((G z)⁻¹ 0 0 + ε)) x


def sternPhiM (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (u : M → ℝ) (ε : ℝ) (p : M) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u p + ε)


def sternGaussM (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (u : M → ℝ) (p : M) : ℝ :=
  levelGaussLoc (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm) (fun y => u ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)) (chartAt E3 p p)


def sternAdmissible (Ω : Set M) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M) (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∃ (Ω' O : Set M), calPartition q φ Ω' ∧ IsOpen O ∧ Ω ⊆ O ∧ ∀ x ∈ O, ∑ j, φ j x = 1


def sternBulk (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M)
    (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (S : Set M) (ε s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  calVolSum g q φ S (fun p => Real.smoothTransition (β p / s) * g.lapM (sternPhiM g u ε) p)


def sternCollar (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M)
    (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (S : Set M) (ε s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  calVolSum g q φ S (fun p => s⁻¹ * deriv Real.smoothTransition (β p / s) *
    g.gradInner β (sternPhiM g u ε) p)


def sternBandJ (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M)
    (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (S : Set M) (s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  calVolSum g q φ S (fun p => Real.smoothTransition (β p / s) *
      Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u p) * sternGaussM g u p) -
    calVolSum g q φ S (fun p => s⁻¹ * deriv Real.smoothTransition (β p / s) *
      g.gradInner β (fun x => Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u x)) p)
structure NdsAtlas (M : Type*) [TopologicalSpace M] [ChartedSpace E3 M]
    (β : M → ℝ) (Ω₀ S₀ : Set M) where
  n : ℕ
  κ : Fin n → PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞
  c : Fin n → E3
  r : Fin n → ℝ
  D : Fin n → Prop
  ψ : Fin n → M → ℝ
  r_pos : ∀ j, 0 < r j
  source_eq : ∀ j, (κ j).source = Metric.ball (c j) (r j)
  center : ∀ j, c j 0 = 0 ∨ r j ≤ c j 0
  D_center : ∀ j, D j → c j 0 = 0
  dom : ∀ j, ∀ x ∈ Metric.ball (c j) (r j), κ j x ∈ Ω₀ ↔ 0 ≤ x 0
  dir : ∀ j, ∀ x ∈ Metric.ball (c j) (r j), κ j x ∈ S₀ ↔ (D j ∧ x 0 = 0)
  bdry : ∀ j, ∀ x ∈ Metric.ball (c j) (r j), β (κ j x) = 0 ↔ (¬ D j ∧ x 0 = 0)
  neu : ∀ j, ¬ D j → c j 0 = 0 → ∀ x ∈ Metric.ball (c j) (r j), β (κ j x) = x 0
  ψ_smooth : ∀ j, ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (ψ j)
  ψ_nonneg : ∀ j x, 0 ≤ ψ j x
  ψ_supp : ∀ j, IsCompact (tsupport (ψ j)) ∧ tsupport (ψ j) ⊆ κ j '' Metric.ball (c j) (r j / 8)
  ψ_sum : ∀ q ∈ Ω₀, ∑ j, ψ j q = 1

def ndsHalf (c : E3) (r : ℝ) : Set E3 := Metric.ball c (r / 2) ∩ {x : E3 | 0 < x 0}

def ndsWeakSol (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) {β : M → ℝ} {Ω₀ S₀ : Set M} (A : NdsAtlas M β Ω₀ S₀)
    (f : M → ℝ) (u : ℕ → M → ℝ) (v : Fin A.n → E3 → ℝ) (Gr : Fin A.n → Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  (∀ m, ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (u m) ∧
    ∃ N : Set M, IsOpen N ∧ S₀ ⊆ N ∧ ∀ q ∈ N, u m q = 0) ∧
  ∀ j, MemLp (v j) 2 (volume.restrict (ndsHalf (A.c j) (A.r j))) ∧
    (∀ a, MemLp (Gr j a) 2 (volume.restrict (ndsHalf (A.c j) (A.r j)))) ∧
    Tendsto (fun m => ∫ x in ndsHalf (A.c j) (A.r j), (u m (A.κ j x) - v j x) ^ 2) atTop (𝓝 0) ∧
    (∀ a, Tendsto (fun m => ∫ x in ndsHalf (A.c j) (A.r j),
      (partialDeriv a (fun z => u m (A.κ j z)) x - Gr j a x) ^ 2) atTop (𝓝 0)) ∧
    ∀ ζ : E3 → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ ζ → HasCompactSupport ζ →
      tsupport ζ ⊆ Metric.ball (A.c j) (A.r j / 2) →
      (A.D j → ∃ O : Set E3, IsOpen O ∧ {x ∈ Metric.ball (A.c j) (A.r j) | x 0 = 0} ⊆ O ∧
        ∀ x ∈ O, ζ x = 0) →
      ∫ x in ndsHalf (A.c j) (A.r j),
        (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Real.sqrt (g.coeff (A.κ j) x).det * (g.coeff (A.κ j) x)⁻¹ a b *
            Gr j b x * partialDeriv a ζ x +
          Real.sqrt (g.coeff (A.κ j) x).det * f (A.κ j x) * ζ x) = 0
def sbgbAreaConst : ℝ :=
  Real.pi / (MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure (2 : ℝ) (Metric.ball (0 : E2) 1)).toReal


def sbgbLenConst : ℝ :=
  1 / (MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure (1 : ℝ) (Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1)).toReal


def sbgbAreaDens (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  sbgbAreaConst * Real.sqrt (G y).det * Real.sqrt (gradSqLoc G f y) / ‖fderiv ℝ f y‖


def sbgbCross (f b : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : Fin 3 → ℝ :=
  ![partialDeriv 1 f y * partialDeriv 2 b y - partialDeriv 2 f y * partialDeriv 1 b y,
    partialDeriv 2 f y * partialDeriv 0 b y - partialDeriv 0 f y * partialDeriv 2 b y,
    partialDeriv 0 f y * partialDeriv 1 b y - partialDeriv 1 f y * partialDeriv 0 b y]


def sbgbEdgeDens (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f b : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  sbgbLenConst *
    Real.sqrt (∑ k : Fin 3, ∑ l : Fin 3, G y k l * sbgbCross f b y k * sbgbCross f b y l) /
    Real.sqrt (∑ k : Fin 3, sbgbCross f b y k ^ 2)


def sbgbSliceInt (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (u : M → ℝ) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M)
    (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (S : Set M) (t : ℝ) (h : M → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ j, ∫ y in chartAt E3 (q j) '' (S ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∩ (chartAt E3 (q j)).source),
    φ j ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm y) * h ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm y) *
      sbgbAreaDens (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (q j)).symm) (fun z => u ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm z)) y
    ∂(MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure (2 : ℝ))


def sbgbEdgeInt (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M)
    (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (S : Set M) (t : ℝ) (h : M → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ j, ∫ y in chartAt E3 (q j) '' (S ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∩ β ⁻¹' {0} ∩ (chartAt E3 (q j)).source),
    φ j ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm y) * h ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm y) *
      sbgbEdgeDens (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (q j)).symm) (fun z => u ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm z))
        (fun z => β ((chartAt E3 (q j)).symm z)) y
    ∂(MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure (1 : ℝ))


def sbgbSliceJ (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M)
    (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (S : Set M) (t s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  sbgbSliceInt g u q φ S t (fun p => Real.smoothTransition (β p / s) * sternGaussM g u p) -
    sbgbSliceInt g u q φ S t (fun p => s⁻¹ * deriv Real.smoothTransition (β p / s) *
      g.gradInner β (fun x => Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u x)) p / Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u p))


def sbgbSliceLim (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) {n : ℕ} (q : Fin n → M)
    (φ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (S : Set M) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  sbgbSliceInt g u q φ S t (fun p => sternGaussM g u p) -
    sbgbEdgeInt g β u q φ S t (fun p => g.gradInner β (fun x => Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u x)) p /
      (Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u p) * Real.sqrt (g.gradInner β β p)))
def sternTheta (R₁ : ℝ) (x : E3) : ℝ := Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - (R₁ + 1))

def sternKset (R₁ L : ℝ) : Set E3 :=
  {x : E3 | |x 0| ≤ L ∧ x 1 ^ 2 + x 2 ^ 2 ≤ L ^ 2 ∧ R₁ + 1 ≤ ‖x‖}

def sternWt (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ)
    (P : PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞) (R₁ s ε : ℝ) (x : E3) : E3 :=
  sternTheta R₁ x • (EuclideanSpace.equiv (Fin 3) ℝ).symm (fun i =>
    Real.smoothTransition (β (P x) / s) * ∑ k : Fin 3, (g.coeff P x)⁻¹ i k *
      partialDeriv k (fun z => sternPhiM g u ε (P z)) x)
def ndsInt (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) {β : M → ℝ} {Ω₀ S₀ : Set M} (A : NdsAtlas M β Ω₀ S₀)
    (F : M → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ j, ∫ x in ndsHalf (A.c j) (A.r j),
    A.ψ j (A.κ j x) * F (A.κ j x) * Real.sqrt (g.coeff (A.κ j) x).det

def ndsV0 [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (S₀ : Set M) : Submodule ℝ (M → ℝ) where
  carrier := {u | ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ u ∧
    ∃ N : Set M, IsOpen N ∧ S₀ ⊆ N ∧ ∀ q ∈ N, u q = 0}
  add_mem' := by
    rintro u w ⟨hu, N₁, hN₁, hS₁, hu0⟩ ⟨hw, N₂, hN₂, hS₂, hw0⟩
    show ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (u + w) ∧
      ∃ N : Set M, IsOpen N ∧ S₀ ⊆ N ∧ ∀ q ∈ N, (u + w) q = 0
    refine ⟨hu.add hw, N₁ ∩ N₂, hN₁.inter hN₂, Set.subset_inter hS₁ hS₂, ?_⟩
    intro q hq
    simp [hu0 q hq.1, hw0 q hq.2]
  zero_mem' := by
    show ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (0 : M → ℝ) ∧
      ∃ N : Set M, IsOpen N ∧ S₀ ⊆ N ∧ ∀ q ∈ N, (0 : M → ℝ) q = 0
    exact ⟨contMDiff_const, Set.univ, isOpen_univ, Set.subset_univ _, fun q _ => rfl⟩
  smul_mem' := by
    rintro c u ⟨hu, N, hN, hS, hu0⟩
    show ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (c • u) ∧
      ∃ N : Set M, IsOpen N ∧ S₀ ⊆ N ∧ ∀ q ∈ N, (c • u) q = 0
    refine ⟨contMDiff_const.smul hu, N, hN, hS, ?_⟩
    intro q hq
    simp [hu0 q hq]
def fcrHalf (c : E3) (ρ : ℝ) : Set E3 := Metric.ball c ρ ∩ {x : E3 | 0 < x 0}


def fcrSob (c : E3) (ρ : ℝ) (k : ℕ) (φ : E3 → ℝ) (D : List (Fin 3) → E3 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  D [] = φ ∧
  (∀ L : List (Fin 3), L.length ≤ k → MemLp (D L) 2 (volume.restrict (fcrHalf c ρ))) ∧
  (∀ (L : List (Fin 3)) (a : Fin 3), L.length < k →
    ∀ ζ : E3 → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ ζ → HasCompactSupport ζ → tsupport ζ ⊆ fcrHalf c ρ →
      ∫ x, D L x * partialDeriv a ζ x = -∫ x, D (a :: L) x * ζ x)
def fcrMoll (b : ContDiffBump (0 : E3)) (f : E3 → ℝ) (x : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∫ t, b.normed volume (x + (2 * b.rOut) • e 0 - t) * f t
def fcrWD (c : E3) (s : ℝ) (φ : E3 → ℝ) (a : Fin 3) (ψ : E3 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ ζ : E3 → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ ζ → HasCompactSupport ζ → tsupport ζ ⊆ fcrHalf c s →
    ∫ x, φ x * partialDeriv a ζ x = -∫ x, ψ x * ζ x


def fcrProb (c : E3) (s : ℝ) (A : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (w : E3 → ℝ)
    (D : List (Fin 3) → E3 → ℝ) (G : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) (F : E3 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  fcrSob c s 1 w D ∧ (∀ a, MemLp (G a) 2 (volume.restrict (fcrHalf c s))) ∧
  MemLp F 2 (volume.restrict (fcrHalf c s)) ∧
  ∀ ζ : E3 → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ ζ → HasCompactSupport ζ → tsupport ζ ⊆ Metric.ball c s →
    ∫ x in fcrHalf c s,
      ((∑ a : Fin 3, ((∑ b : Fin 3, A x a b * D [b] x) + G a x) * partialDeriv a ζ x)
        + F x * ζ x) = 0


def fcrNormalZ (A : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (D : List (Fin 3) → E3 → ℝ)
    (E : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) (GD : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) (F : E3 → ℝ) (x : E3) : ℝ :=
  (F x
    - (∑ a ∈ ({1, 2} : Finset (Fin 3)),
        ((∑ b : Fin 3, (partialDeriv a (fun y => A y a b) x * D [b] x + A x a b * E a b x))
          + GD a x))
    - (∑ b ∈ ({1, 2} : Finset (Fin 3)),
        (partialDeriv 0 (fun y => A y 0 b) x * D [b] x + A x 0 b * E b 0 x))
    - GD 0 x - partialDeriv 0 (fun y => A y 0 0) x * D [0] x) / A x 0 0
def fdrZT (c : E3) (ρ : ℝ) (U : E3 → ℝ) (G : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ (a : Fin 3) (ζ : E3 → ℝ), ContDiff ℝ ∞ ζ → HasCompactSupport ζ →
    tsupport ζ ⊆ Metric.ball c ρ →
    ∫ x in fcrHalf c ρ, U x * partialDeriv a ζ x = -∫ x in fcrHalf c ρ, G a x * ζ x

def fdrWeakEq (c : E3) (ρ : ℝ) (P : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∀ ζ : E3 → ℝ, ContDiff ℝ ∞ ζ → HasCompactSupport ζ → tsupport ζ ⊆ Metric.ball c ρ →
    (∃ O : Set E3, IsOpen O ∧ {x ∈ Metric.ball c ρ | x 0 = 0} ⊆ O ∧ ∀ x ∈ O, ζ x = 0) →
    ∫ x in fcrHalf c ρ, (∑ a : Fin 3, P a x * partialDeriv a ζ x + f x * ζ x) = 0
def fcrDQ (a : Fin 3) (h : ℝ) (φ : E3 → ℝ) (x : E3) : ℝ := (φ (x + h • e a) - φ x) / h
def fdrProb (c : E3) (s : ℝ) (A : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (w : E3 → ℝ)
    (D : List (Fin 3) → E3 → ℝ) (G : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) (F : E3 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  fcrSob c s 1 w D ∧ fdrZT c s w (fun b => D [b]) ∧
  (∀ a, MemLp (G a) 2 (volume.restrict (fcrHalf c s))) ∧
  MemLp F 2 (volume.restrict (fcrHalf c s)) ∧
  fdrWeakEq c s (fun a x => (∑ b : Fin 3, A x a b * D [b] x) + G a x) F
def atlasInt (h : RiemannianMetric3 M) {n : ℕ}
    (κ : Fin n → PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞)
    (χ : Fin n → M → ℝ) (F : M → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i, ∫ y in (κ i).source, χ i (κ i y) * F (κ i y) * Real.sqrt (h.coeff (κ i) y).det


def IsCLSAtlas (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) (ρA : ℝ) {n : ℕ}
    (κ : Fin n → PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞) (χ : Fin n → M → ℝ) : Prop :=
  2 ≤ ρA ∧ (∀ i, ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (χ i)) ∧ (∀ i p, 0 ≤ χ i p) ∧
  (∀ p, ∑ i, χ i p = 1) ∧ (∀ i, tsupport (χ i) ⊆ (κ i).target) ∧
  (∀ i, IsCompact (tsupport (χ i)) ∨ ∃ j : Fin hAF.numEnds, κ i = (hAF.ends j).Φ ∧
      (∀ y : E3, ρA + 1 ≤ ‖y‖ → χ i ((hAF.ends j).Φ y) = 1) ∧
      (∀ y : E3, 1 < ‖y‖ → ‖y‖ ≤ ρA → χ i ((hAF.ends j).Φ y) = 0))


def clsQ (h : RiemannianMetric3 M) {n : ℕ}
    (κ : Fin n → PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞) (χ : Fin n → M → ℝ)
    (V : M → ℝ) (u w : M → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  8 * atlasInt h κ χ (h.gradInner u w) + atlasInt h κ χ (fun p => V p * u p * w p)


def clsL (h : RiemannianMetric3 M) {n : ℕ}
    (κ : Fin n → PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞) (χ : Fin n → M → ℝ)
    (f : M → ℝ) (w : M → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  atlasInt h κ χ (fun p => f p * w p)
def sclBulk (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) (q : M) (φ : M → ℝ) (S : Set M)
    (t s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ y in chartAt E3 q '' (S ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∩ (chartAt E3 q).source),
    φ ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) *
      (Real.smoothTransition (β ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) / s) *
        sternGaussM g u ((chartAt E3 q).symm y)) *
      sbgbAreaDens (g.coeff (chartAt E3 q).symm) (fun z => u ((chartAt E3 q).symm z)) y
    ∂(MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure (2 : ℝ))


def sclBulkLim (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (u : M → ℝ) (q : M) (φ : M → ℝ) (S : Set M)
    (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ y in chartAt E3 q '' (S ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∩ (chartAt E3 q).source),
    φ ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) * sternGaussM g u ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) *
      sbgbAreaDens (g.coeff (chartAt E3 q).symm) (fun z => u ((chartAt E3 q).symm z)) y
    ∂(MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure (2 : ℝ))


def sclCollar (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) (q : M) (φ : M → ℝ) (S : Set M)
    (t s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ y in chartAt E3 q '' (S ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∩ (chartAt E3 q).source),
    φ ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) *
      (s⁻¹ * deriv Real.smoothTransition (β ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) / s) *
        g.gradInner β (fun x => Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u x)) ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) /
        Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u ((chartAt E3 q).symm y))) *
      sbgbAreaDens (g.coeff (chartAt E3 q).symm) (fun z => u ((chartAt E3 q).symm z)) y
    ∂(MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure (2 : ℝ))


def sclEdge (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) (q : M) (φ : M → ℝ) (S : Set M)
    (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ y in chartAt E3 q '' (S ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∩ β ⁻¹' {0} ∩ (chartAt E3 q).source),
    φ ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) *
      (g.gradInner β (fun x => Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u x)) ((chartAt E3 q).symm y) /
        (Real.sqrt (g.gradInner u u ((chartAt E3 q).symm y)) *
          Real.sqrt (g.gradInner β β ((chartAt E3 q).symm y)))) *
      sbgbEdgeDens (g.coeff (chartAt E3 q).symm) (fun z => u ((chartAt E3 q).symm z))
        (fun z => β ((chartAt E3 q).symm z)) y
    ∂(MeasureTheory.Measure.hausdorffMeasure (1 : ℝ))
def sgbGradSq2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (w : E2 → ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, (h x)⁻¹ a c * pd2 a w x * pd2 c w x


def sgbLevelCurv2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (w : E2 → ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  -((Real.sqrt (h x).det)⁻¹ * ∑ i : Fin 2, pd2 i (fun y => Real.sqrt (h y).det *
      (∑ a : Fin 2, (h y)⁻¹ i a * pd2 a w y) / Real.sqrt (sgbGradSq2 h w y)) x)


def sgbCollarGB {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (ρ : Fin P.n → X → ℝ) (b : X → ℝ) (s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  eigWInt P ρ (fun j x => Real.smoothTransition (b (P.param j x) / s) * gaussCurv2 (P.h j) x) +
  eigWInt P ρ (fun j x => s⁻¹ * deriv Real.smoothTransition (b (P.param j x) / s) *
    Real.sqrt (sgbGradSq2 (P.h j) (fun y => b (P.param j y)) x) *
    sgbLevelCurv2 (P.h j) (fun y => b (P.param j y)) x)


def sgbSideMetric (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (t : ℝ) (x : E2) :
    Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ :=
  fun a b => G (cylPt t (x 0) (x 1)) a.succ b.succ


def sgbSideDef (L : ℝ) (x : E2) : ℝ := L ^ 2 - x 0 ^ 2 - x 1 ^ 2
def sgbSideF (g : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (d : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (y0 y1 : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  let A0 := g 1 1 * y0 - g 0 1 * y1
  let A1 := g 0 0 * y1 - g 0 1 * y0
  let q := g 1 1 * y0 ^ 2 - 2 * g 0 1 * y0 * y1 + g 0 0 * y1 ^ 2
  let X0 := d 0 1 1 * y0 ^ 2 - 2 * d 0 0 1 * y0 * y1 + d 0 0 0 * y1 ^ 2
  let X1 := d 1 1 1 * y0 ^ 2 - 2 * d 1 0 1 * y0 * y1 + d 1 0 0 * y1 ^ 2
  let S := g 0 0 + g 1 1 + y0 * d 0 1 1 - y1 * d 0 0 1 + y1 * d 1 0 0 - y0 * d 1 0 1
  (2 * S - (A0 * X0 + A1 * X1 + 2 * (A0 ^ 2 + A1 ^ 2)) / q) / Real.sqrt g.det
def fvChristoffelVar (G H : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (k i j : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ k l *
    (partialDeriv i (fun z => H z j l) y + partialDeriv j (fun z => H z i l) y
      - partialDeriv l (fun z => H z i j) y)
  - ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ k a * H y a b * christoffel G b i j y


def fvRicciVar (G H : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (j k : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  ∑ i : Fin 3, (partialDeriv i (fvChristoffelVar G H i j k) y
      - partialDeriv j (fvChristoffelVar G H i i k) y)
  + ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3,
      (fvChristoffelVar G H i i p y * christoffel G p j k y
        + christoffel G i i p y * fvChristoffelVar G H p j k y
        - fvChristoffelVar G H i j p y * christoffel G p i k y
        - christoffel G i j p y * fvChristoffelVar G H p i k y)


def fvScalarVar (G H : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  - ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3,
      (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ j a * H y a b * (G y)⁻¹ b k) * ricci G j k y
  + ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ j k * fvRicciVar G H j k y


def fvField (G H : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f : E3 → ℝ) (i : Fin 3) (y : E3) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt (G y).det *
    (f y * (∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ j k * fvChristoffelVar G H i j k y
            - ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i j * fvChristoffelVar G H k k j y)
     - ∑ j : Fin 3, (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ i a * H y a b * (G y)⁻¹ b j
            - (G y)⁻¹ i j * ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ a b * H y a b)
          * partialDeriv j f y)
def sspGood (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (Φ : EndChart M) (β u : M → ℝ) (Y : E3 → E3)
    (R₁ L t σ₀ δ₀ : ℝ) (S : Set M) (P : EigPatchedSurface M S) (ρ : Fin P.n → M → ℝ)
    (Kc : Fin P.n → Set E2) (b : M → ℝ) (js : Fin P.n) : Prop :=
  (∀ i z, 0 ≤ ρ i z) ∧
  (∀ i j, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => ρ i (P.param j x)) (P.W j)) ∧
  (∀ i, IsCompact (Kc i) ∧ Kc i ⊆ P.W i) ∧
  (∀ i, ∀ x ∈ P.W i, x ∉ Kc i → ρ i (P.param i x) = 0) ∧
  (∀ i z, z ∉ P.O i → ρ i z = 0) ∧
  (∀ i, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => b (P.param i x)) (P.W i)) ∧
  IsCompact {z | z ∈ S ∧ 0 ≤ b z} ∧
  IsConnected {z | z ∈ S ∧ 0 ≤ b z} ∧
  (∀ z, z ∈ S → 0 ≤ b z → ∑ i, ρ i z = 1) ∧
  (∀ i, ∀ x ∈ P.W i, b (P.param i x) = 0 →
    fderiv ℝ (fun y => b (P.param i y)) x ≠ 0) ∧
  (∃ z ∈ S, b z = 0) ∧
  (∀ z ∈ S, u z = t ∧ mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) u z ≠ 0) ∧
  {z | z ∈ S ∧ 0 ≤ b z} = sternDomain Φ β Y L ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∧
  0 < σ₀ ∧ 0 < δ₀ ∧ R₁ ^ 2 < L ^ 2 - 2 * δ₀ ∧ σ₀ < δ₀ ∧
  (∀ j (q' : M),
    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => chartAt E3 q' (P.param j x))
      (P.W j ∩ P.param j ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 q').source) ∧
    ∀ x ∈ P.W j ∩ P.param j ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 q').source,
      Function.Injective (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 q' (P.param j y)) x) ∧
      P.h j x = pullMetric2 (g.coeff (chartAt E3 q').symm)
        (fun y => chartAt E3 q' (P.param j y)) x) ∧
  (∀ j, Set.InjOn (P.param j) (P.W j)) ∧
  (∀ j, j ≠ js → ∃ (z : M) (F : E2 → E3), eigSurfParam S z (P.W j) F ∧
    (∀ x ∈ P.W j, P.param j x = (chartAt E3 z).symm (F x)) ∧
    P.h j = pullMetric2 (g.coeff (chartAt E3 z).symm) F) ∧
  (∀ j, ∀ x ∈ P.W j, gaussCurv2 (P.h j) x = sternGaussM g u (P.param j x)) ∧
  P.W js = {x : E2 | L ^ 2 - 2 * δ₀ < x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 ∧ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 < L ^ 2 + δ₀ / 2} ∧
  (∀ x ∈ P.W js, P.param js x = sternPsi Φ Y (cylPt t (x 0) (x 1)) ∧
    P.h js x = sgbSideMetric (pullbackMetric (g.coeff Φ.Φ) Y) t x ∧ σ₀ ≤ β (P.param js x)) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ P.W js, L ^ 2 - δ₀ ≤ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 → b (P.param js x) = sgbSideDef L x) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ P.W js, L ^ 2 - δ₀ ≤ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 → x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 ≤ L ^ 2 →
    ρ js (P.param js x) = 1) ∧
  (∀ z ∈ S, b z < σ₀ → β z < σ₀ ∨
    ∃ x ∈ P.W js, P.param js x = z ∧ L ^ 2 - δ₀ ≤ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2) ∧
  (∀ z ∈ S, β z < σ₀ → (∀ᶠ z' in 𝓝 z, b z' = β z') ∧ ρ js z = 0)
def pcgbPoleRad {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (j₀ : Fin P.n) (x₀ x : E2) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt (∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, P.h j₀ x₀ a c * (x - x₀) a * (x - x₀) c)


structure PcgbGreenData {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X}
    (P : EigPatchedSurface X S) (b : X → ℝ) where
  p₀ : X
  j₀ : Fin P.n
  x₀ : E2
  r : ℝ
  C : ℝ
  U : Set X
  w : X → ℝ
  r_pos : 0 < r
  C_nonneg : 0 ≤ C
  U_open : IsOpen U
  R_sub : {q | q ∈ S ∧ 0 ≤ b q} ⊆ U
  param_x₀ : P.param j₀ x₀ = p₀
  ball_sub : Metric.closedBall x₀ r ⊆ P.W j₀
  ball_pos : ∀ x ∈ Metric.closedBall x₀ r, 2 * r ≤ b (P.param j₀ x)
  smooth : ∀ j, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => w (P.param j x)) (P.W j ∩ P.param j ⁻¹' (U \ {p₀}))
  harm : ∀ j, ∀ x ∈ P.W j, 0 ≤ b (P.param j x) → P.param j x ≠ p₀ →
    lap2 (P.h j) (fun y => w (P.param j y)) x = 0
  dirichlet : ∀ j, ∀ x ∈ P.W j, b (P.param j x) = 0 →
    w (P.param j x) = 0 ∧ fderiv ℝ (fun y => w (P.param j y)) x ≠ 0
  neg : ∀ q ∈ S, 0 < b q → q ≠ p₀ → w q < 0
  pole : ∀ x ∈ Metric.ball x₀ r, x ≠ x₀ →
    |w (P.param j₀ x) - Real.log (pcgbPoleRad P j₀ x₀ x)| ≤ C ∧
    ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => w (P.param j₀ y) - Real.log (pcgbPoleRad P j₀ x₀ y)) x‖ ≤ C ∧
    ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => w (P.param j₀ y) - Real.log (pcgbPoleRad P j₀ x₀ y))) x‖ ≤
      C / pcgbPoleRad P j₀ x₀ x


def pcgbDefect {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (ρ : Fin P.n → X → ℝ) (b w : X → ℝ) (ε s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  eigWInt P ρ (fun j x => Real.smoothTransition (b (P.param j x) / s) * gaussCurv2 (P.h j) x *
    (ε / (sgbGradSq2 (P.h j) (fun y => w (P.param j y)) x + ε)))


def pcgbCollarErr {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (ρ : Fin P.n → X → ℝ) (b w : X → ℝ) (ε s : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  eigWInt P ρ (fun j x => s⁻¹ * deriv Real.smoothTransition (b (P.param j x) / s) *
    (Real.sqrt (sgbGradSq2 (P.h j) (fun y => b (P.param j y)) x) *
        sgbLevelCurv2 (P.h j) (fun y => b (P.param j y)) x -
      ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, (P.h j x)⁻¹ a c * pd2 a (fun y => b (P.param j y)) x *
        pd2 c (fun y => (1 / 2 : ℝ) *
          Real.log (sgbGradSq2 (P.h j) (fun z => w (P.param j z)) y + ε)) x))
def sspSideData (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (Φ : EndChart M) (β u : M → ℝ) (Y : E3 → E3)
    (R₁ L t σ₀ : ℝ) (b ψs : M → ℝ) (Z V Os : Set M) (prs : M → E2) (Kcs : Set E2) : Prop :=
  let Ws : Set E2 := {x : E2 | L ^ 2 - 2 < x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 ∧ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 < L ^ 2 + 1 / 2}
  let ps : E2 → M := fun x => sternPsi Φ Y (cylPt t (x 0) (x 1))
  let hs : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ := sgbSideMetric (pullbackMetric (g.coeff Φ.Φ) Y) t
  let Sg : Set M := sternDomain Φ β Y L ∩ u ⁻¹' {t}
  (0 < σ₀ ∧ σ₀ < 1 ∧ R₁ ^ 2 < L ^ 2 - 2) ∧
  (ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ b ∧ ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ ψs ∧ ∀ z, 0 ≤ ψs z) ∧
  (IsCompact (tsupport ψs) ∧ tsupport ψs ⊆ Os) ∧
  (IsOpen Os ∧ ContinuousOn ps Ws ∧ ContinuousOn prs Os ∧ ps '' Ws = Os ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∧
    (∀ x ∈ Ws, prs (ps x) = x) ∧ Set.InjOn ps Ws) ∧
  (∀ q' : M, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => prs ((chartAt E3 q').symm y))
    ((chartAt E3 q').target ∩ (chartAt E3 q').symm ⁻¹' Os)) ∧
  (∀ q' : M,
    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => chartAt E3 q' (ps x)) (Ws ∩ ps ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 q').source) ∧
    ∀ x ∈ Ws ∩ ps ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 q').source,
      Function.Injective (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 q' (ps y)) x) ∧
      hs x = pullMetric2 (g.coeff (chartAt E3 q').symm) (fun y => chartAt E3 q' (ps y)) x) ∧
  ((∀ a c : Fin 2, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => hs x a c) Ws) ∧ ∀ x ∈ Ws, (hs x).PosDef) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ Ws, u (ps x) = t ∧ mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) u (ps x) ≠ 0 ∧ σ₀ ≤ β (ps x) ∧
    gaussCurv2 hs x = sternGaussM g u (ps x)) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ Ws, L ^ 2 - 1 ≤ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 → b (ps x) = sgbSideDef L x) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ Ws, b (ps x) = 0 → fderiv ℝ (fun y => b (ps y)) x ≠ 0) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ Ws, L ^ 2 - 5 / 4 ≤ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 → ps x ∈ Z) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ Ws, L ^ 2 - 1 ≤ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 → x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2 ≤ L ^ 2 → ψs (ps x) = 1) ∧
  (IsClosed Z ∧ IsOpen V) ∧
  (∀ z ∈ Sg, z ∈ V → z ∈ ps '' Ws ∧ ψs z = 1) ∧
  (∀ z ∈ Sg, z ∉ V → z ∉ Z ∧ z ∉ sternOuterClosed Φ Y L) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ Ws, (0 ≤ b (ps x) ↔ ps x ∈ Sg)) ∧
  (∀ z : M, u z = t → z ∉ Z → (0 ≤ b z ↔ 0 ≤ β z)) ∧
  (∀ z : M, u z = t → z ∉ Z → b z < σ₀ → β z < σ₀) ∧
  (∀ x ∈ Ws, b (ps x) < σ₀ → L ^ 2 - 1 ≤ x 0 ^ 2 + x 1 ^ 2) ∧
  (∀ z : M, β z < σ₀ → (∀ᶠ z' in 𝓝 z, b z' = β z') ∧ ψs z = 0) ∧
  (IsCompact Kcs ∧ Kcs ⊆ Ws ∧ ∀ x ∈ Ws, x ∉ Kcs → ψs (ps x) = 0)

def sspChartData [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (β u : M → ℝ) (t : ℝ)
    (U K : Set M) (m : ℕ) (W : Fin m → Set E2) (pm : Fin m → E2 → M) (pr : Fin m → M → E2)
    (O : Fin m → Set M) (z : Fin m → M) (F : Fin m → E2 → E3) (ψ : Fin m → M → ℝ)
    (Kc : Fin m → Set E2) : Prop :=
  (∀ i : Fin m,
    (IsOpen (W i) ∧ IsOpen (O i) ∧ O i ⊆ U ∧ ContinuousOn (pm i) (W i) ∧
      ContinuousOn (pr i) (O i) ∧ pm i '' W i = O i ∩ u ⁻¹' {t} ∧
      (∀ x ∈ W i, pr i (pm i x) = x) ∧ Set.InjOn (pm i) (W i)) ∧
    (∀ q' : M, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => pr i ((chartAt E3 q').symm y))
      ((chartAt E3 q').target ∩ (chartAt E3 q').symm ⁻¹' O i)) ∧
    (∀ q' : M,
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => chartAt E3 q' (pm i x)) (W i ∩ pm i ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 q').source) ∧
      ∀ x ∈ W i ∩ pm i ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 q').source,
        Function.Injective (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 q' (pm i y)) x) ∧
        pullMetric2 (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (z i)).symm) (F i) x =
          pullMetric2 (g.coeff (chartAt E3 q').symm) (fun y => chartAt E3 q' (pm i y)) x) ∧
    ((∀ a c : Fin 2, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞
        (fun x => pullMetric2 (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (z i)).symm) (F i) x a c) (W i)) ∧
      ∀ x ∈ W i, (pullMetric2 (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (z i)).symm) (F i) x).PosDef) ∧
    (ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (F i) (W i) ∧ ∀ x ∈ W i, F i x ∈ (chartAt E3 (z i)).target ∧
      Function.Injective (fderiv ℝ (F i) x) ∧ pm i x = (chartAt E3 (z i)).symm (F i x)) ∧
    (∀ x ∈ W i, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) u (pm i x) ≠ 0 ∧
      gaussCurv2 (pullMetric2 (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (z i)).symm) (F i)) x =
        sternGaussM g u (pm i x)) ∧
    (∀ x ∈ W i, β (pm i x) = 0 → fderiv ℝ (fun y => β (pm i y)) x ≠ 0) ∧
    (ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (ψ i) ∧ (∀ p, 0 ≤ ψ i p) ∧ IsCompact (tsupport (ψ i)) ∧
      tsupport (ψ i) ⊆ O i) ∧
    (IsCompact (Kc i) ∧ Kc i ⊆ W i ∧ ∀ x ∈ W i, x ∉ Kc i → ψ i (pm i x) = 0)) ∧
  ∀ p ∈ K, 1 ≤ ∑ i, ψ i p
def pcgbTransport {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (j₀ : Fin P.n) (G : E2 → ℝ) : X → ℝ :=
  (P.O j₀ ∩ S).indicator (fun q => G (P.proj j₀ q))
def gfiVec (G H : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (f u : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3) : E3 :=
  (EuclideanSpace.equiv (Fin 3) ℝ).symm (fun a =>
    Real.sqrt (H y).det / Real.sqrt (G y).det *
        (f y * ∑ e : Fin 3, (H y)⁻¹ a e * partialDeriv e u y) -
      u y * ∑ e : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ a e * partialDeriv e f y)
def fplDt (f : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ := fderiv ℝ f p (1, 0)


def fplDs (f : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ := fderiv ℝ f p (0, 1)


def fplV0 (a b w : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ := a p * fplDt w p + b p * fplDs w p


def fplV1 (b c w : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : ℝ := b p * fplDt w p + c p * fplDs w p


def fplCylData (T C₁ : ℝ) (a b c w : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ a {p : ℝ × ℝ | p.1 < T} ∧ ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ b {p : ℝ × ℝ | p.1 < T} ∧
  ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ c {p : ℝ × ℝ | p.1 < T} ∧ ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ w {p : ℝ × ℝ | p.1 < T} ∧
  (∀ p : ℝ × ℝ, p.1 < T →
    a (p.1, p.2 + 2 * Real.pi) = a p ∧ b (p.1, p.2 + 2 * Real.pi) = b p ∧
    c (p.1, p.2 + 2 * Real.pi) = c p ∧ w (p.1, p.2 + 2 * Real.pi) = w p) ∧
  (∀ p : ℝ × ℝ, p.1 < T →
    a p * c p - b p ^ 2 = 1 ∧ 1 / 2 ≤ a p ∧ a p ≤ 2 ∧ |b p| ≤ 2 ∧
    |fplDt a p| ≤ C₁ * Real.exp p.1 ∧ |fplDs a p| ≤ C₁ * Real.exp p.1 ∧
    |fplDt b p| ≤ C₁ * Real.exp p.1 ∧ |fplDs b p| ≤ C₁ * Real.exp p.1 ∧
    fplDt (fplV0 a b w) p + fplDs (fplV1 b c w) p = 0)


def fplH (a w : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ θ in (-Real.pi)..Real.pi, a (t, θ) * w (t, θ) ^ 2


def fplD (a b w : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ θ in (-Real.pi)..Real.pi, w (t, θ) * fplV0 a b w (t, θ)


def fplX (a b w : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ θ in (-Real.pi)..Real.pi, fplV0 a b w (t, θ) ^ 2 / a (t, θ)


def fplY (a w : ℝ × ℝ → ℝ) (t : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∫ θ in (-Real.pi)..Real.pi, fplDs w (t, θ) ^ 2 / a (t, θ)
def pcgbPxQuad (H : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ x : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, H a c * (x - x₀) a * (x - x₀) c

def pcgbPxMu (H M : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) : ℝ :=
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ i : Fin 2, ∑ j : Fin 2, H⁻¹ i j * M j i

def pcgbPxPsi (H M : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ x : E2) : ℝ :=
  (pcgbPxQuad M x₀ x - pcgbPxMu H M * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) * Real.log (pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) / 16

def pcgbPxEik (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (D : E2 → ℝ) (y : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, (h y)⁻¹ a c * pd2 a D y * pd2 c D y - 4 * D y

def pcgbPxJet (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (D : E2 → ℝ) (M : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ)
    (x₀ : E2) (c₀ K : ℝ) (x : E2) : Prop :=
  c₀ * dist x x₀ ^ 2 ≤ D x ∧
  |D x - pcgbPxQuad (h x₀) x₀ x| ≤ K * dist x x₀ ^ 3 ∧
  ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => D y - pcgbPxQuad (h x₀) x₀ y) x‖ ≤ K * dist x x₀ ^ 2 ∧
  ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => D y - pcgbPxQuad (h x₀) x₀ y)) x‖ ≤ K * dist x x₀ ∧
  |pcgbPxEik h D x| ≤ K * dist x x₀ ^ 5 ∧
  ‖fderiv ℝ (pcgbPxEik h D) x‖ ≤ K * dist x x₀ ^ 4 ∧
  |lap2 h D x - 4 - pcgbPxQuad M x₀ x| ≤ K * dist x x₀ ^ 3 ∧
  ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => lap2 h D y - 4 - pcgbPxQuad M x₀ y) x‖ ≤ K * dist x x₀ ^ 2

def pcgbPxPsiEst (H M : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ : E2) (K : ℝ) (x : E2) : Prop :=
  ∑ i : Fin 2, ∑ j : Fin 2, H⁻¹ i j * pd2 i (pd2 j (pcgbPxPsi H M x₀)) x =
    (pcgbPxQuad M x₀ x - pcgbPxMu H M * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) / (2 * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) ∧
  |pcgbPxPsi H M x₀ x| ≤ K * dist x x₀ ^ 2 * (1 + |Real.log (dist x x₀)|) ∧
  ‖fderiv ℝ (pcgbPxPsi H M x₀) x‖ ≤ K * dist x x₀ * (1 + |Real.log (dist x x₀)|) ∧
  ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ (pcgbPxPsi H M x₀)) x‖ ≤ K * (1 + |Real.log (dist x x₀)|) ∧
  ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 3 (pcgbPxPsi H M x₀) x‖ ≤ K / dist x x₀
def cylPhi (x₀ : E2) (P : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (p : ℝ × ℝ) : E2 :=
  x₀ + Real.exp p.1 • (EuclideanSpace.equiv (Fin 2) ℝ).symm
    (fun i => P i 0 * Real.cos p.2 + P i 1 * Real.sin p.2)

def cylA (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x : E2) (i j : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt (h x).det * (h x)⁻¹ i j

def cylM00 (P : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (A00 A01 A11 : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  P 1 1 ^ 2 * A00 - 2 * P 1 1 * P 0 1 * A01 + P 0 1 ^ 2 * A11

def cylM01 (P : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (A00 A01 A11 : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  -(P 1 1 * P 1 0 * A00) + (P 1 1 * P 0 0 + P 0 1 * P 1 0) * A01 - P 0 1 * P 0 0 * A11

def cylM11 (P : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (A00 A01 A11 : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  P 1 0 ^ 2 * A00 - 2 * P 1 0 * P 0 0 * A01 + P 0 0 ^ 2 * A11

def cylRotA (θ m00 m01 m11 : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  Real.cos θ ^ 2 * m00 + 2 * Real.cos θ * Real.sin θ * m01 + Real.sin θ ^ 2 * m11

def cylRotB (θ m00 m01 m11 : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  -(Real.cos θ * Real.sin θ * m00) + (Real.cos θ ^ 2 - Real.sin θ ^ 2) * m01 +
    Real.cos θ * Real.sin θ * m11

def cylRotC (θ m00 m01 m11 : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  Real.sin θ ^ 2 * m00 - 2 * Real.cos θ * Real.sin θ * m01 + Real.cos θ ^ 2 * m11
def pcgbPsiG1 (H M : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ : E2) (j : Fin 2) (y : E2) : ℝ :=
  (∑ c : Fin 2, (M j c - pcgbPxMu H M * H j c) * (y - x₀) c) * Real.log (pcgbPxQuad H x₀ y) / 8 +
  (pcgbPxQuad M x₀ y - pcgbPxMu H M * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ y) * (∑ c : Fin 2, H j c * (y - x₀) c) /
    (8 * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ y)

def pcgbPsiG2 (H M : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ : E2) (i j : Fin 2) (x : E2) : ℝ :=
  (M j i - pcgbPxMu H M * H j i) * Real.log (pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) / 8 +
  (∑ c : Fin 2, (M j c - pcgbPxMu H M * H j c) * (x - x₀) c) * (∑ c : Fin 2, H i c * (x - x₀) c) /
    (4 * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) +
  (∑ c : Fin 2, (M i c - pcgbPxMu H M * H i c) * (x - x₀) c) * (∑ c : Fin 2, H j c * (x - x₀) c) /
    (4 * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) +
  (pcgbPxQuad M x₀ x - pcgbPxMu H M * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) * H j i / (8 * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) -
  (pcgbPxQuad M x₀ x - pcgbPxMu H M * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x) * (∑ c : Fin 2, H i c * (x - x₀) c) *
    (∑ c : Fin 2, H j c * (x - x₀) c) / (4 * pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x ^ 2)
def pcgbBdrPull (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (Ψ : E2 → E2) (z : E2) :
    Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ :=
  Matrix.of fun c d => ∑ c' : Fin 2, ∑ d' : Fin 2,
    fderiv ℝ Ψ z (e2 c) c' * h (Ψ z) c' d' * fderiv ℝ Ψ z (e2 d) d'

def pcgbBdrVec (G : Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ) (Ψ : E2 → E2) (k : Fin 2) (z : E2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ c : Fin 2, fderiv ℝ Ψ z (e2 k) c * G c (Ψ z)
def pcgbJg1 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ : E2) (k : Fin 2) : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ :=
  fun p q => pd2 k (fun y => (h y)⁻¹ p q) x₀

def pcgbJg2 (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ : E2) (k l : Fin 2) :
    Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ :=
  fun p q => pd2 k (pd2 l (fun y => (h y)⁻¹ p q)) x₀

def pcgbJT (H : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (g1 : Fin 2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ)
    (a b c : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  -(1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ p : Fin 2, ∑ q : Fin 2, H p a * g1 c p q * H q b

def pcgbJW (T : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (p a b : Fin 2) : ℝ := T p a b + T a p b + T a b p

def pcgbJU (H : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (g1 : Fin 2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ)
    (g2 : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (a b c d : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  -(1 / 12 : ℝ) * ∑ p : Fin 2, ∑ q : Fin 2,
    (H⁻¹ p q * pcgbJW (pcgbJT H g1) p a b * pcgbJW (pcgbJT H g1) q c d
      + 2 * H p a * g1 b p q * pcgbJW (pcgbJT H g1) q c d
      + 2 * pcgbJW (pcgbJT H g1) p c d * g1 b p q * H q a
      + 2 * H p a * g2 c d p q * H q b)

def pcgbJV (U : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (p b c d : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  U p b c d + U b p c d + U b c p d + U b c d p

def pcgbJD (H : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (g1 : Fin 2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ)
    (g2 : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ x : E2) : ℝ :=
  pcgbPxQuad H x₀ x
  + ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2,
      pcgbJT H g1 a b c * (x - x₀) a * (x - x₀) b * (x - x₀) c
  + ∑ a : Fin 2, ∑ b : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, ∑ d : Fin 2,
      pcgbJU H g1 g2 a b c d * (x - x₀) a * (x - x₀) b * (x - x₀) c * (x - x₀) d

def pcgbJetD (h : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ : E2) : E2 → ℝ :=
  pcgbJD (h x₀) (pcgbJg1 h x₀) (pcgbJg2 h x₀) x₀

def pcgbTay2 (φ : E2 → ℝ) (x₀ y : E2) : ℝ :=
  φ y - φ x₀ - ∑ k : Fin 2, pd2 k φ x₀ * (y - x₀) k
    - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ k : Fin 2, ∑ l : Fin 2, pd2 k (pd2 l φ) x₀ * (y - x₀) k * (y - x₀) l

def pcgbOrd (x₀ : E2) (σ : ℝ) (n : ℕ) (u : E2 → ℝ) : Prop :=
  ∃ c : ℝ, 0 ≤ c ∧ ∀ x : E2, dist x x₀ < σ →
    DifferentiableAt ℝ u x ∧ |u x| ≤ c * dist x x₀ ^ n ∧ ‖fderiv ℝ u x‖ ≤ c * dist x x₀ ^ (n - 1)
def pcgbWsAdm {X : Type*} [TopologicalSpace X] {S : Set X} (P : EigPatchedSurface X S)
    (b : X → ℝ) : Submodule ℝ (X → ℝ) where
  carrier := {u | (∀ j, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => u (P.param j x)) (P.W j)) ∧
    ∃ c : ℝ, 0 < c ∧ ∀ q ∈ S, b q < c → u q = 0}
  add_mem' := by
    rintro u w ⟨hu, c₁, hc₁, hu0⟩ ⟨hw, c₂, hc₂, hw0⟩
    show (∀ j, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => (u + w) (P.param j x)) (P.W j)) ∧
      ∃ c : ℝ, 0 < c ∧ ∀ q ∈ S, b q < c → (u + w) q = 0
    refine ⟨fun j => ?_, min c₁ c₂, lt_min hc₁ hc₂, fun q hq hbq => ?_⟩
    · exact (hu j).add (hw j)
    · show u q + w q = 0
      rw [hu0 q hq (lt_of_lt_of_le hbq (min_le_left _ _)),
        hw0 q hq (lt_of_lt_of_le hbq (min_le_right _ _)), add_zero]
  zero_mem' := by
    show (∀ j, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => (0 : X → ℝ) (P.param j x)) (P.W j)) ∧
      ∃ c : ℝ, 0 < c ∧ ∀ q ∈ S, b q < c → (0 : X → ℝ) q = 0
    exact ⟨fun j => contDiffOn_const, 1, one_pos, fun q _ _ => rfl⟩
  smul_mem' := by
    rintro r u ⟨hu, c, hc, hu0⟩
    show (∀ j, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => (r • u) (P.param j x)) (P.W j)) ∧
      ∃ c : ℝ, 0 < c ∧ ∀ q ∈ S, b q < c → (r • u) q = 0
    refine ⟨fun j => ?_, c, hc, fun q hq hbq => ?_⟩
    · exact contDiffOn_const.mul (hu j)
    · show r * u q = 0
      rw [hu0 q hq hbq, mul_zero]
def pcgbF2P : E3 →L[ℝ] E2 :=
  (EuclideanSpace.proj (0 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).smulRight (e2 0) +
    (EuclideanSpace.proj (1 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).smulRight (e2 1)


def pcgbF2A (A : E2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x : E3) : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
  !![A (pcgbF2P x) 0 0, A (pcgbF2P x) 0 1, 0;
     A (pcgbF2P x) 1 0, A (pcgbF2P x) 1 1, 0;
     0, 0, 1]


def pcgbF2G (G : Fin 2 → E2 → ℝ) : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ :=
  ![fun x => G 0 (pcgbF2P x), fun x => G 1 (pcgbF2P x), fun _ => 0]
def pcgbJv1 (H : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ x : E2) (p : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ b : Fin 2, (H p b + H b p) * (x - x₀) b

def pcgbJv2 (T : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (x₀ x : E2) (p : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ b : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, (T p b c + T b p c + T b c p) * (x - x₀) b * (x - x₀) c

def pcgbJv3 (U : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (x₀ x : E2) (p : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ b : Fin 2, ∑ c : Fin 2, ∑ d : Fin 2,
    (U p b c d + U b p c d + U b c p d + U b c d p) * (x - x₀) b * (x - x₀) c * (x - x₀) d

def pcgbJA1 (g1 : Fin 2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ x : E2) (p q : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  ∑ k : Fin 2, g1 k p q * (x - x₀) k

def pcgbJA2 (g2 : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (x₀ x : E2) (p q : Fin 2) : ℝ :=
  (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ k : Fin 2, ∑ l : Fin 2, g2 k l p q * (x - x₀) k * (x - x₀) l

def pcgbJE5 (Hi : Matrix (Fin 2) (Fin 2) ℝ) (A1 A2 : Fin 2 → Fin 2 → ℝ) (v1 v2 v3 : Fin 2 → ℝ) : ℝ :=
  ∑ p : Fin 2, ∑ q : Fin 2,
    (Hi p q * (v2 p * v3 q + v3 p * v2 q + v3 p * v3 q)
      + A1 p q * (v1 p * v3 q + v3 p * v1 q + v2 p * v2 q + v2 p * v3 q + v3 p * v2 q + v3 p * v3 q)
      + A2 p q * (v1 p * v2 q + v2 p * v1 q + v1 p * v3 q + v3 p * v1 q + v2 p * v2 q
          + v2 p * v3 q + v3 p * v2 q + v3 p * v3 q))

theorem coeff_contDiffOn_source [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M)
    (Φ : PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞) (i j : Fin 3) :
    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => g.coeff Φ x i j) Φ.source :=
by
  
  have hw : ∀ w : E3, w = ∑ a : Fin 3, w a • e a := by
    intro w
    ext k
    simp [e, Pi.single_apply]
  
  have hexp : ∀ (B : E3 →L[ℝ] E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) (D : E3 →L[ℝ] E3) (w1 w2 : E3),
      B (D w1) (D w2) = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, w1 a * w2 b * B (D (e a)) (D (e b)) := by
    intro B D w1 w2
    calc B (D w1) (D w2)
        = B (D (∑ a : Fin 3, w1 a • e a)) (D (∑ b : Fin 3, w2 b • e b)) := by
          rw [← hw w1, ← hw w2]
      _ = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, w1 a * w2 b * B (D (e a)) (D (e b)) := by
          simp only [map_sum, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply,
            ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, Finset.mul_sum]
          conv_lhs => rw [Finset.sum_comm]
          refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun a _ => Finset.sum_congr rfl fun b _ => ?_
          ring
  have hΦ : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ Φ Φ.source := Φ.contMDiffOn_toFun
  apply contDiffOn_of_locally_contDiffOn
  intro x0 hx0
  
  have hu : IsOpen (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source) :=
    hΦ.continuousOn.isOpen_inter_preimage Φ.open_source (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).open_source
  
  have hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y))
      (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source) := by
    have h1 := (contMDiffOn_iff_target.mp hΦ).2 (Φ x0)
    rw [extChartAt_source] at h1
    have h2 := contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp h1
    simpa [extChartAt_coe, Function.comp_def] using h2
  have hmaps : Set.MapsTo (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y))
      (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source) (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).target :=
    fun y hy => (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).map_source hy.2
  
  have hD : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)))
      (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source) :=
    ((contDiffOn_infty_iff_fderiv_of_isOpen hu).mp hF).2
  have hcoord : ∀ k a : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞
      (fun x => (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) x (e k)) a)
      (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source) := by
    intro k a
    have h2 : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) x (e k))
        (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source) := hD.clm_apply contDiffOn_const
    exact (EuclideanSpace.proj a : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).contDiff.comp_contDiffOn h2
  have hG : ∀ a b : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞
      (fun x => g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)) a b)
      (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source) :=
    fun a b => (g.smooth (Φ x0) a b).comp hF hmaps
  have hR : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
      (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) x (e i)) a *
      (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) x (e j)) b *
      g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)) a b)
      (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source) := by
    apply ContDiffOn.sum
    intro a _
    apply ContDiffOn.sum
    intro b _
    exact ((hcoord i a).mul (hcoord j b)).mul (hG a b)
  
  have key : ∀ x ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source,
      g.coeff Φ x i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
      (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) x (e i)) a *
      (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) x (e j)) b *
      g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)) a b := by
    intro x hx
    have hcont : ContinuousAt Φ x :=
      hΦ.continuousOn.continuousAt (Φ.open_source.mem_nhds hx.1)
    have hFdiff : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) x :=
      (hF.contDiffAt (hu.mem_nhds hx)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hFx : chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x) ∈ (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).target := hmaps hx
    have hev : (Φ : E3 → M) =ᶠ[𝓝 x]
        ((chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm ∘ fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) := by
      have hmem : (Φ : E3 → M) ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source ∈ 𝓝 x :=
        hcont.preimage_mem_nhds ((chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).open_source.mem_nhds hx.2)
      filter_upwards [hmem] with y hy
      simp only [Function.comp_apply]
      exact ((chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).left_inv hy).symm
    have hg : MDifferentiableAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm
        (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)) :=
      ((contMDiffOn_chart_symm (n := ∞)).contMDiffAt
        ((chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).open_target.mem_nhds hFx)).mdifferentiableAt (by simp)
    have hfac : ∀ v : E3, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ x v =
        mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x))
          (fderiv ℝ (fun y => chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ y)) x v) := by
      intro v
      rw [hev.mfderiv_eq, mfderiv_comp x hg hFdiff.mdifferentiableAt, mfderiv_eq_fderiv]
      rfl
    have hpt : (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)) = Φ x :=
      (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).left_inv hx.2
    have h1 : g.coeff Φ x i j = g.g (Φ x) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ x (e i))
        (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ x (e j)) := rfl
    have h2 : ∀ a b : Fin 3,
        g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)) a b =
        g.g (Φ x)
          (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)) (e a))
          (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)) (e b)) := by
      intro a b
      show g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x))) _ _ = _
      rw [show g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x))) = g.g (Φ x) from
        congrArg g.g hpt]
    rw [h1, hfac, hfac]
    simp only [h2]
    exact hexp (g.g (Φ x))
      (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x0) (Φ x)))
      _ _
  refine ⟨Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x0)).source, hu,
    ⟨hx0, mem_chart_source E3 (Φ x0)⟩, ?_⟩
  rw [Set.inter_eq_right.mpr Set.inter_subset_left]
  exact hR.congr key

theorem scalarCurvature_eq_scalarCurvatureLocal_coeff [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (Φ : PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞)
    (x : E3) (hx : x ∈ Φ.source) :
    g.scalarCurvature (Φ x) = scalarCurvatureLocal (g.coeff Φ) x :=
by
  
  have hu : ∀ u : E3, u = ∑ d : Fin 3, u d • e d := by
    intro u
    conv_lhs => rw [← (EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin 3) ℝ).sum_repr u]
    simp [EuclideanSpace.basisFun_apply]
  have hcomp_e : ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∀ a : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) a = v a := by
    intro v a
    simp [Pi.single_apply]
  have hcompo : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z → ∀ l d : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z = (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)) d := by
    intro ψ z hψ l d
    have hfun : (fun v => ψ v d) = (EuclideanSpace.proj d : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) ∘ ψ := by
      funext v; simp
    rw [partialDeriv, hfun, fderiv_comp z (EuclideanSpace.proj d).differentiableAt hψ,
      ContinuousLinearMap.fderiv]
    simp
  have dmul : ∀ (f g : E3 → ℝ) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ f z → DifferentiableAt ℝ g z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => f w * g w) z := fun f g z hf hg => hf.mul hg
  have pd_add : ∀ (f g : E3 → ℝ) (z : E3) (l : Fin 3), DifferentiableAt ℝ f z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ g z →
      partialDeriv l (fun w => f w + g w) z = partialDeriv l f z + partialDeriv l g z := by
    intro f g z l hf hg
    simp only [partialDeriv, fderiv_fun_add hf hg, ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply]
  have pd_mul : ∀ (f g : E3 → ℝ) (z : E3) (l : Fin 3), DifferentiableAt ℝ f z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ g z →
      partialDeriv l (fun w => f w * g w) z = partialDeriv l f z * g z + f z * partialDeriv l g z := by
    intro f g z l hf hg
    simp only [partialDeriv, fderiv_fun_mul hf hg, ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply,
      ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
    ring
  have pd_sum : ∀ (f : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) (z : E3) (l : Fin 3), (∀ a, DifferentiableAt ℝ (f a) z) →
      partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, f a w) z = ∑ a : Fin 3, partialDeriv l (f a) z := by
    intro f z l hf
    simp only [partialDeriv, fderiv_fun_sum (fun a _ => hf a), ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply]
  have pd_comp : ∀ (F : E3 → ℝ) (ψ : E3 → E3) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ F (ψ z) → ∀ l : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun w => F (ψ w)) z
        = ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d F (ψ z) * partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z := by
    intro F ψ z hψ hF l
    have h1 : partialDeriv l (fun w => F (ψ w)) z = fderiv ℝ F (ψ z) (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)) := by
      show fderiv ℝ (F ∘ ψ) z (e l) = _
      rw [fderiv_comp z hF hψ]
      rfl
    rw [h1, hu (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)), map_sum]
    simp only [map_smul, smul_eq_mul, hcompo ψ z hψ]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro d _
    rw [mul_comm]
    rfl
  have hpdU : ∀ (U : Set E3), IsOpen U → ∀ f : E3 → ℝ, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f U → ∀ i,
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (partialDeriv i f) U := by
    intro U hU f hf i
    have h1 : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => fderiv ℝ f y) U := hf.fderiv_of_isOpen hU (by simp)
    exact h1.clm_apply contDiffOn_const
  
  have christoffel_contDiffOn : ∀ (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (V : Set E3), IsOpen V →
      (∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => G y i j) V) → (∀ y ∈ V, (G y).det ≠ 0) →
      ∀ k i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (christoffel G k i j) V := by
    intro G V hV hG hdet k i j
    have hdetS : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => (G y).det) V := by
      simp only [Matrix.det_fin_three]
      repeat (first | apply ContDiffOn.sub | apply ContDiffOn.add | apply ContDiffOn.mul | exact hG _ _)
    have hadj : ∀ a b, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => (G y).adjugate a b) V := by
      intro a b
      fin_cases a <;> fin_cases b <;>
        simp only [Matrix.adjugate_fin_three, Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.cons_val', Matrix.cons_val_zero,
          Matrix.cons_val_one, Matrix.cons_val_two, Matrix.empty_val', Matrix.cons_val_fin_one,
          Fin.zero_eta, Fin.mk_one, Fin.reduceFinMk, Fin.isValue] <;>
        repeat (first | apply ContDiffOn.sub | apply ContDiffOn.add | apply ContDiffOn.mul | apply ContDiffOn.neg | exact hG _ _)
    have hinv : ∀ a b, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ a b) V := by
      intro a b
      have : (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ a b) = fun y => ((G y).det)⁻¹ * (G y).adjugate a b := by
        funext y
        rw [Matrix.inv_def, Ring.inverse_eq_inv', Matrix.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
      rw [this]
      exact (hdetS.inv hdet).mul (hadj a b)
    show ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ k l *
      (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) y + partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) y
        - partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) y)) V
    apply ContDiffOn.mul contDiffOn_const
    apply ContDiffOn.sum
    intro l _
    exact (hinv k l).mul
      (((hpdU V hV _ (hG j l) i).add (hpdU V hV _ (hG i l) j)).sub (hpdU V hV _ (hG i j) l))
  
  have pullback_partialDeriv : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (U V : Set E3),
      IsOpen U → IsOpen V → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ ψ U → (∀ z ∈ U, ψ z ∈ V) →
      (∀ a b : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => G y a b) V) → ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ l i j : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) z =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a)) z * G (ψ z) a b *
              partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z +
            partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z *
              (∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d (fun y => G y a b) (ψ z) *
                partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z) * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z +
            partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z * G (ψ z) a b *
              partialDeriv l (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b)) z) := by
    intro ψ G U V hU hV hψ hmaps hG z hz l i j
    have hψd : DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z :=
      (hψ.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hJd : ∀ a k : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v a)) z := by
      intro a k
      exact ((hpdU U hU _ (contDiffOn_euclidean.mp hψ a) k).contDiffAt
        (hU.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hGd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => G y a b) (ψ z) := fun a b =>
      ((hG a b).contDiffAt (hV.mem_nhds (hmaps z hz))).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hGψd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => G (ψ w) a b) z :=
      fun a b => (hGd a b).comp z hψd
    have htd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w *
        G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) z :=
      fun a b => dmul _ _ _ (dmul _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b)) (hJd b j)
    rw [pd_sum _ _ _ (fun a => DifferentiableAt.fun_sum (fun b _ => htd a b))]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro a _
    rw [pd_sum _ _ _ (fun b => htd a b)]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro b _
    rw [pd_mul _ _ _ _ (dmul _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b)) (hJd b j),
      pd_mul _ _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b), pd_comp (fun y => G y a b) ψ z hψd (hGd a b) l]
    ring
  
  have christoffel_pullback_algebra : ∀ (A G Gt : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
      (dG H dGt : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ),
      A.det ≠ 0 → G.det ≠ 0 → (∀ a b, G a b = G b a) → (∀ c i j, H c i j = H c j i) →
      (∀ i j, Gt i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * G a b * A b j) →
      (∀ l i j, dGt l i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        (H a l i * G a b * A b j + A a i * (∑ d : Fin 3, dG d a b * A d l) * A b j
          + A a i * G a b * H b l j)) →
      ∀ c i j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ k l *
          (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j)) =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c l *
          (dG a b l + dG b a l - dG l a b)) * A a i * A b j + H c i j := by
    intro A G Gt dG H dGt hA hG hGs hH hGt hdGt c i j
    have hAu : IsUnit A.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hA
    have hGu : IsUnit G.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hG
    have hGt' : Gt = Matrix.transpose A * G * A := by
      ext i j
      rw [hGt]
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply, Finset.sum_mul]
      rw [Finset.sum_comm]
    have hAB : A * A⁻¹ = 1 := Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv A hAu
    have hGiG : G⁻¹ * G = 1 := Matrix.nonsing_inv_mul G hGu
    have hGtinv : Gt⁻¹ = A⁻¹ * G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGt', Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.transpose_nonsing_inv]
      exact (mul_assoc _ _ _).symm
    have hα : A * Gt⁻¹ = G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGtinv, ← Matrix.mul_assoc, ← Matrix.mul_assoc, hAB, Matrix.one_mul]
    have hα' : ∀ l, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Gt⁻¹ k l = ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * A⁻¹ l b := by
      intro l
      have h1 := congrFun (congrFun hα c) l
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply] at h1
      exact h1
    have hβ : ∀ l, dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j = ∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l *
        (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β)
          + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j) := by
      intro l
      rw [hdGt, hdGt, hdGt]
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three, hH _ j i, hH _ l i, hH _ l j]
      simp only [hGs 1 0, hGs 2 0, hGs 2 1]
      ring
    have eAB : ∀ γ b : Fin 3, A γ 0 * A⁻¹ 0 b + A γ 1 * A⁻¹ 1 b + A γ 2 * A⁻¹ 2 b
        = if γ = b then 1 else 0 := by
      intro γ b
      rw [← Matrix.one_apply, ← hAB, Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    have hcontr : ∀ (u W : Fin 3 → ℝ), ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, u b * A⁻¹ l b) *
        (∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l * W γ) = ∑ b : Fin 3, u b * W b := by
      intro u W
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      linear_combination
        (u 0 * W 0) * (eAB 0 0).trans (if_pos rfl)
        + (u 1 * W 0) * (eAB 0 1).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 2 * W 0) * (eAB 0 2).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 0 * W 1) * (eAB 1 0).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 1 * W 1) * (eAB 1 1).trans (if_pos rfl)
        + (u 2 * W 1) * (eAB 1 2).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 0 * W 2) * (eAB 2 0).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 1 * W 2) * (eAB 2 1).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 2 * W 2) * (eAB 2 2).trans (if_pos rfl)
    have hGG : ∑ a : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * G a b) * H a i j = H c i j := by
      have h2 : ∀ a, ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * G a b = (1 : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) c a := by
        intro a
        rw [← hGiG, Matrix.mul_apply]
        exact Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun b _ => by rw [hGs a b])
      simp only [h2, Matrix.one_apply, ite_mul, one_mul, zero_mul, Finset.sum_ite_eq,
        Finset.mem_univ, if_true]
    calc ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ k l *
            (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j))
        = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Gt⁻¹ k l) *
            (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j) := by
          simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
          ring
      _ = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * A⁻¹ l b) * (∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l *
            (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β)
              + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j)) := by
          simp only [hα', hβ]
      _ = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b *
            (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β b + dG β α b - dG b α β)
              + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a b * H a i j) := by
          rw [hcontr (fun b => G⁻¹ c b) (fun γ => ∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3,
            A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β) + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j)]
      _ = _ := by
          rw [← hGG]
          simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
          ring
  
  have christoffel_law_differentiate : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (U : Set E3), IsOpen U →
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ ψ U → ∀ z₀ ∈ U, ∀ (Γt Γ : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ),
      (∀ k i j, DifferentiableAt ℝ (Γt k i j) z₀) →
      (∀ c a b, DifferentiableAt ℝ (Γ c a b) (ψ z₀)) →
      (∀ z ∈ U, ∀ c i j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c) z * Γt k i j z =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b (ψ z) * partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z *
          partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z + partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) z) →
      ∀ c l i j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c)) z₀ * Γt k i j z₀ +
            partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c) z₀ * partialDeriv l (Γt k i j) z₀) =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
            (∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d (Γ c a b) (ψ z₀) * partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z₀) *
              partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z₀ * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z₀ +
          ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b (ψ z₀) *
            (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a)) z₀ * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z₀ +
              partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z₀ * partialDeriv l (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b)) z₀) +
          partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c))) z₀ := by
    intro ψ U hU hψ z₀ hz₀ Γt Γ hΓt hΓ hlaw c l i j
    have hψd : DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z₀ :=
      (hψ.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz₀)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hJ : ∀ a k : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v a)) U :=
      fun a k => hpdU U hU _ (contDiffOn_euclidean.mp hψ a) k
    have hJd : ∀ a k : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v a)) z₀ :=
      fun a k => ((hJ a k).contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz₀)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hHd : ∀ a k m : Fin 3,
        DifferentiableAt ℝ (partialDeriv k (partialDeriv m (fun v => ψ v a))) z₀ :=
      fun a k m => ((hpdU U hU _ (hJ a m) k).contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz₀)).differentiableAt
        (by simp)
    have hΓψd : ∀ c a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => Γ c a b (ψ w)) z₀ :=
      fun c a b => (hΓ c a b).comp z₀ hψd
    have hev : (fun w => ∑ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c) w * Γt k i j w) =ᶠ[𝓝 z₀]
        (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b (ψ w) * partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w *
          partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w + partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) w) := by
      filter_upwards [hU.mem_nhds hz₀] with w hw
      exact hlaw w hw c i j
    have hEq : partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c) w * Γt k i j w) z₀
        = partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b (ψ w) *
          partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w +
            partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) w) z₀ := by
      exact congrArg (fun L : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ => L (e l)) hev.fderiv_eq
    have hterm : ∀ a b : Fin 3, partialDeriv l (fun w => Γ c a b (ψ w) *
        partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) z₀ =
        (∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d (Γ c a b) (ψ z₀) * partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z₀) *
          partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z₀ * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z₀ +
        Γ c a b (ψ z₀) *
          (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a)) z₀ * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z₀ +
            partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z₀ * partialDeriv l (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b)) z₀) := by
      intro a b
      rw [pd_mul _ _ _ _ (dmul _ _ _ (hΓψd c a b) (hJd a i)) (hJd b j),
        pd_mul _ _ _ _ (hΓψd c a b) (hJd a i), pd_comp (Γ c a b) ψ z₀ hψd (hΓ c a b) l]
      ring
    have htd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => Γ c a b (ψ w) *
        partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) z₀ :=
      fun a b => dmul _ _ _ (dmul _ _ _ (hΓψd c a b) (hJd a i)) (hJd b j)
    have hR : partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b (ψ w) *
          partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w +
            partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) w) z₀ =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
            (∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d (Γ c a b) (ψ z₀) * partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z₀) *
              partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z₀ * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z₀ +
          ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b (ψ z₀) *
            (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a)) z₀ * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z₀ +
              partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z₀ * partialDeriv l (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b)) z₀) +
          partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c))) z₀ := by
      rw [pd_add _ _ _ _ (DifferentiableAt.fun_sum (fun a _ =>
          DifferentiableAt.fun_sum (fun b _ => htd a b))) (hHd c i j),
        pd_sum _ _ _ (fun a => DifferentiableAt.fun_sum (fun b _ => htd a b))]
      rw [Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun a _ => pd_sum _ z₀ l (fun b => htd a b))]
      simp only [hterm, Finset.sum_add_distrib]
    have hL : partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c) w * Γt k i j w) z₀
        = ∑ k : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c)) z₀ * Γt k i j z₀ +
            partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c) z₀ * partialDeriv l (Γt k i j) z₀) := by
      rw [pd_sum _ _ _ (fun k => dmul _ _ _ (hJd c k) (hΓt k i j))]
      apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
      intro k _
      rw [pd_mul _ _ _ _ (hJd c k) (hΓt k i j)]
    rw [← hL, hEq, hR]
  
  have scalar_contraction_algebra : ∀ (A G Gt : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
      (T Tt : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ),
      A.det ≠ 0 → G.det ≠ 0 →
      (∀ i j, Gt i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * G a b * A b j) →
      (∀ c j l i, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Tt k j l i =
        ∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ d : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, T c b d a * A b j * A d l * A a i) →
      ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ j k * ∑ i : Fin 3, Tt i k i j =
        ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, G⁻¹ j k * ∑ i : Fin 3, T i k i j := by
    intro A G Gt T Tt hA hG hGt hT
    have hAu : IsUnit A.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hA
    have hGt' : Gt = Matrix.transpose A * G * A := by
      ext i j
      rw [hGt]
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply, Finset.sum_mul]
      rw [Finset.sum_comm]
    have hBA : A⁻¹ * A = 1 := Matrix.nonsing_inv_mul A hAu
    have hAB : A * A⁻¹ = 1 := Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv A hAu
    have hGtinv : Gt⁻¹ = A⁻¹ * G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGt', Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.transpose_nonsing_inv]
      exact (mul_assoc _ _ _).symm
    have hTt : ∀ k j l i, Tt k j l i = ∑ c : Fin 3, A⁻¹ k c *
        (∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ d : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, T c b d a * A b j * A d l * A a i) := by
      intro k j l i
      have hv : A.mulVec (fun k => Tt k j l i) = fun c =>
          ∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ d : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, T c b d a * A b j * A d l * A a i := by
        funext c
        rw [← hT c j l i]
        rfl
      have h1 := congrFun (congrArg (fun v => A⁻¹.mulVec v) hv) k
      simp only [Matrix.mulVec_mulVec, hBA, Matrix.one_mulVec] at h1
      rw [h1]
      rfl
    have eAB : ∀ d c : Fin 3, A d 0 * A⁻¹ 0 c + A d 1 * A⁻¹ 1 c + A d 2 * A⁻¹ 2 c
        = if d = c then 1 else 0 := by
      intro d c
      rw [← Matrix.one_apply, ← hAB, Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    have hcontr2 : ∀ W : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ,
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ c : Fin 3, A⁻¹ i c * ∑ d : Fin 3, A d i * W c d = ∑ c : Fin 3, W c c := by
      intro W
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      linear_combination
        W 0 0 * (eAB 0 0).trans (if_pos rfl) + W 1 0 * (eAB 0 1).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + W 2 0 * (eAB 0 2).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + W 0 1 * (eAB 1 0).trans (if_neg (by decide)) + W 1 1 * (eAB 1 1).trans (if_pos rfl)
        + W 2 1 * (eAB 1 2).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + W 0 2 * (eAB 2 0).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + W 1 2 * (eAB 2 1).trans (if_neg (by decide)) + W 2 2 * (eAB 2 2).trans (if_pos rfl)
    have hRt : (Matrix.of fun j k => ∑ i : Fin 3, Tt i k i j)
        = Matrix.transpose A * (Matrix.of fun j k => ∑ i : Fin 3, T i k i j) * A := by
      ext j k
      simp only [Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply]
      calc ∑ i : Fin 3, Tt i k i j
          = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ c : Fin 3, A⁻¹ i c * ∑ d : Fin 3, A d i *
              (∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, T c b d a * A b k * A a j) := by
            simp only [hTt]
            simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
            ring
        _ = ∑ c : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, T c b c a * A b k * A a j :=
            hcontr2 (fun c d => ∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, T c b d a * A b k * A a j)
        _ = _ := by
            simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
            ring
    have htr : ∀ X Y : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ,
        ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, X j k * Y j k = Matrix.trace (X * Matrix.transpose Y) := by
      intro X Y
      simp only [Matrix.trace, Matrix.diag, Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply]
    have h1 : Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A = 1 := by
      rw [← Matrix.transpose_mul, hAB, Matrix.transpose_one]
    show ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ j k * (Matrix.of fun j k => ∑ i : Fin 3, Tt i k i j) j k
      = ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, G⁻¹ j k * (Matrix.of fun j k => ∑ i : Fin 3, T i k i j) j k
    rw [htr, htr, hRt, hGtinv]
    set R := Matrix.of fun j k => ∑ i : Fin 3, T i k i j
    calc Matrix.trace (A⁻¹ * G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ *
          Matrix.transpose (Matrix.transpose A * R * A))
        = Matrix.trace (A⁻¹ * G⁻¹ * (Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A) *
            Matrix.transpose R * A) := by
          simp only [Matrix.transpose_mul, Matrix.transpose_transpose, Matrix.mul_assoc]
      _ = Matrix.trace (A⁻¹ * G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose R * A) := by rw [h1, Matrix.mul_one]
      _ = Matrix.trace (A * (A⁻¹ * G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose R)) := by rw [Matrix.trace_mul_comm]
      _ = Matrix.trace (G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose R) := by
          rw [← Matrix.mul_assoc, ← Matrix.mul_assoc, hAB, Matrix.one_mul]
  
  have partialDeriv_comm : ∀ (f : E3 → ℝ) (U : Set E3), IsOpen U → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f U →
      ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j f) z = partialDeriv j (partialDeriv i f) z := by
    intro f U hU hf z hz i j
    have hfz : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ f z := hf.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz)
    have hsymm : IsSymmSndFDerivAt ℝ f z :=
      hfz.isSymmSndFDerivAt (by simpa using (WithTop.coe_le_coe.mpr le_top : (2 : WithTop ℕ∞) ≤ ∞))
    have hd : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fderiv ℝ f) z :=
      (hfz.fderiv_right (m := 1) (by
        rw [one_add_one_eq_two]; exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mpr le_top)).differentiableAt one_ne_zero
    have key2 : ∀ a b : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv a (partialDeriv b f) z = fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ f) z (e a) (e b) := by
      intro a b
      show fderiv ℝ (fun y => fderiv ℝ f y (e b)) z (e a) = _
      rw [fderiv_clm_apply hd (differentiableAt_const _)]
      simp
    rw [key2, key2, hsymm]
  
  have scalarCurvatureLocal_congr : ∀ (G G' : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y : E3),
      G =ᶠ[𝓝 y] G' → scalarCurvatureLocal G y = scalarCurvatureLocal G' y := by
    intro G G' y h
    have hchr : ∀ k i j, christoffel G k i j =ᶠ[𝓝 y] christoffel G' k i j := by
      intro k i j
      filter_upwards [h.eventuallyEq_nhds] with w hw
      have hw0 : G w = G' w := hw.eq_of_nhds
      have hent : ∀ a b i, partialDeriv i (fun z => G z a b) w
          = partialDeriv i (fun z => G' z a b) w := by
        intro a b i
        have : (fun z => G z a b) =ᶠ[𝓝 w] (fun z => G' z a b) :=
          hw.mono (fun z hz => by simp [hz])
        simp only [partialDeriv, this.fderiv_eq]
      simp only [christoffel, hw0, hent]
    have hy0 : G y = G' y := h.eq_of_nhds
    have hval : ∀ k i j, christoffel G k i j y = christoffel G' k i j y :=
      fun k i j => (hchr k i j).eq_of_nhds
    have hder : ∀ l k i j, partialDeriv l (christoffel G k i j) y
        = partialDeriv l (christoffel G' k i j) y := by
      intro l k i j
      simp only [partialDeriv, (hchr k i j).fderiv_eq]
    simp only [scalarCurvatureLocal, ricci, hy0, hval, hder]
  
  have riemann_law_algebra : ∀ (A : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
      (Γt Γ H : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (dΓt dΓ H3 : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ),
      (∀ c i j, H c i j = H c j i) → (∀ l c i j, H3 l c i j = H3 i c l j) →
      (∀ c i j, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Γt k i j =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b * A a i * A b j + H c i j) →
      (∀ c l i j, ∑ k : Fin 3, (H c l k * Γt k i j + A c k * dΓt l k i j) =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (∑ d : Fin 3, dΓ d c a b * A d l) * A a i * A b j +
          ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b * (H a l i * A b j + A a i * H b l j) + H3 l c i j) →
      ∀ c j l i, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * (dΓt l k i j - dΓt i k l j +
          ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γt k l p * Γt p i j - Γt k i p * Γt p l j)) =
        ∑ b : Fin 3, ∑ d : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, (dΓ d c a b - dΓ a c d b +
          ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ c d p * Γ p a b - Γ c a p * Γ p d b)) * A b j * A d l * A a i := by
    intro A Γt Γ H dΓt dΓ H3 hH hH3 hT1 hD c j l i
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three] at hT1 hD ⊢
    linear_combination hD c l i j - hD c i l j
      + Γt 0 i j * hT1 c l 0 + Γt 1 i j * hT1 c l 1 + Γt 2 i j * hT1 c l 2
      - Γt 0 l j * hT1 c i 0 - Γt 1 l j * hT1 c i 1 - Γt 2 l j * hT1 c i 2
      + Γ c 0 0 * A 0 l * hT1 0 i j + Γ c 0 1 * A 0 l * hT1 1 i j + Γ c 0 2 * A 0 l * hT1 2 i j
      + Γ c 1 0 * A 1 l * hT1 0 i j + Γ c 1 1 * A 1 l * hT1 1 i j + Γ c 1 2 * A 1 l * hT1 2 i j
      + Γ c 2 0 * A 2 l * hT1 0 i j + Γ c 2 1 * A 2 l * hT1 1 i j + Γ c 2 2 * A 2 l * hT1 2 i j
      - Γ c 0 0 * A 0 i * hT1 0 l j - Γ c 0 1 * A 0 i * hT1 1 l j - Γ c 0 2 * A 0 i * hT1 2 l j
      - Γ c 1 0 * A 1 i * hT1 0 l j - Γ c 1 1 * A 1 i * hT1 1 l j - Γ c 1 2 * A 1 i * hT1 2 l j
      - Γ c 2 0 * A 2 i * hT1 0 l j - Γ c 2 1 * A 2 i * hT1 1 l j - Γ c 2 2 * A 2 i * hT1 2 l j
      + Γ c 0 0 * A 0 j * hH 0 l i + Γ c 0 1 * A 1 j * hH 0 l i + Γ c 0 2 * A 2 j * hH 0 l i
      + Γ c 1 0 * A 0 j * hH 1 l i + Γ c 1 1 * A 1 j * hH 1 l i + Γ c 1 2 * A 2 j * hH 1 l i
      + Γ c 2 0 * A 0 j * hH 2 l i + Γ c 2 1 * A 1 j * hH 2 l i + Γ c 2 2 * A 2 j * hH 2 l i
      + hH3 l c i j
  
  have key : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (U V : Set E3),
      IsOpen U → IsOpen V → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ ψ U → (∀ z ∈ U, ψ z ∈ V) →
      (∀ a b : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => G y a b) V) →
      (∀ y a b, G y a b = G y b a) →
      (∀ y ∈ V, (G y).det ≠ 0) →
      (∀ z ∈ U, (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) z).det ≠ 0) →
      x ∈ U →
      scalarCurvatureLocal (fun w => Matrix.of fun i j : Fin 3 => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) x
        = scalarCurvatureLocal G (ψ x) := by
    intro ψ G U V hUo hVo hψ hmaps hG hGsym hdetG hdetJ hxU
    have hpd : ∀ f : E3 → ℝ, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f U → ∀ i, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (partialDeriv i f) U := by
      intro f hf i
      have h1 : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => fderiv ℝ f y) U := hf.fderiv_of_isOpen hUo (by simp)
      exact h1.clm_apply contDiffOn_const
    have hψc : ∀ a : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun v => ψ v a) U := by
      intro a
      exact contDiffOn_euclidean.mp hψ a
    have hJ : ∀ a i : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a)) U :=
      fun a i => hpd _ (hψc a) i
    have hGψ : ∀ a b : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun w => G (ψ w) a b) U :=
      fun a b => (hG a b).comp hψ hmaps
    set Gt : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ := fun w => Matrix.of fun i j : Fin 3 =>
      ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w
      with hGt
    have hGt_smooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun w => Gt w i j) U := by
      intro i j
      show ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) U
      apply ContDiffOn.sum
      intro a _
      apply ContDiffOn.sum
      intro b _
      exact ((hJ a i).mul (hGψ a b)).mul (hJ b j)
    have hGt_det : ∀ z ∈ U, (Gt z).det ≠ 0 := by
      intro z hz
      have hm : Gt z = Matrix.transpose (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) z) *
          G (ψ z) * (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) z) := by
        ext i j
        simp only [hGt, Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply, Finset.sum_mul]
        rw [Finset.sum_comm]
      rw [hm, Matrix.det_mul, Matrix.det_mul, Matrix.det_transpose]
      exact mul_ne_zero (mul_ne_zero (hdetJ z hz) (hdetG _ (hmaps z hz))) (hdetJ z hz)
    have hH : ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ c i j : Fin 3, partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) z
        = partialDeriv j (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v c)) z :=
      fun z hz c i j => partialDeriv_comm _ U hUo (hψc c) z hz i j
    
    have hT1 : ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ c i j : Fin 3,
        ∑ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c) z * christoffel Gt k i j z
          = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, christoffel G c a b (ψ z) * partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z *
            partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z + partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) z := by
      intro z hz c i j
      have h8 := pullback_partialDeriv ψ G U V hUo hVo hψ hmaps hG z hz
      have h9 := christoffel_pullback_algebra
        (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) z) (G (ψ z)) (Gt z)
        (fun d a b => partialDeriv d (fun y => G y a b) (ψ z))
        (fun c i j => partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) z)
        (fun l i j => partialDeriv l (fun w => Gt w i j) z)
        (hdetJ z hz) (hdetG _ (hmaps z hz)) (fun a b => hGsym _ a b)
        (fun c i j => hH z hz c i j) (fun i j => rfl) (fun l i j => h8 l i j) c i j
      exact h9
    
    have hΓt : ∀ k i j : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (christoffel Gt k i j) x := fun k i j =>
      ((christoffel_contDiffOn Gt U hUo hGt_smooth hGt_det k i j).contDiffAt
        (hUo.mem_nhds hxU)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hΓ : ∀ c a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (christoffel G c a b) (ψ x) := fun c a b =>
      ((christoffel_contDiffOn G V hVo hG hdetG c a b).contDiffAt
        (hVo.mem_nhds (hmaps x hxU))).differentiableAt (by simp)
    
    have hD := christoffel_law_differentiate ψ U hUo hψ x hxU (christoffel Gt) (christoffel G)
      hΓt hΓ hT1
    have hH3 : ∀ l c i j : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c))) x
          = partialDeriv i (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c))) x :=
      fun l c i j => partialDeriv_comm _ U hUo (hJ c j) x hxU l i
    
    have hT2 := riemann_law_algebra
      (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) x)
      (fun k i j => christoffel Gt k i j x) (fun c a b => christoffel G c a b (ψ x))
      (fun c i j => partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) x)
      (fun l k i j => partialDeriv l (christoffel Gt k i j) x)
      (fun d c a b => partialDeriv d (christoffel G c a b) (ψ x))
      (fun l c i j => partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c))) x)
      (fun c i j => hH x hxU c i j) hH3 (fun c i j => hT1 x hxU c i j) hD
    
    have h12 := scalar_contraction_algebra
      (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) x) (G (ψ x)) (Gt x)
      (fun c b d a => partialDeriv d (christoffel G c a b) (ψ x)
        - partialDeriv a (christoffel G c d b) (ψ x)
        + ∑ p : Fin 3, (christoffel G c d p (ψ x) * christoffel G p a b (ψ x)
          - christoffel G c a p (ψ x) * christoffel G p d b (ψ x)))
      (fun k j l i => partialDeriv l (christoffel Gt k i j) x
        - partialDeriv i (christoffel Gt k l j) x
        + ∑ p : Fin 3, (christoffel Gt k l p x * christoffel Gt p i j x
          - christoffel Gt k i p x * christoffel Gt p l j x))
      (hdetJ x hxU) (hdetG _ (hmaps x hxU)) (fun i j => rfl) hT2
    have hric : ∀ (G' : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y : E3) (j k : Fin 3),
        ricci G' j k y = ∑ i : Fin 3, (partialDeriv i (christoffel G' i j k) y
          - partialDeriv j (christoffel G' i i k) y
          + ∑ p : Fin 3, (christoffel G' i i p y * christoffel G' p j k y
            - christoffel G' i j p y * christoffel G' p i k y)) := by
      intro G' y j k
      simp only [ricci, ← Finset.sum_add_distrib]
    simp only [scalarCurvatureLocal, hric]
    exact h12
  
  
  have h2 : IsOpen (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source) ∧
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w))
        (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source) := by
    have hΦ : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ Φ Φ.source := Φ.contMDiffOn_toFun
    refine ⟨hΦ.continuousOn.isOpen_inter_preimage Φ.open_source
      (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).open_source, ?_⟩
    have hc : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ (chartAt E3 (Φ x))
        (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source := contMDiffOn_chart
    have hcomp := hc.comp (hΦ.mono Set.inter_subset_left) (fun w hw => hw.2)
    exact contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp hcomp
  have hxU : x ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source := ⟨hx, mem_chart_source E3 (Φ x)⟩
  have hψd : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source,
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z := fun z hz =>
    (h2.2.contDiffAt (h2.1.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
  
  have hM1 : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source,
      mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z =
        (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z))).comp
          (fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z) := by
    intro z hz
    have hev : (Φ : E3 → M) =ᶠ[𝓝 z]
        ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm ∘ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w))) := by
      filter_upwards [h2.1.mem_nhds hz] with w hw
      exact ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).left_inv hw.2).symm
    rw [hev.mfderiv_eq, mfderiv_comp z
      (mdifferentiableAt_atlas_symm (chart_mem_atlas E3 (Φ x))
        ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).map_source hz.2)) (hψd z hz).mdifferentiableAt, mfderiv_eq_fderiv]
  have hM1' : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source, ∀ u : E3,
      mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z u =
        mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z))
          (fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z u) := by
    intro z hz u
    rw [hM1 z hz]
    rfl
  
  have s1 : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      g.coeff Φ z i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv i (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) a) z *
          g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) a b *
            partialDeriv j (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) b) z := by
    intro z hz i j
    have hq : (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) = Φ z :=
      (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).left_inv hz.2
    have hgq : g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z))) = g.g (Φ z) :=
      congrArg g.g hq
    obtain ⟨D, hD⟩ : ∃ D : E3 →L[ℝ] E3,
        D = mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) :=
      ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hΦD : ∀ u : E3, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z u =
        D (fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z u) := by
      intro u
      rw [hM1' z hz u, hD]
      rfl
    have hcD : ∀ a b : Fin 3, g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) a b
        = g.g (Φ z) (D (e a)) (D (e b)) := by
      intro a b
      rw [← hgq, hD]
      rfl
    have hJ : ∀ k : Fin 3, fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z (e k)
        = ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) d) z • e d := by
      intro k
      rw [hu (fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z (e k))]
      simp only [hcompo _ z (hψd z hz)]
    simp only [hcD]
    show g.g (Φ z) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z (e i))
      (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z (e j)) = _
    rw [hΦD, hΦD, hJ i, hJ j]
    simp only [map_sum, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply,
      smul_eq_mul]
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  
  have s3 : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source,
      (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) a) z).det
        ≠ 0 := by
    intro z hz hdet
    obtain ⟨v, hv0, hJv⟩ := Matrix.exists_mulVec_eq_zero_iff.mpr hdet
    have hloc := PartialDiffeomorph.isLocalDiffeomorphAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ Φ hz.1
    have hinj : ∀ u : E3, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z u = 0 → u = 0 := by
      intro u hu0
      rw [← hloc.mfderivToContinuousLinearEquiv_coe (by simp)] at hu0
      exact (hloc.mfderivToContinuousLinearEquiv (by simp)).map_eq_zero_iff.mp hu0
    have hw : fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) = 0 := by
      ext a
      rw [map_sum]
      simp only [map_smul]
      have := congrFun hJv a
      simp only [Matrix.mulVec, dotProduct, Matrix.of_apply, Pi.zero_apply,
        hcompo _ z (hψd z hz)] at this
      simp only [WithLp.ofLp_sum, WithLp.ofLp_smul, Finset.sum_apply, Pi.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul,
        WithLp.ofLp_zero, Pi.zero_apply]
      rw [← this]
      apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
      intro i _
      ring
    have h0 : (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) = 0 := by
      apply hinj
      rw [hM1' z hz, hw]
      exact ContinuousLinearMap.map_zero _
    apply hv0
    funext a
    rw [← hcomp_e v a, h0]
    rfl
  
  have s4 : ∀ y ∈ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).target,
      (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y).det ≠ 0 := by
    intro y hy hdet
    obtain ⟨v, hv0, hGv⟩ := Matrix.exists_mulVec_eq_zero_iff.mpr hdet
    obtain ⟨D, hD⟩ : ∃ D : E3 →L[ℝ] E3,
        D = mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hid := (mdifferentiable_chart (I := 𝓘(ℝ, E3)) (Φ x)).comp_symm_deriv hy
    have hinj : ∀ u : E3, D u = 0 → u = 0 := by
      intro u hu0
      have h1 := DFunLike.congr_fun hid u
      have h' : mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)) ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D u)
          = u := by
        rw [hD]
        exact h1
      rw [hu0] at h'
      rw [← h']
      exact ContinuousLinearMap.map_zero _
    have hcD : ∀ a b : Fin 3, g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y a b
        = g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (e a)) (D (e b)) := by
      intro a b
      rw [hD]
      rfl
    have hw0 : (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) ≠ 0 := by
      intro h
      apply hv0
      funext a
      rw [← hcomp_e v a, h]
      rfl
    have hpos := g.posDef ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i))
      (fun h => hw0 (hinj _ h))
    have hG : ∀ a, ∑ b : Fin 3, g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (e a)) (D (e b)) * v b = 0 := by
      intro a
      have := congrFun hGv a
      simp only [Matrix.mulVec, dotProduct, Pi.zero_apply, hcD] at this
      exact this
    have hzero : g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i))
        (D (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i)) = 0 := by
      simp only [map_sum, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply,
        smul_eq_mul]
      calc _ = ∑ a : Fin 3, v a * ∑ b : Fin 3,
            g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (e a)) (D (e b)) * v b := by
            simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]; ring
        _ = 0 := by simp [hG]
    rw [hzero] at hpos
    exact lt_irrefl _ hpos
  
  have hkey := key (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm)
    (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).target
    h2.1 (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).open_target h2.2
    (fun z hz => (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).map_source hz.2)
    (fun a b => g.smooth (Φ x) a b)
    (fun y a b => g.symm _ _ _)
    (fun y hy => s4 y hy)
    (fun z hz => s3 z hz)
    hxU
  have heq : g.coeff Φ =ᶠ[𝓝 x] (fun w => Matrix.of fun i j : Fin 3 => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv i (fun v => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ v) a) w *
        g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) a b *
          partialDeriv j (fun v => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ v) b) w) := by
    filter_upwards [h2.1.mem_nhds hxU] with z hz
    ext i j
    exact s1 z hz i j
  rw [scalarCurvatureLocal_congr _ _ x heq]
  exact hkey.symm

theorem metric_coeff_bounds (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (q : ℝ) (hq : 0 < q)
    (hsmooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => G x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖})
    (hdecay : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ∀ l : ℕ, l ≤ 2 →
      (fun x : E3 => ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l
          (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖)
        =O[Bornology.cobounded E3] fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (-q - (l : ℝ))) :
    ∃ R C : ℝ, 1 ≤ R ∧ 0 ≤ C ∧
      ∀ x : E3, R < ‖x‖ → (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ (G x).det ∧ ∀ i j k : Fin 3,
        |G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q) ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j) x‖ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 1) ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j) y) x‖ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 2) :=
by
  classical
  
  have hconv : ∀ i j : Fin 3, Tendsto (fun x => G x i j) (Bornology.cobounded E3)
      (𝓝 (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)) := by
    intro i j
    have h0 := hdecay i j 0 (Nat.zero_le 2)
    have hv : Tendsto (fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (-q - ((0 : ℕ) : ℝ))) (Bornology.cobounded E3)
        (𝓝 0) := by
      simp only [Nat.cast_zero, sub_zero]
      exact (tendsto_rpow_neg_atTop hq).comp tendsto_norm_cobounded_atTop
    have h1 := h0.trans_tendsto hv
    simp only [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero] at h1
    have h2 : Tendsto (fun x => G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0))
        (Bornology.cobounded E3) (𝓝 0) :=
      tendsto_zero_iff_norm_tendsto_zero.2 h1
    have h3 := h2.add_const (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)
    simp only [sub_add_cancel, zero_add] at h3
    exact h3
  
  have hG : Tendsto G (Bornology.cobounded E3) (𝓝 (1 : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)) := by
    refine tendsto_pi_nhds.2 fun i => tendsto_pi_nhds.2 fun j => ?_
    rw [Matrix.one_apply]
    exact hconv i j
  have hdetT : Tendsto (fun x => (G x).det) (Bornology.cobounded E3) (𝓝 1) := by
    have := ((continuous_id.matrix_det).tendsto (1 : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)).comp hG
    simpa [Function.comp_def, Matrix.det_one] using this
  have hdet : ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3, (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ (G x).det :=
    hdetT.eventually_const_le (by norm_num)
  
  have hbound : ∀ i j l : Fin 3, ∃ c : ℝ, ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3,
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l.val (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖
        ≤ c * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - (l.val : ℝ)) := by
    intro i j l
    obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := (hdecay i j l.val (Nat.lt_succ_iff.1 l.isLt)).bound
    refine ⟨c, hc.mono fun x hx => ?_⟩
    rwa [norm_norm, Real.norm_of_nonneg (Real.rpow_nonneg (norm_nonneg x) _)] at hx
  choose c hc using hbound
  set C : ℝ := ∑ a : Fin 3 × Fin 3 × Fin 3, |c a.1 a.2.1 a.2.2| with hCdef
  have hC : 0 ≤ C := Finset.sum_nonneg fun a _ => abs_nonneg _
  have hcC : ∀ i j l : Fin 3, c i j l ≤ C := fun i j l =>
    (le_abs_self _).trans
      (Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun a : Fin 3 × Fin 3 × Fin 3 => |c a.1 a.2.1 a.2.2|)
        (fun b _ => abs_nonneg _) (Finset.mem_univ (i, j, l)))
  have hunif : ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3, ∀ i j l : Fin 3,
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l.val (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖
        ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - (l.val : ℝ)) := by
    refine Filter.eventually_all.2 fun i => Filter.eventually_all.2 fun j =>
      Filter.eventually_all.2 fun l => ?_
    exact (hc i j l).mono fun x hx =>
      hx.trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hcC i j l) (Real.rpow_nonneg (norm_nonneg x) _))
  
  obtain ⟨r, -, hr⟩ :=
    (Metric.hasBasis_cobounded_compl_closedBall (0 : E3)).eventually_iff.1 (hdet.and hunif)
  refine ⟨max r 1, C, le_max_right _ _, hC, fun x hx => ?_⟩
  have hxr : x ∈ (Metric.closedBall (0 : E3) r)ᶜ := by
    simp only [Set.mem_compl_iff, Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right, not_le]
    exact lt_of_le_of_lt (le_max_left _ _) hx
  obtain ⟨hdx, hux⟩ := hr hxr
  have hx1 : 1 < ‖x‖ := lt_of_le_of_lt (le_max_right _ _) hx
  
  refine ⟨hdx, fun i j k => ⟨?_, ?_, ?_⟩⟩
  · have h := hux i j 0
    change ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 0 (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖
        ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - ((0 : ℕ) : ℝ)) at h
    rw [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero, Real.norm_eq_abs, Nat.cast_zero, sub_zero] at h
    exact h
  · have h := hux i j 1
    change ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 1 (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖
        ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - ((1 : ℕ) : ℝ)) at h
    rw [norm_iteratedFDeriv_one, Nat.cast_one, fderiv_sub_const] at h
    exact h
  · have h := hux i j 2
    change ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 2 (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖
        ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - ((2 : ℕ) : ℝ)) at h
    rw [Nat.cast_ofNat] at h
    refine le_trans ?_ h
    have hU : IsOpen {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := isOpen_lt continuous_const continuous_norm
    have hcd : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ (fun y => G y i j) x :=
      (hsmooth i j).contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hx1)
    have hcd2 : ContDiffAt ℝ 2 (fun y => G y i j) x :=
      hcd.of_le (WithTop.coe_le_coe.2 le_top)
    have hD : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j)) x :=
      (hcd2.fderiv_right (m := 1) (by norm_num)).differentiableAt one_ne_zero
    have hfd : fderiv ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j) y) x
        = (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j)) x).flip (e k) := by
      have h' := hD.hasFDerivAt.clm_apply (hasFDerivAt_const (e k) x)
      rw [ContinuousLinearMap.comp_zero, zero_add] at h'
      exact h'.fderiv
    rw [hfd]
    have hconst : fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)
        = fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j) := by
      funext y
      exact fderiv_sub_const _
    have h12 := norm_iteratedFDeriv_fderiv (𝕜 := ℝ)
      (f := fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) (x := x) (n := 1)
    rw [hconst, norm_iteratedFDeriv_one] at h12
    calc ‖(fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j)) x).flip (e k)‖
        ≤ ‖(fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j)) x).flip‖ * ‖e k‖ :=
          ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _
      _ = ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j)) x‖ := by
          rw [ContinuousLinearMap.opNorm_flip]
          simp [e, EuclideanSpace.norm_single]
      _ = ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 2 (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖ := h12

theorem inv3_entry_bounds (A : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (B ε : ℝ)
    (hdet : (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ A.det)
    (hB : ∀ i j : Fin 3, |A i j| ≤ B)
    (hε : ∀ i j : Fin 3, |A i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ ε) :
    ∀ k l : Fin 3, |A⁻¹ k l| ≤ 4 * B ^ 2 ∧
      |A⁻¹ k l - (if k = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 12 * B ^ 2 * ε :=
by
  have hB0 : 0 ≤ B := (abs_nonneg _).trans (hB 0 0)
  have hdpos : 0 < A.det := by linarith
  have hdne : A.det ≠ 0 := ne_of_gt hdpos
  have hinvpos : 0 < (A.det)⁻¹ := inv_pos.mpr hdpos
  have hinv2 : (A.det)⁻¹ ≤ 2 := by
    rw [inv_le_comm₀ hdpos (by norm_num)]
    linarith
  have aux : ∀ x y z w : ℝ, |x| ≤ B → |y| ≤ B → |z| ≤ B → |w| ≤ B →
      |x * y - z * w| ≤ 2 * B ^ 2 := by
    intro x y z w hx hy hz hw
    have h1 : |x * y| ≤ B * B := by
      rw [abs_mul]; exact mul_le_mul hx hy (abs_nonneg _) hB0
    have h2 : |z * w| ≤ B * B := by
      rw [abs_mul]; exact mul_le_mul hz hw (abs_nonneg _) hB0
    have h1' := abs_le.mp h1
    have h2' := abs_le.mp h2
    rw [abs_le]
    constructor <;> nlinarith [h1'.1, h1'.2, h2'.1, h2'.2]
  have aux' : ∀ x y z w : ℝ, |x| ≤ B → |y| ≤ B → |z| ≤ B → |w| ≤ B →
      |-(x * y) + z * w| ≤ 2 * B ^ 2 := by
    intro x y z w hx hy hz hw
    rw [neg_add_eq_sub]
    exact aux z w x y hz hw hx hy
  have hadj : ∀ k l : Fin 3, |A.adjugate k l| ≤ 2 * B ^ 2 := by
    intro k l
    rw [Matrix.adjugate_fin_three]
    fin_cases k <;> fin_cases l <;> simp <;>
      first
        | exact aux _ _ _ _ (hB _ _) (hB _ _) (hB _ _) (hB _ _)
        | exact aux' _ _ _ _ (hB _ _) (hB _ _) (hB _ _) (hB _ _)
  have hentry : ∀ k l : Fin 3, A⁻¹ k l = (A.det)⁻¹ * A.adjugate k l := by
    intro k l
    rw [Matrix.inv_def, Ring.inverse_eq_inv', Matrix.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
  have ha : ∀ k l : Fin 3, |A⁻¹ k l| ≤ 4 * B ^ 2 := by
    intro k l
    rw [hentry, abs_mul, abs_of_pos hinvpos]
    have := mul_le_mul hinv2 (hadj k l) (abs_nonneg _) (by norm_num)
    linarith
  have hPA : A⁻¹ * A = 1 := Matrix.nonsing_inv_mul A (isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hdne)
  intro k l
  refine ⟨ha k l, ?_⟩
  have h := congrFun (congrFun hPA k) l
  rw [Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_three, Matrix.one_apply] at h
  have hd : A⁻¹ k 0 * (if (0 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0)
      + A⁻¹ k 1 * (if (1 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0)
      + A⁻¹ k 2 * (if (2 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) = A⁻¹ k l := by
    fin_cases l <;> simp
  have key : A⁻¹ k l - (if k = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0)
      = A⁻¹ k 0 * ((if (0 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - A 0 l)
        + A⁻¹ k 1 * ((if (1 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - A 1 l)
        + A⁻¹ k 2 * ((if (2 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - A 2 l) := by
    linear_combination h - hd
  have hterm : ∀ m : Fin 3,
      |A⁻¹ k m * ((if m = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - A m l)| ≤ 4 * B ^ 2 * ε := by
    intro m
    rw [abs_mul, abs_sub_comm]
    exact mul_le_mul (ha k m) (hε m l) (abs_nonneg _) (by positivity)
  rw [key]
  have h3 := abs_add_three (A⁻¹ k 0 * ((if (0 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - A 0 l))
    (A⁻¹ k 1 * ((if (1 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - A 1 l))
    (A⁻¹ k 2 * ((if (2 : Fin 3) = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - A 2 l))
  have t0 := hterm 0
  have t1 := hterm 1
  have t2 := hterm 2
  linarith

theorem inv_entry_partialDeriv (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (x : E3)
    (hG : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => G y a b) x)
    (hdet : (G x).det ≠ 0) (m : Fin 3) :
    ∀ k l : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x ∧
      partialDeriv m (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x =
        -∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          (G x)⁻¹ k a * partialDeriv m (fun y => G y a b) x * (G x)⁻¹ b l :=
by
  have hdetD : ∀ H : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ,
      (∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => H y a b) x) →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => (H y).det) x := by
    intro H hH
    have hfun : (fun y => (H y).det) = fun y =>
        H y 0 0 * H y 1 1 * H y 2 2 - H y 0 0 * H y 1 2 * H y 2 1
        - H y 0 1 * H y 1 0 * H y 2 2 + H y 0 1 * H y 1 2 * H y 2 0
        + H y 0 2 * H y 1 0 * H y 2 1 - H y 0 2 * H y 1 1 * H y 2 0 := by
      funext y; exact Matrix.det_fin_three (H y)
    rw [hfun]
    have h00 := hH 0 0
    have h01 := hH 0 1
    have h02 := hH 0 2
    have h10 := hH 1 0
    have h11 := hH 1 1
    have h12 := hH 1 2
    have h20 := hH 2 0
    have h21 := hH 2 1
    have h22 := hH 2 2
    fun_prop
  have hD : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => (G y).det) x := hdetD G hG
  have hP : ∀ k l : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x := by
    intro k l
    have hfun : (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) =
        fun y => ((G y).det)⁻¹ * ((G y).updateRow l (Pi.single k 1)).det := by
      funext y
      rw [Matrix.inv_def, Matrix.smul_apply, Matrix.adjugate_apply, Ring.inverse_eq_inv,
        smul_eq_mul]
    rw [hfun]
    refine (hD.inv hdet).mul (hdetD _ ?_)
    intro a b
    by_cases hal : a = l
    · subst hal
      simp only [Matrix.updateRow_self]
      exact differentiableAt_const _
    · simp only [Matrix.updateRow_ne hal]
      exact hG a b
  have hev : ∀ᶠ y in 𝓝 x, (G y).det ≠ 0 := hD.continuousAt.eventually_ne hdet
  have hE : ∀ a l : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, G x a b * partialDeriv m (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ b l) x
      + ∑ b : Fin 3, partialDeriv m (fun y => G y a b) x * (G x)⁻¹ b l = 0 := by
    intro a l
    have h1 : HasFDerivAt (fun y => ∑ b : Fin 3, G y a b * (G y)⁻¹ b l)
        (∑ b : Fin 3, (G x a b • fderiv ℝ (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ b l) x
          + (G x)⁻¹ b l • fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y a b) x)) x := by
      have hs := HasFDerivAt.sum (u := Finset.univ)
        (A := fun b y => G y a b * (G y)⁻¹ b l)
        (fun b _ => (hG a b).hasFDerivAt.mul (hP b l).hasFDerivAt)
      convert hs using 1
    have h2 : HasFDerivAt (fun y => ∑ b : Fin 3, G y a b * (G y)⁻¹ b l)
        (0 : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) x := by
      apply (hasFDerivAt_const (if a = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x).congr_of_eventuallyEq
      filter_upwards [hev] with y hy
      have := congrFun (congrFun (Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv (G y) (isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hy)) a) l
      rw [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.one_apply] at this
      exact this
    have h3 := congrArg (fun L : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ => L (e m)) (h1.unique h2)
    simp only [ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply,
      ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, ContinuousLinearMap.zero_apply] at h3
    unfold partialDeriv
    rw [← h3, ← Finset.sum_add_distrib]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro b _
    ring
  intro k l
  refine ⟨hP k l, ?_⟩
  let X : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
    Matrix.of fun b l => partialDeriv m (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ b l) x
  let D : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
    Matrix.of fun a b => partialDeriv m (fun y => G y a b) x
  have hM : G x * X = -(D * (G x)⁻¹) := by
    ext a l'
    rw [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.neg_apply, Matrix.mul_apply, eq_neg_iff_add_eq_zero]
    simp only [X, D, Matrix.of_apply]
    exact hE a l'
  have hX : X = -((G x)⁻¹ * (D * (G x)⁻¹)) := by
    calc X = ((G x)⁻¹ * G x) * X := by
          rw [Matrix.nonsing_inv_mul _ (isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hdet), Matrix.one_mul]
      _ = (G x)⁻¹ * (G x * X) := Matrix.mul_assoc _ _ _
      _ = _ := by rw [hM, Matrix.mul_neg]
  have hkl := congrFun (congrFun hX k) l
  simp only [X, D, Matrix.of_apply, Matrix.neg_apply, Matrix.mul_apply] at hkl
  rw [hkl]
  congr 1
  apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
  intro a _
  rw [Finset.mul_sum]
  apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
  intro b _
  ring

theorem christoffel_partialDeriv_formula (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (x : E3)
    (hP : ∀ k l : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x)
    (hdG : ∀ c a b : Fin 3,
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b) y) x)
    (m k i j : Fin 3) :
    partialDeriv m (christoffel G k i j) x =
      (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3,
        (partialDeriv m (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x *
            (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) x + partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) x
              - partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) x)
          + (G x)⁻¹ k l *
            (partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) y) x
              + partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) y) x
              - partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) y) x)) :=
by
  have hT : ∀ l ∈ (Finset.univ : Finset (Fin 3)), HasFDerivAt (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l *
      (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) y + partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) y
        - partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) y))
      ((G x)⁻¹ k l • (fderiv ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) y) x
          + fderiv ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) y) x
          - fderiv ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) y) x)
        + (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) x + partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) x
          - partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) x) • fderiv ℝ (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x) x := by
    intro l _
    exact (hP k l).hasFDerivAt.fun_mul
      (((hdG i j l).hasFDerivAt.fun_add (hdG j i l).hasFDerivAt).fun_sub (hdG l i j).hasFDerivAt)
  have hS := (HasFDerivAt.fun_sum hT).const_mul (1 / 2 : ℝ)
  have hD : HasFDerivAt (christoffel G k i j) _ x := hS
  show fderiv ℝ (christoffel G k i j) x (e m) = _
  rw [hD.fderiv]
  simp only [ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply,
    ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.sub_apply, smul_eq_mul]
  unfold partialDeriv
  congr 1
  refine Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun l _ => ?_)
  ring

theorem christoffel_value_bounds (P : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
    (dP : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (d1 : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ)
    (d2 : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (b e p α β : ℝ)
    (hPb : ∀ k l : Fin 3, |P k l| ≤ b)
    (hPe : ∀ k l : Fin 3, |P k l - (if k = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ e)
    (hdP : ∀ m k l : Fin 3, |dP m k l| ≤ p)
    (hd1 : ∀ c a b' : Fin 3, |d1 c a b'| ≤ α)
    (hd2 : ∀ m c a b' : Fin 3, |d2 m c a b'| ≤ β) (m k i j : Fin 3) :
    |(1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, P k l * (d1 i j l + d1 j i l - d1 l i j)| ≤ 9 / 2 * b * α ∧
    |(1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (dP m k l * (d1 i j l + d1 j i l - d1 l i j)
        + P k l * (d2 m i j l + d2 m j i l - d2 m l i j))
      - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (d2 m i j k + d2 m j i k - d2 m k i j)| ≤ 9 / 2 * (p * α + e * β) :=
by
  have hb0 : 0 ≤ b := (abs_nonneg _).trans (hPb 0 0)
  have he0 : 0 ≤ e := (abs_nonneg _).trans (hPe 0 0)
  have hp0 : 0 ≤ p := (abs_nonneg _).trans (hdP 0 0 0)
  have hYb : ∀ l : Fin 3, |d1 i j l + d1 j i l - d1 l i j| ≤ 3 * α := by
    intro l
    have h1 := abs_le.mp (hd1 i j l)
    have h2 := abs_le.mp (hd1 j i l)
    have h3 := abs_le.mp (hd1 l i j)
    exact abs_le.mpr ⟨by linarith, by linarith⟩
  have hXb : ∀ l : Fin 3, |d2 m i j l + d2 m j i l - d2 m l i j| ≤ 3 * β := by
    intro l
    have h1 := abs_le.mp (hd2 m i j l)
    have h2 := abs_le.mp (hd2 m j i l)
    have h3 := abs_le.mp (hd2 m l i j)
    exact abs_le.mpr ⟨by linarith, by linarith⟩
  have hA : ∀ l : Fin 3, |P k l * (d1 i j l + d1 j i l - d1 l i j)| ≤ b * (3 * α) := by
    intro l
    rw [abs_mul]
    exact mul_le_mul (hPb k l) (hYb l) (abs_nonneg _) hb0
  have hC : ∀ l : Fin 3, |dP m k l * (d1 i j l + d1 j i l - d1 l i j)| ≤ p * (3 * α) := by
    intro l
    rw [abs_mul]
    exact mul_le_mul (hdP m k l) (hYb l) (abs_nonneg _) hp0
  have hB : ∀ l : Fin 3, |(P k l - (if k = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0)) *
      (d2 m i j l + d2 m j i l - d2 m l i j)| ≤ e * (3 * β) := by
    intro l
    rw [abs_mul]
    exact mul_le_mul (hPe k l) (hXb l) (abs_nonneg _) he0
  refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
  · rw [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    have h0 := abs_le.mp (hA 0)
    have h1 := abs_le.mp (hA 1)
    have h2 := abs_le.mp (hA 2)
    rw [abs_le]
    constructor <;> linarith [h0.1, h0.2, h1.1, h1.2, h2.1, h2.2]
  · have hδ : (∑ l : Fin 3, (if k = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0) *
        (d2 m i j l + d2 m j i l - d2 m l i j)) = d2 m i j k + d2 m j i k - d2 m k i j := by
      simp [ite_mul]
    rw [← hδ, Fin.sum_univ_three, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    have h0 := abs_le.mp (hB 0)
    have h1 := abs_le.mp (hB 1)
    have h2 := abs_le.mp (hB 2)
    have c0 := abs_le.mp (hC 0)
    have c1 := abs_le.mp (hC 1)
    have c2 := abs_le.mp (hC 2)
    rw [abs_le]
    constructor <;> linarith [h0.1, h0.2, h1.1, h1.2, h2.1, h2.2, c0.1, c0.2, c1.1, c1.2, c2.1, c2.2]

theorem scalar_trace_algebra (P : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
    (Γ : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (dΓ : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ)
    (dd : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (e g t β : ℝ)
    (hP : ∀ j k : Fin 3, |P j k - (if j = k then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ e)
    (hΓ : ∀ k i j : Fin 3, |Γ k i j| ≤ g)
    (hdΓ : ∀ m k i j : Fin 3,
      |dΓ m k i j - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd m i j k + dd m j i k - dd m k i j)| ≤ t)
    (hdd : ∀ m a b c : Fin 3, |dd m a b c| ≤ β)
    (hsym : ∀ m a b c : Fin 3, dd m a b c = dd m a c b) :
    |∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, P j k *
        (∑ i : Fin 3, (dΓ i i j k - dΓ j i i k)
          + ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k))
      - ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (dd j i i j - dd j j i i)|
      ≤ 3 * (6 * t + 18 * g ^ 2) + 9 * e * (9 * β + 6 * t + 18 * g ^ 2) :=
by
  have he : 0 ≤ e := le_trans (abs_nonneg _) (hP 0 0)
  have hg : 0 ≤ g := le_trans (abs_nonneg _) (hΓ 0 0 0)
  
  have key : ∀ (X L : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (D a M : ℝ),
      (∀ j k : Fin 3, |X j k - L j k| ≤ a) → (∀ j k : Fin 3, |L j k| ≤ M) →
      ∑ j : Fin 3, L j j = D →
      |∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, P j k * X j k - D| ≤ 3 * a + 9 * e * (M + a) := by
    intro X L D a M hXL hL htr
    subst htr
    have hX : ∀ j k : Fin 3, |X j k| ≤ M + a := by
      intro j k
      have h1 := abs_add_le (L j k) (X j k - L j k)
      have h2 : L j k + (X j k - L j k) = X j k := by ring
      rw [h2] at h1
      linarith [hL j k, hXL j k]
    have hoff : ∀ j k : Fin 3, j ≠ k → |P j k * X j k| ≤ e * (M + a) := by
      intro j k hjk
      have h := hP j k
      rw [if_neg hjk, sub_zero] at h
      rw [abs_mul]
      exact mul_le_mul h (hX j k) (abs_nonneg _) he
    have hdiag : ∀ j : Fin 3, |P j j * X j j - X j j| ≤ e * (M + a) := by
      intro j
      have h := hP j j
      rw [if_pos rfl] at h
      have h2 : P j j * X j j - X j j = (P j j - 1) * X j j := by ring
      rw [h2, abs_mul]
      exact mul_le_mul h (hX j j) (abs_nonneg _) he
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    have o01 := abs_le.mp (hoff 0 1 (by decide))
    have o02 := abs_le.mp (hoff 0 2 (by decide))
    have o10 := abs_le.mp (hoff 1 0 (by decide))
    have o12 := abs_le.mp (hoff 1 2 (by decide))
    have o20 := abs_le.mp (hoff 2 0 (by decide))
    have o21 := abs_le.mp (hoff 2 1 (by decide))
    have d0 := abs_le.mp (hdiag 0)
    have d1 := abs_le.mp (hdiag 1)
    have d2 := abs_le.mp (hdiag 2)
    have x0 := abs_le.mp (hXL 0 0)
    have x1 := abs_le.mp (hXL 1 1)
    have x2 := abs_le.mp (hXL 2 2)
    rw [abs_le]
    constructor
    · linarith [o01.1, o02.1, o10.1, o12.1, o20.1, o21.1, d0.1, d1.1, d2.1, x0.1, x1.1, x2.1]
    · linarith [o01.2, o02.2, o10.2, o12.2, o20.2, o21.2, d0.2, d1.2, d2.2, x0.2, x1.2, x2.2]
  
  have hXL : ∀ j k : Fin 3,
      |(∑ i : Fin 3, (dΓ i i j k - dΓ j i i k)
          + ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k))
        - ∑ i : Fin 3, ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k)
          - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k))| ≤ 6 * t + 18 * g ^ 2 := by
    intro j k
    have hprod : ∀ a b c d f h : Fin 3, |Γ a b c * Γ d f h| ≤ g ^ 2 := by
      intro a b c d f h
      rw [abs_mul, sq]
      exact mul_le_mul (hΓ a b c) (hΓ d f h) (abs_nonneg _) hg
    have h1 : |∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k)|
        ≤ 18 * g ^ 2 := by
      calc |∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k)|
          ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, |∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k)| :=
            Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _
        _ ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, |Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k| :=
            Finset.sum_le_sum fun i _ => Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _
        _ ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (2 * g ^ 2) := by
            apply Finset.sum_le_sum; intro i _; apply Finset.sum_le_sum; intro p _
            have u := abs_le.mp (hprod i i p p j k)
            have v := abs_le.mp (hprod i j p p i k)
            rw [abs_le]; constructor <;> linarith [u.1, u.2, v.1, v.2]
        _ = 18 * g ^ 2 := by simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]; ring
    have h2 : |∑ i : Fin 3,
          ((dΓ i i j k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k))
            - (dΓ j i i k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k)))|
        ≤ 6 * t := by
      calc |∑ i : Fin 3,
            ((dΓ i i j k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k))
              - (dΓ j i i k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k)))|
          ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3,
            |(dΓ i i j k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k))
              - (dΓ j i i k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k))| :=
            Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _
        _ ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, (2 * t) := by
            apply Finset.sum_le_sum; intro i _
            have u := abs_le.mp (hdΓ i i j k)
            have v := abs_le.mp (hdΓ j i i k)
            rw [abs_le]; constructor <;> linarith [u.1, u.2, v.1, v.2]
        _ = 6 * t := by simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]; ring
    have heq : (∑ i : Fin 3, (dΓ i i j k - dΓ j i i k)
          + ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k))
        - ∑ i : Fin 3, ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k)
          - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k))
        = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k)
          + ∑ i : Fin 3,
          ((dΓ i i j k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k))
            - (dΓ j i i k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k))) := by
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]; ring
    rw [heq]
    have h3 := abs_add_le (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k))
      (∑ i : Fin 3,
          ((dΓ i i j k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k))
            - (dΓ j i i k - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k))))
    linarith
  
  have hLb : ∀ j k : Fin 3,
      |∑ i : Fin 3, ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k)
          - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k))| ≤ 9 * β := by
    intro j k
    calc |∑ i : Fin 3, ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k)
          - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k))|
        ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, |(1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k)
          - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k)| :=
          Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _
      _ ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, (3 * β) := by
          apply Finset.sum_le_sum; intro i _
          have u1 := abs_le.mp (hdd i j k i)
          have u2 := abs_le.mp (hdd i k j i)
          have u3 := abs_le.mp (hdd i i j k)
          have v1 := abs_le.mp (hdd j i k i)
          have v2 := abs_le.mp (hdd j k i i)
          have v3 := abs_le.mp (hdd j i i k)
          rw [abs_le]; constructor
          · linarith [u1.1, u1.2, u2.1, u2.2, u3.1, u3.2, v1.1, v1.2, v2.1, v2.2, v3.1, v3.2]
          · linarith [u1.1, u1.2, u2.1, u2.2, u3.1, u3.2, v1.1, v1.2, v2.1, v2.2, v3.1, v3.2]
      _ = 9 * β := by simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]; ring
  
  have htr : ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ i : Fin 3,
      ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j j i + dd i j j i - dd i i j j)
        - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i j i + dd j j i i - dd j i i j))
      = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (dd j i i j - dd j j i i) := by
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    linarith [hsym 0 0 0 0, hsym 0 1 0 1, hsym 0 2 0 2, hsym 1 0 1 0, hsym 1 1 1 1,
      hsym 1 2 1 2, hsym 2 0 2 0, hsym 2 1 2 1, hsym 2 2 2 2]
  have h := key
    (fun j k => ∑ i : Fin 3, (dΓ i i j k - dΓ j i i k)
      + ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ p : Fin 3, (Γ i i p * Γ p j k - Γ i j p * Γ p i k))
    (fun j k => ∑ i : Fin 3, ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd i j k i + dd i k j i - dd i i j k)
      - (1 / 2 : ℝ) * (dd j i k i + dd j k i i - dd j i i k)))
    (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (dd j i i j - dd j j i i)) (6 * t + 18 * g ^ 2) (9 * β)
    hXL hLb htr
  have e2 : 3 * (6 * t + 18 * g ^ 2) + 9 * e * (9 * β + (6 * t + 18 * g ^ 2))
      = 3 * (6 * t + 18 * g ^ 2) + 9 * e * (9 * β + 6 * t + 18 * g ^ 2) := by ring
  exact h.trans (le_of_eq e2)

theorem scalar_curvature_div_decomp (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (q : ℝ) (hq : 0 < q)
    (hsmooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => G x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖})
    (hsymm : ∀ (x : E3) (i j : Fin 3), G x i j = G x j i)
    (R C : ℝ) (hR : 1 ≤ R) (hC : 0 ≤ C)
    (hb : ∀ x : E3, R < ‖x‖ → (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ (G x).det ∧ ∀ i j k : Fin 3,
        |G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q) ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j) x‖ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 1) ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j) y) x‖ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 2)) :
    ∃ R₀ C₀ : ℝ, ∀ x : E3, R₀ < ‖x‖ →
      |scalarCurvatureLocal G x - fluxDivLocal G x| ≤ C₀ * ‖x‖ ^ (-2 * q - 2) :=
by
  
  obtain ⟨B, hBdef⟩ : ∃ B : ℝ, B = 1 + C := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨b, hbdef⟩ : ∃ b : ℝ, b = 4 * B ^ 2 := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨eb, hebdef⟩ : ∃ eb : ℝ, eb = 12 * B ^ 2 * C := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨T, hTdef⟩ : ∃ T : ℝ, T = 9 / 2 * (9 * b ^ 2 * C ^ 2 + 12 * B ^ 2 * C ^ 2) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨Gc, hGcdef⟩ : ∃ Gc : ℝ, Gc = 81 / 4 * b ^ 2 * C ^ 2 := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hB1 : 1 ≤ B := by rw [hBdef]; linarith
  have hb0 : 0 ≤ b := by rw [hbdef]; positivity
  have heb0 : 0 ≤ eb := by rw [hebdef]; positivity
  have hT0 : 0 ≤ T := by rw [hTdef]; positivity
  have hGc0 : 0 ≤ Gc := by rw [hGcdef]; positivity
  refine ⟨R, 18 * T + 54 * Gc + 972 * B ^ 2 * C ^ 2 + 54 * eb * T + 162 * eb * Gc, ?_⟩
  intro x hx
  have hr1 : 1 < ‖x‖ := lt_of_le_of_lt hR hx
  have hr0 : 0 < ‖x‖ := by linarith
  obtain ⟨hdet, hbx⟩ := hb x hx
  
  obtain ⟨ρ, hρ⟩ : ∃ ρ : ℝ, ρ = ‖x‖ ^ (-q) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨u, hu⟩ : ∃ u : ℝ, u = ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 1) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨v, hv⟩ : ∃ v : ℝ, v = ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 2) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨EE, hEE⟩ : ∃ EE : ℝ, EE = ‖x‖ ^ (-2 * q - 2) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hρ0 : 0 ≤ ρ := by rw [hρ]; exact Real.rpow_nonneg hr0.le _
  have hu0 : 0 ≤ u := by rw [hu]; exact Real.rpow_nonneg hr0.le _
  have hv0 : 0 ≤ v := by rw [hv]; exact Real.rpow_nonneg hr0.le _
  have hEE0 : 0 ≤ EE := by rw [hEE]; exact Real.rpow_nonneg hr0.le _
  have hρ1 : ρ ≤ 1 := by
    rw [hρ]; exact Real.rpow_le_one_of_one_le_of_nonpos hr1.le (by linarith)
  have huu : u * u = EE := by
    rw [hu, hEE, ← Real.rpow_add hr0]; congr 1; ring
  have hρv : ρ * v = EE := by
    rw [hρ, hv, hEE, ← Real.rpow_add hr0]; congr 1; ring
  rw [← hEE]
  
  have hPD : ∀ (c : Fin 3) (f : E3 → ℝ), |partialDeriv c f x| ≤ ‖fderiv ℝ f x‖ := by
    intro c f
    have hn : ‖e c‖ = 1 := by simp [e]
    calc |partialDeriv c f x| = ‖fderiv ℝ f x (e c)‖ := (Real.norm_eq_abs _).symm
      _ ≤ ‖fderiv ℝ f x‖ * ‖e c‖ := (fderiv ℝ f x).le_opNorm _
      _ = ‖fderiv ℝ f x‖ := by rw [hn, mul_one]
  have hd1 : ∀ c a b' : Fin 3, |partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b') x| ≤ C * u := by
    intro c a b'
    rw [hu]; exact (hPD c _).trans (hbx a b' 0).2.1
  have hd2 : ∀ m c a b' : Fin 3,
      |partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b') y) x| ≤ C * v := by
    intro m c a b'
    rw [hv]; exact (hPD m _).trans (hbx a b' c).2.2
  have hGε : ∀ i j : Fin 3, |G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ρ := by
    intro i j; rw [hρ]; exact (hbx i j 0).1
  have hGB : ∀ i j : Fin 3, |G x i j| ≤ B := by
    intro i j
    have h1 := hGε i j
    have h2 : |(if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 := by split_ifs <;> simp
    have h3 := abs_sub_abs_le_abs_sub (G x i j) (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)
    have h4 : C * ρ ≤ C := by nlinarith
    rw [hBdef]; linarith
  
  obtain ⟨ee, heedef⟩ : ∃ ee : ℝ, ee = 12 * B ^ 2 * (C * ρ) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have h1 := inv3_entry_bounds (G x) B (C * ρ) hdet hGB hGε
  have hPb : ∀ k l : Fin 3, |(G x)⁻¹ k l| ≤ b := by
    intro k l; rw [hbdef]; exact (h1 k l).1
  have hPe : ∀ k l : Fin 3, |(G x)⁻¹ k l - (if k = l then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ ee := by
    intro k l; rw [heedef]; exact (h1 k l).2
  
  have hU : IsOpen {y : E3 | 1 < ‖y‖} := isOpen_lt continuous_const continuous_norm
  have hxU : {y : E3 | 1 < ‖y‖} ∈ 𝓝 x := hU.mem_nhds hr1
  have hGd : ∀ a b' : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => G y a b') x := fun a b' =>
    ((hsmooth a b').differentiableOn (by simp)).differentiableAt hxU
  have hdGd : ∀ c a b' : Fin 3,
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b') y) x := by
    intro c a b'
    have h1' : ContDiffOn ℝ 1 (fun y => fderiv ℝ (fun z => G z a b') y) {y : E3 | 1 < ‖y‖} :=
      (hsmooth a b').fderiv_of_isOpen hU (by norm_cast)
    have h2' : ContDiffOn ℝ 1 (fun y => fderiv ℝ (fun z => G z a b') y (e c))
        {y : E3 | 1 < ‖y‖} :=
      h1'.clm_apply contDiffOn_const
    exact (h2'.differentiableOn one_ne_zero).differentiableAt hxU
  
  have hdet' : (G x).det ≠ 0 := ne_of_gt (by linarith)
  have h2 := fun m => inv_entry_partialDeriv G x hGd hdet' m
  have hPd : ∀ k l : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x :=
    fun k l => ((h2 0) k l).1
  obtain ⟨p, hpdef⟩ : ∃ p : ℝ, p = 9 * b ^ 2 * (C * u) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hα0 : 0 ≤ C * u := mul_nonneg hC hu0
  have hdP : ∀ m k l : Fin 3, |partialDeriv m (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x| ≤ p := by
    intro m k l
    rw [((h2 m) k l).2, abs_neg, hpdef]
    calc |∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b' : Fin 3,
            (G x)⁻¹ k a * partialDeriv m (fun y => G y a b') x * (G x)⁻¹ b' l|
        ≤ ∑ a : Fin 3, |∑ b' : Fin 3,
            (G x)⁻¹ k a * partialDeriv m (fun y => G y a b') x * (G x)⁻¹ b' l| :=
          Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _
      _ ≤ ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b' : Fin 3,
            |(G x)⁻¹ k a * partialDeriv m (fun y => G y a b') x * (G x)⁻¹ b' l| :=
          Finset.sum_le_sum (fun a _ => Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _)
      _ ≤ ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b' : Fin 3, b * (C * u) * b := by
          apply Finset.sum_le_sum; intro a _; apply Finset.sum_le_sum; intro b' _
          rw [abs_mul, abs_mul]
          exact mul_le_mul (mul_le_mul (hPb k a) (hd1 m a b') (abs_nonneg _) hb0) (hPb b' l)
            (abs_nonneg _) (mul_nonneg hb0 hα0)
      _ = 9 * b ^ 2 * (C * u) := by simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]; ring
  
  have h5 := fun m k i j => christoffel_value_bounds (G x)⁻¹
    (fun m k l => partialDeriv m (fun y => (G y)⁻¹ k l) x)
    (fun c a b' => partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b') x)
    (fun m c a b' => partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b') y) x)
    b ee p (C * u) (C * v) hPb hPe hdP hd1 hd2 m k i j
  have hΓ : ∀ k i j : Fin 3, |christoffel G k i j x| ≤ 9 / 2 * b * (C * u) :=
    fun k i j => (h5 0 k i j).1
  have hdΓ : ∀ m k i j : Fin 3,
      |partialDeriv m (christoffel G k i j) x - (1 / 2 : ℝ) *
        (partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j k) y) x
          + partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i k) y) x
          - partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j) y) x)|
        ≤ 9 / 2 * (p * (C * u) + ee * (C * v)) := by
    intro m k i j
    rw [christoffel_partialDeriv_formula G x hPd hdGd m k i j]
    exact (h5 m k i j).2
  have hsym : ∀ m a b' c : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv a (fun z => G z b' c) y) x
        = partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv a (fun z => G z c b') y) x := by
    intro m a b' c
    have : (fun z => G z b' c) = (fun z => G z c b') := funext (fun z => hsymm z b' c)
    rw [this]
  
  have h6 := scalar_trace_algebra (G x)⁻¹
    (fun k i j => christoffel G k i j x)
    (fun m k i j => partialDeriv m (christoffel G k i j) x)
    (fun m c a b' => partialDeriv m (fun y => partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b') y) x)
    ee (9 / 2 * b * (C * u)) (9 / 2 * (p * (C * u) + ee * (C * v))) (C * v)
    hPe hΓ hdΓ hd2 hsym
  have hmain : |scalarCurvatureLocal G x - fluxDivLocal G x| ≤
      3 * (6 * (9 / 2 * (p * (C * u) + ee * (C * v))) + 18 * (9 / 2 * b * (C * u)) ^ 2)
        + 9 * ee * (9 * (C * v) + 6 * (9 / 2 * (p * (C * u) + ee * (C * v)))
          + 18 * (9 / 2 * b * (C * u)) ^ 2) := h6
  
  have ht : 9 / 2 * (p * (C * u) + ee * (C * v)) = T * EE := by
    rw [hpdef, heedef, hTdef]
    linear_combination (9 / 2 * 9 * b ^ 2 * C ^ 2) * huu + (9 / 2 * 12 * B ^ 2 * C ^ 2) * hρv
  have hg : (9 / 2 * b * (C * u)) ^ 2 = Gc * EE := by
    rw [hGcdef]
    linear_combination (81 / 4 * b ^ 2 * C ^ 2) * huu
  have heβ : ee * (C * v) = 12 * B ^ 2 * C ^ 2 * EE := by
    rw [heedef]
    linear_combination (12 * B ^ 2 * C ^ 2) * hρv
  have hee_le : ee ≤ eb := by
    rw [heedef, hebdef]
    have h12 : 0 ≤ 12 * B ^ 2 * C := by positivity
    have := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hρ1 h12
    linarith
  have hk1 : (ee - eb) * (T * EE) ≤ 0 :=
    mul_nonpos_of_nonpos_of_nonneg (by linarith) (mul_nonneg hT0 hEE0)
  have hk2 : (ee - eb) * (Gc * EE) ≤ 0 :=
    mul_nonpos_of_nonpos_of_nonneg (by linarith) (mul_nonneg hGc0 hEE0)
  rw [ht, hg] at hmain
  refine hmain.trans ?_
  nlinarith [hk1, hk2, heβ]

theorem div_integrable_exterior (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (q : ℝ) (hq : 1 / 2 < q)
    (hsmooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => G x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖})
    (R C : ℝ) (hR : 1 ≤ R) (hC : 0 ≤ C)
    (hb : ∀ x : E3, R < ‖x‖ → (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ (G x).det ∧ ∀ i j k : Fin 3,
        |G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q) ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j) x‖ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 1) ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j) y) x‖ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 2))
    (hint : IntegrableOn (fun x : E3 => scalarCurvatureLocal G x * Real.sqrt (G x).det)
      {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖})
    (R₀ C₀ : ℝ)
    (hdecomp : ∀ x : E3, R₀ < ‖x‖ →
      |scalarCurvatureLocal G x - fluxDivLocal G x| ≤ C₀ * ‖x‖ ^ (-2 * q - 2)) :
    ∃ R₁ : ℝ, IntegrableOn (fluxDivLocal G) {x : E3 | R₁ < ‖x‖} :=
by
  classical
  refine ⟨max (max R 2) R₀, ?_⟩
  set R₁ : ℝ := max (max R 2) R₀ with hR₁def
  set S : Set E3 := {x : E3 | R₁ < ‖x‖} with hSdef
  have hS : MeasurableSet S := measurableSet_lt measurable_const measurable_norm
  have hRR₁ : R ≤ R₁ := le_trans (le_max_left _ _) (le_max_left _ _)
  have h2R₁ : (2 : ℝ) ≤ R₁ := le_trans (le_max_right _ _) (le_max_left _ _)
  have hR₀R₁ : R₀ ≤ R₁ := le_max_right _ _
  
  have hpow : IntegrableOn (fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (-(2 * q + 2))) S := by
    have hs : (Module.finrank ℝ E3 : ℝ) < 2 * q + 2 := by
      rw [finrank_euclideanSpace_fin]; push_cast; linarith
    have hg : Integrable (fun x : E3 => (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * q + 2) * (1 + ‖x‖) ^ (-(2 * q + 2)))
        (volume.restrict S) :=
      ((integrable_one_add_norm hs).const_mul _).integrableOn
    refine hg.mono' ((measurable_norm.pow_const _).aestronglyMeasurable) ?_
    refine ae_restrict_of_forall_mem hS ?_
    intro x hx
    have hx' : R₁ < ‖x‖ := hx
    have ht : 1 ≤ ‖x‖ := by linarith
    have ht0 : 0 ≤ ‖x‖ := norm_nonneg _
    rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (Real.rpow_nonneg ht0 _)]
    have h1 : (2 * ‖x‖) ^ (-(2 * q + 2)) ≤ (1 + ‖x‖) ^ (-(2 * q + 2)) :=
      Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_nonpos (by linarith) (by linarith) (by linarith)
    rw [Real.mul_rpow (by norm_num) ht0] at h1
    have h2 : (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * q + 2) * (2 : ℝ) ^ (-(2 * q + 2)) = 1 := by
      rw [← Real.rpow_add two_pos, add_neg_cancel, Real.rpow_zero]
    have h3 : 0 ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * q + 2) := Real.rpow_nonneg (by norm_num) _
    calc ‖x‖ ^ (-(2 * q + 2))
        = (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * q + 2) * ((2 : ℝ) ^ (-(2 * q + 2)) * ‖x‖ ^ (-(2 * q + 2))) := by
          rw [← mul_assoc, h2, one_mul]
      _ ≤ (2 : ℝ) ^ (2 * q + 2) * (1 + ‖x‖) ^ (-(2 * q + 2)) :=
          mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h1 h3
  
  have hc : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ContinuousOn (fun x => G x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} :=
    fun i j => (hsmooth i j).continuousOn
  have hdetcont : ContinuousOn (fun x => (G x).det) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
    have hfun : (fun x => (G x).det) = fun x =>
        G x 0 0 * G x 1 1 * G x 2 2 - G x 0 0 * G x 1 2 * G x 2 1
          - G x 0 1 * G x 1 0 * G x 2 2 + G x 0 1 * G x 1 2 * G x 2 0
          + G x 0 2 * G x 1 0 * G x 2 1 - G x 0 2 * G x 1 1 * G x 2 0 := by
      funext x; rw [Matrix.det_fin_three]
    rw [hfun]
    have t1 := ((hc 0 0).mul (hc 1 1)).mul (hc 2 2)
    have t2 := ((hc 0 0).mul (hc 1 2)).mul (hc 2 1)
    have t3 := ((hc 0 1).mul (hc 1 0)).mul (hc 2 2)
    have t4 := ((hc 0 1).mul (hc 1 2)).mul (hc 2 0)
    have t5 := ((hc 0 2).mul (hc 1 0)).mul (hc 2 1)
    have t6 := ((hc 0 2).mul (hc 1 1)).mul (hc 2 0)
    exact ((((t1.sub t2).sub t3).add t4).add t5).sub t6
  
  have hSsub1 : S ⊆ {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
    intro x hx
    have hx' : R₁ < ‖x‖ := hx
    show (1 : ℝ) < ‖x‖
    linarith
  have hSsub2 : S ⊆ {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖} := by
    intro x hx
    have hx' : R₁ < ‖x‖ := hx
    show (2 : ℝ) < ‖x‖
    linarith
  have hlow : ∀ x ∈ S, (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ (G x).det := by
    intro x hx
    have hx' : R₁ < ‖x‖ := hx
    exact (hb x (by linarith)).1
  have hpos : ∀ x ∈ S, 0 < Real.sqrt (G x).det := by
    intro x hx
    exact Real.sqrt_pos.mpr (by linarith [hlow x hx])
  have hhc : ContinuousOn (fun x => (Real.sqrt (G x).det)⁻¹) S :=
    ((hdetcont.mono hSsub1).sqrt).inv₀ (fun x hx => (hpos x hx).ne')
  have hhm : AEStronglyMeasurable (fun x => (Real.sqrt (G x).det)⁻¹) (volume.restrict S) :=
    hhc.aestronglyMeasurable hS
  have hhb : ∀ᵐ x ∂(volume.restrict S),
      ‖(Real.sqrt (G x).det)⁻¹‖ ≤ (Real.sqrt (1 / 2))⁻¹ := by
    refine ae_restrict_of_forall_mem hS ?_
    intro x hx
    rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (inv_pos.mpr (hpos x hx))]
    exact (inv_le_inv₀ (hpos x hx) (Real.sqrt_pos.mpr (by norm_num))).mpr
      (Real.sqrt_le_sqrt (hlow x hx))
  have hscal : IntegrableOn (scalarCurvatureLocal G) S := by
    have h1 : Integrable (fun x => (Real.sqrt (G x).det)⁻¹ *
        (scalarCurvatureLocal G x * Real.sqrt (G x).det)) (volume.restrict S) :=
      Integrable.bdd_mul (hint.mono_set hSsub2) hhm hhb
    refine IntegrableOn.congr_fun h1 ?_ hS
    intro x hx
    show (Real.sqrt (G x).det)⁻¹ * (scalarCurvatureLocal G x * Real.sqrt (G x).det)
      = scalarCurvatureLocal G x
    rw [mul_comm, mul_inv_cancel_right₀ (hpos x hx).ne']
  
  have hmeas : Measurable (fluxDivLocal G) := by
    unfold fluxDivLocal partialDeriv
    refine Finset.measurable_sum _ (fun i _ => Finset.measurable_sum _ (fun j _ => ?_))
    exact (measurable_fderiv_apply_const ℝ _ _).sub (measurable_fderiv_apply_const ℝ _ _)
  
  refine Integrable.mono' (hscal.norm.add (hpow.const_mul C₀)) hmeas.aestronglyMeasurable ?_
  refine ae_restrict_of_forall_mem hS ?_
  intro x hx
  have hx' : R₁ < ‖x‖ := hx
  have h := hdecomp x (by linarith)
  rw [show (-2 * q - 2 : ℝ) = -(2 * q + 2) by ring] at h
  show ‖fluxDivLocal G x‖ ≤ ‖scalarCurvatureLocal G x‖ + C₀ * ‖x‖ ^ (-(2 * q + 2))
  rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, Real.norm_eq_abs]
  have hA := abs_le.mp h
  rw [abs_le]
  constructor <;>
    linarith [neg_abs_le (scalarCurvatureLocal G x), le_abs_self (scalarCurvatureLocal G x)]

theorem smoothed_tail_tendsto_zero (f : E3 → ℝ) (R₁ : ℝ)
    (hf : IntegrableOn f {x : E3 | R₁ < ‖x‖}) :
    (∀ a : ℝ, R₁ ≤ a → Integrable (fun x : E3 => f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a))) ∧
    Tendsto (fun a : ℝ => ∫ x : E3, f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a)) atTop (𝓝 0) :=
by
  set S : Set E3 := {x : E3 | R₁ < ‖x‖} with hS
  have hSm : MeasurableSet S := measurableSet_lt measurable_const measurable_norm
  have hF : Integrable (S.indicator f) := hf.integrable_indicator hSm
  have hφc : ∀ a : ℝ, Continuous (fun x : E3 => Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a)) := fun a =>
    Real.smoothTransition.continuous.comp (continuous_norm.sub continuous_const)
  have hφb : ∀ a : ℝ, ∀ x : E3, ‖Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a)‖ ≤ 1 := by
    intro a x
    rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (Real.smoothTransition.nonneg _)]
    exact Real.smoothTransition.le_one _
  have hEq : ∀ a : ℝ, R₁ ≤ a → ∀ x : E3,
      f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) = S.indicator f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) := by
    intro a ha x
    by_cases hx : x ∈ S
    · rw [Set.indicator_of_mem hx]
    · have hx' : ‖x‖ ≤ R₁ := not_lt.mp hx
      have h0 : Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) = 0 :=
        Real.smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by linarith)
      rw [h0, mul_zero, mul_zero]
  have hInt : ∀ a : ℝ, R₁ ≤ a →
      Integrable (fun x : E3 => f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a)) := by
    intro a ha
    have h1 : Integrable (fun x : E3 => S.indicator f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a)) :=
      hF.mul_bdd (hφc a).aestronglyMeasurable (ae_of_all _ (hφb a))
    have h2 : (fun x : E3 => f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a))
        = (fun x : E3 => S.indicator f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a)) :=
      funext (hEq a ha)
    rw [h2]
    exact h1
  refine ⟨hInt, ?_⟩
  have hlim : Tendsto (fun a : ℝ => ∫ x : E3, f x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a)) atTop
      (𝓝 (∫ _x : E3, (0 : ℝ))) := by
    refine tendsto_integral_filter_of_dominated_convergence (fun x => ‖S.indicator f x‖) ?_ ?_
      hF.norm ?_
    · filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop R₁] with a ha
      exact (hInt a ha).aestronglyMeasurable
    · filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop R₁] with a ha
      refine ae_of_all _ (fun x => ?_)
      rw [hEq a ha x, norm_mul]
      exact mul_le_of_le_one_right (norm_nonneg _) (hφb a x)
    · refine ae_of_all _ (fun x => ?_)
      refine tendsto_const_nhds.congr' ?_
      filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop ‖x‖] with a ha
      have h0 : Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) = 0 :=
        Real.smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by linarith)
      rw [h0, mul_zero]
  rw [integral_zero] at hlim
  exact hlim

theorem divergence_shell_identity (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
    (hsmooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => G x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖})
    (a b : ℝ) (ha : 2 ≤ a) (hb : 2 ≤ b) :
    ∫ x : E3, fluxDivLocal G x
        * (Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) - Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - b))
      = -(16 * Real.pi) *
        ((∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * fluxLocal G (a + s))
          - (∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * fluxLocal G (b + s))) :=
by
  
  have s1 : Continuous (deriv Real.smoothTransition) ∧
      (∀ t : ℝ, t < 0 → deriv Real.smoothTransition t = 0) ∧
      (∀ t : ℝ, 1 < t → deriv Real.smoothTransition t = 0) := by
    refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_⟩
    · exact (Real.smoothTransition.contDiff (n := 1)).continuous_deriv le_rfl
    · intro t ht
      have h : Real.smoothTransition =ᶠ[𝓝 t] fun _ => (0 : ℝ) := by
        filter_upwards [Iio_mem_nhds ht] with s hs
        exact Real.smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (le_of_lt hs)
      rw [h.deriv_eq, deriv_const]
    · intro t ht
      have h : Real.smoothTransition =ᶠ[𝓝 t] fun _ => (1 : ℝ) := by
        filter_upwards [Ioi_mem_nhds ht] with s hs
        exact Real.smoothTransition.one_of_one_le (le_of_lt hs)
      rw [h.deriv_eq, deriv_const]
  obtain ⟨hwc, hw0, hw1⟩ := s1
  have hU : IsOpen {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := isOpen_lt continuous_const continuous_norm
  have hB : IsOpen {x : E3 | ‖x‖ < 2} := isOpen_lt continuous_norm continuous_const
  
  have s2 : ∀ (f : E3 → ℝ), ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} → ∀ i : Fin 3,
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (partialDeriv i f) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
    intro f hf i
    exact (hf.fderiv_of_isOpen hU (by simp)).clm_apply contDiffOn_const
  
  have s3 : ∀ c : ℝ,
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y : E3 => Real.smoothTransition (‖y‖ - c)) {y : E3 | y ≠ 0} ∧
      ∀ x : E3, x ≠ 0 → ∀ j : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv j (fun y : E3 => Real.smoothTransition (‖y‖ - c)) x
          = deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - c) * (x j / ‖x‖) := by
    intro c
    constructor
    · intro y hy
      have h1 : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ (fun y : E3 => ‖y‖ - c) y :=
        (contDiffAt_norm ℝ hy).sub contDiffAt_const
      exact (Real.smoothTransition.contDiff.comp_contDiffAt y h1).contDiffWithinAt
    · intro x hx j
      have hn : ‖x‖ ≠ 0 := norm_ne_zero_iff.mpr hx
      have hsq : HasFDerivAt (fun y : E3 => ‖y‖ ^ 2) (2 • innerSL ℝ x) x :=
        (hasStrictFDerivAt_norm_sq x).hasFDerivAt
      have hsqrt := hsq.sqrt (by positivity)
      have heq : (fun y : E3 => Real.sqrt (‖y‖ ^ 2)) = fun y => ‖y‖ := by
        funext y; exact Real.sqrt_sq (norm_nonneg _)
      rw [heq] at hsqrt
      have hψ : HasDerivAt Real.smoothTransition (deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - c))
          (‖x‖ - c) :=
        (Real.smoothTransition.contDiff (n := 1).differentiable one_ne_zero _).hasDerivAt
      have hcomp := HasDerivAt.comp_hasFDerivAt x hψ (hsqrt.sub_const c)
      have hf : (fun y : E3 => Real.smoothTransition (‖y‖ - c))
          = Real.smoothTransition ∘ (fun y : E3 => ‖y‖ - c) := rfl
      unfold partialDeriv
      rw [hf, hcomp.fderiv]
      simp [EuclideanSpace.inner_single_right, Real.sqrt_sq (norm_nonneg _)]
      field_simp
      try simp
  
  have s4 : ∀ (f χ : E3 → ℝ), ContDiffOn ℝ 1 f {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} →
      ContDiffOn ℝ 1 χ {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} → (∀ x : E3, ‖x‖ < 2 → χ x = 0) → ∀ j : Fin 3,
      Differentiable ℝ (fun x => f x * χ x) ∧
      Continuous (partialDeriv j (fun x => f x * χ x)) ∧
      ∀ x : E3, partialDeriv j (fun x => f x * χ x) x
        = partialDeriv j f x * χ x + f x * partialDeriv j χ x := by
    intro f χ hf hχ hχ0 j
    have hloc : ∀ x : E3, ‖x‖ < 2 →
        (χ =ᶠ[𝓝 x] fun _ => (0 : ℝ)) ∧ ((fun y => f y * χ y) =ᶠ[𝓝 x] fun _ => (0 : ℝ)) := by
      intro x hx
      have hm : {x : E3 | ‖x‖ < 2} ∈ 𝓝 x := hB.mem_nhds hx
      constructor
      · filter_upwards [hm] with y hy using hχ0 y hy
      · filter_upwards [hm] with y hy
        simp [hχ0 y hy]
    have hdU : ∀ x : E3, 1 < ‖x‖ → DifferentiableAt ℝ f x ∧ DifferentiableAt ℝ χ x := by
      intro x hx
      exact ⟨(hf.differentiableOn one_ne_zero).differentiableAt (hU.mem_nhds hx),
        (hχ.differentiableOn one_ne_zero).differentiableAt (hU.mem_nhds hx)⟩
    have hformula : ∀ x : E3, partialDeriv j (fun x => f x * χ x) x
        = partialDeriv j f x * χ x + f x * partialDeriv j χ x := by
      intro x
      by_cases hx : 1 < ‖x‖
      · obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := hdU x hx
        unfold partialDeriv
        rw [fderiv_fun_mul h1 h2]
        simp only [ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
        ring
      · have hx2 : ‖x‖ < 2 := by linarith [not_lt.mp hx]
        obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := hloc x hx2
        unfold partialDeriv
        rw [h1.fderiv_eq, h2.fderiv_eq, hχ0 x hx2]
        simp
    refine ⟨?_, ?_, hformula⟩
    · intro x
      by_cases hx : 1 < ‖x‖
      · obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := hdU x hx
        exact h1.mul h2
      · have hx2 : ‖x‖ < 2 := by linarith [not_lt.mp hx]
        exact (differentiableAt_const (0:ℝ)).congr_of_eventuallyEq (hloc x hx2).2
    · rw [continuous_iff_continuousAt]
      intro x
      by_cases hx : 1 < ‖x‖
      · have hcf : ContinuousOn (fun y => fderiv ℝ f y (e j)) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} :=
          (hf.continuousOn_fderiv_of_isOpen hU le_rfl).clm_apply continuousOn_const
        have hcχ : ContinuousOn (fun y => fderiv ℝ χ y (e j)) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} :=
          (hχ.continuousOn_fderiv_of_isOpen hU le_rfl).clm_apply continuousOn_const
        have hcon : ContinuousOn (fun y => partialDeriv j f y * χ y + f y * partialDeriv j χ y)
            {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} :=
          (hcf.mul hχ.continuousOn).add (hf.continuousOn.mul hcχ)
        have := hcon.continuousAt (hU.mem_nhds hx)
        exact this.congr (Filter.Eventually.of_forall (fun y => (hformula y).symm))
      · have hx2 : ‖x‖ < 2 := by linarith [not_lt.mp hx]
        have hev : (fun _ => (0:ℝ)) =ᶠ[𝓝 x] partialDeriv j (fun x => f x * χ x) := by
          filter_upwards [hB.mem_nhds hx2] with y hy
          unfold partialDeriv
          rw [(hloc y hy).2.fderiv_eq]
          simp
        exact continuousAt_const.congr hev
  
  have s5 : ∀ (f : E3 → ℝ) (j : Fin 3), Differentiable ℝ f → HasCompactSupport f →
      Continuous (partialDeriv j f) →
      Integrable (partialDeriv j f) ∧ ∫ x : E3, partialDeriv j f x = 0 := by
    intro f j hdiff hcs hcont
    have hcs' : HasCompactSupport (partialDeriv j f) := by
      unfold partialDeriv
      exact hcs.fderiv_apply ℝ (e j)
    have hint : Integrable (partialDeriv j f) := hcont.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport hcs'
    refine ⟨hint, ?_⟩
    have key := integral_mul_fderiv_eq_neg_fderiv_mul_of_integrable (μ := (volume : Measure E3))
      (f := f) (g := fun _ => (1 : ℝ)) (v := e j) ?_ ?_ ?_ hdiff (differentiable_const _)
    · simp at key
      have : ∫ x, partialDeriv j f x = ∫ x, fderiv ℝ f x (e j) := rfl
      rw [this]
      linarith
    · simpa [mul_one] using hint
    · simp
    · simpa using hdiff.continuous.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport hcs
  
  have s6 : ∀ x : E3, 1 < ‖x‖ →
      ∑ j : Fin 3, partialDeriv j (fun y => ∑ i : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y)) x
        = fluxDivLocal G x := by
    intro x hx
    have hd : ∀ (k : Fin 3) (f : E3 → ℝ), ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} →
        DifferentiableAt ℝ (partialDeriv k f) x := by
      intro k f hf
      exact ((s2 f hf k).differentiableOn (by simp)).differentiableAt (hU.mem_nhds hx)
    have hj : ∀ j : Fin 3, partialDeriv j (fun y => ∑ i : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y)) x
        = ∑ i : Fin 3, (partialDeriv j (fun y => partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y) x
            - partialDeriv j (fun y => partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y) x) := by
      intro j
      have hdiff : ∀ i ∈ (Finset.univ : Finset (Fin 3)), DifferentiableAt ℝ
          (fun y => partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y)
          x :=
        fun i _ => (hd i _ (hsmooth i j)).sub (hd j _ (hsmooth i i))
      show fderiv ℝ (fun y => ∑ i : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y)) x (e j)
        = _
      rw [fderiv_fun_sum hdiff, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply]
      refine Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun i _ => ?_)
      rw [fderiv_fun_sub (hd i _ (hsmooth i j)) (hd j _ (hsmooth i i))]
      rfl
    rw [Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun j _ => hj j), Finset.sum_comm]
    rfl
  
  have s7 : ∀ c : ℝ, 2 ≤ c →
      Integrable (fun x : E3 => (∑ j : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3,
        (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) x - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) x))
          * (x j / ‖x‖)) * deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - c)) := by
    intro c hc
    set H := fun x : E3 => (∑ j : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) x - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) x))
            * (x j / ‖x‖)) * deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - c) with hH
    have hz : ∀ x : E3, (‖x‖ < 2 ∨ c + 1 < ‖x‖) → H x = 0 := by
      intro x hx
      rcases hx with hx | hx
      · simp only [hH, hw0 (‖x‖ - c) (by linarith), mul_zero]
      · simp only [hH, hw1 (‖x‖ - c) (by linarith), mul_zero]
    have hcs : HasCompactSupport H := by
      apply HasCompactSupport.intro (isCompact_closedBall (0:E3) (c+1))
      intro x hx
      rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, not_le] at hx
      exact hz x (Or.inr hx)
    have hcont : Continuous H := by
      rw [continuous_iff_continuousAt]
      intro x
      by_cases hx : 1 < ‖x‖
      · have hP : ∀ i j k : Fin 3, ContinuousOn (partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j))
            {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
          intro i j k
          exact ((hsmooth i j).continuousOn_fderiv_of_isOpen hU (by simp)).clm_apply
            continuousOn_const
        have hcoord : ∀ j : Fin 3, ContinuousOn (fun x : E3 => x j / ‖x‖)
            {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
          intro j
          apply ContinuousOn.div
          · exact (EuclideanSpace.proj j).continuous.continuousOn
          · exact continuous_norm.continuousOn
          · intro y hy
            have : (1:ℝ) < ‖y‖ := hy
            positivity
        have hon : ContinuousOn H {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
          apply ContinuousOn.mul
          · apply continuousOn_finset_sum
            intro j _
            apply ContinuousOn.mul _ (hcoord j)
            apply continuousOn_finset_sum
            intro i _
            exact (hP i j i).sub (hP i i j)
          · exact (hwc.comp (continuous_norm.sub continuous_const)).continuousOn
        exact hon.continuousAt (hU.mem_nhds hx)
      · have hx2 : ‖x‖ < 2 := by linarith [not_lt.mp hx]
        have hev : (fun _ => (0:ℝ)) =ᶠ[𝓝 x] H := by
          filter_upwards [hB.mem_nhds hx2] with y hy
          exact (hz y (Or.inl hy)).symm
        exact continuousAt_const.congr hev
    exact hcont.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport hcs
  
  have s8 : ∀ h : E3 → ℝ, Integrable h →
      ∫ x : E3, h x = ∫ r in Set.Ioi (0 : ℝ),
        r ^ 2 * ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1), h (r • (θ : E3)) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere := by
    intro h hh
    have hdim : Module.finrank ℝ E3 - 1 = 2 := by simp
    have hmp := Measure.measurePreserving_homeomorphUnitSphereProd (volume : Measure E3)
    rw [hdim] at hmp
    have h2 : ∫ x : E3, h x
        = ∫ x : ({0}ᶜ : Set E3), h x ∂(Measure.comap Subtype.val volume) := by
      rw [integral_subtype_comap (measurableSet_singleton 0).compl h]
      rw [← integral_add_compl (measurableSet_singleton (0:E3)) hh,
        setIntegral_measure_zero _ (measure_singleton 0), zero_add]
    let g : (sphere (0:E3) 1) × (Set.Ioi (0:ℝ)) → ℝ :=
      fun p => h ((homeomorphUnitSphereProd E3).symm p : E3)
    have hgΦ : ∀ x : ({0}ᶜ : Set E3), g (homeomorphUnitSphereProd E3 x) = h x := by
      intro x
      simp only [g, Homeomorph.symm_apply_apply]
    have h3 : ∫ x : ({0}ᶜ : Set E3), h x ∂(Measure.comap Subtype.val volume)
        = ∫ p, g p ∂((volume : Measure E3).toSphere.prod (Measure.volumeIoiPow 2)) := by
      rw [← hmp.integral_comp (homeomorphUnitSphereProd E3).measurableEmbedding g]
      simp only [hgΦ]
    have hgi : Integrable g ((volume : Measure E3).toSphere.prod (Measure.volumeIoiPow 2)) := by
      rw [← hmp.integrable_comp_emb (homeomorphUnitSphereProd E3).measurableEmbedding]
      have : g ∘ (homeomorphUnitSphereProd E3) = h ∘ Subtype.val := by
        funext x
        exact hgΦ x
      rw [this]
      exact (integrableOn_iff_comap_subtypeVal (measurableSet_singleton 0).compl).mp
        hh.integrableOn
    rw [h2, h3, integral_prod_symm g hgi, Measure.volumeIoiPow.eq_1]
    have hmeas : Measurable (fun r : Set.Ioi (0:ℝ) => ENNReal.ofReal ((r:ℝ) ^ 2)) :=
      ENNReal.measurable_ofReal.comp (measurable_subtype_coe.pow_const 2)
    rw [integral_withDensity_eq_integral_toReal_smul hmeas
      (ae_of_all _ (fun _ => ENNReal.ofReal_lt_top))]
    rw [← integral_subtype_comap measurableSet_Ioi
      (fun r => r ^ 2 * ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1), h (r • (θ : E3))
        ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere)]
    congr 1
    funext y
    rw [ENNReal.toReal_ofReal (by positivity), smul_eq_mul]
    congr 1
  
  have s9 : ∀ c : ℝ, 0 < c →
      ∫ r in Set.Ioi (0 : ℝ), r ^ 2 * ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1),
          (∑ j : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3,
             (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) (r • (θ : E3))
               - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) (r • (θ : E3))))
             * ((r • (θ : E3)) j / ‖r • (θ : E3)‖))
            * deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖r • (θ : E3)‖ - c) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere
        = 16 * Real.pi * ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1,
            deriv Real.smoothTransition s * fluxLocal G (c + s) := by
    intro c hc
    set g : ℝ → ℝ := fun r => 16 * Real.pi * (deriv Real.smoothTransition (r - c) * fluxLocal G r)
      with hg
    have h1 : ∀ r ∈ Set.Ioi (0:ℝ), r ^ 2 * ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1),
          (∑ j : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3,
             (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) (r • (θ : E3))
               - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) (r • (θ : E3))))
             * ((r • (θ : E3)) j / ‖r • (θ : E3)‖))
            * deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖r • (θ : E3)‖ - c) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere
          = g r := by
      intro r hr
      have hr0 : 0 < r := hr
      have hin : ∀ θ : sphere (0:E3) 1,
          (∑ j : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3,
             (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) (r • (θ : E3))
               - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) (r • (θ : E3))))
             * ((r • (θ : E3)) j / ‖r • (θ : E3)‖))
            * deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖r • (θ : E3)‖ - c)
          = (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
              (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r • (θ : E3))
                - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j)
              * deriv Real.smoothTransition (r - c) := by
        intro θ
        have hθ : ‖(θ : E3)‖ = 1 := norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ
        have hn : ‖r • (θ : E3)‖ = r := by
          rw [norm_smul, hθ, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos hr0, mul_one]
        have hcj : ∀ j : Fin 3, (r • (θ:E3)) j / r = (θ:E3) j := by
          intro j
          rw [PiLp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
          field_simp
        simp only [hn, hcj, Fin.sum_univ_three]
        ring
      rw [integral_congr_ae (ae_of_all _ hin), integral_mul_const]
      simp only [hg, fluxLocal]
      field_simp
      try ring
    rw [setIntegral_congr_fun measurableSet_Ioi h1]
    have hsub : Set.Icc c (c+1) ⊆ Set.Ioi 0 := fun r hr => lt_of_lt_of_le hc hr.1
    have hzero : ∀ r ∈ Set.Ioi (0:ℝ) \ Set.Icc c (c+1), g r = 0 := by
      intro r hr
      have hr2 := hr.2
      simp only [Set.mem_Icc, not_and_or, not_le] at hr2
      rcases hr2 with hr2 | hr2
      · simp [hg, hw0 (r - c) (by linarith)]
      · simp [hg, hw1 (r - c) (by linarith)]
    rw [setIntegral_eq_of_subset_of_forall_diff_eq_zero measurableSet_Ioi hsub hzero]
    rw [integral_Icc_eq_integral_Ioc, ← intervalIntegral.integral_of_le (by linarith)]
    have hshift := intervalIntegral.integral_comp_add_right g c (a := 0) (b := 1)
    rw [zero_add, show (1:ℝ) + c = c + 1 by ring] at hshift
    rw [← hshift, ← intervalIntegral.integral_const_mul]
    congr 1
    funext s
    simp only [hg]
    rw [add_sub_cancel_right, add_comm s c]
  
  obtain ⟨V, hVdef⟩ : ∃ V : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ, V = fun j y => ∑ i : Fin 3,
      (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨η, hηdef⟩ : ∃ η : E3 → ℝ, η = fun x =>
      Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) - Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - b) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨H, hHdef⟩ : ∃ H : ℝ → E3 → ℝ, H = fun c x => (∑ j : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3,
        (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) x - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) x))
          * (x j / ‖x‖)) * deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - c) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hVx : ∀ j y, V j y = ∑ i : Fin 3,
      (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y) :=
    fun j y => by rw [hVdef]
  have hηx : ∀ x, η x = Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) - Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - b) :=
    fun x => by rw [hηdef]
  have hHx : ∀ c x, H c x = (∑ j : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3,
        (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) x - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) x))
          * (x j / ‖x‖)) * deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - c) :=
    fun c x => by rw [hHdef]
  have hVs : ∀ j, ContDiffOn ℝ 1 (V j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
    intro j
    have hfun : V j = fun y => ∑ i : Fin 3,
        (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z i j) y - partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i i) y) := by
      rw [hVdef]
    have h : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (V j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
      rw [hfun]
      apply ContDiffOn.sum
      intro i _
      exact (s2 _ (hsmooth i j) i).sub (s2 _ (hsmooth i i) j)
    exact h.of_le (by exact_mod_cast le_top)
  have hη : ContDiffOn ℝ 1 η {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
    have h : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ η {y : E3 | y ≠ 0} := by
      rw [hηdef]
      exact (s3 a).1.sub (s3 b).1
    refine (h.mono ?_).of_le (by exact_mod_cast le_top)
    intro y hy
    have : (1:ℝ) < ‖y‖ := hy
    exact norm_pos_iff.mp (by linarith)
  have hη0 : ∀ x : E3, ‖x‖ < 2 → η x = 0 := by
    intro x hx
    rw [hηx, Real.smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by linarith),
      Real.smoothTransition.zero_of_nonpos (by linarith), sub_zero]
  have hηcs : HasCompactSupport η := by
    apply HasCompactSupport.intro (isCompact_closedBall (0:E3) (max a b + 1))
    intro x hx
    rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff, not_le] at hx
    have h1 : a ≤ max a b := le_max_left _ _
    have h2 : b ≤ max a b := le_max_right _ _
    rw [hηx, Real.smoothTransition.one_of_one_le (by linarith),
      Real.smoothTransition.one_of_one_le (by linarith), sub_self]
  have hW : ∀ j : Fin 3, Differentiable ℝ (fun x => V j x * η x) ∧
      Continuous (partialDeriv j (fun x => V j x * η x)) ∧
      ∀ x : E3, partialDeriv j (fun x => V j x * η x) x
        = partialDeriv j (V j) x * η x + V j x * partialDeriv j η x :=
    fun j => s4 (V j) η (hVs j) hη hη0 j
  have hWcs : ∀ j : Fin 3, HasCompactSupport (fun x => V j x * η x) := by
    intro j
    have := hηcs.mul_left (f := V j)
    exact this
  have hWi : ∀ j : Fin 3, Integrable (partialDeriv j (fun x => V j x * η x)) ∧
      ∫ x : E3, partialDeriv j (fun x => V j x * η x) x = 0 :=
    fun j => s5 _ j (hW j).1 (hWcs j) (hW j).2.1
  have s6' : ∀ x : E3, 1 < ‖x‖ → ∑ j : Fin 3, partialDeriv j (V j) x = fluxDivLocal G x := by
    intro x hx
    rw [hVdef]
    exact s6 x hx
  
  have hpt : ∀ x : E3, ∑ j : Fin 3, partialDeriv j (fun x => V j x * η x) x
      = fluxDivLocal G x * η x + (H a x - H b x) := by
    intro x
    by_cases hx : 1 < ‖x‖
    · have hx0 : x ≠ 0 := norm_pos_iff.mp (by linarith)
      have hdη : ∀ j : Fin 3, partialDeriv j η x
          = deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) * (x j / ‖x‖)
            - deriv Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - b) * (x j / ‖x‖) := by
        intro j
        have hda : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y : E3 => Real.smoothTransition (‖y‖ - a)) x :=
          ((s3 a).1.differentiableOn (by simp)).differentiableAt (isOpen_ne.mem_nhds hx0)
        have hdb : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y : E3 => Real.smoothTransition (‖y‖ - b)) x :=
          ((s3 b).1.differentiableOn (by simp)).differentiableAt (isOpen_ne.mem_nhds hx0)
        rw [← (s3 a).2 x hx0 j, ← (s3 b).2 x hx0 j, hηdef]
        unfold partialDeriv
        rw [fderiv_fun_sub hda hdb, ContinuousLinearMap.sub_apply]
      rw [Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun j _ => (hW j).2.2 x), Finset.sum_add_distrib,
        ← Finset.sum_mul, s6' x hx]
      simp only [hdη, hHx, hVx, Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    · have hx2 : ‖x‖ < 2 := by linarith [not_lt.mp hx]
      have hηev : η =ᶠ[𝓝 x] fun _ => (0:ℝ) := by
        filter_upwards [hB.mem_nhds hx2] with y hy using hη0 y hy
      have hdη : ∀ j : Fin 3, partialDeriv j η x = 0 := by
        intro j
        unfold partialDeriv
        rw [hηev.fderiv_eq]
        simp
      rw [Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun j _ => (hW j).2.2 x)]
      simp only [hdη, hη0 x hx2, hHx, hw0 (‖x‖ - a) (by linarith),
        hw0 (‖x‖ - b) (by linarith)]
      simp
  
  have hHi : ∀ c : ℝ, 2 ≤ c → Integrable (H c) := by
    intro c hc
    rw [hHdef]
    exact s7 c hc
  have hHint : ∀ c : ℝ, 2 ≤ c → ∫ x : E3, H c x
      = 16 * Real.pi * ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * fluxLocal G (c + s) := by
    intro c hc
    rw [s8 (H c) (hHi c hc), hHdef]
    exact s9 c (by linarith)
  have hfun : (fun x : E3 => fluxDivLocal G x
      * (Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a) - Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - b)))
      = fun x => (∑ j : Fin 3, partialDeriv j (fun x => V j x * η x) x) - (H a x - H b x) := by
    funext x
    rw [hpt x, hηx x]
    ring
  have i1 : Integrable (fun x : E3 => ∑ j : Fin 3, partialDeriv j (fun x => V j x * η x) x) :=
    integrable_finset_sum _ (fun j _ => (hWi j).1)
  have i2 : Integrable (fun x : E3 => H a x - H b x) := (hHi a ha).sub (hHi b hb)
  have hsum0 : ∑ j : Fin 3, ∫ x : E3, partialDeriv j (fun x => V j x * η x) x = 0 :=
    Finset.sum_eq_zero (fun j _ => (hWi j).2)
  rw [hfun, integral_sub i1 i2, integral_finset_sum _ (fun j _ => (hWi j).1), hsum0,
    integral_sub (hHi a ha) (hHi b hb), hHint a ha, hHint b hb]
  ring

theorem flux_increment_bound (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (q : ℝ) (hq : 0 < q)
    (hsmooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => G x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖})
    (R C : ℝ) (hR : 1 ≤ R) (hC : 0 ≤ C)
    (hb : ∀ x : E3, R < ‖x‖ → (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ (G x).det ∧ ∀ i j k : Fin 3,
        |G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q) ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j) x‖ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 1) ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j) y) x‖ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 2)) :
    ∃ R₀ C₀ : ℝ, ∀ r r' : ℝ, R₀ ≤ r → r ≤ r' → r' ≤ r + 1 →
      |fluxLocal G r' - fluxLocal G r| ≤ C₀ * r ^ (-q) * (r' - r) :=
by
  have hUo : IsOpen {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := isOpen_lt continuous_const continuous_norm
  
  have hcoord : ∀ (u : E3), ‖u‖ = 1 → ∀ j : Fin 3, |u j| ≤ 1 := by
    intro u hu j
    have := PiLp.norm_apply_le u j
    rw [Real.norm_eq_abs, hu] at this
    exact this
  
  have hsum : ∀ (a b : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (u : E3) (M : ℝ), ‖u‖ = 1 →
      (∀ i j, |a i j| ≤ M) → (∀ i j, |b i j| ≤ M) →
      |∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (a i j - b i j) * u j| ≤ 18 * M := by
    intro a b u M hu ha hb
    have hS : ∀ i j, |(a i j - b i j) * u j| ≤ 2 * M := by
      intro i j
      rw [abs_mul]
      have h1 : |a i j - b i j| ≤ 2 * M := by
        have := abs_sub (a i j) (b i j)
        linarith [ha i j, hb i j]
      calc |a i j - b i j| * |u j| ≤ |a i j - b i j| * 1 :=
            mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hcoord u hu j) (abs_nonneg _)
        _ ≤ 2 * M := by linarith
    calc |∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, (a i j - b i j) * u j|
        ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, |∑ j : Fin 3, (a i j - b i j) * u j| := Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _
      _ ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, |(a i j - b i j) * u j| :=
          Finset.sum_le_sum (fun i _ => Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _)
      _ ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, 2 * M :=
          Finset.sum_le_sum (fun i _ => Finset.sum_le_sum (fun j _ => hS i j))
      _ = 18 * M := by simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]; ring
  
  have hdiff : ∀ i j k : Fin 3,
      DifferentiableOn ℝ (partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j)) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
    intro i j k
    have h1 : ContDiffOn ℝ 1 (fun y => fderiv ℝ (fun z => G z i j) y) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} :=
      (hsmooth i j).fderiv_of_isOpen hUo (WithTop.coe_le_coe.mpr le_top)
    have h2 := h1.differentiableOn (by norm_num)
    exact h2.clm_apply (differentiableOn_const (e k))
  
  have hP : ∀ t : ℝ, 0 < t → R < t → ∀ u : E3, ‖u‖ = 1 → ∀ i j k : Fin 3,
      |partialDeriv k (fun x => G x i j) (t • u)| ≤ C * t ^ (-q - 1) := by
    intro t ht0 hRt u hu i j k
    have hn : ‖t • u‖ = t := by rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos ht0, hu, mul_one]
    have h1 := (fderiv ℝ (fun x => G x i j) (t • u)).le_opNorm (e k)
    have h2 : ‖e k‖ = 1 := by simp [e]
    have h3 := ((hb (t • u) (by rw [hn]; exact hRt)).2 i j k).2.1
    rw [hn] at h3
    rw [h2, mul_one] at h1
    rw [← Real.norm_eq_abs]
    exact h1.trans h3
  
  have hL : ∀ r r' : ℝ, R < r → r ≤ r' → ∀ u : E3, ‖u‖ = 1 → ∀ i j k : Fin 3,
      |partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j) (r' • u) - partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j) (r • u)|
        ≤ C * r ^ (-q - 2) * (r' - r) := by
    intro r r' hr hrr' u hu i j k
    have hr0 : 0 < r := by linarith
    have hseg : ∀ y ∈ segment ℝ (r • u) (r' • u), r ≤ ‖y‖ := by
      intro y hy
      rw [segment_eq_image] at hy
      obtain ⟨l, ⟨hl0, hl1⟩, rfl⟩ := hy
      have hsm : (1 - l) • (r • u) + l • (r' • u) = ((1 - l) * r + l * r') • u := by
        rw [smul_smul, smul_smul, ← add_smul]
      have hle : r ≤ (1 - l) * r + l * r' := by nlinarith [mul_nonneg hl0 (sub_nonneg.2 hrr')]
      show r ≤ ‖(1 - l) • (r • u) + l • (r' • u)‖
      rw [hsm, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, hu, mul_one, abs_of_pos (by linarith)]
      exact hle
    have hmvt := Convex.norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_fderiv_le (𝕜 := ℝ)
      (f := partialDeriv k (fun z => G z i j)) (C := C * r ^ (-q - 2))
      (s := segment ℝ (r • u) (r' • u)) ?_ ?_ (convex_segment _ _)
      (left_mem_segment ℝ _ _) (right_mem_segment ℝ _ _)
    · rw [← sub_smul, norm_smul, hu, mul_one,
        Real.norm_of_nonneg (by linarith : (0:ℝ) ≤ r' - r)] at hmvt
      rw [← Real.norm_eq_abs]
      exact hmvt
    · intro y hy
      have hy1 : y ∈ {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
        show 1 < ‖y‖
        linarith [hseg y hy]
      exact (hdiff i j k).differentiableAt (hUo.mem_nhds hy1)
    · intro y hy
      have hry := hseg y hy
      have h1 := ((hb y (by linarith)).2 i j k).2.2
      refine h1.trans ?_
      apply mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left _ hC
      exact Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_nonpos hr0 hry (by linarith)
  
  have hint : ∀ t : ℝ, 1 < t → Integrable (fun θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1 =>
      ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
        (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (t • (θ : E3))
          - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (t • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j)
      (volume : Measure E3).toSphere := by
    intro t ht
    have hc : ∀ i j k : Fin 3, Continuous
        (fun θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1 => partialDeriv k (fun x => G x i j) (t • (θ : E3))) := by
      intro i j k
      refine ((hdiff i j k).continuousOn).comp_continuous
        (continuous_subtype_val.const_smul t) ?_
      intro θ
      show 1 < ‖t • (θ : E3)‖
      rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos (by linarith), norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ,
        mul_one]
      exact ht
    have hcont : Continuous (fun θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1 =>
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (t • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (t • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j) := by
      refine continuous_finset_sum _ (fun i _ => continuous_finset_sum _ (fun j _ => ?_))
      refine ((hc i j i).sub (hc i i j)).mul ?_
      fun_prop
    exact hcont.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport (HasCompactSupport.of_compactSpace _)
  
  set K : ℝ := (volume : Measure E3).toSphere.real Set.univ with hK
  have hK0 : 0 ≤ K := measureReal_nonneg
  refine ⟨R + 1, 9 * C * K / (2 * Real.pi), ?_⟩
  intro r r' hr hrr' hr'
  have hRr : R < r := by linarith
  have hRr' : R < r' := by linarith
  have hr0 : 0 < r := by linarith
  have hr0' : 0 < r' := by linarith
  have hr1 : 1 < r := by linarith
  have hr1' : 1 < r' := by linarith
  have hF : ∀ t, fluxLocal G t = 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * t ^ 2 *
      ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1),
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (t • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (t • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j
        ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere := fun t => rfl
  rw [hF r', hF r]
  set I1 := ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1),
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r' • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r' • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j
        ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere with hI1def
  set I0 := ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1),
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j
        ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere with hI0def
  have hI1 : |I1| ≤ 18 * (C * r' ^ (-q - 1)) * K := by
    have := norm_integral_le_of_norm_le_const (μ := (volume : Measure E3).toSphere)
      (C := 18 * (C * r' ^ (-q - 1))) (ae_of_all _ (fun θ => by
        rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]
        exact hsum _ _ (θ : E3) _ (norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ)
          (fun i j => hP r' hr0' hRr' _ (norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ) i j i)
          (fun i j => hP r' hr0' hRr' _ (norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ) i i j)))
    rw [Real.norm_eq_abs] at this
    exact this
  have hI10 : |I1 - I0| ≤ 18 * (C * r ^ (-q - 2) * (r' - r)) * K := by
    rw [hI1def, hI0def, ← integral_sub (hint r' hr1') (hint r hr1)]
    have := norm_integral_le_of_norm_le_const (μ := (volume : Measure E3).toSphere)
      (f := fun θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1 =>
        (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r' • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r' • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j)
        - ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j)
      (C := 18 * (C * r ^ (-q - 2) * (r' - r))) (ae_of_all _ (fun θ => by
        rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]
        have heq : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r' • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r' • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j)
          - ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j
          = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
            ((partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r' • (θ : E3))
                - partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r • (θ : E3)))
              - (partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r' • (θ : E3))
                - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r • (θ : E3)))) * (θ : E3) j := by
          simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
          ring
        have hfin := hsum _ _ (θ : E3) _ (norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ)
          (fun i j => hL r r' hRr hrr' _ (norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ) i j i)
          (fun i j => hL r r' hRr hrr' _ (norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ) i i j)
        rw [← heq] at hfin
        exact hfin))
    rw [Real.norm_eq_abs] at this
    exact this
  
  set a := r ^ (-q) with ha
  have ha0 : 0 < a := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hr0 _
  have hpow1 : r ^ (-q - 1) = a / r := by
    rw [Real.rpow_sub hr0, Real.rpow_one]
  have hpow2 : r ^ (-q - 2) = a / r ^ 2 := by
    rw [Real.rpow_sub hr0, Real.rpow_two]
  have hmono : r' ^ (-q - 1) ≤ r ^ (-q - 1) :=
    Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_nonpos hr0 hrr' (by linarith)
  have hX : r * |I1| ≤ 18 * C * K * a := by
    have h1 : |I1| ≤ 18 * (C * r ^ (-q - 1)) * K := by
      refine hI1.trans ?_
      have : C * r' ^ (-q - 1) ≤ C * r ^ (-q - 1) := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hmono hC
      nlinarith
    rw [hpow1] at h1
    have h2 : r * |I1| ≤ r * (18 * (C * (a / r)) * K) := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h1 hr0.le
    have h3 : r * (18 * (C * (a / r)) * K) = 18 * C * K * a := by
      field_simp
    linarith
  have hY : r ^ 2 * |I1 - I0| ≤ 18 * C * K * a * (r' - r) := by
    rw [hpow2] at hI10
    have h2 : r ^ 2 * |I1 - I0| ≤ r ^ 2 * (18 * (C * (a / r ^ 2) * (r' - r)) * K) :=
      mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hI10 (by positivity)
    have h3 : r ^ 2 * (18 * (C * (a / r ^ 2) * (r' - r)) * K) = 18 * C * K * a * (r' - r) := by
      field_simp
    linarith
  have hsq : r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2 ≤ 3 * r * (r' - r) := by nlinarith
  have hsq0 : 0 ≤ r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2 := by nlinarith
  have hZ : (r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2) * |I1| ≤ 3 * (r' - r) * (18 * C * K * a) := by
    have h1 : (r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2) * |I1| ≤ 3 * r * (r' - r) * |I1| :=
      mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hsq (abs_nonneg _)
    have h2 : 3 * (r' - r) * (r * |I1|) ≤ 3 * (r' - r) * (18 * C * K * a) :=
      mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hX (by linarith)
    nlinarith
  have hpi : 0 < Real.pi := Real.pi_pos
  have hdecomp : 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r' ^ 2 * I1 - 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r ^ 2 * I0
      = 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * ((r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2) * I1 + r ^ 2 * (I1 - I0)) := by ring
  rw [hdecomp, abs_mul, abs_of_pos (by positivity : (0:ℝ) < 1 / (16 * Real.pi))]
  have htri : |(r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2) * I1 + r ^ 2 * (I1 - I0)|
      ≤ (r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2) * |I1| + r ^ 2 * |I1 - I0| := by
    refine (abs_add_le _ _).trans ?_
    rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_of_nonneg hsq0, abs_of_nonneg (by positivity : (0:ℝ) ≤ r ^ 2)]
  have htot : |(r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2) * I1 + r ^ 2 * (I1 - I0)| ≤ 72 * C * K * a * (r' - r) := by
    linarith
  calc 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * |(r' ^ 2 - r ^ 2) * I1 + r ^ 2 * (I1 - I0)|
      ≤ 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * (72 * C * K * a * (r' - r)) :=
        mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left htot (by positivity)
    _ = 9 * C * K / (2 * Real.pi) * a * (r' - r) := by
        field_simp
        ring

theorem tendsto_of_smoothed_tendsto (F : ℝ → ℝ) (q : ℝ) (hq : 0 < q) (R₀ C₀ : ℝ)
    (hosc : ∀ r r' : ℝ, R₀ ≤ r → r ≤ r' → r' ≤ r + 1 → |F r' - F r| ≤ C₀ * r ^ (-q) * (r' - r))
    (m : ℝ)
    (hA : Tendsto (fun a : ℝ => ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * F (a + s))
      atTop (𝓝 m)) :
    Tendsto F atTop (𝓝 m) :=
by
  
  have hcd : ContDiff ℝ ((1 : ℕ∞) : WithTop ℕ∞) Real.smoothTransition :=
    Real.smoothTransition.contDiff (n := 1)
  have hw : Continuous (deriv Real.smoothTransition) := hcd.continuous_deriv (by norm_num)
  have hdiff : Differentiable ℝ Real.smoothTransition := hcd.differentiable (by norm_num)
  have hw1 : ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s = 1 := by
    rw [intervalIntegral.integral_deriv_eq_sub (fun x _ => hdiff x) (hw.intervalIntegrable 0 1)]
    simp [Real.smoothTransition.one, Real.smoothTransition.zero]
  obtain ⟨W, hW⟩ := isCompact_Icc.exists_bound_of_continuousOn
    (hw.continuousOn (s := Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1))
  
  have key : ∀ a : ℝ, max R₀ 1 ≤ a →
      |(∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * F (a + s)) - F a|
        ≤ W * |C₀| * a ^ (-q) := by
    intro a ha
    have hRa : R₀ ≤ a := le_trans (le_max_left _ _) ha
    have h1a : 1 ≤ a := le_trans (le_max_right _ _) ha
    have ha0 : 0 < a := by linarith
    have hP : 0 < a ^ (-q) := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos ha0 _
    have main : ∀ u v : ℝ, u ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 → v ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 → u ≤ v →
        |F (a + v) - F (a + u)| ≤ |C₀| * (v - u) := by
      intro u v hu hv huv
      have hr : (a + u) ^ (-q) ≤ 1 :=
        Real.rpow_le_one_of_one_le_of_nonpos (by linarith [hu.1]) (by linarith)
      have hr0 : 0 < (a + u) ^ (-q) := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos (by linarith [hu.1]) _
      have h0 := hosc (a + u) (a + v) (by linarith [hu.1]) (by linarith)
        (by linarith [hu.1, hv.2])
      have e : a + v - (a + u) = v - u := by ring
      rw [e] at h0
      have hd : 0 ≤ v - u := by linarith
      have h4 : C₀ * (a + u) ^ (-q) ≤ |C₀| := by
        calc C₀ * (a + u) ^ (-q) ≤ |C₀| * (a + u) ^ (-q) :=
              mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (le_abs_self _) hr0.le
          _ ≤ |C₀| * 1 := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hr (abs_nonneg _)
          _ = |C₀| := mul_one _
      have h3 : C₀ * (a + u) ^ (-q) * (v - u) ≤ |C₀| * (v - u) :=
        mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right h4 hd
      linarith
    have hcont : ContinuousOn (fun s => F (a + s)) (Set.uIcc 0 1) := by
      rw [Set.uIcc_of_le zero_le_one]
      have hlip : LipschitzOnWith (Real.toNNReal |C₀|) (fun s => F (a + s)) (Set.Icc 0 1) := by
        apply LipschitzOnWith.of_dist_le_mul
        intro s hs s' hs'
        simp only [Real.dist_eq]
        rw [Real.coe_toNNReal _ (abs_nonneg _)]
        rcases le_total s s' with h | h
        · rw [abs_sub_comm (F (a + s)), abs_sub_comm s s', abs_of_nonneg (sub_nonneg.mpr h)]
          exact main s s' hs hs' h
        · rw [abs_of_nonneg (sub_nonneg.mpr h)]
          exact main s' s hs' hs h
      exact hlip.continuousOn
    have hI1 : IntervalIntegrable (fun s => deriv Real.smoothTransition s * F (a + s))
        MeasureTheory.volume 0 1 :=
      (hw.intervalIntegrable 0 1).mul_continuousOn hcont
    have hI2 : IntervalIntegrable (fun s => deriv Real.smoothTransition s * F a)
        MeasureTheory.volume 0 1 :=
      (hw.mul continuous_const).intervalIntegrable 0 1
    have hc : ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * F a = F a := by
      rw [intervalIntegral.integral_mul_const, hw1, one_mul]
    have hsplit : (∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * F (a + s)) - F a
        = ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * (F (a + s) - F a) := by
      have h5 := intervalIntegral.integral_sub hI1 hI2
      rw [hc] at h5
      rw [← h5]
      congr 1
      ext s
      ring
    rw [hsplit]
    have hb : ∀ s ∈ Set.uIoc (0 : ℝ) 1,
        ‖deriv Real.smoothTransition s * (F (a + s) - F a)‖ ≤ W * (|C₀| * a ^ (-q)) := by
      intro s hs
      rw [Set.uIoc_of_le zero_le_one] at hs
      have hs' : s ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 := ⟨hs.1.le, hs.2⟩
      have h1 := hW s hs'
      have h2 : |F (a + s) - F a| ≤ |C₀| * a ^ (-q) := by
        have h6 := hosc a (a + s) hRa (by linarith [hs.1]) (by linarith [hs.2])
        have e : a + s - a = s := by ring
        rw [e] at h6
        calc |F (a + s) - F a| ≤ C₀ * a ^ (-q) * s := h6
          _ ≤ |C₀| * a ^ (-q) * s :=
              mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right
                (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (le_abs_self _) hP.le) hs.1.le
          _ ≤ |C₀| * a ^ (-q) * 1 :=
              mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hs.2 (mul_nonneg (abs_nonneg _) hP.le)
          _ = |C₀| * a ^ (-q) := mul_one _
      rw [norm_mul, Real.norm_eq_abs (F (a + s) - F a)]
      exact mul_le_mul h1 h2 (abs_nonneg _) ((norm_nonneg _).trans h1)
    have h7 := intervalIntegral.norm_integral_le_of_norm_le_const hb
    rw [Real.norm_eq_abs] at h7
    have e : W * (|C₀| * a ^ (-q)) * |(1 : ℝ) - 0| = W * |C₀| * a ^ (-q) := by
      rw [sub_zero, abs_one, mul_one, mul_assoc]
    rw [e] at h7
    exact h7
  
  have hdiffT : Tendsto (fun a : ℝ =>
      (∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * F (a + s)) - F a) atTop (𝓝 0) := by
    have h' : Tendsto (fun a : ℝ => W * |C₀| * a ^ (-q)) atTop (𝓝 0) := by
      have h8 := (tendsto_rpow_neg_atTop hq).const_mul (W * |C₀|)
      rwa [mul_zero] at h8
    apply squeeze_zero_norm' _ h'
    filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop (max R₀ 1)] with a ha
    rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]
    exact key a ha
  have h9 := hA.sub hdiffT
  rw [sub_zero] at h9
  exact h9.congr (fun a => sub_sub_cancel _ _)

theorem adm_flux_converges (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (q : ℝ) (hq : 1 / 2 < q)
    (hsmooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => G x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖})
    (hsymm : ∀ (x : E3) (i j : Fin 3), G x i j = G x j i)
    (hdecay : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ∀ l : ℕ, l ≤ 2 →
      (fun x : E3 => ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l
          (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖)
        =O[Bornology.cobounded E3] fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (-q - (l : ℝ)))
    (hint : IntegrableOn (fun x : E3 => scalarCurvatureLocal G x * Real.sqrt (G x).det)
      {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖}) :
    ∃ m : ℝ, Tendsto (fun r : ℝ => 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r ^ 2 *
      ∫ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1),
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => G x i j) (r • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => G x i i) (r • (θ : E3))) * (θ : E3) j
        ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere) atTop (𝓝 m) :=
by
  have hq0 : 0 < q := by linarith
  obtain ⟨R, C, hR, hC, hb⟩ := metric_coeff_bounds G q hq0 hsmooth hdecay
  obtain ⟨R₀, C₀, hdecomp⟩ :=
    scalar_curvature_div_decomp G q hq0 hsmooth hsymm R C hR hC hb
  obtain ⟨R₁, hD⟩ :=
    div_integrable_exterior G q hq hsmooth R C hR hC hb hint R₀ C₀ hdecomp
  obtain ⟨hInt, hΨ⟩ := smoothed_tail_tendsto_zero (fluxDivLocal G) R₁ hD
  obtain ⟨R₂, C₂, hosc⟩ := flux_increment_bound G q hq0 hsmooth R C hR hC hb
  
  let A : ℝ → ℝ := fun a =>
    ∫ s in (0 : ℝ)..1, deriv Real.smoothTransition s * fluxLocal G (a + s)
  let Ψ : ℝ → ℝ := fun a =>
    ∫ x : E3, fluxDivLocal G x * Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a)
  have hΨ' : Tendsto Ψ atTop (𝓝 0) := hΨ
  have hpi : (16 * Real.pi) ≠ 0 := by positivity
  have h01 : R₁ ≤ max R₁ 2 := le_max_left _ _
  have h02 : (2 : ℝ) ≤ max R₁ 2 := le_max_right _ _
  have hAeq : ∀ a : ℝ, max R₁ 2 ≤ a →
      A a = (A (max R₁ 2) + Ψ (max R₁ 2) / (16 * Real.pi)) - Ψ a / (16 * Real.pi) := by
    intro a ha
    have ha1 : R₁ ≤ a := le_trans h01 ha
    have ha2 : (2 : ℝ) ≤ a := le_trans h02 ha
    have hL : ∫ x : E3, fluxDivLocal G x
        * (Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - max R₁ 2) - Real.smoothTransition (‖x‖ - a))
        = Ψ (max R₁ 2) - Ψ a := by
      simp only [Ψ, mul_sub]
      exact integral_sub (hInt _ h01) (hInt a ha1)
    have hs5 : Ψ (max R₁ 2) - Ψ a = -(16 * Real.pi) * (A (max R₁ 2) - A a) := by
      rw [← hL]
      exact divergence_shell_identity G hsmooth (max R₁ 2) a h02 ha2
    have key : Ψ (max R₁ 2) / (16 * Real.pi) - Ψ a / (16 * Real.pi) = A a - A (max R₁ 2) := by
      rw [← sub_div, hs5]
      field_simp
      ring
    linarith
  have hAt : Tendsto A atTop (𝓝 (A (max R₁ 2) + Ψ (max R₁ 2) / (16 * Real.pi))) := by
    have h1 : Tendsto (fun a => (A (max R₁ 2) + Ψ (max R₁ 2) / (16 * Real.pi))
        - Ψ a / (16 * Real.pi)) atTop
        (𝓝 ((A (max R₁ 2) + Ψ (max R₁ 2) / (16 * Real.pi)) - 0 / (16 * Real.pi))) :=
      tendsto_const_nhds.sub (hΨ'.div_const _)
    rw [zero_div, sub_zero] at h1
    refine h1.congr' ?_
    filter_upwards [eventually_ge_atTop (max R₁ 2)] with a ha
    exact (hAeq a ha).symm
  exact ⟨A (max R₁ 2) + Ψ (max R₁ 2) / (16 * Real.pi),
    tendsto_of_smoothed_tendsto (fluxLocal G) q hq0 R₂ C₂ hosc _ hAt⟩

theorem isometric_coeff_eq_inner_fderiv [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (Φ : EndChart M)
    (F : Diffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) M E3 ∞)
    (hF : ∀ (p : M) (v w : E3), g.g p v w = @inner ℝ E3 _
      (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) F p v) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) F p w)) :
    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => F (Φ.Φ x)) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} ∧
    ∀ x : E3, 1 < ‖x‖ → ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      g.coeff Φ.Φ x i j = @inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fun y => F (Φ.Φ y)) x (e i))
        (fderiv ℝ (fun y => F (Φ.Φ y)) x (e j)) :=
by
  have hφ : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ Φ.Φ Φ.Φ.source := Φ.Φ.contMDiffOn_toFun
  have hFs : ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ F := F.contMDiff
  have hcomp : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ (fun x => F (Φ.Φ x)) Φ.Φ.source :=
    hFs.comp_contMDiffOn hφ
  refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
  · rw [← Φ.source_eq]
    exact contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp hcomp
  · intro x hx i j
    have hmem : x ∈ Φ.Φ.source := by rw [Φ.source_eq]; exact hx
    have hφx : MDifferentiableAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ.Φ x :=
      (hφ.contMDiffAt (Φ.Φ.open_source.mem_nhds hmem)).mdifferentiableAt (by simp)
    have hFx : MDifferentiableAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) F (Φ.Φ x) :=
      hFs.mdifferentiableAt (by simp)
    have hchain : ∀ v : E3, fderiv ℝ (fun y => F (Φ.Φ y)) x v =
        mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) F (Φ.Φ x) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ.Φ x v) := by
      intro v
      rw [← mfderiv_eq_fderiv]
      exact mfderiv_comp_apply x hFx hφx v
    have h1 : g.coeff Φ.Φ x i j = g.g (Φ.Φ x) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ.Φ x (e i))
        (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ.Φ x (e j)) := rfl
    rw [h1, hF, hchain, hchain]

theorem gram_inverse_bound (p : Fin 3 → E3)
    (hp : ∀ i j : Fin 3, |@inner ℝ E3 _ (p i) (p j) - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 / 6)
    (v : E3) : ‖v‖ ≤ 3 * ∑ l : Fin 3, |@inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l)| :=
by
  
  have hq : ∀ c : Fin 3 → ℝ,
      (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ i : Fin 3, c i ^ 2 ≤ ‖∑ i : Fin 3, c i • p i‖ ^ 2 := by
    intro c
    have key : ∀ i j : Fin 3,
        c i * c j * (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - (c i ^ 2 + c j ^ 2) / 12
          ≤ c i * (c j * @inner ℝ E3 _ (p i) (p j)) := by
      intro i j
      obtain ⟨h1, h2⟩ := abs_le.mp (hp i j)
      have e1 : 0 ≤ (1 / 6 + (@inner ℝ E3 _ (p i) (p j) - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)))
          * (c i + c j) ^ 2 := mul_nonneg (by linarith) (sq_nonneg _)
      have e2 : 0 ≤ (1 / 6 - (@inner ℝ E3 _ (p i) (p j) - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)))
          * (c i - c j) ^ 2 := mul_nonneg (by linarith) (sq_nonneg _)
      nlinarith
    rw [← real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq]
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three, inner_add_left, inner_add_right, real_inner_smul_left,
      real_inner_smul_right]
    have k00 := key 0 0
    have k01 := key 0 1
    have k02 := key 0 2
    have k10 := key 1 0
    have k11 := key 1 1
    have k12 := key 1 2
    have k20 := key 2 0
    have k21 := key 2 1
    have k22 := key 2 2
    simp only [Fin.isValue, Fin.reduceEq, ↓reduceIte, mul_one, mul_zero] at k00 k01 k02 k10 k11 k12 k20 k21 k22
    linarith
  
  have hli : LinearIndependent ℝ p := by
    rw [Fintype.linearIndependent_iff]
    intro g hg i
    have h := hq g
    rw [hg, norm_zero] at h
    have hi : g i ^ 2 ≤ ∑ j : Fin 3, g j ^ 2 :=
      Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun j => g j ^ 2) (fun j _ => sq_nonneg (g j))
        (Finset.mem_univ i)
    have hz : g i ^ 2 = 0 := le_antisymm (by nlinarith) (sq_nonneg _)
    exact (pow_eq_zero_iff two_ne_zero).mp hz
  
  have hspan : Submodule.span ℝ (Set.range p) = ⊤ :=
    hli.span_eq_top_of_card_eq_finrank' (by rw [Fintype.card_fin, finrank_euclideanSpace_fin])
  have hvmem : v ∈ Submodule.span ℝ (Set.range p) := by
    rw [hspan]; exact Submodule.mem_top
  obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := (Submodule.mem_span_range_iff_exists_fun ℝ).mp hvmem
  
  have hinner : @inner ℝ E3 _ v (∑ i : Fin 3, c i • p i)
      = ∑ l : Fin 3, c l * @inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l) := by
    rw [inner_sum]
    simp only [real_inner_smul_right]
  rw [hc] at hinner
  have hN : ‖v‖ ^ 2 = ∑ l : Fin 3, c l * @inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l) := by
    rw [← real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq, hinner]
  have hqc := hq c
  rw [hc] at hqc
  have hn0 : 0 ≤ ‖v‖ := norm_nonneg v
  have hcl : ∀ l : Fin 3, |c l| ≤ 3 * ‖v‖ := by
    intro l
    have hl : c l ^ 2 ≤ ∑ j : Fin 3, c j ^ 2 :=
      Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun j => c j ^ 2) (fun j _ => sq_nonneg (c j))
        (Finset.mem_univ l)
    have hsq : c l ^ 2 ≤ (3 * ‖v‖) ^ 2 := by nlinarith
    have := sq_le_sq.mp hsq
    rwa [abs_of_nonneg (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 3 * ‖v‖)] at this
  have hterm : ∀ l : Fin 3, c l * @inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l)
      ≤ 3 * ‖v‖ * |@inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l)| := by
    intro l
    calc c l * @inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l) ≤ |c l * @inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l)| := le_abs_self _
      _ = |c l| * |@inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l)| := abs_mul _ _
      _ ≤ 3 * ‖v‖ * |@inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l)| :=
          mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hcl l) (abs_nonneg _)
  have hsum : ‖v‖ * ‖v‖ ≤ ‖v‖ * (3 * ∑ l : Fin 3, |@inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l)|) := by
    have h1 : ‖v‖ ^ 2 ≤ ∑ l : Fin 3, 3 * ‖v‖ * |@inner ℝ E3 _ v (p l)| := by
      rw [hN]; exact Finset.sum_le_sum (fun l _ => hterm l)
    rw [← Finset.mul_sum] at h1
    nlinarith
  rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hn0 with h0 | hpos
  · rw [← h0]; positivity
  · exact le_of_mul_le_mul_left hsum hpos

theorem sphere_oscillation_bound (f : E3 → E3) (r B : ℝ) (hr : 0 < r)
    (hdiff : ∀ z : E3, r / 2 ≤ ‖z‖ → DifferentiableAt ℝ f z)
    (hB : ∀ z : E3, r / 2 ≤ ‖z‖ → ∀ j : Fin 3, ‖fderiv ℝ f z (e j)‖ ≤ B)
    (x y : E3) (hx : ‖x‖ = r) (hy : ‖y‖ = r) : ‖f x - f y‖ ≤ 5 * r * B :=
by
  have hB0 : 0 ≤ B := (norm_nonneg _).trans (hB x (by rw [hx]; linarith) 0)
  
  have hop : ∀ z : E3, r / 2 ≤ ‖z‖ → ‖fderiv ℝ f z‖ ≤ 7 / 4 * B := by
    intro z hz
    have hcol := hB z hz
    refine ContinuousLinearMap.opNorm_le_bound _ (by positivity) (fun v => ?_)
    have hv : v = v 0 • e 0 + v 1 • e 1 + v 2 • e 2 := by
      ext i; fin_cases i <;> simp
    have hLv : fderiv ℝ f z v = v 0 • fderiv ℝ f z (e 0) + v 1 • fderiv ℝ f z (e 1)
        + v 2 • fderiv ℝ f z (e 2) := by
      conv_lhs => rw [hv]
      simp only [map_add, map_smul]
    have hn : ‖v‖ ^ 2 = v 0 ^ 2 + v 1 ^ 2 + v 2 ^ 2 := by
      rw [EuclideanSpace.norm_sq_eq, Fin.sum_univ_three]
      simp [Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]
    have c0 := hcol 0
    have c1 := hcol 1
    have c2 := hcol 2
    have h1 : ‖fderiv ℝ f z v‖ ≤ |v 0| * B + |v 1| * B + |v 2| * B := by
      rw [hLv]
      calc _ ≤ ‖v 0 • fderiv ℝ f z (e 0)‖ + ‖v 1 • fderiv ℝ f z (e 1)‖
            + ‖v 2 • fderiv ℝ f z (e 2)‖ := norm_add₃_le
        _ = |v 0| * ‖fderiv ℝ f z (e 0)‖ + |v 1| * ‖fderiv ℝ f z (e 1)‖
            + |v 2| * ‖fderiv ℝ f z (e 2)‖ := by simp only [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs]
        _ ≤ _ := by gcongr
    have hs2 : (|v 0| + |v 1| + |v 2|) ^ 2 ≤ (7 / 4 * ‖v‖) ^ 2 := by
      have := sq_abs (v 0)
      have := sq_abs (v 1)
      have := sq_abs (v 2)
      nlinarith [sq_nonneg (|v 0| - |v 1|), sq_nonneg (|v 1| - |v 2|), sq_nonneg (|v 0| - |v 2|),
        sq_nonneg ‖v‖]
    have hs : |v 0| + |v 1| + |v 2| ≤ 7 / 4 * ‖v‖ := by
      have hn0 := norm_nonneg v
      have a0 := abs_nonneg (v 0)
      have a1 := abs_nonneg (v 1)
      have a2 := abs_nonneg (v 2)
      nlinarith
    calc ‖fderiv ℝ f z v‖ ≤ B * (|v 0| + |v 1| + |v 2|) := by linarith
      _ ≤ B * (7 / 4 * ‖v‖) := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hs hB0
      _ = 7 / 4 * B * ‖v‖ := by ring
  
  have hseg : ∀ a b : E3, ‖a‖ = r → ‖b‖ = r → 0 ≤ @inner ℝ E3 _ a b →
      ‖f a - f b‖ ≤ 7 / 4 * B * (10 / 7 * r) := by
    intro a b ha hb hab
    have hba : 0 ≤ @inner ℝ E3 _ b a := by rw [real_inner_comm]; exact hab
    have hmem : ∀ z ∈ segment ℝ b a, r / 2 ≤ ‖z‖ := by
      rintro z ⟨s, t, hs, ht, hst, rfl⟩
      have hsq : ‖s • b + t • a‖ ^ 2
          = s ^ 2 * r ^ 2 + 2 * (s * t) * @inner ℝ E3 _ b a + t ^ 2 * r ^ 2 := by
        rw [norm_add_sq_real, norm_smul, norm_smul, real_inner_smul_left, real_inner_smul_right,
          ha, hb, Real.norm_eq_abs, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg hs, abs_of_nonneg ht]
        ring
      have h2 : 1 / 2 ≤ s ^ 2 + t ^ 2 := by nlinarith [sq_nonneg (s - t)]
      have h3 : (r / 2) ^ 2 ≤ ‖s • b + t • a‖ ^ 2 := by
        rw [hsq]
        nlinarith [mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right h2 (sq_nonneg r),
          mul_nonneg (mul_nonneg hs ht) hba, sq_nonneg r]
      nlinarith [norm_nonneg (s • b + t • a)]
    have hC := Convex.norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_fderiv_le (𝕜 := ℝ) (f := f)
      (fun z hz => hdiff z (hmem z hz)) (fun z hz => hop z (hmem z hz)) (convex_segment b a)
      (left_mem_segment ℝ b a) (right_mem_segment ℝ b a)
    have hchord : ‖a - b‖ ≤ 10 / 7 * r := by
      have hsq : ‖a - b‖ ^ 2 = r ^ 2 - 2 * @inner ℝ E3 _ a b + r ^ 2 := by
        rw [norm_sub_sq_real, ha, hb]
      nlinarith [norm_nonneg (a - b)]
    calc ‖f a - f b‖ ≤ 7 / 4 * B * ‖a - b‖ := hC
      _ ≤ 7 / 4 * B * (10 / 7 * r) := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hchord (by positivity)
  
  obtain ⟨u, hu0, hxu⟩ : ∃ u : E3, u ≠ 0 ∧ @inner ℝ E3 _ x u = 0 := by
    have hie : ∀ i : Fin 3, @inner ℝ E3 _ x (e i) = x i := by
      intro i
      simp [e, EuclideanSpace.inner_single_right]
    by_cases h : x 0 = 0 ∧ x 1 = 0
    · refine ⟨e 0, ?_, ?_⟩
      · intro h0
        have := congrArg (fun v : E3 => v 0) h0
        simp at this
      · rw [hie 0, h.1]
    · refine ⟨x 0 • e 1 - x 1 • e 0, ?_, ?_⟩
      · intro h0
        apply h
        have h1 := congrArg (fun v : E3 => v 1) h0
        have h2 := congrArg (fun v : E3 => v 0) h0
        simp at h1 h2
        exact ⟨h1, h2⟩
      · rw [inner_sub_right, real_inner_smul_right, real_inner_smul_right, hie 0, hie 1]
        ring
  have hun : 0 < ‖u‖ := norm_pos_iff.mpr hu0
  set w₀ : E3 := (r / ‖u‖) • u with hw₀
  have hw₀n : ‖w₀‖ = r := by
    rw [hw₀, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (div_nonneg hr.le hun.le),
      div_mul_cancel₀ _ hun.ne']
  have hxw₀ : @inner ℝ E3 _ x w₀ = 0 := by
    rw [hw₀, real_inner_smul_right, hxu, mul_zero]
  obtain ⟨w, hw, hxw, hwy⟩ : ∃ w : E3, ‖w‖ = r ∧ @inner ℝ E3 _ x w = 0 ∧
      0 ≤ @inner ℝ E3 _ w y := by
    rcases le_or_gt 0 (@inner ℝ E3 _ w₀ y) with hpos | hneg
    · exact ⟨w₀, hw₀n, hxw₀, hpos⟩
    · refine ⟨-w₀, by rw [norm_neg, hw₀n], by rw [inner_neg_right, hxw₀, neg_zero], ?_⟩
      rw [inner_neg_left]
      linarith
  have h1 := hseg x w hx hw (le_of_eq hxw.symm)
  have h2 := hseg w y hw hy hwy
  calc ‖f x - f y‖ ≤ ‖f x - f w‖ + ‖f w - f y‖ := norm_sub_le_norm_sub_add_norm_sub _ _ _
    _ ≤ 5 * r * B := by nlinarith

theorem sphere_rotation_integral_zero (r : ℝ) (hr : 0 < r) (U : Set E3) (hU : IsOpen U)
    (hsub : sphere (0 : E3) r ⊆ U) (f : E3 → ℝ) (hf : ContDiffOn ℝ 1 f U) (i j : Fin 3) :
    ∫ θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1,
        fderiv ℝ f (r • (θ : E3)) ((r • (θ : E3)) j • e i - (r • (θ : E3)) i • e j)
      ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere = 0 :=
by
  rcases eq_or_ne i j with rfl | hij
  · simp
  
  have s2 : ∀ (R : E3 ≃ₗᵢ[ℝ] E3) (h : E3 → ℝ),
      ∫ θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1, h (R (θ : E3)) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere =
        ∫ θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1, h (θ : E3) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere := by
    intro R h
    have hiff : ∀ x : E3, x ∈ sphere (0:E3) 1 ↔ R.toHomeomorph x ∈ sphere (0:E3) 1 := by
      intro x
      simp
    let RS : sphere (0:E3) 1 ≃ₜ sphere (0:E3) 1 := R.toHomeomorph.subtype hiff
    let RSm := RS.toMeasurableEquiv
    have hcoe : ∀ θ : sphere (0:E3) 1, ((RSm θ : sphere (0:E3) 1) : E3) = R θ := fun θ => rfl
    open scoped Pointwise in
    have hset : ∀ s : Set (sphere (0:E3) 1),
        Set.Ioo (0:ℝ) 1 • (Subtype.val '' (RSm ⁻¹' s))
          = R ⁻¹' (Set.Ioo (0:ℝ) 1 • (Subtype.val '' s)) := by
      intro s
      ext y
      simp only [Set.mem_smul, Set.mem_preimage, Set.mem_image]
      constructor
      · rintro ⟨c, hc, _, ⟨θ, hθ, rfl⟩, rfl⟩
        exact ⟨c, hc, R θ, ⟨RSm θ, hθ, hcoe θ⟩, by rw [map_smul]⟩
      · rintro ⟨c, hc, _, ⟨φ, hφ, rfl⟩, hy⟩
        have hmem : R.symm (φ : E3) ∈ sphere (0:E3) 1 := by
          rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm, LinearIsometryEquiv.norm_map]
          exact mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm.mp φ.2
        refine ⟨c, hc, R.symm φ, ⟨⟨R.symm φ, hmem⟩, ?_, rfl⟩, ?_⟩
        · have : RSm ⟨R.symm φ, hmem⟩ = φ := Subtype.ext (by rw [hcoe]; simp)
          rw [this]; exact hφ
        · rw [← map_smul, hy]; simp
    have hvol : ∀ X : Set E3, volume (R ⁻¹' X) = volume X := fun X => by
      have hmp : MeasurePreserving (R.toHomeomorph.toMeasurableEquiv) volume volume :=
        R.measurePreserving
      exact hmp.measure_preimage_equiv X
    have hmp : MeasurePreserving RSm (volume : Measure E3).toSphere
        (volume : Measure E3).toSphere := by
      refine ⟨RSm.measurable, ?_⟩
      ext s hs
      rw [MeasurableEquiv.map_apply, Measure.toSphere_apply' _ (RSm.measurable hs),
        Measure.toSphere_apply' _ hs, hset, hvol]
    exact hmp.integral_comp' (fun φ : sphere (0:E3) 1 => h φ)
  
  have s3 : ∀ t : ℝ, ∃ R : E3 ≃ₗᵢ[ℝ] E3, ∀ x : E3,
      R x = x + (Real.cos t - 1) • (x i • e i + x j • e j)
        + Real.sin t • (x j • e i - x i • e j) := by
    intro t
    let L : E3 →ₗ[ℝ] E3 :=
      { toFun := fun x => x + (Real.cos t - 1) • (x i • e i + x j • e j)
          + Real.sin t • (x j • e i - x i • e j)
        map_add' := by
          intro x y
          simp only [PiLp.add_apply, add_smul, smul_add]
          module
        map_smul' := by
          intro a x
          simp only [PiLp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, RingHom.id_apply, smul_add, smul_sub, mul_smul]
          module }
    have hn : ∀ x, ‖L x‖ = ‖x‖ := by
      intro x
      rw [← sq_eq_sq₀ (norm_nonneg _) (norm_nonneg _), EuclideanSpace.norm_sq_eq,
        EuclideanSpace.norm_sq_eq]
      simp only [Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs, Fin.sum_univ_three]
      fin_cases i <;> fin_cases j <;> simp [L, EuclideanSpace.single_apply] at hij ⊢ <;>
        first
        | linear_combination (x.ofLp 0 ^ 2 + x.ofLp 1 ^ 2) * Real.sin_sq_add_cos_sq t
        | linear_combination (x.ofLp 0 ^ 2 + x.ofLp 2 ^ 2) * Real.sin_sq_add_cos_sq t
        | linear_combination (x.ofLp 1 ^ 2 + x.ofLp 2 ^ 2) * Real.sin_sq_add_cos_sq t
    exact ⟨(LinearIsometry.mk L hn).toLinearIsometryEquiv rfl, fun x => rfl⟩
  
  obtain ⟨ρ, hρ⟩ : ∃ ρ : ℝ → E3 → E3, ∀ t x, ρ t x = x + (Real.cos t - 1) • (x i • e i + x j • e j)
      + Real.sin t • (x j • e i - x i • e j) := ⟨_, fun _ _ => rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨ρ', hρ'⟩ : ∃ ρ' : ℝ → E3 → E3, ∀ t x, ρ' t x = (-Real.sin t) • (x i • e i + x j • e j)
      + Real.cos t • (x j • e i - x i • e j) := ⟨_, fun _ _ => rfl⟩
  have hnorm : ∀ t x, ‖ρ t x‖ = ‖x‖ := by
    intro t x
    obtain ⟨R, hR⟩ := s3 t
    rw [hρ, ← hR]
    exact R.norm_map x
  have hderiv : ∀ t x, HasDerivAt (fun s => ρ s x) (ρ' t x) t := by
    intro t x
    have := ((hasDerivAt_const t x).add (((Real.hasDerivAt_cos t).sub_const 1).smul_const
      (x i • e i + x j • e j))).add ((Real.hasDerivAt_sin t).smul_const (x j • e i - x i • e j))
    rw [zero_add, ← hρ'] at this
    have heq : (fun s => ρ s x) = ((fun _ => x) + fun y => (Real.cos y - 1) • (x i • e i + x j • e j))
        + fun y => Real.sin y • (x j • e i - x i • e j) := by
      funext s
      simp only [Pi.add_apply, hρ]
    rw [heq]
    exact this
  have hbound : ∀ t x, ‖ρ' t x‖ ≤ 4 * ‖x‖ := by
    intro t x
    rw [hρ']
    have hi : ‖x i‖ ≤ ‖x‖ := PiLp.norm_apply_le x i
    have hj : ‖x j‖ ≤ ‖x‖ := PiLp.norm_apply_le x j
    have hs := Real.abs_sin_le_one t
    have hc := Real.abs_cos_le_one t
    have h1 : ‖x i • e i + x j • e j‖ ≤ ‖x‖ + ‖x‖ := by
      refine (norm_add_le _ _).trans ?_
      simp only [norm_smul, EuclideanSpace.norm_single, norm_one, mul_one]
      exact add_le_add hi hj
    have h2 : ‖x j • e i - x i • e j‖ ≤ ‖x‖ + ‖x‖ := by
      refine (norm_sub_le _ _).trans ?_
      simp only [norm_smul, EuclideanSpace.norm_single, norm_one, mul_one]
      exact add_le_add hj hi
    calc _ ≤ ‖(-Real.sin t) • (x i • e i + x j • e j)‖ + ‖Real.cos t • (x j • e i - x i • e j)‖ :=
          norm_add_le _ _
      _ = |Real.sin t| * ‖x i • e i + x j • e j‖ + |Real.cos t| * ‖x j • e i - x i • e j‖ := by
          rw [norm_smul, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_neg]
      _ ≤ 1 * (‖x‖ + ‖x‖) + 1 * (‖x‖ + ‖x‖) :=
          add_le_add (mul_le_mul hs h1 (norm_nonneg _) zero_le_one)
            (mul_le_mul hc h2 (norm_nonneg _) zero_le_one)
      _ = 4 * ‖x‖ := by ring
  have hcont : ∀ t, Continuous (ρ t) := by
    intro t
    rw [show ρ t = _ from funext (hρ t)]
    fun_prop
  have hcont' : ∀ t, Continuous (ρ' t) := by
    intro t
    rw [show ρ' t = _ from funext (hρ' t)]
    fun_prop
  have hsph : ∀ t (θ : sphere (0:E3) 1), r • ρ t θ ∈ sphere (0:E3) r := by
    intro t θ
    rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm, norm_smul, hnorm, norm_eq_of_mem_sphere, Real.norm_eq_abs,
      abs_of_pos hr, mul_one]
  have hmem : ∀ t (θ : sphere (0:E3) 1), r • ρ t θ ∈ U := fun t θ => hsub (hsph t θ)
  have hfc : ContinuousOn f U := hf.continuousOn
  have hf'c : ContinuousOn (fderiv ℝ f) U := hf.continuousOn_fderiv_of_isOpen hU le_rfl
  have hfd : ∀ y ∈ U, HasFDerivAt f (fderiv ℝ f y) y := fun y hy =>
    ((hf.differentiableOn one_ne_zero y hy).differentiableAt (hU.mem_nhds hy)).hasFDerivAt
  obtain ⟨Mf, hMf⟩ := (isCompact_sphere (0:E3) r).exists_bound_of_continuousOn (hf'c.mono hsub)
  have hFc : ∀ t, Continuous (fun θ : sphere (0:E3) 1 => f (r • ρ t θ)) := fun t =>
    hfc.comp_continuous (continuous_const.smul ((hcont t).comp continuous_subtype_val))
      (fun θ => hmem t θ)
  have hF'c : Continuous (fun θ : sphere (0:E3) 1 => fderiv ℝ f (r • ρ 0 θ) (r • ρ' 0 θ)) :=
    (hf'c.comp_continuous (continuous_const.smul ((hcont 0).comp continuous_subtype_val))
      (fun θ => hmem 0 θ)).clm_apply
      (continuous_const.smul ((hcont' 0).comp continuous_subtype_val))
  have hb : ∀ (t : ℝ) (θ : sphere (0:E3) 1),
      ‖fderiv ℝ f (r • ρ t θ) (r • ρ' t θ)‖ ≤ Mf * (r * 4) := by
    intro t θ
    have h1 : ‖r • ρ' t θ‖ ≤ r * 4 := by
      rw [norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos hr]
      have := hbound t θ
      rw [norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ, mul_one] at this
      exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left this hr.le
    have h2 : ‖fderiv ℝ f (r • ρ t θ)‖ ≤ Mf := hMf _ (hsph t θ)
    calc _ ≤ ‖fderiv ℝ f (r • ρ t θ)‖ * ‖r • ρ' t θ‖ := ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _
      _ ≤ Mf * (r * 4) := mul_le_mul h2 h1 (norm_nonneg _) ((norm_nonneg _).trans h2)
  have key := hasDerivAt_integral_of_dominated_loc_of_deriv_le
    (μ := (volume : Measure E3).toSphere)
    (F := fun t (θ : sphere (0:E3) 1) => f (r • ρ t θ))
    (F' := fun t (θ : sphere (0:E3) 1) => fderiv ℝ f (r • ρ t θ) (r • ρ' t θ))
    (x₀ := 0) (bound := fun _ => Mf * (r * 4)) (s := Set.univ) Filter.univ_mem
    (Filter.Eventually.of_forall fun t => (hFc t).aestronglyMeasurable)
    ((hFc 0).integrable_of_hasCompactSupport (HasCompactSupport.of_compactSpace _))
    hF'c.aestronglyMeasurable
    (ae_of_all _ fun θ t _ => hb t θ)
    (integrable_const _)
    (ae_of_all _ fun θ t _ => (hfd _ (hmem t θ)).comp_hasDerivAt t ((hderiv t θ).const_smul r))
  
  have hconst : (fun t => ∫ θ : sphere (0:E3) 1, f (r • ρ t θ) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere)
      = fun _ => ∫ θ : sphere (0:E3) 1, f (r • (θ : E3)) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere := by
    funext t
    obtain ⟨R, hR⟩ := s3 t
    have hR' : ∀ x, ρ t x = R x := fun x => by rw [hρ, hR]
    simp only [hR']
    exact s2 R (fun y => f (r • y))
  have h0 : HasDerivAt
      (fun t => ∫ θ : sphere (0:E3) 1, f (r • ρ t θ) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere) 0 0 := by
    rw [hconst]; exact hasDerivAt_const _ _
  have hI := key.2.unique h0
  have hpt : ∀ θ : sphere (0:E3) 1, fderiv ℝ f (r • ρ 0 θ) (r • ρ' 0 θ) =
      fderiv ℝ f (r • (θ : E3)) ((r • (θ : E3)) j • e i - (r • (θ : E3)) i • e j) := by
    intro θ
    rw [hρ, hρ']
    simp only [Real.cos_zero, Real.sin_zero, sub_self, zero_smul, add_zero, neg_zero, zero_add,
      one_smul]
    congr 1
    simp only [PiLp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, smul_sub, mul_smul]
  simp only [hpt] at hI
  exact hI

theorem decay_bounds_of_isBigO (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (q : ℝ) (hq : 0 < q)
    (hdecay : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ∀ l : ℕ, l ≤ 2 →
      (fun x : E3 => ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l
          (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖)
        =O[Bornology.cobounded E3] fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (-q - (l : ℝ))) :
    ∃ C R : ℝ, 0 ≤ C ∧ 0 < R ∧ ∀ x : E3, R ≤ ‖x‖ → ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      |G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 / 6 ∧
      ∀ k : Fin 3, |partialDeriv k (fun y => G y i j) x| ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 1) :=
by
  classical
  
  have hsmall1 : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3,
      ‖G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)‖ ≤ 1 / 6 := by
    intro i j
    have h0 := hdecay i j 0 (Nat.zero_le 2)
    have hv : Tendsto (fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (-q - ((0 : ℕ) : ℝ))) (Bornology.cobounded E3)
        (𝓝 0) := by
      simp only [Nat.cast_zero, sub_zero]
      exact (tendsto_rpow_neg_atTop hq).comp tendsto_norm_cobounded_atTop
    have h1 := h0.trans_tendsto hv
    simp only [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero] at h1
    exact h1.eventually (ge_mem_nhds (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 1 / 6))
  have hsmall : ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      ‖G x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)‖ ≤ 1 / 6 :=
    Filter.eventually_all.2 fun i => Filter.eventually_all.2 fun j => hsmall1 i j
  
  have hbound : ∀ i j l : Fin 3, ∃ c : ℝ, ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3,
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l.val (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖
        ≤ c * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - (l.val : ℝ)) := by
    intro i j l
    obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ := (hdecay i j l.val (Nat.lt_succ_iff.1 l.isLt)).bound
    refine ⟨c, hc.mono fun x hx => ?_⟩
    rwa [norm_norm, Real.norm_of_nonneg (Real.rpow_nonneg (norm_nonneg x) _)] at hx
  choose c hc using hbound
  set C : ℝ := ∑ a : Fin 3 × Fin 3 × Fin 3, |c a.1 a.2.1 a.2.2| with hCdef
  have hC : 0 ≤ C := Finset.sum_nonneg fun a _ => abs_nonneg _
  have hcC : ∀ i j l : Fin 3, c i j l ≤ C := fun i j l =>
    (le_abs_self _).trans
      (Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun a : Fin 3 × Fin 3 × Fin 3 => |c a.1 a.2.1 a.2.2|)
        (fun b _ => abs_nonneg _) (Finset.mem_univ (i, j, l)))
  have hunif : ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3, ∀ i j l : Fin 3,
      ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ l.val (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖
        ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - (l.val : ℝ)) := by
    refine Filter.eventually_all.2 fun i => Filter.eventually_all.2 fun j =>
      Filter.eventually_all.2 fun l => ?_
    exact (hc i j l).mono fun x hx =>
      hx.trans (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hcC i j l) (Real.rpow_nonneg (norm_nonneg x) _))
  
  obtain ⟨r, -, hr⟩ :=
    (Metric.hasBasis_cobounded_compl_closedBall (0 : E3)).eventually_iff.1 (hsmall.and hunif)
  refine ⟨C, max (r + 1) 1, hC, lt_of_lt_of_le one_pos (le_max_right _ _), fun x hx => ?_⟩
  have hxr : x ∈ (Metric.closedBall (0 : E3) r)ᶜ := by
    simp only [Set.mem_compl_iff, Metric.mem_closedBall, dist_zero_right, not_le]
    have : r + 1 ≤ ‖x‖ := le_trans (le_max_left _ _) hx
    linarith
  obtain ⟨hsx, hux⟩ := hr hxr
  intro i j
  refine ⟨?_, fun k => ?_⟩
  · have h := hsx i j
    rwa [Real.norm_eq_abs] at h
  · have h := hux i j 1
    change ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ 1 (fun y => G y i j - if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) x‖
        ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - ((1 : ℕ) : ℝ)) at h
    rw [norm_iteratedFDeriv_one, Nat.cast_one, fderiv_sub_const] at h
    unfold partialDeriv
    rw [← Real.norm_eq_abs]
    calc ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j) x (e k)‖
        ≤ ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j) x‖ * ‖e k‖ := ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _
      _ = ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => G y i j) x‖ := by simp [e, EuclideanSpace.norm_single]
      _ ≤ C * ‖x‖ ^ (-q - 1) := h

theorem flux_tendsto_zero_of_isometric [T2Space M] [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) (hiso : IsometricToEuclidean g)
    (k : Fin hAF.numEnds) :
    Tendsto (fun r : ℝ => admFlux g (hAF.ends k) r) atTop (𝓝 0) :=
by
  obtain ⟨F, hF⟩ := hiso
  obtain ⟨hψ, hcoef⟩ := isometric_coeff_eq_inner_fderiv g (hAF.ends k) F hF
  generalize hψdef : (fun y => F ((hAF.ends k).Φ y)) = ψ at hψ hcoef
  set U₁ : Set E3 := {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} with hU₁def
  have hU₁ : IsOpen U₁ := isOpen_lt continuous_const continuous_norm
  have hq2 : 1 / 2 < hAF.q := hAF.q_gt
  
  have hψ3 : ContDiffOn ℝ 3 ψ U₁ := hψ.of_le (by norm_cast)
  have hψ2 : ContDiffOn ℝ 2 ψ U₁ := hψ.of_le (by norm_cast)
  have hDψ : ContDiffOn ℝ 2 (fderiv ℝ ψ) U₁ := hψ3.fderiv_of_isOpen hU₁ (by norm_num)
  have hDψ1 : ContDiffOn ℝ 1 (fderiv ℝ ψ) U₁ := hDψ.of_le (by norm_num)
  have hDψdiff : ∀ z ∈ U₁, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) z := fun z hz =>
    (hDψ.differentiableOn (by norm_num) z hz).differentiableAt (hU₁.mem_nhds hz)
  have hD2cont : ContinuousOn (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ)) U₁ :=
    hDψ.continuousOn_fderiv_of_isOpen hU₁ (by norm_num)
  have hDcont : ContinuousOn (fderiv ℝ ψ) U₁ := hDψ.continuousOn
  have hpdiff : ∀ z ∈ U₁, ∀ v : E3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => fderiv ℝ ψ y v) z :=
    fun z hz v => (hDψdiff z hz).clm_apply (differentiableAt_const v)
  have hpQ : ∀ z ∈ U₁, ∀ v w : E3,
      fderiv ℝ (fun y => fderiv ℝ ψ y v) z w = fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) z w v := by
    intro z hz v w
    rw [fderiv_clm_apply (hDψdiff z hz) (differentiableAt_const v)]
    simp
  have hQsym : ∀ z ∈ U₁, ∀ v w : E3,
      fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) z v w = fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) z w v := fun z hz v w =>
    (hψ2.contDiffAt (hU₁.mem_nhds hz)).isSymmSndFDerivAt (by simp) v w
  
  have hstar : ∀ x ∈ U₁, ∀ i j l : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun y => g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ y i j) x =
        @inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e l) (e i)) (fderiv ℝ ψ x (e j)) +
        @inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ ψ x (e i)) (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e l) (e j)) := by
    intro x hx i j l
    have heq : (fun y => g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ y i j) =ᶠ[𝓝 x]
        (fun y => @inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ ψ y (e i)) (fderiv ℝ ψ y (e j))) :=
      Filter.eventually_of_mem (hU₁.mem_nhds hx) (fun y hy => hcoef y hy i j)
    unfold partialDeriv
    rw [heq.fderiv_eq, fderiv_inner_apply ℝ (hpdiff x hx _) (hpdiff x hx _), hpQ x hx,
      hpQ x hx]
    ring
  
  obtain ⟨C, R, hC, hR, hdec⟩ :=
    decay_bounds_of_isBigO (g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ) hAF.q (by linarith) (hAF.decay k)
  set R₁ := max R 2 with hR₁
  set K := (27 / 2 : ℝ) * C with hK
  have hK0 : 0 ≤ K := by positivity
  
  have hQb : ∀ x : E3, R₁ ≤ ‖x‖ → ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e i) (e j)‖ ≤ K * ‖x‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1) := by
    intro x hx i j
    have hxR : R ≤ ‖x‖ := le_trans (le_max_left _ _) hx
    have hx2 : 2 ≤ ‖x‖ := le_trans (le_max_right _ _) hx
    have hxU : x ∈ U₁ := by show 1 < ‖x‖; linarith
    have hgram : ∀ a b : Fin 3, |@inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ ψ x (e a)) (fderiv ℝ ψ x (e b))
        - (if a = b then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 / 6 := by
      intro a b
      rw [← hcoef x hxU a b]
      exact (hdec x hxR a b).1
    have hG : ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e i) (e j)‖ ≤ 3 * ∑ l : Fin 3,
        |@inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e i) (e j)) (fderiv ℝ ψ x (e l))| :=
      gram_inverse_bound (fun l => fderiv ℝ ψ x (e l)) hgram _
    have hkos : ∀ l : Fin 3,
        |@inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e i) (e j)) (fderiv ℝ ψ x (e l))|
          ≤ (3 / 2) * (C * ‖x‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) := by
      intro l
      have h1 := hstar x hxU j l i
      have h2 := hstar x hxU i l j
      have h3 := hstar x hxU i j l
      have s1 := hQsym x hxU (e j) (e i)
      have s2 := hQsym x hxU (e l) (e i)
      have s3 := hQsym x hxU (e l) (e j)
      rw [s1] at h2
      rw [s2, s3] at h3
      have c1 := real_inner_comm (fderiv ℝ ψ x (e j)) (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e i) (e l))
      obtain ⟨a1, a2⟩ := abs_le.mp ((hdec x hxR j l).2 i)
      obtain ⟨b1, b2⟩ := abs_le.mp ((hdec x hxR i l).2 j)
      obtain ⟨d1, d2⟩ := abs_le.mp ((hdec x hxR i j).2 l)
      rw [abs_le]
      constructor <;> linarith
    calc ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e i) (e j)‖
        ≤ 3 * ∑ l : Fin 3,
          |@inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) x (e i) (e j)) (fderiv ℝ ψ x (e l))| := hG
      _ ≤ 3 * ∑ l : Fin 3, (3 / 2) * (C * ‖x‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) :=
          mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (Finset.sum_le_sum fun l _ => hkos l) (by norm_num)
      _ = K * ‖x‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1) := by
          rw [hK, Finset.sum_const, Finset.card_univ, Fintype.card_fin, nsmul_eq_mul]
          push_cast
          ring
  
  have alg : ∀ (p a : Fin 3 → E3) (Q : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → E3) (θ : Fin 3 → ℝ),
      (∀ i j, Q i j = Q j i) →
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
        ((@inner ℝ E3 _ (Q i i) (p j) + @inner ℝ E3 _ (p i) (Q i j))
          - (@inner ℝ E3 _ (Q j i) (p i) + @inner ℝ E3 _ (p i) (Q j i))) * θ j)
      = (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (θ j * @inner ℝ E3 _ (a j) (Q i i) - θ i * @inner ℝ E3 _ (a j) (Q j i)))
        + ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ i : Fin 3,
          (@inner ℝ E3 _ (Q i i) (p j - a j) - @inner ℝ E3 _ (p i - a i) (Q i j)) * θ j := by
    intro p a Q θ hQ
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three, inner_sub_left, inner_sub_right]
    rw [hQ 1 0, hQ 2 0, hQ 2 1]
    simp only [real_inner_comm (p 0), real_inner_comm (p 1), real_inner_comm (p 2),
      real_inner_comm (a 0), real_inner_comm (a 1), real_inner_comm (a 2)]
    ring
  
  have hint : ∀ f : sphere (0 : E3) 1 → ℝ, Continuous f →
      Integrable f (volume : Measure E3).toSphere := fun f hf =>
    hf.integrable_of_hasCompactSupport (HasCompactSupport.of_compactSpace f)
  
  set S := ((volume : Measure E3).toSphere).real Set.univ with hS
  have hS0 : 0 ≤ S := measureReal_nonneg
  have hT : 0 < (2 : ℝ) ^ (-hAF.q - 1) := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos (by norm_num) _
  set Dc := 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * 90 * K ^ 2 * S / (2 : ℝ) ^ (-hAF.q - 1) with hDc
  
  have hmain : ∀ r : ℝ, 2 * R₁ ≤ r →
      ‖admFlux g (hAF.ends k) r‖ ≤ Dc * r ^ (1 - 2 * hAF.q) := by
    intro r hr
    have hR₁2 : 2 ≤ R₁ := le_max_right _ _
    have hr0 : 0 < r := by linarith
    have hr1 : 1 < r := by linarith
    have hnorm : ∀ θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1, ‖r • (θ : E3)‖ = r := by
      intro θ
      rw [norm_smul, norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos hr0, mul_one]
    have hmemU : ∀ θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1, r • (θ : E3) ∈ U₁ := by
      intro θ
      show 1 < ‖r • (θ : E3)‖
      rw [hnorm θ]; exact hr1
    have hθ1 : ∀ (θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1) (j : Fin 3), |(θ : E3) j| ≤ 1 := by
      intro θ j
      have := PiLp.norm_apply_le (θ : E3) j
      rw [norm_eq_of_mem_sphere θ, Real.norm_eq_abs] at this
      exact this
    obtain ⟨a, ha⟩ : ∃ a : Fin 3 → E3, ∀ m, a m = fderiv ℝ ψ (r • e 0) (e m) :=
      ⟨_, fun _ => rfl⟩
    set B := K * (r / 2) ^ (-hAF.q - 1) with hBdef
    have hB0 : 0 ≤ B := mul_nonneg hK0 (Real.rpow_nonneg (by linarith) _)
    have hKr0 : 0 ≤ K * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1) := mul_nonneg hK0 (Real.rpow_nonneg hr0.le _)
    
    have hosc : ∀ m : Fin 3, ∀ x : E3, ‖x‖ = r → ‖fderiv ℝ ψ x (e m) - a m‖ ≤ 5 * r * B := by
      intro m x hx
      rw [ha m]
      refine sphere_oscillation_bound (fun y => fderiv ℝ ψ y (e m)) r B hr0 ?_ ?_ x (r • e 0)
        hx ?_
      · intro z hz
        exact hpdiff z (by show 1 < ‖z‖; linarith) _
      · intro z hz j
        have hzU : z ∈ U₁ := by show 1 < ‖z‖; linarith
        rw [hpQ z hzU]
        calc ‖fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) z (e j) (e m)‖ ≤ K * ‖z‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1) :=
              hQb z (by linarith) j m
          _ ≤ K * (r / 2) ^ (-hAF.q - 1) :=
              mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left
                (Real.rpow_le_rpow_of_nonpos (by linarith) hz (by linarith)) hK0
      · rw [norm_smul, EuclideanSpace.norm_single, Real.norm_eq_abs, Real.norm_eq_abs,
          abs_of_pos hr0, abs_one, mul_one]
    
    obtain ⟨Lq, hLq⟩ : ∃ Lq : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → sphere (0 : E3) 1 → ℝ, ∀ i j θ,
        Lq i j θ = (θ : E3) j * @inner ℝ E3 _ (a j)
            (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e i))
          - (θ : E3) i * @inner ℝ E3 _ (a j)
            (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e j) (e i)) :=
      ⟨_, fun _ _ _ => rfl⟩
    obtain ⟨rem, hrem⟩ : ∃ rem : sphere (0 : E3) 1 → ℝ, ∀ θ,
        rem θ = ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ i : Fin 3,
          (@inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e i))
              (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e j) - a j)
            - @inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) - a i)
              (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e j))) * (θ : E3) j :=
      ⟨_, fun _ => rfl⟩
    
    have hcont_smul : Continuous (fun θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1 => r • (θ : E3)) :=
      continuous_const.smul continuous_subtype_val
    have hcp : ∀ m : Fin 3, Continuous (fun θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1 =>
        fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e m)) := fun m =>
      (hDcont.clm_apply continuousOn_const).comp_continuous hcont_smul hmemU
    have hcQ : ∀ m n : Fin 3, Continuous (fun θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1 =>
        fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e m) (e n)) := fun m n =>
      ((hD2cont.clm_apply continuousOn_const).clm_apply continuousOn_const).comp_continuous
        hcont_smul hmemU
    have hcθ : ∀ m : Fin 3, Continuous (fun θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1 => (θ : E3) m) := by
      intro m; fun_prop
    have hLqint : ∀ i j, Integrable (Lq i j) (volume : Measure E3).toSphere := by
      intro i j
      apply hint
      rw [show Lq i j = _ from funext (hLq i j)]
      exact ((hcθ j).mul (continuous_const.inner (hcQ i i))).sub
        ((hcθ i).mul (continuous_const.inner (hcQ j i)))
    have hremint : Integrable rem (volume : Measure E3).toSphere := by
      apply hint
      rw [show rem = _ from funext hrem]
      refine continuous_finset_sum _ (fun j _ => continuous_finset_sum _ (fun i _ => ?_))
      exact (((hcQ i i).inner ((hcp j).sub continuous_const)).sub
        (((hcp i).sub continuous_const).inner (hcQ i j))).mul (hcθ j)
    
    have hLq0 : ∀ i j, ∫ θ, Lq i j θ ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere = 0 := by
      intro i j
      have hsub : sphere (0 : E3) r ⊆ U₁ := by
        intro y hy
        show 1 < ‖y‖
        rw [mem_sphere_zero_iff_norm.mp hy]; exact hr1
      have hfC : ContDiffOn ℝ 1 (fun y => @inner ℝ E3 _ (a j) (fderiv ℝ ψ y (e i))) U₁ :=
        contDiffOn_const.inner ℝ (hDψ1.clm_apply contDiffOn_const)
      have h5 := sphere_rotation_integral_zero r hr0 U₁ hU₁ hsub _ hfC i j
      have hpt : ∀ θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1,
          fderiv ℝ (fun y => @inner ℝ E3 _ (a j) (fderiv ℝ ψ y (e i))) (r • (θ : E3))
            ((r • (θ : E3)) j • e i - (r • (θ : E3)) i • e j) = r * Lq i j θ := by
        intro θ
        have hx := hmemU θ
        rw [fderiv_inner_apply ℝ (f := fun _ : E3 => a j)
          (g := fun y => fderiv ℝ ψ y (e i)) (differentiableAt_const (a j))
          (hpdiff _ hx (e i)), hpQ _ hx, hLq]
        simp only [fderiv_const_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.zero_apply, inner_zero_left,
          add_zero, map_sub, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sub_apply,
          ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, inner_sub_right, real_inner_smul_right,
          PiLp.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, smul_zero, sub_self]
        ring
      simp only [hpt] at h5
      rw [integral_const_mul] at h5
      exact (mul_eq_zero.mp h5).resolve_left hr0.ne'
    
    have hA : ∀ θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1,
        (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv i (fun x => g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ x i j) (r • (θ : E3))
            - partialDeriv j (fun x => g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ x i i) (r • (θ : E3)))
            * (θ : E3) j)
        = (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Lq i j θ) + rem θ := by
      intro θ
      have hx := hmemU θ
      simp only [hstar _ hx, hLq, hrem]
      exact alg (fun m => fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e m)) a
        (fun m n => fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e m) (e n)) (fun m => (θ : E3) m)
        (fun m n => hQsym _ hx (e m) (e n))
    
    have hsumint : Integrable (fun θ => ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Lq i j θ)
        (volume : Measure E3).toSphere :=
      integrable_finset_sum _ (fun i _ => integrable_finset_sum _ (fun j _ => hLqint i j))
    have h0 : ∫ θ, (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Lq i j θ) ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere = 0 := by
      rw [integral_finset_sum _ (fun i _ => integrable_finset_sum _ (fun j _ => hLqint i j))]
      refine Finset.sum_eq_zero (fun i _ => ?_)
      rw [integral_finset_sum _ (fun j _ => hLqint i j)]
      exact Finset.sum_eq_zero (fun j _ => hLq0 i j)
    have hflux : admFlux g (hAF.ends k) r =
        1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r ^ 2 * ∫ θ, rem θ ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere := by
      unfold admFlux
      congr 1
      rw [integral_congr_ae (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hA), integral_add hsumint hremint, h0,
        zero_add]
    
    have hremb : ∀ θ : sphere (0 : E3) 1,
        ‖rem θ‖ ≤ 9 * (2 * (K * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (5 * r * B)) := by
      intro θ
      have hx := hnorm θ
      have hxR : R₁ ≤ ‖r • (θ : E3)‖ := by rw [hx]; linarith
      have hterm : ∀ j i : Fin 3,
          |(@inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e i))
              (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e j) - a j)
            - @inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) - a i)
              (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e j))) * (θ : E3) j|
            ≤ 2 * (K * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (5 * r * B) := by
        intro j i
        have hQ1 := hQb _ hxR i i
        have hQ2 := hQb _ hxR i j
        rw [hx] at hQ1 hQ2
        have hp1 := hosc j _ hx
        have hp2 := hosc i _ hx
        have hδ0 : 0 ≤ 5 * r * B := by positivity
        have e1 := (abs_real_inner_le_norm (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e i))
          (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e j) - a j)).trans
          (mul_le_mul hQ1 hp1 (norm_nonneg _) hKr0)
        have e2 := (abs_real_inner_le_norm (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) - a i)
          (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e j))).trans
          (mul_le_mul hp2 hQ2 (norm_nonneg _) hδ0)
        rw [abs_mul]
        calc _ ≤ (2 * (K * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (5 * r * B)) * 1 :=
              mul_le_mul ((abs_sub _ _).trans (by linarith)) (hθ1 θ j) (abs_nonneg _)
                (by positivity)
          _ = _ := mul_one _
      rw [hrem θ, Real.norm_eq_abs]
      calc _ ≤ ∑ j : Fin 3, |∑ i : Fin 3,
            (@inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e i))
              (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e j) - a j)
            - @inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) - a i)
              (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e j))) * (θ : E3) j| :=
            Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _
        _ ≤ ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ i : Fin 3,
            |(@inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e i))
              (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e j) - a j)
            - @inner ℝ E3 _ (fderiv ℝ ψ (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) - a i)
              (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ ψ) (r • (θ : E3)) (e i) (e j))) * (θ : E3) j| :=
            Finset.sum_le_sum (fun j _ => Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _)
        _ ≤ ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ i : Fin 3, 2 * (K * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (5 * r * B) :=
            Finset.sum_le_sum (fun j _ => Finset.sum_le_sum (fun i _ => hterm j i))
        _ = 9 * (2 * (K * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (5 * r * B)) := by
            simp only [Finset.sum_const, Finset.card_univ, Fintype.card_fin, nsmul_eq_mul]
            push_cast
            ring
    have hIb : ‖∫ θ, rem θ ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere‖
        ≤ 9 * (2 * (K * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (5 * r * B)) * S :=
      norm_integral_le_of_norm_le_const (Filter.Eventually.of_forall hremb)
    
    have hsplit : r ^ (1 - 2 * hAF.q) = r ^ 3 * (r ^ (-hAF.q - 1) * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) := by
      have h3 : r ^ (3 : ℝ) = r ^ 3 := by exact_mod_cast Real.rpow_natCast r 3
      rw [← h3, ← Real.rpow_add hr0, ← Real.rpow_add hr0]
      congr 1
      ring
    have hhalf : (r / 2) ^ (-hAF.q - 1) = r ^ (-hAF.q - 1) / (2 : ℝ) ^ (-hAF.q - 1) :=
      Real.div_rpow hr0.le (by norm_num) _
    rw [hflux, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_mul,
      abs_of_nonneg (by positivity : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r ^ 2)]
    calc 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r ^ 2 * |∫ θ, rem θ ∂(volume : Measure E3).toSphere|
        ≤ 1 / (16 * Real.pi) * r ^ 2 * (9 * (2 * (K * r ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (5 * r * B)) * S) :=
          mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (by rw [← Real.norm_eq_abs]; exact hIb) (by positivity)
      _ = Dc * r ^ (1 - 2 * hAF.q) := by
          rw [hsplit, hDc, hBdef, hhalf]
          field_simp
          ring
  
  have hlim : Tendsto (fun r : ℝ => Dc * r ^ (1 - 2 * hAF.q)) atTop (𝓝 0) := by
    have h := (tendsto_rpow_neg_atTop (by linarith : (0 : ℝ) < 2 * hAF.q - 1)).const_mul Dc
    rw [mul_zero] at h
    refine h.congr (fun r => ?_)
    congr 2
    ring
  exact squeeze_zero_norm' (Filter.eventually_atTop.2 ⟨2 * R₁, hmain⟩) hlim

theorem harmonic_coord_change (v : E3 → ℝ) (q R C : ℝ) (hq : 0 < q) (hq1 : q < 1) (hR : 2 ≤ R)
    (hC : 0 < C) (hv : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ v {y : E3 | R < ‖y‖})
    (hb : ∀ y : E3, R < ‖y‖ →
      |v y - y 0| ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (1 - q) ∧
      (∀ i : Fin 3, |partialDeriv i v y - (if i = 0 then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-q)) ∧
      (∀ i j : Fin 3, |partialDeriv i (fun z => partialDeriv j v z) y| ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-q - 1))) :
    ∃ (R₀ R₁ C' : ℝ) (Y : E3 → E3), R ≤ R₀ ∧
      CoordChange (fun y => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2)) Y q R₀ R₁ C' :=
by
  
  have K0 : ∀ t a b : ℝ, cylPt t a b 0 = t ∧ cylPt t a b 1 = a ∧ cylPt t a b 2 = b := by
    intro t a b
    simp [cylPt, EuclideanSpace.single_apply]
  have K1 : ∀ y : E3, cylPt (y 0) (y 1) (y 2) = y := by
    intro y
    ext i
    fin_cases i <;> simp [cylPt, EuclideanSpace.single_apply]
  have K2 : ∀ y : E3, ‖y‖ ^ 2 = (y 0) ^ 2 + (y 1) ^ 2 + (y 2) ^ 2 := by
    intro y
    rw [EuclideanSpace.norm_sq_eq, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    simp [Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]
  
  have s6 : ∀ K : ℝ, (4 * C) ^ (1 / q) ≤ K →
      ∀ r : ℝ, K < r → C * r ^ (-q) ≤ 1 / 4 ∧ C * r ^ (1 - q) ≤ r / 4 := by
    intro K hK r hr
    have ha : 0 < (4 * C) ^ (1 / q) := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos (by linarith) _
    have hr0 : 0 < r := by linarith
    have haq : ((4 * C) ^ (1 / q)) ^ q = 4 * C := by
      rw [← Real.rpow_mul (by linarith)]
      rw [show 1 / q * q = 1 by field_simp]
      exact Real.rpow_one _
    have hrq : 4 * C ≤ r ^ q := by
      rw [← haq]; exact Real.rpow_le_rpow ha.le (by linarith) hq.le
    have hrqpos : 0 < r ^ q := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hr0 _
    have h1 : C * r ^ (-q) ≤ 1 / 4 := by
      rw [Real.rpow_neg hr0.le]
      rw [← div_eq_mul_inv, div_le_iff₀ hrqpos]
      linarith
    refine ⟨h1, ?_⟩
    have : r ^ (1 - q) = r * r ^ (-q) := by
      rw [sub_eq_add_neg, Real.rpow_add hr0, Real.rpow_one]
    rw [this]
    nlinarith
  
  have s3 : ∀ (X Y : E3 → E3) (U W : Set E3), IsOpen U → IsOpen W →
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ X U → Set.InjOn X U → (∀ y ∈ U, Function.Injective (fderiv ℝ X y)) →
      (∀ x ∈ W, Y x ∈ U ∧ X (Y x) = x) → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ Y W := by
    intro X Y U W hU hW hX hinj hd hYW
    intro x₀ hx₀
    apply ContDiffAt.contDiffWithinAt
    obtain ⟨hy₀U, hXy₀⟩ := hYW x₀ hx₀
    set y₀ := Y x₀ with hy₀
    have hXa : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ X y₀ := hX.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hy₀U)
    have hdiff : DifferentiableAt ℝ X y₀ := hXa.differentiableAt (by simp)
    let L' : E3 ≃L[ℝ] E3 :=
      (LinearEquiv.ofInjectiveEndo ((fderiv ℝ X y₀ : E3 →L[ℝ] E3) : E3 →ₗ[ℝ] E3)
        (hd y₀ hy₀U)).toContinuousLinearEquiv
    have hL' : (L' : E3 →L[ℝ] E3) = fderiv ℝ X y₀ := by
      ext1 h; rfl
    have hF : HasFDerivAt X (L' : E3 →L[ℝ] E3) y₀ := by
      rw [hL']; exact hdiff.hasFDerivAt
    have hn : (∞ : WithTop ℕ∞) ≠ 0 := by simp
    have hS : HasStrictFDerivAt X (L' : E3 →L[ℝ] E3) y₀ := hXa.hasStrictFDerivAt' hF (by simp)
    have hg : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ (hS.localInverse X L' y₀) (X y₀) := hXa.to_localInverse hF hn
    rw [hXy₀] at hg
    apply hg.congr_of_eventuallyEq
    have h1 : ∀ᶠ x in 𝓝 (X y₀), X (hS.localInverse X L' y₀ x) = x :=
      hS.eventually_right_inverse
    have h2 : ∀ᶠ x in 𝓝 (X y₀), hS.localInverse X L' y₀ x ∈ U := by
      have hc := hS.localInverse_continuousAt
      have hv : hS.localInverse X L' y₀ (X y₀) = y₀ := hS.localInverse_apply_image
      apply hc.preimage_mem_nhds
      rw [hv]; exact hU.mem_nhds hy₀U
    rw [hXy₀] at h1 h2
    filter_upwards [h1, h2, hW.mem_nhds hx₀] with x hx1 hx2 hx3
    obtain ⟨hYU, hXY⟩ := hYW x hx3
    exact hinj hYU hx2 (hXY.trans hx1.symm)
  
  have s4 : ∀ S : Set E3, IsOpen S → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ v S → (∀ y ∈ S, partialDeriv 0 v y ≠ 0) →
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun z : E3 => cylPt (v z) (z 1) (z 2)) S ∧
        ∀ y ∈ S, Function.Injective (fderiv ℝ (fun z : E3 => cylPt (v z) (z 1) (z 2)) y) := by
    intro S hS hvS hd
    have hp1 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun z : E3 => z 1) :=
      (EuclideanSpace.proj (1 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).contDiff
    have hp2 : ContDiff ℝ ∞ (fun z : E3 => z 2) :=
      (EuclideanSpace.proj (2 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).contDiff
    refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
    · unfold cylPt
      exact ((hvS.smul contDiffOn_const).add (hp1.contDiffOn.smul contDiffOn_const)).add
        (hp2.contDiffOn.smul contDiffOn_const)
    · intro y hy
      have hvd : DifferentiableAt ℝ v y :=
        (hvS.contDiffAt (hS.mem_nhds hy)).differentiableAt (by simp)
      have hD : HasFDerivAt (fun z : E3 => cylPt (v z) (z 1) (z 2))
          ((fderiv ℝ v y).smulRight (e 0) +
            (EuclideanSpace.proj (1 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).smulRight (e 1) +
            (EuclideanSpace.proj (2 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).smulRight (e 2)) y := by
        unfold cylPt
        exact ((hvd.hasFDerivAt.smul_const (e 0)).add
          ((EuclideanSpace.proj (1 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).hasFDerivAt.smul_const (e 1))).add
          ((EuclideanSpace.proj (2 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).hasFDerivAt.smul_const (e 2))
      rw [hD.fderiv]
      rw [injective_iff_map_eq_zero]
      intro h hh
      have c1 := congrArg (fun w : E3 => w 1) hh
      have c2 := congrArg (fun w : E3 => w 2) hh
      have c0 := congrArg (fun w : E3 => w 0) hh
      simp [EuclideanSpace.single_apply] at c0 c1 c2
      have hh0 : h = (h 0) • e 0 := by
        ext i; fin_cases i <;> simp [EuclideanSpace.single_apply, c1, c2]
      have : fderiv ℝ v y h = h 0 * partialDeriv 0 v y := by
        rw [hh0, map_smul, smul_eq_mul]; simp [partialDeriv]
      rw [this] at c0
      have h00 : h 0 = 0 := by
        rcases mul_eq_zero.mp c0 with h' | h'
        · exact h'
        · exact absurd h' (hd y hy)
      rw [hh0, h00, zero_smul]
  
  have coord_eq :
      (fun z : E3 => cylPt (v z) (z 1) (z 2) 0) = v ∧
      (fun z : E3 => cylPt (v z) (z 1) (z 2) 1) =
        (EuclideanSpace.proj (1 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) ∧
      (fun z : E3 => cylPt (v z) (z 1) (z 2) 2) =
        (EuclideanSpace.proj (2 : Fin 3) : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) := by
    refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_⟩ <;> funext z <;> simp [cylPt, EuclideanSpace.single_apply]
  have s5 : ∀ y : E3, R < ‖y‖ →
      ‖(fun y => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2)) y - y‖ ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (1 - q) ∧
      (∀ i a : Fin 3,
        |partialDeriv i (fun z => (fun y => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2)) z a) y
          - (if i = a then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-q)) ∧
      (∀ i j a : Fin 3,
        |partialDeriv i (fun z => partialDeriv j
          (fun w => (fun y => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2)) w a) z) y| ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-q - 1)) := by
    intro y hy
    obtain ⟨h0, h1, h2⟩ := hb y hy
    obtain ⟨e0, e1, e2⟩ := coord_eq
    have hn1 : 0 ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-q) := mul_nonneg hC.le (Real.rpow_nonneg (norm_nonneg _) _)
    have hn2 : 0 ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-q - 1) := mul_nonneg hC.le (Real.rpow_nonneg (norm_nonneg _) _)
    have hlin : ∀ (a : Fin 3) (z : E3) (i : Fin 3),
        partialDeriv i (EuclideanSpace.proj a : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) z = if i = a then 1 else 0 := by
      intro a z i
      simp only [partialDeriv, ContinuousLinearMap.fderiv]
      simp [EuclideanSpace.single_apply, eq_comm]
    refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_⟩
    · have : cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2) - y = (v y - y 0) • e 0 := by
        ext i; fin_cases i <;> simp [cylPt, EuclideanSpace.single_apply]
      simp only
      rw [this, norm_smul, EuclideanSpace.norm_single, norm_one, mul_one, Real.norm_eq_abs]
      exact h0
    · intro i a
      fin_cases a
      · simp only [Fin.zero_eta]
        rw [e0]; exact h1 i
      · simp only [Fin.mk_one]
        rw [e1, hlin]; simpa using hn1
      · show |partialDeriv i (fun z => cylPt (v z) (z 1) (z 2) 2) y - _| ≤ _
        rw [e2, hlin]; simpa using hn1
    · intro i j a
      fin_cases a
      · simp only [Fin.zero_eta]
        rw [e0]; exact h2 i j
      · simp only [Fin.mk_one]
        rw [e1]
        simp only [hlin]
        simp [partialDeriv]; exact hn2
      · show |partialDeriv i (fun z => partialDeriv j (fun w => cylPt (v w) (w 1) (w 2) 2) z) y|
          ≤ _
        rw [e2]
        simp only [hlin]
        simp [partialDeriv]; exact hn2
  
  have s2 : ∀ K R₀ : ℝ, K ≤ R₀ → ContinuousOn v {y : E3 | K < ‖y‖} →
      (∀ y : E3, K < ‖y‖ → |v y - y 0| ≤ ‖y‖ / 4) →
      ∀ x : E3, 2 * R₀ < ‖x‖ → ∃ y : E3, R₀ < ‖y‖ ∧ cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2) = x := by
    intro K R₀ hKR hvc hcl x hx
    set h := ‖x‖ / 2 with hh
    have hzx : ∀ τ : ℝ, cylPt τ (x 1) (x 2) = x + (τ - x 0) • e 0 := by
      intro τ; ext i; fin_cases i <;> simp [cylPt, EuclideanSpace.single_apply]
    have hnorm : ∀ τ ∈ Set.Icc (x 0 - h) (x 0 + h),
        ‖x‖ / 2 ≤ ‖cylPt τ (x 1) (x 2)‖ ∧ ‖cylPt τ (x 1) (x 2)‖ ≤ 3 * ‖x‖ / 2 := by
      intro τ hτ
      have hab : |τ - x 0| ≤ h := by rw [abs_le]; constructor <;> linarith [hτ.1, hτ.2]
      have hn : ‖(τ - x 0) • e 0‖ = |τ - x 0| := by
        rw [norm_smul, EuclideanSpace.norm_single, norm_one, mul_one, Real.norm_eq_abs]
      rw [hzx]
      constructor
      · have := norm_sub_norm_le x (-((τ - x 0) • e 0))
        rw [sub_neg_eq_add, norm_neg, hn] at this
        linarith
      · have := norm_add_le x ((τ - x 0) • e 0)
        rw [hn] at this
        linarith
    have hcont : Continuous fun τ : ℝ => cylPt τ (x 1) (x 2) := by
      unfold cylPt; fun_prop
    have hφ : ContinuousOn (fun τ => v (cylPt τ (x 1) (x 2))) (Set.Icc (x 0 - h) (x 0 + h)) := by
      refine hvc.comp hcont.continuousOn ?_
      intro τ hτ
      show K < ‖cylPt τ (x 1) (x 2)‖
      have := (hnorm τ hτ).1
      linarith
    have hx0 : 0 ≤ ‖x‖ := norm_nonneg x
    have hle : x 0 - h ≤ x 0 + h := by linarith
    have hlo : v (cylPt (x 0 - h) (x 1) (x 2)) ≤ x 0 := by
      have hm : x 0 - h ∈ Set.Icc (x 0 - h) (x 0 + h) := ⟨le_refl _, hle⟩
      obtain ⟨n1, n2⟩ := hnorm _ hm
      have := hcl _ (by linarith)
      rw [(K0 _ _ _).1] at this
      have := (abs_le.mp this).2
      linarith
    have hhi : x 0 ≤ v (cylPt (x 0 + h) (x 1) (x 2)) := by
      have hm : x 0 + h ∈ Set.Icc (x 0 - h) (x 0 + h) := ⟨hle, le_refl _⟩
      obtain ⟨n1, n2⟩ := hnorm _ hm
      have := hcl _ (by linarith)
      rw [(K0 _ _ _).1] at this
      have := (abs_le.mp this).1
      linarith
    obtain ⟨τ, hτ, hτv⟩ := intermediate_value_Icc hle hφ ⟨hlo, hhi⟩
    refine ⟨cylPt τ (x 1) (x 2), ?_, ?_⟩
    · have := (hnorm τ hτ).1; linarith
    · obtain ⟨k0, k1, k2⟩ := K0 τ (x 1) (x 2)
      simp only at hτv
      rw [k1, k2, hτv, K1]
  
  have s1 : ∀ K : ℝ, 0 < K → (∀ y : E3, K < ‖y‖ → DifferentiableAt ℝ v y) →
      (∀ y : E3, K < ‖y‖ → 1 / 2 ≤ partialDeriv 0 v y) →
      (∀ y : E3, K < ‖y‖ → |v y - y 0| ≤ ‖y‖ / 4) →
      Set.InjOn (fun y : E3 => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2)) {y : E3 | 2 * K < ‖y‖} := by
    intro K hK hdiff hd0 hcl
    have key : ∀ y y' : E3, 2 * K < ‖y‖ → 2 * K < ‖y'‖ → y' 0 < y 0 → y 1 = y' 1 →
        y 2 = y' 2 → v y = v y' → False := by
      intro y y' hy hy' hlt h1 h2 hvv
      set t := y 0 with ht
      set t' := y' 0 with ht'
      set a := y 1 with ha
      set b := y 2 with hbb
      have hzn : ∀ s : ℝ, ‖cylPt s a b‖ ^ 2 = s ^ 2 + a ^ 2 + b ^ 2 := by
        intro s; rw [K2]; obtain ⟨k0, k1, k2⟩ := K0 s a b; rw [k0, k1, k2]
      have hyz : cylPt t a b = y := K1 y
      have hyz' : cylPt t' a b = y' := by rw [h1, h2]; exact K1 y'
      have hny : ‖y‖ ^ 2 = t ^ 2 + a ^ 2 + b ^ 2 := by rw [← hyz]; exact hzn t
      have hny' : ‖y'‖ ^ 2 = t' ^ 2 + a ^ 2 + b ^ 2 := by rw [← hyz']; exact hzn t'
      have hyp : 0 ≤ ‖y‖ := norm_nonneg _
      have hyp' : 0 ≤ ‖y'‖ := norm_nonneg _
      have hsq : (2 * K) ^ 2 < ‖y‖ ^ 2 := by nlinarith
      have hsq' : (2 * K) ^ 2 < ‖y'‖ ^ 2 := by nlinarith
      by_cases hseg : ∀ s ∈ Set.Icc t' t, K < ‖cylPt s a b‖
      · 
        have hzd : ∀ s : ℝ, HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => cylPt s a b) (e 0) s := by
          intro s
          unfold cylPt
          have := ((hasDerivAt_id s).smul_const (e 0)).add_const (a • e 1) |>.add_const (b • e 2)
          simpa using this
        have hψ : ∀ s ∈ Set.Icc t' t,
            HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => v (cylPt s a b)) (partialDeriv 0 v (cylPt s a b)) s := by
          intro s hs
          have := (hdiff _ (hseg s hs)).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt s (hzd s)
          exact this
        obtain ⟨c, hc, hceq⟩ := exists_hasDerivAt_eq_slope (fun s : ℝ => v (cylPt s a b))
          (fun s => partialDeriv 0 v (cylPt s a b)) hlt
          (fun s hs => (hψ s hs).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt)
          (fun s hs => hψ s (Set.Ioo_subset_Icc_self hs))
        simp only [hyz, hyz', hvv, sub_self, zero_div] at hceq
        have := hd0 _ (hseg c (Set.Ioo_subset_Icc_self hc))
        linarith
      · 
        push_neg at hseg
        obtain ⟨s, hs, hsK⟩ := hseg
        have hsK2 : ‖cylPt s a b‖ ^ 2 ≤ K ^ 2 := by
          have := norm_nonneg (cylPt s a b); nlinarith
        rw [hzn] at hsK2
        have hρ : a ^ 2 + b ^ 2 ≤ K ^ 2 := by nlinarith [sq_nonneg s]
        have ht'neg : t' < 0 := by
          by_contra hc; push_neg at hc
          have : t' ^ 2 ≤ s ^ 2 := by nlinarith [hs.1]
          nlinarith
        have htpos : 0 < t := by
          by_contra hc; push_neg at hc
          have : t ^ 2 ≤ s ^ 2 := by nlinarith [hs.2]
          nlinarith
        have htK : K < t := by nlinarith
        have hyle : ‖y‖ ≤ t + K := by
          have : ‖y‖ ^ 2 ≤ (t + K) ^ 2 := by nlinarith
          nlinarith
        have hvy := hcl y (by linarith)
        have hvy' := (abs_le.mp hvy).1
        have hpos : 0 < v y := by linarith
        have ht'K : K < -t' := by nlinarith
        have hyle' : ‖y'‖ ≤ -t' + K := by
          have : ‖y'‖ ^ 2 ≤ (-t' + K) ^ 2 := by nlinarith
          nlinarith
        have hvy2 := hcl y' (by linarith)
        have hvy2' := (abs_le.mp hvy2).2
        have hneg : v y' < 0 := by linarith
        linarith
    intro y hy y' hy' hXX
    simp only [Set.mem_setOf_eq] at hy hy'
    have hv' := congrArg (fun w : E3 => w 0) hXX
    have h1 := congrArg (fun w : E3 => w 1) hXX
    have h2 := congrArg (fun w : E3 => w 2) hXX
    simp only [K0] at hv' h1 h2
    rcases lt_trichotomy (y 0) (y' 0) with hlt | heq | hgt
    · exact (key y' y hy' hy hlt h1.symm h2.symm hv'.symm).elim
    · calc y = cylPt (y 0) (y 1) (y 2) := (K1 y).symm
        _ = cylPt (y' 0) (y' 1) (y' 2) := by rw [heq, h1, h2]
        _ = y' := K1 y'
    · exact (key y y' hy hy' hgt h1 h2 hv').elim
  
  set K := max R ((4 * C) ^ (1 / q)) with hKdef
  have hRK : R ≤ K := le_max_left _ _
  have hKa : (4 * C) ^ (1 / q) ≤ K := le_max_right _ _
  have hK0 : 0 < K := by linarith
  have htail := s6 K hKa
  have hopen : ∀ r : ℝ, IsOpen {y : E3 | r < ‖y‖} :=
    fun r => isOpen_lt continuous_const continuous_norm
  have hd0 : ∀ z : E3, K < ‖z‖ → 1 / 2 ≤ partialDeriv 0 v z := by
    intro z hz
    have h := (hb z (by linarith)).2.1 0
    rw [if_pos rfl] at h
    have h' := (htail ‖z‖ hz).1
    have h'' := (abs_le.mp h).1
    linarith
  have hcl : ∀ z : E3, K < ‖z‖ → |v z - z 0| ≤ ‖z‖ / 4 := by
    intro z hz
    exact (hb z (by linarith)).1.trans (htail ‖z‖ hz).2
  have hvK : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ v {y : E3 | K < ‖y‖} :=
    hv.mono (fun y hy => lt_of_le_of_lt hRK hy)
  have hdiff : ∀ y : E3, K < ‖y‖ → DifferentiableAt ℝ v y := fun y hy =>
    (hvK.contDiffAt ((hopen K).mem_nhds hy)).differentiableAt (by simp)
  have hv2K : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ v {y : E3 | 2 * K < ‖y‖} :=
    hv.mono (fun y hy => by
      have hy' : 2 * K < ‖y‖ := hy
      show R < ‖y‖
      linarith)
  obtain ⟨hXs, hXd⟩ := s4 {y : E3 | 2 * K < ‖y‖} (hopen _) hv2K (fun y hy => by
    have hy' : 2 * K < ‖y‖ := hy
    have := hd0 y (by linarith)
    exact ne_of_gt (by linarith))
  have hinj := s1 K hK0 hdiff hd0 hcl
  have hsurj := s2 K (2 * K) (by linarith) hvK.continuousOn hcl
  have hYW : ∀ x ∈ {x : E3 | 2 * (2 * K) < ‖x‖},
      Function.invFunOn (fun y : E3 => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2)) {y : E3 | 2 * K < ‖y‖} x
          ∈ {y : E3 | 2 * K < ‖y‖} ∧
        (fun y : E3 => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2))
          (Function.invFunOn (fun y : E3 => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2))
            {y : E3 | 2 * K < ‖y‖} x) = x := by
    intro x hx
    obtain ⟨y, hy, hyx⟩ := hsurj x hx
    exact Function.invFunOn_pos ⟨y, hy, hyx⟩
  have hYs := s3 _ _ _ _ (hopen _) (hopen _) hXs hinj hXd hYW
  refine ⟨2 * K, 2 * (2 * K), C,
    Function.invFunOn (fun y : E3 => cylPt (v y) (y 1) (y 2)) {y : E3 | 2 * K < ‖y‖},
    by linarith, ?_⟩
  unfold CoordChange
  refine ⟨by linarith, by linarith, hC, hXs, hYs, fun x hx => hYW x hx, hinj, ?_⟩
  intro y hy
  exact s5 y (by linarith)

theorem far_hess_pos_end [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M)
    (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) :
    ∃ r₀ : ℝ, 2 ≤ r₀ ∧ ∀ (l : Fin hAF.numEnds) (y : E3), r₀ < ‖y‖ →
      ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, v ≠ 0 →
        0 < ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          v i * v j * hessLoc (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖ ^ 2) i j y :=
by
  
  have hpd1 : ∀ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖ ^ 2) = fun z => 2 * z k := by
    intro k
    funext z
    simp only [partialDeriv]
    rw [fderiv_norm_sq_apply]
    simp [EuclideanSpace.inner_single_right]
  have hpd2 : ∀ (i j : Fin 3) (y : E3),
      partialDeriv i (fun z : E3 => 2 * z j) y = 2 * (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) := by
    intro i j y
    simp only [partialDeriv]
    have hd : HasFDerivAt (fun z : E3 => 2 * z j)
        ((2 : ℝ) • (EuclideanSpace.proj j : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ)) y :=
      ((EuclideanSpace.proj j : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).hasFDerivAt (x := y)).const_mul 2
    rw [hd.fderiv]
    by_cases h : i = j
    · subst h
      simp
    · simp [h, Ne.symm h]
  have hhess : ∀ (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y : E3) (i j : Fin 3),
      hessLoc G (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖ ^ 2) i j y =
        2 * (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - ∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel G k i j y * (2 * y k) := by
    intro G y i j
    simp only [hessLoc, hpd1, hpd2]
  
  have hinvB : ∀ (A : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (B : ℝ), (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ A.det →
      (∀ i j : Fin 3, |A i j| ≤ B) → ∀ k l : Fin 3, |A⁻¹ k l| ≤ 4 * B ^ 2 := by
    intro A B hdet hB
    have hB0 : 0 ≤ B := (abs_nonneg _).trans (hB 0 0)
    have hdpos : 0 < A.det := by linarith
    have hinvpos : 0 < (A.det)⁻¹ := inv_pos.mpr hdpos
    have hinv2 : (A.det)⁻¹ ≤ 2 := by
      rw [inv_le_comm₀ hdpos (by norm_num)]
      linarith
    have aux : ∀ x y z w : ℝ, |x| ≤ B → |y| ≤ B → |z| ≤ B → |w| ≤ B →
        |x * y - z * w| ≤ 2 * B ^ 2 := by
      intro x y z w hx hy hz hw
      have h1 : |x * y| ≤ B * B := by
        rw [abs_mul]; exact mul_le_mul hx hy (abs_nonneg _) hB0
      have h2 : |z * w| ≤ B * B := by
        rw [abs_mul]; exact mul_le_mul hz hw (abs_nonneg _) hB0
      have h1' := abs_le.mp h1
      have h2' := abs_le.mp h2
      rw [abs_le]
      constructor <;> nlinarith [h1'.1, h1'.2, h2'.1, h2'.2]
    have aux' : ∀ x y z w : ℝ, |x| ≤ B → |y| ≤ B → |z| ≤ B → |w| ≤ B →
        |-(x * y) + z * w| ≤ 2 * B ^ 2 := by
      intro x y z w hx hy hz hw
      rw [neg_add_eq_sub]
      exact aux z w x y hz hw hx hy
    have hadj : ∀ k l : Fin 3, |A.adjugate k l| ≤ 2 * B ^ 2 := by
      intro k l
      rw [Matrix.adjugate_fin_three]
      fin_cases k <;> fin_cases l <;> simp <;>
        first
          | exact aux _ _ _ _ (hB _ _) (hB _ _) (hB _ _) (hB _ _)
          | exact aux' _ _ _ _ (hB _ _) (hB _ _) (hB _ _) (hB _ _)
    have hentry : ∀ k l : Fin 3, A⁻¹ k l = (A.det)⁻¹ * A.adjugate k l := by
      intro k l
      rw [Matrix.inv_def, Ring.inverse_eq_inv', Matrix.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
    intro k l
    rw [hentry, abs_mul, abs_of_pos hinvpos]
    have := mul_le_mul hinv2 (hadj k l) (abs_nonneg _) (by norm_num)
    linarith
  
  have hchr : ∀ (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y : E3) (ε α : ℝ),
      (1 / 2 : ℝ) ≤ (G y).det →
      (∀ i j : Fin 3, |G y i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ ε) →
      (∀ i j : Fin 3, ‖fderiv ℝ (fun x => G x i j) y‖ ≤ α) →
      ∀ k i j : Fin 3, |christoffel G k i j y| ≤ 18 * (1 + ε) ^ 2 * α := by
    intro G y ε α hdet h0 h1 k i j
    have hB : ∀ a b : Fin 3, |G y a b| ≤ 1 + ε := by
      intro a b
      have h := h0 a b
      have hd : |(if a = b then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 := by split_ifs <;> simp
      calc |G y a b| = |(G y a b - (if a = b then (1 : ℝ) else 0))
            + (if a = b then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| := by ring_nf
        _ ≤ |G y a b - (if a = b then (1 : ℝ) else 0)|
            + |(if a = b then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| := abs_add_le _ _
        _ ≤ ε + 1 := add_le_add h hd
        _ = 1 + ε := by ring
    have hP := hinvB (G y) (1 + ε) hdet hB
    have hd1 : ∀ c a b : Fin 3, |partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b) y| ≤ α := by
      intro c a b
      calc |partialDeriv c (fun z => G z a b) y|
          = ‖fderiv ℝ (fun z => G z a b) y (e c)‖ := by rw [Real.norm_eq_abs]; rfl
        _ ≤ ‖fderiv ℝ (fun z => G z a b) y‖ * ‖e c‖ := ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _
        _ = ‖fderiv ℝ (fun z => G z a b) y‖ := by simp [EuclideanSpace.norm_single]
        _ ≤ α := h1 a b
    have hterm : ∀ l : Fin 3, |(G y)⁻¹ k l * (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) y
        + partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) y - partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) y)|
          ≤ 4 * (1 + ε) ^ 2 * (3 * α) := by
      intro l
      rw [abs_mul]
      apply mul_le_mul (hP k l) _ (abs_nonneg _) (by positivity)
      have t1 := abs_le.mp (hd1 i j l)
      have t2 := abs_le.mp (hd1 j i l)
      have t3 := abs_le.mp (hd1 l i j)
      rw [abs_le]
      constructor <;> linarith [t1.1, t1.2, t2.1, t2.2, t3.1, t3.2]
    unfold christoffel
    rw [abs_mul, abs_of_pos (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 1 / 2)]
    have hs : |∑ l : Fin 3, (G y)⁻¹ k l * (partialDeriv i (fun z => G z j l) y
        + partialDeriv j (fun z => G z i l) y - partialDeriv l (fun z => G z i j) y)|
          ≤ 3 * (4 * (1 + ε) ^ 2 * (3 * α)) := by
      refine (Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _).trans ?_
      refine (Finset.sum_le_sum fun l _ => hterm l).trans ?_
      simp
    linarith
  
  have hquad : ∀ (K : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (η : ℝ), (∀ i j : Fin 3, |K i j| ≤ η) → 3 * η < 2 →
      ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, v ≠ 0 →
        0 < ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          v i * v j * (2 * (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - K i j) := by
    intro K η hK hη v hv
    have hη0 : 0 ≤ η := le_trans (abs_nonneg _) (hK 0 0)
    have hb : ∀ i j : Fin 3, v i * v j * K i j ≤ |v i| * |v j| * η := by
      intro i j
      calc v i * v j * K i j ≤ |v i * v j * K i j| := le_abs_self _
        _ = |v i| * |v j| * |K i j| := by rw [abs_mul, abs_mul]
        _ ≤ |v i| * |v j| * η := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hK i j) (by positivity)
    have hS : 0 < v 0 ^ 2 + v 1 ^ 2 + v 2 ^ 2 := by
      by_contra hc
      push_neg at hc
      apply hv
      have q0 : v 0 ^ 2 ≤ 0 := by nlinarith [sq_nonneg (v 0), sq_nonneg (v 1), sq_nonneg (v 2)]
      have q1 : v 1 ^ 2 ≤ 0 := by nlinarith [sq_nonneg (v 0), sq_nonneg (v 1), sq_nonneg (v 2)]
      have q2 : v 2 ^ 2 ≤ 0 := by nlinarith [sq_nonneg (v 0), sq_nonneg (v 1), sq_nonneg (v 2)]
      have h0 : v 0 = 0 := pow_eq_zero_iff two_ne_zero |>.mp (le_antisymm q0 (sq_nonneg _))
      have h1 : v 1 = 0 := pow_eq_zero_iff two_ne_zero |>.mp (le_antisymm q1 (sq_nonneg _))
      have h2 : v 2 = 0 := pow_eq_zero_iff two_ne_zero |>.mp (le_antisymm q2 (sq_nonneg _))
      funext i
      fin_cases i <;> simp [h0, h1, h2]
    have hexp : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          v i * v j * (2 * (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) - K i j)
        = 2 * (v 0 ^ 2 + v 1 ^ 2 + v 2 ^ 2) - ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * K i j := by
      simp [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    have hsum : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * K i j
        ≤ η * (|v 0| + |v 1| + |v 2|) ^ 2 := by
      have := Finset.sum_le_sum fun i (_ : i ∈ Finset.univ) =>
        Finset.sum_le_sum fun j (_ : j ∈ Finset.univ) => hb i j
      refine this.trans (le_of_eq ?_)
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    have ha : (|v 0| + |v 1| + |v 2|) ^ 2 ≤ 3 * (v 0 ^ 2 + v 1 ^ 2 + v 2 ^ 2) := by
      nlinarith [sq_abs (v 0), sq_abs (v 1), sq_abs (v 2), sq_nonneg (|v 0| - |v 1|),
        sq_nonneg (|v 1| - |v 2|), sq_nonneg (|v 0| - |v 2|)]
    have h3 := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left ha hη0
    have h4 := mul_pos (by linarith : (0 : ℝ) < 2 - 3 * η) hS
    rw [hexp]
    nlinarith
  
  have hq0 : 0 < hAF.q := lt_trans (by norm_num) hAF.q_gt
  have hend : ∀ l : Fin hAF.numEnds, ∃ r : ℝ, 2 ≤ r ∧ ∀ y : E3, r < ‖y‖ →
      ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, v ≠ 0 →
        0 < ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          v i * v j * hessLoc (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖ ^ 2) i j y := by
    intro l
    have hsmooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3,
        ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
      intro i j
      rw [← (hAF.ends l).source_eq]
      exact coeff_contDiffOn_source g (hAF.ends l).Φ i j
    obtain ⟨R, C, hR1, hC0, hb⟩ :=
      metric_coeff_bounds (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) hAF.q hq0 hsmooth (hAF.decay l)
    have hT0 : 0 ≤ 162 * C * (1 + C) ^ 2 := by positivity
    refine ⟨max 2 (max R ((162 * C * (1 + C) ^ 2 + 1) ^ hAF.q⁻¹)), le_max_left _ _, ?_⟩
    intro y hy v hv
    have hr2 : 2 < ‖y‖ := lt_of_le_of_lt (le_max_left _ _) hy
    have hrR : R < ‖y‖ := lt_of_le_of_lt (le_trans (le_max_left _ _) (le_max_right _ _)) hy
    have hrT : (162 * C * (1 + C) ^ 2 + 1) ^ hAF.q⁻¹ < ‖y‖ :=
      lt_of_le_of_lt (le_trans (le_max_right _ _) (le_max_right _ _)) hy
    obtain ⟨hdet, hrest⟩ := hb y hrR
    have hr0 : 0 < ‖y‖ := by linarith
    have hrq : 162 * C * (1 + C) ^ 2 + 1 < ‖y‖ ^ hAF.q := by
      have h1 := Real.rpow_lt_rpow (Real.rpow_nonneg (by linarith) _) hrT hq0
      rwa [Real.rpow_inv_rpow (by linarith) hq0.ne'] at h1
    have hs0 : 0 < ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q) := Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hr0 _
    have hsr : ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q) * ‖y‖ ^ hAF.q = 1 := by
      rw [Real.rpow_neg hr0.le, inv_mul_cancel₀ (Real.rpow_pos_of_pos hr0 _).ne']
    have hs1 : ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q) ≤ 1 :=
      Real.rpow_le_one_of_one_le_of_nonpos (by linarith) (by linarith)
    have hrs : ‖y‖ * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1) = ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q) := by
      rw [Real.rpow_sub_one hr0.ne']
      field_simp
    have hΓ := hchr (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) y (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q)) (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1))
      hdet (fun i j => (hrest i j 0).1) (fun i j => (hrest i j 0).2.1)
    have hα0 : 0 ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1) := mul_nonneg hC0 (Real.rpow_nonneg hr0.le _)
    have hγ0 : 0 ≤ 18 * (1 + C) ^ 2 * (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) := by positivity
    have hΓ' : ∀ k i j : Fin 3, |christoffel (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) k i j y|
        ≤ 18 * (1 + C) ^ 2 * (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) := by
      intro k i j
      refine (hΓ k i j).trans ?_
      have hCs : C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q) ≤ C := mul_le_of_le_one_right hC0 hs1
      have hCs0 : 0 ≤ C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q) := mul_nonneg hC0 hs0.le
      have h1 : (1 + C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q)) ^ 2 ≤ (1 + C) ^ 2 :=
        pow_le_pow_left₀ (by linarith) (by linarith) 2
      exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right
        (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left h1 (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) ≤ 18)) hα0
    have hyk : ∀ k : Fin 3, |y k| ≤ ‖y‖ := fun k => by
      have := PiLp.norm_apply_le y k
      rwa [Real.norm_eq_abs] at this
    have hKb : ∀ i j : Fin 3,
        |∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) k i j y * (2 * y k)|
          ≤ 6 * ‖y‖ * (18 * (1 + C) ^ 2 * (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1))) := by
      intro i j
      have hterm : ∀ k : Fin 3,
          |christoffel (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) k i j y * (2 * y k)|
            ≤ 18 * (1 + C) ^ 2 * (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (2 * ‖y‖) := by
        intro k
        rw [abs_mul, abs_mul, abs_of_pos (by norm_num : (0 : ℝ) < 2)]
        exact mul_le_mul (hΓ' k i j) (by linarith [hyk k]) (by positivity) hγ0
      have hs : |∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) k i j y * (2 * y k)|
          ≤ 3 * (18 * (1 + C) ^ 2 * (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1)) * (2 * ‖y‖)) := by
        refine (Finset.abs_sum_le_sum_abs _ _).trans ?_
        refine (Finset.sum_le_sum fun k _ => hterm k).trans ?_
        simp
      linarith
    have hη : 3 * (6 * ‖y‖ * (18 * (1 + C) ^ 2 * (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1)))) < 2 := by
      have e1 : 3 * (6 * ‖y‖ * (18 * (1 + C) ^ 2 * (C * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q - 1))))
          = 2 * (162 * C * (1 + C) ^ 2) * ‖y‖ ^ (-hAF.q) := by
        linear_combination (324 * (1 + C) ^ 2 * C) * hrs
      have h2 := mul_lt_mul_of_pos_left hrq hs0
      rw [e1]
      nlinarith
    have hpos := hquad
      (fun i j => ∑ k : Fin 3, christoffel (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) k i j y * (2 * y k))
      _ hKb hη v hv
    simp only [hhess]
    exact hpos
  
  choose rf hrf2 hrf using hend
  refine ⟨2 + ∑ l, rf l, ?_, ?_⟩
  · have : 0 ≤ ∑ l, rf l := Finset.sum_nonneg fun l _ => by linarith [hrf2 l]
    linarith
  · intro l y hy v hv
    have hle : rf l ≤ ∑ l', rf l' :=
      Finset.single_le_sum (fun l' _ => by linarith [hrf2 l']) (Finset.mem_univ l)
    have hsum0 : 0 ≤ ∑ l', rf l' := Finset.sum_nonneg fun l' _ => by linarith [hrf2 l']
    exact hrf l y (by linarith) v hv

theorem endChart_far_isClosed [T2Space M] [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M)
    (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) (k : Fin hAF.numEnds) :
    ∃ ρ₀ : ℝ, 2 ≤ ρ₀ ∧ ∀ ρ : ℝ, ρ₀ ≤ ρ → IsClosed ((hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖}) :=
by
  classical
  have hsrc : (hAF.ends k).Φ.source = {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := (hAF.ends k).source_eq
  have hq : 0 < hAF.q := by linarith [hAF.q_gt]
  
  
  have hnormsq : ∀ v : E3, ‖v‖ ^ 2 = v 0 ^ 2 + v 1 ^ 2 + v 2 ^ 2 := by
    intro v
    rw [EuclideanSpace.norm_sq_eq, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    simp only [Real.norm_eq_abs, sq_abs]
  have s1 : ∀ (A : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ),
      (∀ i j : Fin 3, |A i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 / 6) →
      ∀ v : E3, ‖v‖ ^ 2 / 2 ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * A i j := by
    intro A hA v
    have key : ∀ i j : Fin 3, (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) * (v i * v j)
        - 1 / 6 * (|v i| * |v j|) ≤ v i * v j * A i j := by
      intro i j
      have h1 : -|(A i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)) * (v i * v j)| ≤
          (A i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)) * (v i * v j) := neg_abs_le _
      have h2 : |(A i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)) * (v i * v j)| ≤
          1 / 6 * (|v i| * |v j|) := by
        rw [abs_mul, abs_mul]
        exact mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hA i j) (by positivity)
      nlinarith
    have k00 := key 0 0
    have k01 := key 0 1
    have k02 := key 0 2
    have k10 := key 1 0
    have k11 := key 1 1
    have k12 := key 1 2
    have k20 := key 2 0
    have k21 := key 2 1
    have k22 := key 2 2
    simp only [Fin.isValue, if_true, if_false, Fin.reduceEq] at k00 k01 k02 k10 k11 k12 k20 k21 k22
    rw [hnormsq]
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    have a01 := two_mul_le_add_sq |v 0| |v 1|
    have a02 := two_mul_le_add_sq |v 0| |v 2|
    have a12 := two_mul_le_add_sq |v 1| |v 2|
    simp only [sq_abs] at a01 a02 a12
    have q0 : |v 0| * |v 0| = v 0 ^ 2 := by rw [← sq, sq_abs]
    have q1 : |v 1| * |v 1| = v 1 ^ 2 := by rw [← sq, sq_abs]
    have q2 : |v 2| * |v 2| = v 2 ^ 2 := by rw [← sq, sq_abs]
    nlinarith
  
  
  obtain ⟨R, hR2, hRb⟩ : ∃ R : ℝ, 2 ≤ R ∧ ∀ x : E3, R < ‖x‖ → ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      |g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 / 6 := by
    have hev : ∀ i j : Fin 3, ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3,
        |g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 / 6 := by
      intro i j
      have hO := hAF.decay k i j 0 (by norm_num)
      have ht : Tendsto (fun x : E3 => ‖x‖ ^ (-hAF.q - ((0 : ℕ) : ℝ)))
          (Bornology.cobounded E3) (𝓝 0) := by
        have := (tendsto_rpow_neg_atTop hq).comp (tendsto_norm_cobounded_atTop (E := E3))
        simpa using this
      have h2 := hO.trans_tendsto ht
      have h3 := h2.eventually (eventually_le_nhds (show (0 : ℝ) < 1 / 6 by norm_num))
      filter_upwards [h3] with x hx
      simpa [norm_iteratedFDeriv_zero, Real.norm_eq_abs] using hx
    have hall : ∀ᶠ x in Bornology.cobounded E3, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
        |g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ x i j - (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0)| ≤ 1 / 6 :=
      Filter.eventually_all.2 fun i => Filter.eventually_all.2 fun j => hev i j
    rw [← comap_norm_atTop, Filter.eventually_comap, Filter.eventually_atTop] at hall
    obtain ⟨R₁, hR₁⟩ := hall
    refine ⟨max R₁ 2, le_max_right _ _, fun x hx => ?_⟩
    exact hR₁ ‖x‖ (le_trans (le_max_left _ _) hx.le) x rfl
  have LB : ∀ x : E3, R < ‖x‖ → ∀ v : E3,
      ‖v‖ ^ 2 / 2 ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * g.coeff (hAF.ends k).Φ x i j :=
    fun x hx v => s1 _ (hRb x hx) v
  
  
  have s6 : ∀ (U : Set ℝ) (h h' : ℝ → E3) (K : ℝ), IsOpen U → 0 ≤ K → (0 : ℝ) ∈ U →
      (∀ t ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, t ∈ U → HasDerivAt h (h' t) t ∧ ‖h' t‖ ≤ K) →
      (∀ (s : ℕ → ℝ) (τ : ℝ) (xb : E3), τ ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 →
        (∀ n, s n ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 ∧ s n ∈ U) →
        Tendsto s atTop (𝓝 τ) → Tendsto (fun n => h (s n)) atTop (𝓝 xb) →
        dist xb (h 0) ≤ K → τ ∈ U) →
      (1 : ℝ) ∈ U := by
    intro U h h' K hU hK h0 hD hcl
    have hlip : ∀ a b : ℝ, 0 ≤ a → a ≤ b → b ≤ 1 → (∀ x ∈ Set.Icc a b, x ∈ U) →
        ‖h b - h a‖ ≤ K * (b - a) := by
      intro a b ha hab hb1 hU'
      exact norm_image_sub_le_of_norm_deriv_le_segment' (f := h) (f' := h') (C := K)
        (fun x hx => ((hD x ⟨le_trans ha hx.1, le_trans hx.2 hb1⟩ (hU' x hx)).1).hasDerivWithinAt)
        (fun x hx => (hD x ⟨le_trans ha hx.1, le_trans hx.2.le hb1⟩
          (hU' x ⟨hx.1, hx.2.le⟩)).2) b ⟨hab, le_rfl⟩
    obtain ⟨T, hT⟩ : ∃ T : Set ℝ, T = {t | t ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 ∧ ∀ s ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) t, s ∈ U} :=
      ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have h0T : (0 : ℝ) ∈ T := by
      rw [hT]
      refine ⟨⟨le_rfl, zero_le_one⟩, fun s hs => ?_⟩
      have : s = 0 := le_antisymm hs.2 hs.1
      rw [this]; exact h0
    have hTsub : ∀ t ∈ T, t ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 ∧ ∀ s ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) t, s ∈ U := by
      intro t ht; rw [hT] at ht; exact ht
    have hbdd : BddAbove T := ⟨1, fun t ht => (hTsub t ht).1.2⟩
    obtain ⟨τ, hτ⟩ : ∃ τ : ℝ, τ = sSup T := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hτ0 : 0 ≤ τ := by rw [hτ]; exact le_csSup hbdd h0T
    have hτ1 : τ ≤ 1 := by rw [hτ]; exact csSup_le ⟨0, h0T⟩ (fun t ht => (hTsub t ht).1.2)
    have ha : ∀ s, 0 ≤ s → s < τ → s ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 ∧ ∀ u ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) s, u ∈ U := by
      intro s hs0 hsτ
      rw [hτ] at hsτ
      obtain ⟨t, htT, hst⟩ := exists_lt_of_lt_csSup ⟨0, h0T⟩ hsτ
      have ht := hTsub t htT
      exact ⟨⟨hs0, le_trans hst.le ht.1.2⟩, fun u hu => ht.2 u ⟨hu.1, le_trans hu.2 hst.le⟩⟩
    have hτU : τ ∈ U := by
      rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hτ0 with h | hpos
      · rw [← h]; exact h0
      obtain ⟨s, hs⟩ : ∃ s : ℕ → ℝ, s = fun n : ℕ => τ * (1 - 1 / ((n : ℝ) + 2)) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
      have hs0 : ∀ n, 0 ≤ s n := by
        intro n
        have : 1 / ((n : ℝ) + 2) ≤ 1 := by
          rw [div_le_one (by positivity)]; linarith [(Nat.cast_nonneg n : (0 : ℝ) ≤ n)]
        rw [hs]; exact mul_nonneg hτ0 (by linarith)
      have hsτ : ∀ n, s n < τ := by
        intro n
        have : 0 < 1 / ((n : ℝ) + 2) := by positivity
        rw [hs]; nlinarith
      have hsT : ∀ n, s n ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 ∧ ∀ u ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) (s n), u ∈ U :=
        fun n => ha (s n) (hs0 n) (hsτ n)
      have hsU : ∀ n, s n ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1 ∧ s n ∈ U :=
        fun n => ⟨(hsT n).1, (hsT n).2 (s n) ⟨hs0 n, le_rfl⟩⟩
      have hmono : Monotone s := by
        intro n m hnm
        have : 1 / ((m : ℝ) + 2) ≤ 1 / ((n : ℝ) + 2) := by
          apply one_div_le_one_div_of_le (by positivity)
          have : (n : ℝ) ≤ m := by exact_mod_cast hnm
          linarith
        rw [hs]; simp only; nlinarith
      have hlim : Tendsto s atTop (𝓝 τ) := by
        have h1 : Tendsto (fun n : ℕ => 1 / ((n : ℝ) + 2)) atTop (𝓝 0) := by
          have : Tendsto (fun n : ℕ => (n : ℝ) + 2) atTop atTop :=
            tendsto_atTop_add_const_right _ 2 tendsto_natCast_atTop_atTop
          simpa [one_div] using this.inv_tendsto_atTop
        have := (tendsto_const_nhds (x := τ)).mul ((tendsto_const_nhds (x := (1 : ℝ))).sub h1)
        rw [hs]
        simpa using this
      have hpair : ∀ n m, n ≤ m → ‖h (s m) - h (s n)‖ ≤ K * (s m - s n) := by
        intro n m hnm
        exact hlip (s n) (s m) (hs0 n) (hmono hnm) (le_trans (hsτ m).le hτ1)
          (fun x hx => (hsT m).2 x ⟨le_trans (hs0 n) hx.1, hx.2⟩)
      have hcauchy : CauchySeq (fun n => h (s n)) := by
        refine cauchySeq_of_le_tendsto_0 (fun N => 2 * (K * (τ - s N))) ?_ ?_
        · intro n m N hn hm
          rw [dist_eq_norm]
          have e1 := hpair N n hn
          have e2 := hpair N m hm
          have : ‖h (s n) - h (s m)‖ ≤ ‖h (s n) - h (s N)‖ + ‖h (s m) - h (s N)‖ := by
            rw [← norm_neg (h (s m) - h (s N))]
            calc ‖h (s n) - h (s m)‖ = ‖(h (s n) - h (s N)) + -(h (s m) - h (s N))‖ := by
                  congr 1; abel
              _ ≤ _ := norm_add_le _ _
          have hsn := hsτ n
          have hsm := hsτ m
          nlinarith
        · have := ((tendsto_const_nhds (x := τ)).sub hlim).const_mul K |>.const_mul 2
          simpa using this
      obtain ⟨xb, hxb⟩ := cauchySeq_tendsto_of_complete hcauchy
      refine hcl s τ xb ⟨hτ0, hτ1⟩ hsU hlim hxb ?_
      have hle : ∀ n, dist (h (s n)) (h 0) ≤ K := by
        intro n
        rw [dist_eq_norm]
        have := hlip 0 (s n) le_rfl (hs0 n) (le_trans (hsτ n).le hτ1)
          (fun x hx => (hsT n).2 x hx)
        have h1 : s n ≤ 1 := le_trans (hsτ n).le hτ1
        nlinarith
      exact le_of_tendsto (hxb.dist tendsto_const_nhds) (Eventually.of_forall hle)
    have hall : ∀ s ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) τ, s ∈ U := by
      intro s hs
      rcases eq_or_lt_of_le hs.2 with h | h
      · rw [h]; exact hτU
      · exact (ha s hs.1 h).2 s ⟨hs.1, le_rfl⟩
    have hτeq : τ = 1 := by
      by_contra hne
      have hlt : τ < 1 := lt_of_le_of_ne hτ1 hne
      obtain ⟨ε, hε, hball⟩ := Metric.isOpen_iff.mp hU τ hτU
      have hT' : min 1 (τ + ε / 2) ∈ T := by
        rw [hT]
        refine ⟨⟨le_min zero_le_one (by linarith), min_le_left _ _⟩, fun s hs => ?_⟩
        by_cases hsτ : s ≤ τ
        · exact hall s ⟨hs.1, hsτ⟩
        · push_neg at hsτ
          apply hball
          rw [Metric.mem_ball, Real.dist_eq, abs_lt]
          have := min_le_right 1 (τ + ε / 2)
          constructor <;> linarith [hs.2]
      have := le_csSup hbdd hT'
      have h2 : τ < min 1 (τ + ε / 2) := lt_min hlt (by linarith)
      rw [← hτ] at this
      linarith
    rw [← hτeq]; exact hτU
  
  
  have hw : ∀ w : E3, w = ∑ a : Fin 3, w a • e a := by
    intro w
    ext k
    simp [e, Pi.single_apply]
  have hexp : ∀ (B : E3 →L[ℝ] E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) (D : E3 →L[ℝ] E3) (w1 w2 : E3),
      B (D w1) (D w2) = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, w1 a * w2 b * B (D (e a)) (D (e b)) := by
    intro B D w1 w2
    calc B (D w1) (D w2)
        = B (D (∑ a : Fin 3, w1 a • e a)) (D (∑ b : Fin 3, w2 b • e b)) := by
          rw [← hw w1, ← hw w2]
      _ = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, w1 a * w2 b * B (D (e a)) (D (e b)) := by
          simp only [map_sum, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply,
            ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, Finset.mul_sum]
          conv_lhs => rw [Finset.sum_comm]
          refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun a _ => Finset.sum_congr rfl fun b _ => ?_
          ring
  
  set Φ := (hAF.ends k).Φ with hΦdef
  have hRI : ∀ z ∈ Φ.target, Φ (Φ.symm z) = z := fun z hz => Φ.toPartialEquiv.right_inv hz
  have hLI : ∀ x ∈ Φ.source, Φ.symm (Φ x) = x := fun x hx => Φ.toPartialEquiv.left_inv hx
  have hMS : ∀ x ∈ Φ.source, Φ x ∈ Φ.target := fun x hx => Φ.toPartialEquiv.map_source hx
  have hMT : ∀ z ∈ Φ.target, Φ.symm z ∈ Φ.source := fun z hz => Φ.toPartialEquiv.map_target hz
  have hΦsm : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ Φ Φ.source := Φ.contMDiffOn_toFun
  refine ⟨2, le_rfl, fun ρ hρ => ?_⟩
  have hSc : IsClosed {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} := isClosed_le continuous_const continuous_norm
  have hSsrc : {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} ⊆ Φ.source := by
    intro x hx
    rw [hsrc]
    show (1 : ℝ) < ‖x‖
    have : ρ ≤ ‖x‖ := hx
    linarith
  rw [← closure_subset_iff_isClosed]
  intro p hp
  by_cases hpt : p ∈ Φ.target
  · 
    by_contra hnot
    have hxS : Φ.symm p ∉ {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} := fun h => hnot ⟨_, h, hRI p hpt⟩
    have hV : IsOpen (Φ.target ∩ Φ.symm ⁻¹' {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖}ᶜ) :=
      Φ.toOpenPartialHomeomorph.isOpen_inter_preimage_symm hSc.isOpen_compl
    obtain ⟨q, hqV, x, hx, rfl⟩ := mem_closure_iff.1 hp _ hV ⟨hpt, hxS⟩
    apply hqV.2
    show Φ.symm (Φ x) ∈ {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖}
    rw [hLI x (hSsrc hx)]
    exact hx
  · exfalso
    set ψ := chartAt E3 p with hψdef
    have hpψ : p ∈ ψ.source := mem_chart_source E3 p
    have hyp : ψ p ∈ ψ.target := mem_chart_target E3 p
    
    obtain ⟨ε, hε, hεsub⟩ := Metric.isOpen_iff.1 ψ.open_target (ψ p) hyp
    obtain ⟨r, hr⟩ : ∃ r : ℝ, r = ε / 2 := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hr0 : 0 < r := by rw [hr]; linarith
    have hcb : closedBall (ψ p) r ⊆ ψ.target :=
      (closedBall_subset_ball (by rw [hr]; linarith)).trans hεsub
    have hKex : ∀ a b : Fin 3, ∃ K : ℝ, ∀ y ∈ closedBall (ψ p) r,
        |g.coeff ψ.symm y a b| ≤ K := by
      intro a b
      have hc : ContinuousOn (fun y => g.coeff ψ.symm y a b) ψ.target :=
        (g.smooth p a b).continuousOn
      obtain ⟨K, hK⟩ := (isCompact_closedBall (ψ p) r).exists_bound_of_continuousOn (hc.mono hcb)
      exact ⟨K, fun y hy => by simpa [Real.norm_eq_abs] using hK y hy⟩
    choose Kf hKf using hKex
    obtain ⟨K, hK⟩ : ∃ K : ℝ, K = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, |Kf a b| := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hK0 : 0 ≤ K := by rw [hK]; positivity
    have hKab : ∀ a b : Fin 3, ∀ y ∈ closedBall (ψ p) r, |g.coeff ψ.symm y a b| ≤ K := by
      intro a b y hy
      have h1 : |Kf a b| ≤ ∑ b' : Fin 3, |Kf a b'| :=
        Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun b' => |Kf a b'|) (fun b' _ => abs_nonneg _)
          (Finset.mem_univ b)
      have h2 : ∑ b' : Fin 3, |Kf a b'| ≤ K := by
        rw [hK]
        exact Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun a' => ∑ b' : Fin 3, |Kf a' b'|)
          (fun a' _ => Finset.sum_nonneg (fun _ _ => abs_nonneg _)) (Finset.mem_univ a)
      linarith [hKf a b y hy, le_abs_self (Kf a b)]
    obtain ⟨Λ, hΛ⟩ : ∃ Λ : ℝ, Λ = 3 * K + 1 := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hΛ0 : 0 < Λ := by rw [hΛ]; linarith
    have UB : ∀ y ∈ closedBall (ψ p) r, ∀ w : E3,
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, w a * w b * g.coeff ψ.symm y a b ≤ Λ * ‖w‖ ^ 2 := by
      intro y hy w
      have t : ∀ a b : Fin 3, w a * w b * g.coeff ψ.symm y a b ≤ K * (|w a| * |w b|) := by
        intro a b
        calc w a * w b * g.coeff ψ.symm y a b ≤ |w a * w b * g.coeff ψ.symm y a b| :=
              le_abs_self _
          _ = |w a| * |w b| * |g.coeff ψ.symm y a b| := by rw [abs_mul, abs_mul]
          _ ≤ |w a| * |w b| * K := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (hKab a b y hy) (by positivity)
          _ = K * (|w a| * |w b|) := by ring
      have q0 : |w 0| * |w 0| = w 0 ^ 2 := by rw [← sq, sq_abs]
      have q1 : |w 1| * |w 1| = w 1 ^ 2 := by rw [← sq, sq_abs]
      have q2 : |w 2| * |w 2| = w 2 ^ 2 := by rw [← sq, sq_abs]
      have t00 := t 0 0
      have t01 := t 0 1
      have t02 := t 0 2
      have t10 := t 1 0
      have t11 := t 1 1
      have t12 := t 1 2
      have t20 := t 2 0
      have t21 := t 2 1
      have t22 := t 2 2
      rw [q0] at t00
      rw [q1] at t11
      rw [q2] at t22
      have a01 := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (two_mul_le_add_sq |w 0| |w 1|) hK0
      have a02 := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (two_mul_le_add_sq |w 0| |w 2|) hK0
      have a12 := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left (two_mul_le_add_sq |w 1| |w 2|) hK0
      simp only [sq_abs] at a01 a02 a12
      rw [hnormsq]
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      rw [hΛ]
      nlinarith [sq_nonneg (w 0), sq_nonneg (w 1), sq_nonneg (w 2)]
    
    have hu : IsOpen (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' ψ.source) :=
      hΦsm.continuousOn.isOpen_inter_preimage Φ.open_source ψ.open_source
    have hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun z => ψ (Φ z)) (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' ψ.source) := by
      have h1 := (contMDiffOn_iff_target.mp hΦsm).2 p
      rw [extChartAt_source] at h1
      have h2 := contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp h1
      simpa [extChartAt_coe, Function.comp_def] using h2
    have hu' : IsOpen (ψ.target ∩ ψ.symm ⁻¹' Φ.target) :=
      ψ.isOpen_inter_preimage_symm Φ.open_target
    have hGm : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) (ψ.target ∩ ψ.symm ⁻¹' Φ.target) := by
      have h1 : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y))
          (ψ.target ∩ ψ.symm ⁻¹' Φ.target) :=
        Φ.contMDiffOn_invFun.comp (contMDiffOn_chart_symm.mono Set.inter_subset_left)
          (fun y hy => hy.2)
      exact contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp h1
    
    have DB : ∀ y, y ∈ ψ.target → ψ.symm y ∈ Φ.target → R < ‖Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)‖ →
        y ∈ closedBall (ψ p) r →
        DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) y ∧
        ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) y‖ ≤ Real.sqrt (2 * Λ) := by
      intro y hyt hyΦ hyR hyb
      have hyu' : y ∈ ψ.target ∩ ψ.symm ⁻¹' Φ.target := ⟨hyt, hyΦ⟩
      obtain ⟨x, hxdef⟩ : ∃ x : E3, x = Φ.symm (ψ.symm y) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
      have hx : x ∈ Φ.source := by rw [hxdef]; exact hMT _ hyΦ
      have hΦx : Φ x = ψ.symm y := by rw [hxdef]; exact hRI _ hyΦ
      have hxR : R < ‖x‖ := by rw [hxdef]; exact hyR
      have hxp : Φ x ∈ ψ.source := by rw [hΦx]; exact ψ.map_target hyt
      have hxu : x ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' ψ.source := ⟨hx, hxp⟩
      have hFx : ψ (Φ x) = y := by rw [hΦx]; exact ψ.right_inv hyt
      have hFdiff : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun z => ψ (Φ z)) x :=
        (hF.contDiffAt (hu.mem_nhds hxu)).differentiableAt (by simp)
      have hGdiff : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) y :=
        (hGm.contDiffAt (hu'.mem_nhds hyu')).differentiableAt (by simp)
      have hFG : (fun z => ψ (Φ (Φ.symm (ψ.symm z)))) =ᶠ[𝓝 y] (fun z => z) := by
        filter_upwards [hu'.mem_nhds hyu'] with z hz
        rw [hRI _ hz.2, ψ.right_inv hz.1]
      
      have hcont : ContinuousAt Φ x := hΦsm.continuousOn.continuousAt (Φ.open_source.mem_nhds hx)
      have hFxt : ψ (Φ x) ∈ ψ.target := ψ.map_source hxp
      have hev : (Φ : E3 → M) =ᶠ[𝓝 x] (ψ.symm ∘ fun z => ψ (Φ z)) := by
        have hmem : (Φ : E3 → M) ⁻¹' ψ.source ∈ 𝓝 x :=
          hcont.preimage_mem_nhds (ψ.open_source.mem_nhds hxp)
        filter_upwards [hmem] with z hz
        simp only [Function.comp_apply]
        exact (ψ.left_inv hz).symm
      have hg : MDifferentiableAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ψ.symm (ψ (Φ x)) :=
        ((contMDiffOn_chart_symm (n := ∞)).contMDiffAt
          (ψ.open_target.mem_nhds hFxt)).mdifferentiableAt (by simp)
      have hfac : ∀ v : E3, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ x v =
          mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ψ.symm (ψ (Φ x)) (fderiv ℝ (fun z => ψ (Φ z)) x v) := by
        intro v
        rw [hev.mfderiv_eq, mfderiv_comp x hg hFdiff.mdifferentiableAt, mfderiv_eq_fderiv]
        rfl
      have hpt' : ψ.symm (ψ (Φ x)) = Φ x := ψ.left_inv hxp
      have h2 : ∀ a b : Fin 3, g.coeff ψ.symm y a b = g.g (Φ x)
          (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ψ.symm (ψ (Φ x)) (e a))
          (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ψ.symm (ψ (Φ x)) (e b)) := by
        intro a b
        rw [← hFx]
        show g.g (ψ.symm (ψ (Φ x))) _ _ = _
        rw [show g.g (ψ.symm (ψ (Φ x))) = g.g (Φ x) from congrArg g.g hpt']
      have hquad : ∀ v : E3, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * g.coeff Φ x i j =
          ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (fderiv ℝ (fun z => ψ (Φ z)) x v) a *
            (fderiv ℝ (fun z => ψ (Φ z)) x v) b * g.coeff ψ.symm y a b := by
        intro v
        have h1 : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * g.coeff Φ x i j =
            g.g (Φ x) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ x v) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ x v) :=
          (hexp _ _ v v).symm
        rw [h1, hfac v]
        simp only [h2]
        exact hexp _ _ _ _
      
      have hcomp : ∀ w : E3, fderiv ℝ (fun z => ψ (Φ z)) x
          (fderiv ℝ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) y w) = w := by
        intro w
        have hFd' : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun z => ψ (Φ z)) (Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) := by
          rw [← hxdef]; exact hFdiff
        have h1 := fderiv_comp y hFd' hGdiff
        have h3 : fderiv ℝ ((fun z => ψ (Φ z)) ∘ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y))) y =
            ContinuousLinearMap.id ℝ E3 := by
          rw [show ((fun z => ψ (Φ z)) ∘ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y))) =
            (fun z => ψ (Φ (Φ.symm (ψ.symm z)))) from rfl]
          rw [hFG.fderiv_eq, fderiv_id']
        rw [h1] at h3
        have := congrArg (fun T : E3 →L[ℝ] E3 => T w) h3
        simpa [hxdef] using this
      refine ⟨hGdiff, ContinuousLinearMap.opNorm_le_bound _ (Real.sqrt_nonneg _) (fun w => ?_)⟩
      have e1 := LB x hxR (fderiv ℝ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) y w)
      rw [hquad, hcomp w] at e1
      have e2 := UB y hyb w
      have hsq : ‖fderiv ℝ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) y w‖ ^ 2 ≤ 2 * Λ * ‖w‖ ^ 2 := by
        linarith
      have := Real.sqrt_le_sqrt hsq
      rw [Real.sqrt_sq (norm_nonneg _), Real.sqrt_mul' _ (sq_nonneg _),
        Real.sqrt_sq (norm_nonneg _)] at this
      exact this
    obtain ⟨L, hL⟩ : ∃ L : ℝ, L = Real.sqrt (2 * Λ) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hL0 : 0 ≤ L := by rw [hL]; exact Real.sqrt_nonneg _
    rw [← hL] at DB
    
    obtain ⟨R'', hR''⟩ : ∃ R'' : ℝ, R'' = R + 1 + L * r := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hKc : IsCompact ({x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} ∩ closedBall 0 R'') :=
      (isCompact_closedBall 0 R'').inter_left hSc
    have hKcsrc : {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} ∩ closedBall 0 R'' ⊆ Φ.source := fun x hx => hSsrc hx.1
    have hKcl : IsClosed (Φ '' ({x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} ∩ closedBall 0 R'')) :=
      (hKc.image_of_continuousOn (hΦsm.continuousOn.mono hKcsrc)).isClosed
    have hpK : p ∉ Φ '' ({x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} ∩ closedBall 0 R'') := by
      rintro ⟨x, hx, hxp⟩
      exact hpt (hxp ▸ hMS x (hKcsrc hx))
    have hNo : IsOpen ((ψ.source ∩ ψ ⁻¹' ball (ψ p) (r / 2)) ∩
        (Φ '' ({x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} ∩ closedBall 0 R''))ᶜ) :=
      (ψ.isOpen_inter_preimage isOpen_ball).inter hKcl.isOpen_compl
    have hpN : p ∈ (ψ.source ∩ ψ ⁻¹' ball (ψ p) (r / 2)) ∩
        (Φ '' ({x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} ∩ closedBall 0 R''))ᶜ :=
      ⟨⟨hpψ, mem_ball_self (by linarith)⟩, hpK⟩
    obtain ⟨q, ⟨⟨hqψ, hqb⟩, hqK⟩, x₀, hx₀S, hx₀q⟩ := mem_closure_iff.1 hp _ hNo hpN
    subst hx₀q
    have hx₀src : x₀ ∈ Φ.source := hSsrc hx₀S
    have hx₀R : R'' < ‖x₀‖ := by
      by_contra hcon
      push_neg at hcon
      exact hqK ⟨x₀, ⟨hx₀S, mem_closedBall_zero_iff.2 hcon⟩, rfl⟩
    obtain ⟨y₀, hy₀⟩ : ∃ y₀ : E3, y₀ = ψ (Φ x₀) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hy₀b : dist y₀ (ψ p) < r / 2 := by rw [hy₀]; exact hqb
    have hy₀t : y₀ ∈ ψ.target := by rw [hy₀]; exact ψ.map_source hqψ
    have hy₀s : ψ.symm y₀ = Φ x₀ := by rw [hy₀]; exact ψ.left_inv hqψ
    have hGy₀ : Φ.symm (ψ.symm y₀) = x₀ := by rw [hy₀s]; exact hLI x₀ hx₀src
    have hLr : 0 ≤ L * r := mul_nonneg hL0 hr0.le
    
    have hσball : ∀ t ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) 1, dist (y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀)) (ψ p) < r / 2 := by
      intro t ht
      rw [dist_eq_norm]
      have e : y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀) - ψ p = (1 - t) • (y₀ - ψ p) := by
        simp only [smul_sub, sub_smul, one_smul]; abel
      rw [e, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg (by linarith [ht.2]), ← dist_eq_norm]
      have := dist_nonneg (x := y₀) (y := ψ p)
      nlinarith [ht.1]
    have hcont_σ : Continuous (fun t : ℝ => y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀)) :=
      continuous_const.add (continuous_id.smul continuous_const)
    set W := ψ.target ∩ ψ.symm ⁻¹' (Φ.target ∩ Φ.symm ⁻¹' {x : E3 | R < ‖x‖}) with hW
    have hWo : IsOpen W :=
      ψ.isOpen_inter_preimage_symm (Φ.toOpenPartialHomeomorph.isOpen_inter_preimage_symm
        (isOpen_lt continuous_const continuous_norm))
    have hnorm_y₀ : ‖ψ p - y₀‖ < r / 2 := by rw [← dist_eq_norm, dist_comm]; exact hy₀b
    have h1U := s6 {t : ℝ | y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀) ∈ W}
      (fun t => Φ.symm (ψ.symm (y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀))))
      (fun t => fderiv ℝ (fun y => Φ.symm (ψ.symm y)) (y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀)) (ψ p - y₀))
      (L * ‖ψ p - y₀‖) (hWo.preimage hcont_σ) (by positivity) ?h0 ?hD ?hcl
    · have h1W : y₀ + (1 : ℝ) • (ψ p - y₀) ∈ W := h1U
      have hσ1 : y₀ + (1 : ℝ) • (ψ p - y₀) = ψ p := by rw [one_smul]; abel
      rw [hσ1] at h1W
      have := h1W.2.1
      rw [ψ.left_inv hpψ] at this
      exact hpt this
    case h0 =>
      show y₀ + (0 : ℝ) • (ψ p - y₀) ∈ W
      rw [zero_smul, add_zero]
      refine ⟨hy₀t, ?_, ?_⟩
      · rw [hy₀s]; exact hMS x₀ hx₀src
      · show R < ‖Φ.symm (ψ.symm y₀)‖
        rw [hGy₀]; linarith
    case hD =>
      intro t ht htU
      have htW : y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀) ∈ W := htU
      obtain ⟨hdiff, hnorm⟩ := DB (y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀)) htW.1 htW.2.1 htW.2.2
        (mem_closedBall.2 (by linarith [hσball t ht]))
      have hσd : HasDerivAt (fun t : ℝ => y₀ + t • (ψ p - y₀)) (ψ p - y₀) t := by
        simpa using ((hasDerivAt_id t).smul_const (ψ p - y₀)).const_add y₀
      have hcd := hdiff.hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt t hσd
      exact ⟨hcd,
        le_trans (ContinuousLinearMap.le_opNorm _ _)
          (mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hnorm (norm_nonneg _))⟩
    case hcl =>
      intro s τ xb hτ hs hsτ hxb hdist
      change dist xb (Φ.symm (ψ.symm (y₀ + (0 : ℝ) • (ψ p - y₀)))) ≤ _ at hdist
      rw [zero_smul, add_zero, hGy₀] at hdist
      have hKr : L * ‖ψ p - y₀‖ ≤ L * (r / 2) := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hnorm_y₀.le hL0
      have hxbR : R + 1 < ‖xb‖ := by
        have := norm_sub_norm_le x₀ xb
        rw [← dist_eq_norm, dist_comm] at this
        linarith
      have hxbsrc : xb ∈ Φ.source := by
        rw [hsrc]; show (1 : ℝ) < ‖xb‖; linarith
      have hτt : y₀ + τ • (ψ p - y₀) ∈ ψ.target :=
        hcb (mem_closedBall.2 (by linarith [hσball τ hτ]))
      have hlim1 : Tendsto (fun n => Φ (Φ.symm (ψ.symm (y₀ + s n • (ψ p - y₀))))) atTop
          (𝓝 (Φ xb)) :=
        ((hΦsm.continuousOn.continuousAt (Φ.open_source.mem_nhds hxbsrc)).tendsto).comp hxb
      have heq : ∀ n, Φ (Φ.symm (ψ.symm (y₀ + s n • (ψ p - y₀)))) =
          ψ.symm (y₀ + s n • (ψ p - y₀)) := by
        intro n
        have hn : y₀ + s n • (ψ p - y₀) ∈ W := (hs n).2
        exact hRI _ hn.2.1
      have hlim2 : Tendsto (fun n => ψ.symm (y₀ + s n • (ψ p - y₀))) atTop
          (𝓝 (ψ.symm (y₀ + τ • (ψ p - y₀)))) :=
        ((ψ.continuousAt_symm hτt).tendsto).comp ((hcont_σ.tendsto τ).comp hsτ)
      have huniq : Φ xb = ψ.symm (y₀ + τ • (ψ p - y₀)) :=
        tendsto_nhds_unique (hlim1.congr heq) hlim2
      show y₀ + τ • (ψ p - y₀) ∈ W
      refine ⟨hτt, ?_, ?_⟩
      · show ψ.symm (y₀ + τ • (ψ p - y₀)) ∈ Φ.target
        rw [← huniq]; exact hMS xb hxbsrc
      · show R < ‖Φ.symm (ψ.symm (y₀ + τ • (ψ p - y₀)))‖
        rw [← huniq, hLI xb hxbsrc]; linarith

theorem end_chart_escape [T2Space M] [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) (k : Fin hAF.numEnds) :
    ∀ p : M, ∃ ρ : ℝ, ∃ N ∈ 𝓝 p, ∀ y : E3, ρ < ‖y‖ → (hAF.ends k).Φ y ∉ N :=
by
  intro p
  obtain ⟨ρ₀, hρ₀2, hcl⟩ := endChart_far_isClosed g hAF k
  have hsrc : (hAF.ends k).Φ.source = {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := (hAF.ends k).source_eq
  have hinj : Set.InjOn (hAF.ends k).Φ (hAF.ends k).Φ.source :=
    (hAF.ends k).Φ.toPartialEquiv.injOn
  have hex : ∃ ρ : ℝ, ρ₀ ≤ ρ ∧ p ∉ (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖} := by
    by_cases hp : p ∈ (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | ρ₀ ≤ ‖x‖}
    · obtain ⟨y₀, hy₀, hpy₀⟩ := hp
      have hy₀' : ρ₀ ≤ ‖y₀‖ := hy₀
      refine ⟨max ρ₀ (‖y₀‖ + 1), le_max_left _ _, ?_⟩
      rintro ⟨x, hx, hpx⟩
      have hx' : max ρ₀ (‖y₀‖ + 1) ≤ ‖x‖ := hx
      have h1 : ‖y₀‖ + 1 ≤ ‖x‖ := le_trans (le_max_right _ _) hx'
      have hxs : x ∈ (hAF.ends k).Φ.source := by
        rw [hsrc]; show (1 : ℝ) < ‖x‖; linarith [norm_nonneg y₀]
      have hys : y₀ ∈ (hAF.ends k).Φ.source := by
        rw [hsrc]; show (1 : ℝ) < ‖y₀‖; linarith
      have hxy : x = y₀ := hinj hxs hys (hpx.trans hpy₀.symm)
      rw [hxy] at h1
      linarith
    · exact ⟨ρ₀, le_refl _, hp⟩
  obtain ⟨ρ, hρ, hpC⟩ := hex
  refine ⟨ρ, ((hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | ρ ≤ ‖x‖})ᶜ,
    (isOpen_compl_iff.mpr (hcl ρ hρ)).mem_nhds hpC, ?_⟩
  intro y hy hyN
  exact hyN (Set.mem_image_of_mem _ (show ρ ≤ ‖y‖ from hy.le))

theorem far_max_point_exists [T2Space M] [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M)
    (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) (l : Fin hAF.numEnds) (S : Set M) (hS : IsCompact S)
    (y₀ : E3) (hy₀ : 1 < ‖y₀‖) (hy₀S : (hAF.ends l).Φ y₀ ∈ S) :
    ∃ y₁ : E3, ‖y₀‖ ≤ ‖y₁‖ ∧ (hAF.ends l).Φ y₁ ∈ S ∧
      ∀ y : E3, 1 < ‖y‖ → (hAF.ends l).Φ y ∈ S → ‖y‖ ≤ ‖y₁‖ :=
by
  have hsrc : (hAF.ends l).Φ.source = {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := (hAF.ends l).source_eq
  have hcont : ContinuousOn ((hAF.ends l).Φ : E3 → M) (hAF.ends l).Φ.source :=
    (hAF.ends l).Φ.contMDiffOn_toFun.continuousOn
  choose ρ N hN hesc using end_chart_escape g hAF l
  obtain ⟨t, -, htS⟩ := hS.elim_nhds_subcover N (fun p _ => hN p)
  set ρS : ℝ := ‖y₀‖ + ∑ p ∈ t, |ρ p| with hρS
  have hsum0 : 0 ≤ ∑ p ∈ t, |ρ p| := Finset.sum_nonneg (fun p _ => abs_nonneg _)
  have hy₀ρ : ‖y₀‖ ≤ ρS := by linarith
  have hbound : ∀ y : E3, (hAF.ends l).Φ y ∈ S → ‖y‖ ≤ ρS := by
    intro y hyS
    by_contra hlt
    push_neg at hlt
    have hmem := htS hyS
    simp only [Set.mem_iUnion] at hmem
    obtain ⟨p, hpt, hpN⟩ := hmem
    have h1 : ρ p ≤ |ρ p| := le_abs_self _
    have h2 : |ρ p| ≤ ∑ q ∈ t, |ρ q| :=
      Finset.single_le_sum (f := fun q => |ρ q|) (fun q _ => abs_nonneg _) hpt
    have h3 : 0 ≤ ‖y₀‖ := norm_nonneg _
    exact hesc p y (by linarith) hpN
  set K : Set E3 := {y : E3 | ‖y₀‖ ≤ ‖y‖} ∩ {y : E3 | ‖y‖ ≤ ρS} with hKdef
  have hKc : IsClosed K :=
    (isClosed_le continuous_const continuous_norm).inter
      (isClosed_le continuous_norm continuous_const)
  have hKsrc : K ⊆ (hAF.ends l).Φ.source := by
    intro y hy
    rw [hsrc]
    show (1 : ℝ) < ‖y‖
    exact lt_of_lt_of_le hy₀ hy.1
  have hBc : IsClosed (K ∩ (hAF.ends l).Φ ⁻¹' S) :=
    ContinuousOn.preimage_isClosed_of_isClosed (hcont.mono hKsrc) hKc hS.isClosed
  have hBsub : K ∩ (hAF.ends l).Φ ⁻¹' S ⊆ Metric.closedBall (0 : E3) ρS := by
    intro y hy
    rw [mem_closedBall_zero_iff]
    exact hy.1.2
  have hBcpt : IsCompact (K ∩ (hAF.ends l).Φ ⁻¹' S) :=
    (isCompact_closedBall (0 : E3) ρS).of_isClosed_subset hBc hBsub
  have hy₀B : y₀ ∈ K ∩ (hAF.ends l).Φ ⁻¹' S :=
    ⟨⟨show ‖y₀‖ ≤ ‖y₀‖ from le_refl _, show ‖y₀‖ ≤ ρS from hy₀ρ⟩, hy₀S⟩
  obtain ⟨y₁, hy₁B, hmax⟩ := hBcpt.exists_isMaxOn ⟨y₀, hy₀B⟩ continuous_norm.continuousOn
  refine ⟨y₁, hy₁B.1.1, hy₁B.2, ?_⟩
  intro y _ hyS
  rcases le_or_gt ‖y₀‖ ‖y‖ with h | h
  · have hyB : y ∈ K ∩ (hAF.ends l).Φ ⁻¹' S := ⟨⟨h, hbound y hyS⟩, hyS⟩
    exact isMaxOn_iff.mp hmax y hyB
  · exact le_trans h.le hy₁B.1.1

theorem hessLoc_chart_invariant [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M)
    (Φ : PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞) (f : M → ℝ) (V : Set M) (hV : IsOpen V)
    (hf : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ f V) (x : E3) (hx : x ∈ Φ.source) (hxV : Φ x ∈ V) :
    (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) a) x).det ≠ 0 ∧
    ∀ i j : Fin 3, hessLoc (g.coeff Φ) (f ∘ Φ) i j x =
      ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv i (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) a) x *
          partialDeriv j (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) b) x *
          hessLoc (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm) (fun y => f ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y)) a b
            (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ x)) :=
by
  
  have hu : ∀ u : E3, u = ∑ d : Fin 3, u d • e d := by
    intro u
    conv_lhs => rw [← (EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin 3) ℝ).sum_repr u]
    simp [EuclideanSpace.basisFun_apply]
  have hcomp_e : ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∀ a : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) a = v a := by
    intro v a
    simp [Pi.single_apply]
  have hcompo : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z → ∀ l d : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z = (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)) d := by
    intro ψ z hψ l d
    have hfun : (fun v => ψ v d) = (EuclideanSpace.proj d : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) ∘ ψ := by
      funext v; simp
    rw [partialDeriv, hfun, fderiv_comp z (EuclideanSpace.proj d).differentiableAt hψ,
      ContinuousLinearMap.fderiv]
    simp
  have dmul : ∀ (f g : E3 → ℝ) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ f z → DifferentiableAt ℝ g z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => f w * g w) z := fun f g z hf hg => hf.mul hg
  have pd_mul : ∀ (f g : E3 → ℝ) (z : E3) (l : Fin 3), DifferentiableAt ℝ f z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ g z →
      partialDeriv l (fun w => f w * g w) z = partialDeriv l f z * g z + f z * partialDeriv l g z := by
    intro f g z l hf hg
    simp only [partialDeriv, fderiv_fun_mul hf hg, ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply,
      ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
    ring
  have pd_sum : ∀ (f : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) (z : E3) (l : Fin 3), (∀ a, DifferentiableAt ℝ (f a) z) →
      partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, f a w) z = ∑ a : Fin 3, partialDeriv l (f a) z := by
    intro f z l hf
    simp only [partialDeriv, fderiv_fun_sum (fun a _ => hf a), ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply]
  have pd_comp : ∀ (F : E3 → ℝ) (ψ : E3 → E3) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ F (ψ z) → ∀ l : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun w => F (ψ w)) z
        = ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d F (ψ z) * partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z := by
    intro F ψ z hψ hF l
    have h1 : partialDeriv l (fun w => F (ψ w)) z = fderiv ℝ F (ψ z) (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)) := by
      show fderiv ℝ (F ∘ ψ) z (e l) = _
      rw [fderiv_comp z hF hψ]
      rfl
    rw [h1, hu (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)), map_sum]
    simp only [map_smul, smul_eq_mul, hcompo ψ z hψ]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro d _
    rw [mul_comm]
    rfl
  have hpdU : ∀ (U : Set E3), IsOpen U → ∀ f : E3 → ℝ, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f U → ∀ i,
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (partialDeriv i f) U := by
    intro U hU f hf i
    have h1 : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => fderiv ℝ f y) U := hf.fderiv_of_isOpen hU (by simp)
    exact h1.clm_apply contDiffOn_const
  
  have pullback_partialDeriv : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (U V : Set E3),
      IsOpen U → IsOpen V → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ ψ U → (∀ z ∈ U, ψ z ∈ V) →
      (∀ a b : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => G y a b) V) → ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ l i j : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) z =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a)) z * G (ψ z) a b *
              partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z +
            partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z *
              (∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d (fun y => G y a b) (ψ z) *
                partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z) * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z +
            partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z * G (ψ z) a b *
              partialDeriv l (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b)) z) := by
    intro ψ G U V hU hV hψ hmaps hG z hz l i j
    have hψd : DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z :=
      (hψ.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hJd : ∀ a k : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v a)) z := by
      intro a k
      exact ((hpdU U hU _ (contDiffOn_euclidean.mp hψ a) k).contDiffAt
        (hU.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hGd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => G y a b) (ψ z) := fun a b =>
      ((hG a b).contDiffAt (hV.mem_nhds (hmaps z hz))).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hGψd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => G (ψ w) a b) z :=
      fun a b => (hGd a b).comp z hψd
    have htd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w *
        G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) z :=
      fun a b => dmul _ _ _ (dmul _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b)) (hJd b j)
    rw [pd_sum _ _ _ (fun a => DifferentiableAt.fun_sum (fun b _ => htd a b))]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro a _
    rw [pd_sum _ _ _ (fun b => htd a b)]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro b _
    rw [pd_mul _ _ _ _ (dmul _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b)) (hJd b j),
      pd_mul _ _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b), pd_comp (fun y => G y a b) ψ z hψd (hGd a b) l]
    ring
  
  have christoffel_pullback_algebra : ∀ (A G Gt : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
      (dG H dGt : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ),
      A.det ≠ 0 → G.det ≠ 0 → (∀ a b, G a b = G b a) → (∀ c i j, H c i j = H c j i) →
      (∀ i j, Gt i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * G a b * A b j) →
      (∀ l i j, dGt l i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        (H a l i * G a b * A b j + A a i * (∑ d : Fin 3, dG d a b * A d l) * A b j
          + A a i * G a b * H b l j)) →
      ∀ c i j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ k l *
          (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j)) =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c l *
          (dG a b l + dG b a l - dG l a b)) * A a i * A b j + H c i j := by
    intro A G Gt dG H dGt hA hG hGs hH hGt hdGt c i j
    have hAu : IsUnit A.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hA
    have hGu : IsUnit G.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hG
    have hGt' : Gt = Matrix.transpose A * G * A := by
      ext i j
      rw [hGt]
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply, Finset.sum_mul]
      rw [Finset.sum_comm]
    have hAB : A * A⁻¹ = 1 := Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv A hAu
    have hGiG : G⁻¹ * G = 1 := Matrix.nonsing_inv_mul G hGu
    have hGtinv : Gt⁻¹ = A⁻¹ * G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGt', Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.transpose_nonsing_inv]
      exact (mul_assoc _ _ _).symm
    have hα : A * Gt⁻¹ = G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGtinv, ← Matrix.mul_assoc, ← Matrix.mul_assoc, hAB, Matrix.one_mul]
    have hα' : ∀ l, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Gt⁻¹ k l = ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * A⁻¹ l b := by
      intro l
      have h1 := congrFun (congrFun hα c) l
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply] at h1
      exact h1
    have hβ : ∀ l, dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j = ∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l *
        (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β)
          + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j) := by
      intro l
      rw [hdGt, hdGt, hdGt]
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three, hH _ j i, hH _ l i, hH _ l j]
      simp only [hGs 1 0, hGs 2 0, hGs 2 1]
      ring
    have eAB : ∀ γ b : Fin 3, A γ 0 * A⁻¹ 0 b + A γ 1 * A⁻¹ 1 b + A γ 2 * A⁻¹ 2 b
        = if γ = b then 1 else 0 := by
      intro γ b
      rw [← Matrix.one_apply, ← hAB, Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    have hcontr : ∀ (u W : Fin 3 → ℝ), ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, u b * A⁻¹ l b) *
        (∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l * W γ) = ∑ b : Fin 3, u b * W b := by
      intro u W
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      linear_combination
        (u 0 * W 0) * (eAB 0 0).trans (if_pos rfl)
        + (u 1 * W 0) * (eAB 0 1).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 2 * W 0) * (eAB 0 2).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 0 * W 1) * (eAB 1 0).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 1 * W 1) * (eAB 1 1).trans (if_pos rfl)
        + (u 2 * W 1) * (eAB 1 2).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 0 * W 2) * (eAB 2 0).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 1 * W 2) * (eAB 2 1).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 2 * W 2) * (eAB 2 2).trans (if_pos rfl)
    have hGG : ∑ a : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * G a b) * H a i j = H c i j := by
      have h2 : ∀ a, ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * G a b = (1 : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) c a := by
        intro a
        rw [← hGiG, Matrix.mul_apply]
        exact Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun b _ => by rw [hGs a b])
      simp only [h2, Matrix.one_apply, ite_mul, one_mul, zero_mul, Finset.sum_ite_eq,
        Finset.mem_univ, if_true]
    calc ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ k l *
            (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j))
        = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Gt⁻¹ k l) *
            (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j) := by
          simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
          ring
      _ = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * A⁻¹ l b) * (∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l *
            (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β)
              + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j)) := by
          simp only [hα', hβ]
      _ = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b *
            (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β b + dG β α b - dG b α β)
              + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a b * H a i j) := by
          rw [hcontr (fun b => G⁻¹ c b) (fun γ => ∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3,
            A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β) + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j)]
      _ = _ := by
          rw [← hGG]
          simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
          ring
  
  have hess_algebra : ∀ (A : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (Γt Γ H : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ)
      (P : Fin 3 → ℝ) (Q : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ),
      (∀ c i j, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Γt k i j =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b * A a i * A b j + H c i j) →
      ∀ i j : Fin 3, ((∑ d : Fin 3, (∑ e : Fin 3, Q e d * A e i) * A d j
          + ∑ d : Fin 3, P d * H d i j)
            - ∑ k : Fin 3, Γt k i j * (∑ d : Fin 3, P d * A d k)) =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * A b j * (Q a b - ∑ k : Fin 3, Γ k a b * P k) := by
    intro A Γt Γ H P Q hT1 i j
    have h0 := hT1 0 i j
    have h1 := hT1 1 i j
    have h2 := hT1 2 i j
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three] at h0 h1 h2 ⊢
    linear_combination (-(P 0)) * h0 + (-(P 1)) * h1 + (-(P 2)) * h2
  
  have partialDeriv_comm : ∀ (f : E3 → ℝ) (U : Set E3), IsOpen U → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f U →
      ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j f) z = partialDeriv j (partialDeriv i f) z := by
    intro f U hU hf z hz i j
    have hfz : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ f z := hf.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz)
    have hsymm : IsSymmSndFDerivAt ℝ f z :=
      hfz.isSymmSndFDerivAt (by simpa using (WithTop.coe_le_coe.mpr le_top : (2 : WithTop ℕ∞) ≤ ∞))
    have hd : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fderiv ℝ f) z :=
      (hfz.fderiv_right (m := 1) (by
        rw [one_add_one_eq_two]; exact WithTop.coe_le_coe.mpr le_top)).differentiableAt one_ne_zero
    have key2 : ∀ a b : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv a (partialDeriv b f) z = fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ f) z (e a) (e b) := by
      intro a b
      show fderiv ℝ (fun y => fderiv ℝ f y (e b)) z (e a) = _
      rw [fderiv_clm_apply hd (differentiableAt_const _)]
      simp
    rw [key2, key2, hsymm]
  
  have hessLoc_congr : ∀ (G G' : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (u v : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3),
      G =ᶠ[𝓝 y] G' → u =ᶠ[𝓝 y] v → ∀ i j : Fin 3, hessLoc G u i j y = hessLoc G' v i j y := by
    intro G G' u v y hG huv i j
    have hy0 : G y = G' y := hG.eq_of_nhds
    have hent : ∀ a b l, partialDeriv l (fun z => G z a b) y
        = partialDeriv l (fun z => G' z a b) y := by
      intro a b l
      have : (fun z => G z a b) =ᶠ[𝓝 y] (fun z => G' z a b) :=
        hG.mono (fun z hz => by simp [hz])
      simp only [partialDeriv, this.fderiv_eq]
    have hchr : ∀ k i j, christoffel G k i j y = christoffel G' k i j y := by
      intro k i j
      simp only [christoffel, hy0, hent]
    have h1 : ∀ l : Fin 3, partialDeriv l u y = partialDeriv l v y := by
      intro l
      show fderiv ℝ u y (e l) = fderiv ℝ v y (e l)
      rw [huv.fderiv_eq]
    have h2 : partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j u) y = partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j v) y := by
      have hev : partialDeriv j u =ᶠ[𝓝 y] partialDeriv j v := by
        filter_upwards [huv.eventuallyEq_nhds] with z hz
        show fderiv ℝ u z (e j) = fderiv ℝ v z (e j)
        rw [hz.fderiv_eq]
      show fderiv ℝ (partialDeriv j u) y (e i) = fderiv ℝ (partialDeriv j v) y (e i)
      rw [hev.fderiv_eq]
    simp only [hessLoc, hchr, h1, h2]
  
  have key : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (u : E3 → ℝ) (U V : Set E3),
      IsOpen U → IsOpen V → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ ψ U → (∀ z ∈ U, ψ z ∈ V) →
      (∀ a b : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => G y a b) V) →
      (∀ y a b, G y a b = G y b a) → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ u V → x ∈ U →
      (G (ψ x)).det ≠ 0 →
      (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) x).det ≠ 0 →
      ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      hessLoc (fun w => Matrix.of fun p q : Fin 3 => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          partialDeriv p (fun v => ψ v a) w * G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv q (fun v => ψ v b) w)
          (fun w => u (ψ w)) i j x
        = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) x *
            partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) x * hessLoc G u a b (ψ x) := by
    intro ψ G u U V hUo hVo hψ hmaps hG hGsym huV hxU hdetG hdetJ
    have hψc : ∀ a : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun v => ψ v a) U := fun a =>
      contDiffOn_euclidean.mp hψ a
    set Gt : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ := fun w => Matrix.of fun p q : Fin 3 =>
      ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv p (fun v => ψ v a) w * G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv q (fun v => ψ v b) w
      with hGt
    have hH : ∀ c i j : Fin 3, partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) x
        = partialDeriv j (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v c)) x :=
      fun c i j => partialDeriv_comm _ U hUo (hψc c) x hxU i j
    have hT1 : ∀ c i j : Fin 3,
        ∑ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v c) x * christoffel Gt k i j x
          = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, christoffel G c a b (ψ x) * partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) x *
            partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) x + partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) x := by
      intro c i j
      have h8 := pullback_partialDeriv ψ G U V hUo hVo hψ hmaps hG x hxU
      have h9 := christoffel_pullback_algebra
        (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) x) (G (ψ x)) (Gt x)
        (fun d a b => partialDeriv d (fun y => G y a b) (ψ x))
        (fun c i j => partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) x)
        (fun l i j => partialDeriv l (fun w => Gt w i j) x)
        hdetJ hdetG (fun a b => hGsym _ a b)
        (fun c i j => hH c i j) (fun i j => rfl) (fun l i j => h8 l i j) c i j
      exact h9
    have hψd : ∀ z ∈ U, DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z := fun z hz =>
      (hψ.contDiffAt (hUo.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hud : ∀ z ∈ U, DifferentiableAt ℝ u (ψ z) := fun z hz =>
      (huV.contDiffAt (hVo.mem_nhds (hmaps z hz))).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have h7a : ∀ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun w => u (ψ w)) x
        = ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d u (ψ x) * partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v d) x :=
      fun k => pd_comp u ψ x (hψd x hxU) (hud x hxU) k
    have hJd : ∀ a k : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v a)) x := by
      intro a k
      exact ((hpdU U hUo _ (hψc a) k).contDiffAt (hUo.mem_nhds hxU)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hPd : ∀ d : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (partialDeriv d u) (ψ x) := fun d =>
      ((hpdU V hVo u huV d).contDiffAt (hVo.mem_nhds (hmaps x hxU))).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hPψd : ∀ d : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => partialDeriv d u (ψ y)) x := fun d =>
      (hPd d).comp x (hψd x hxU)
    have h7b : ∀ i j : Fin 3, partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun w => u (ψ w))) x
        = ∑ d : Fin 3, (∑ e : Fin 3, partialDeriv e (partialDeriv d u) (ψ x) *
            partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v e) x) * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v d) x
          + ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d u (ψ x) * partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v d)) x := by
      intro i j
      have hev : partialDeriv j (fun w => u (ψ w)) =ᶠ[𝓝 x]
          (fun y => ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d u (ψ y) * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v d) y) := by
        filter_upwards [hUo.mem_nhds hxU] with y hy
        exact pd_comp u ψ y (hψd y hy) (hud y hy) j
      have e1 : partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun w => u (ψ w))) x
          = partialDeriv i (fun y => ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d u (ψ y) *
              partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v d) y) x :=
        congrArg (fun L : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ => L (e i)) hev.fderiv_eq
      rw [e1, pd_sum _ _ _ (fun d => dmul _ _ _ (hPψd d) (hJd d j)), ← Finset.sum_add_distrib]
      apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
      intro d _
      rw [pd_mul _ _ _ _ (hPψd d) (hJd d j),
        pd_comp (partialDeriv d u) ψ x (hψd x hxU) (hPd d) i]
    intro i j
    have h8 := hess_algebra (fun a i => partialDeriv i (fun w => ψ w a) x)
      (fun k i j => christoffel Gt k i j x) (fun c a b => christoffel G c a b (ψ x))
      (fun c i j => partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v c)) x)
      (fun d => partialDeriv d u (ψ x))
      (fun e d => partialDeriv e (partialDeriv d u) (ψ x))
      hT1 i j
    unfold hessLoc
    rw [h7b i j]
    simp only [h7a]
    exact h8
  
  have h2 : IsOpen (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source) ∧
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w))
        (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source) := by
    have hΦ : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ Φ Φ.source := Φ.contMDiffOn_toFun
    refine ⟨hΦ.continuousOn.isOpen_inter_preimage Φ.open_source
      (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).open_source, ?_⟩
    have hc : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ (chartAt E3 (Φ x))
        (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source := contMDiffOn_chart
    have hcomp := hc.comp (hΦ.mono Set.inter_subset_left) (fun w hw => hw.2)
    exact contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp hcomp
  have hxU : x ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source := ⟨hx, mem_chart_source E3 (Φ x)⟩
  have hψd : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source,
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z := fun z hz =>
    (h2.2.contDiffAt (h2.1.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
  have hM1 : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source,
      mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z =
        (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z))).comp
          (fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z) := by
    intro z hz
    have hev : (Φ : E3 → M) =ᶠ[𝓝 z]
        ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm ∘ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w))) := by
      filter_upwards [h2.1.mem_nhds hz] with w hw
      exact ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).left_inv hw.2).symm
    rw [hev.mfderiv_eq, mfderiv_comp z
      (mdifferentiableAt_atlas_symm (chart_mem_atlas E3 (Φ x))
        ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).map_source hz.2)) (hψd z hz).mdifferentiableAt, mfderiv_eq_fderiv]
  have hM1' : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source, ∀ u : E3,
      mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z u =
        mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z))
          (fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z u) := by
    intro z hz u
    rw [hM1 z hz]
    rfl
  
  have s1 : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      g.coeff Φ z i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv i (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) a) z *
          g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) a b *
            partialDeriv j (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) b) z := by
    intro z hz i j
    have hq : (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) = Φ z :=
      (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).left_inv hz.2
    have hgq : g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z))) = g.g (Φ z) :=
      congrArg g.g hq
    obtain ⟨D, hD⟩ : ∃ D : E3 →L[ℝ] E3,
        D = mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) :=
      ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hΦD : ∀ u : E3, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z u =
        D (fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z u) := by
      intro u
      rw [hM1' z hz u, hD]
      rfl
    have hcD : ∀ a b : Fin 3, g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) a b
        = g.g (Φ z) (D (e a)) (D (e b)) := by
      intro a b
      rw [← hgq, hD]
      rfl
    have hJ : ∀ k : Fin 3, fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z (e k)
        = ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) d) z • e d := by
      intro k
      rw [hu (fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z (e k))]
      simp only [hcompo _ z (hψd z hz)]
    simp only [hcD]
    show g.g (Φ z) (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z (e i))
      (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z (e j)) = _
    rw [hΦD, hΦD, hJ i, hJ j]
    simp only [map_sum, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply,
      smul_eq_mul]
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  
  have s3 : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source,
      (Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w) a) z).det
        ≠ 0 := by
    intro z hz hdet
    obtain ⟨v, hv0, hJv⟩ := Matrix.exists_mulVec_eq_zero_iff.mpr hdet
    have hloc := PartialDiffeomorph.isLocalDiffeomorphAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ Φ hz.1
    have hinj : ∀ u : E3, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) Φ z u = 0 → u = 0 := by
      intro u hu0
      rw [← hloc.mfderivToContinuousLinearEquiv_coe (by simp)] at hu0
      exact (hloc.mfderivToContinuousLinearEquiv (by simp)).map_eq_zero_iff.mp hu0
    have hw : fderiv ℝ (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) z (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) = 0 := by
      ext a
      rw [map_sum]
      simp only [map_smul]
      have := congrFun hJv a
      simp only [Matrix.mulVec, dotProduct, Matrix.of_apply, Pi.zero_apply,
        hcompo _ z (hψd z hz)] at this
      simp only [WithLp.ofLp_sum, WithLp.ofLp_smul, Finset.sum_apply, Pi.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul,
        WithLp.ofLp_zero, Pi.zero_apply]
      rw [← this]
      apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
      intro i _
      ring
    have h0 : (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) = 0 := by
      apply hinj
      rw [hM1' z hz, hw]
      exact ContinuousLinearMap.map_zero _
    apply hv0
    funext a
    rw [← hcomp_e v a, h0]
    rfl
  
  have s4 : ∀ y ∈ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).target,
      (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y).det ≠ 0 := by
    intro y hy hdet
    obtain ⟨v, hv0, hGv⟩ := Matrix.exists_mulVec_eq_zero_iff.mpr hdet
    obtain ⟨D, hD⟩ : ∃ D : E3 →L[ℝ] E3,
        D = mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hid := (mdifferentiable_chart (I := 𝓘(ℝ, E3)) (Φ x)).comp_symm_deriv hy
    have hinj : ∀ u : E3, D u = 0 → u = 0 := by
      intro u hu0
      have h1 := DFunLike.congr_fun hid u
      have h' : mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 (Φ x)) ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D u)
          = u := by
        rw [hD]
        exact h1
      rw [hu0] at h'
      rw [← h']
      exact ContinuousLinearMap.map_zero _
    have hcD : ∀ a b : Fin 3, g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y a b
        = g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (e a)) (D (e b)) := by
      intro a b
      rw [hD]
      rfl
    have hw0 : (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) ≠ 0 := by
      intro h
      apply hv0
      funext a
      rw [← hcomp_e v a, h]
      rfl
    have hpos := g.posDef ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i))
      (fun h => hw0 (hinj _ h))
    have hG : ∀ a, ∑ b : Fin 3, g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (e a)) (D (e b)) * v b = 0 := by
      intro a
      have := congrFun hGv a
      simp only [Matrix.mulVec, dotProduct, Pi.zero_apply, hcD] at this
      exact this
    have hzero : g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i))
        (D (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i)) = 0 := by
      simp only [map_sum, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply,
        smul_eq_mul]
      calc _ = ∑ a : Fin 3, v a * ∑ b : Fin 3,
            g.g ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y) (D (e a)) (D (e b)) * v b := by
            simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]; ring
        _ = 0 := by simp [hG]
    rw [hzero] at hpos
    exact lt_irrefl _ hpos
  
  have hUo : IsOpen (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source ∩ V)) :=
    Φ.contMDiffOn_toFun.continuousOn.isOpen_inter_preimage Φ.open_source
      ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).open_source.inter hV)
  have hxU' : x ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source ∩ V) :=
    ⟨hx, mem_chart_source E3 (Φ x), hxV⟩
  have hUsub : Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source ∩ V) ⊆
      Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source := fun z hz => ⟨hz.1, hz.2.1⟩
  have hWo : IsOpen ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).target ∩ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm ⁻¹' V) :=
    (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).isOpen_inter_preimage_symm hV
  have hmapsW : ∀ z ∈ Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source ∩ V),
      chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z) ∈ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).target ∩ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm ⁻¹' V := by
    intro z hz
    refine ⟨(chartAt E3 (Φ x)).map_source hz.2.1, ?_⟩
    show (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)) ∈ V
    rw [(chartAt E3 (Φ x)).left_inv hz.2.1]
    exact hz.2.2
  have huW : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => f ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y))
      ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).target ∩ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm ⁻¹' V) := by
    have : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ (f ∘ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm)
        ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).target ∩ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm ⁻¹' V) :=
      hf.comp (contMDiffOn_chart_symm.mono Set.inter_subset_left) (fun y hy => hy.2)
    exact contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp this
  have hkey := key (fun w => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) (g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm)
    (fun y => f ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm y))
    (Φ.source ∩ Φ ⁻¹' ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).source ∩ V))
    ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).target ∩ (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm ⁻¹' V)
    hUo hWo (h2.2.mono hUsub) hmapsW
    (fun a b => (g.smooth (Φ x) a b).mono Set.inter_subset_left)
    (fun y a b => g.symm _ _ _) huW hxU'
    (s4 _ ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).map_source (mem_chart_source E3 (Φ x)))) (s3 x hxU)
  have heqG : g.coeff Φ =ᶠ[𝓝 x] (fun w => Matrix.of fun i j : Fin 3 => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv i (fun v => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ v) a) w *
        g.coeff (chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)) a b *
          partialDeriv j (fun v => chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ v) b) w) := by
    filter_upwards [h2.1.mem_nhds hxU] with z hz
    ext i j
    exact s1 z hz i j
  have hequ : (f ∘ Φ) =ᶠ[𝓝 x]
      (fun w => f ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ w)))) := by
    filter_upwards [h2.1.mem_nhds hxU] with z hz
    show f (Φ z) = f ((chartAt E3 (Φ x)).symm (chartAt E3 (Φ x) (Φ z)))
    rw [(chartAt E3 (Φ x)).left_inv hz.2]
  refine ⟨s3 x hxU, fun i j => ?_⟩
  exact (hessLoc_congr _ _ _ _ x heqG hequ i j).trans (hkey i j)

theorem coeff_chart_symm_posDef [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (p : M)
    (y : E3) (hy : y ∈ (chartAt E3 p).target) :
    (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm y).PosDef :=
by
  classical
  have hq : (chartAt E3 p).symm y ∈ (chartAt E3 p).source := (chartAt E3 p).map_target hy
  have hf : MDifferentiableAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p).symm y :=
    mdifferentiableAt_atlas_symm (chart_mem_atlas E3 p) hy
  have hg : MDifferentiableAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p) ((chartAt E3 p).symm y) :=
    mdifferentiableAt_atlas (chart_mem_atlas E3 p) hq
  have hcomp : mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ((chartAt E3 p) ∘ (chartAt E3 p).symm) y =
      (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p) ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)).comp
        (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p).symm y) := mfderiv_comp y hg hf
  have hid : mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ((chartAt E3 p) ∘ (chartAt E3 p).symm) y =
      mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) id y := by
    apply Filter.EventuallyEq.mfderiv_eq
    filter_upwards [(chartAt E3 p).eventually_right_inverse hy] with z hz
    exact hz
  rw [mfderiv_id] at hid
  have hinv : ∀ w : E3, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p) ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)
      (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p).symm y w) = w := by
    intro w
    have h1 := congrArg (fun L => L w) (hcomp.symm.trans hid)
    simpa using h1
  have hDinj : ∀ w : E3, mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p).symm y w = 0 → w = 0 := by
    intro w hw
    rw [← hinv w, hw, map_zero]
  apply Matrix.PosDef.of_dotProduct_mulVec_pos
  · apply Matrix.IsHermitian.ext
    intro i j
    simp only [RiemannianMetric3.coeff, coeffMatrix, star_trivial]
    exact g.symm _ _ _
  · intro x hx
    have hvx : (∑ i, x i • e i : E3) ≠ 0 := by
      intro h0
      apply hx
      funext j
      have h1 := congrArg (fun u : E3 => u j) h0
      fin_cases j <;> simpa [e, Fin.sum_univ_three, EuclideanSpace.single_apply] using h1
    have hDv := fun h => hvx (hDinj _ h)
    have hpos := g.posDef ((chartAt E3 p).symm y) _ hDv
    have key : star x ⬝ᵥ (g.coeff (chartAt E3 p).symm y).mulVec x =
        g.g ((chartAt E3 p).symm y)
          (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p).symm y (∑ i, x i • e i : E3))
          (mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (chartAt E3 p).symm y (∑ i, x i • e i : E3)) := by
      simp only [map_sum, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply,
        ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul, Fin.sum_univ_three, map_add,
        ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply, dotProduct, Matrix.mulVec, Pi.star_apply, star_trivial,
        RiemannianMetric3.coeff, coeffMatrix]
      ring
    rw [key]
    exact hpos

theorem lagrange_point_multiplier (F H : E3 → ℝ) (U : Set E3) (hU : IsOpen U) (z₀ : E3)
    (hz₀ : z₀ ∈ U) (hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F U) (hH : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ H U) (hF0 : F z₀ = 0)
    (hdF : fderiv ℝ F z₀ ≠ 0) (hmax : ∀ z ∈ U, F z = 0 → H z ≤ H z₀) :
    ∃ μ : ℝ, ∀ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k H z₀ = μ * partialDeriv k F z₀ :=
by
  have hUn : U ∈ 𝓝 z₀ := hU.mem_nhds hz₀
  have hinf : (∞ : WithTop ℕ∞) ≠ 0 := by simp
  have hFs : HasStrictFDerivAt F (fderiv ℝ F z₀) z₀ := (hF.contDiffAt hUn).hasStrictFDerivAt hinf
  have hHs : HasStrictFDerivAt H (fderiv ℝ H z₀) z₀ := (hH.contDiffAt hUn).hasStrictFDerivAt hinf
  have hext : IsLocalExtrOn H {x | F x = F z₀} z₀ := by
    have hmaxf : IsMaxFilter H (𝓝[{x | F x = F z₀}] z₀) z₀ := by
      show ∀ᶠ x in 𝓝[{x | F x = F z₀}] z₀, H x ≤ H z₀
      filter_upwards [mem_nhdsWithin_of_mem_nhds hUn, self_mem_nhdsWithin] with x hxU hxs
      exact hmax x hxU (hxs.trans hF0)
    exact hmaxf.isExtr
  obtain ⟨a, b, hab, hlin⟩ := hext.exists_multipliers_of_hasStrictFDerivAt_1d hFs hHs
  have hb : b ≠ 0 := by
    intro hb0
    subst hb0
    have ha : a ≠ 0 := by
      intro ha0
      subst ha0
      exact hab rfl
    rw [zero_smul, add_zero] at hlin
    rcases smul_eq_zero.mp hlin with h | h
    · exact ha h
    · exact hdF h
  refine ⟨-a / b, fun k => ?_⟩
  have hk := congrArg (fun L : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ => L (e k)) hlin
  simp only [ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul,
    ContinuousLinearMap.zero_apply] at hk
  show fderiv ℝ H z₀ (e k) = -a / b * fderiv ℝ F z₀ (e k)
  field_simp
  linarith

theorem constrained_second_order (F H : E3 → ℝ) (U : Set E3) (hU : IsOpen U) (z₀ : E3)
    (hz₀ : z₀ ∈ U) (hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F U) (hH : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ H U) (hF0 : F z₀ = 0)
    (hdF : fderiv ℝ F z₀ ≠ 0) (hmax : ∀ z ∈ U, F z = 0 → H z ≤ H z₀) (μ : ℝ)
    (hμ : ∀ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k H z₀ = μ * partialDeriv k F z₀) :
    ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∑ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k F z₀ * v k = 0 →
      ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j *
        (partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j H) z₀ - μ * partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j F) z₀) ≤ 0 :=
by
  intro v hv
  have hUz : U ∈ 𝓝 z₀ := hU.mem_nhds hz₀
  have hFd : ∀ y ∈ U, DifferentiableAt ℝ F y := fun y hy =>
    (hF.differentiableOn (by simp)).differentiableAt (hU.mem_nhds hy)
  have hHd : ∀ y ∈ U, DifferentiableAt ℝ H y := fun y hy =>
    (hH.differentiableOn (by simp)).differentiableAt (hU.mem_nhds hy)
  have hd2 : ∀ G : E3 → ℝ, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ G U → ∀ y ∈ U,
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fderiv ℝ G) y := by
    intro G hG y hy
    exact ((hG.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hy)).fderiv_right (m := 1) (by decide)).differentiableAt
      (by simp)
  have hcontB : ∀ G : E3 → ℝ, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ G U →
      ContinuousOn (fun y => fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ G) y) U := by
    intro G hG
    exact (hG.fderiv_of_isOpen hU (m := 1) (by decide)).continuousOn_fderiv_of_isOpen hU le_rfl
  
  obtain ⟨V, hVdef⟩ : ∃ V : E3, V = ∑ k : Fin 3, v k • e k := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨L, hLdef⟩ : ∃ L : E3 → ℝ, L = fun y => H y - μ * F y := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hLs : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ L U := by
    rw [hLdef]; exact hH.sub (contDiffOn_const.mul hF)
  have hLd1 : ∀ y ∈ U, DifferentiableAt ℝ L y := fun y hy =>
    (hLs.differentiableOn (by simp)).differentiableAt (hU.mem_nhds hy)
  have hLd2 := hd2 L hLs
  
  have key2 : ∀ G : E3 → ℝ, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ G U → ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j G) z₀ = fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ G) z₀ (e i) (e j) := by
    intro G hG i j
    have hc := hd2 G hG z₀ hz₀
    have h1 : partialDeriv j G = fun y => fderiv ℝ G y (e j) := rfl
    show fderiv ℝ (partialDeriv j G) z₀ (e i) = _
    rw [h1, fderiv_clm_apply hc (differentiableAt_const (e j))]
    simp
  have quad : ∀ Bm : E3 →L[ℝ] E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ,
      Bm V V = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * Bm (e i) (e j) := by
    intro Bm
    rw [hVdef]
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three, map_add, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply,
      ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
    ring
  have hVker : fderiv ℝ F z₀ V = 0 := by
    rw [hVdef, map_sum]
    simp only [map_smul, smul_eq_mul]
    rw [← hv]
    refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun k _ => ?_
    rw [mul_comm]
    rfl
  have hLder : ∀ y ∈ U, fderiv ℝ L y = fderiv ℝ H y - μ • fderiv ℝ F y := by
    intro y hy
    rw [hLdef]
    exact ((hHd y hy).hasFDerivAt.sub ((hFd y hy).hasFDerivAt.const_mul μ)).fderiv
  have hdL : fderiv ℝ L z₀ = 0 := by
    rw [hLder z₀ hz₀]
    refine ContinuousLinearMap.ext fun u => ?_
    have hu : u = ∑ d : Fin 3, u d • e d := by
      conv_lhs => rw [← (EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin 3) ℝ).sum_repr u]
      simp [EuclideanSpace.basisFun_apply]
    rw [hu]
    simp only [map_sum, map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.sub_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply,
      smul_eq_mul, ContinuousLinearMap.zero_apply]
    refine Finset.sum_congr rfl fun d _ => ?_
    have := hμ d
    simp only [partialDeriv] at this
    rw [this]
    ring
  have hL2 : fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) z₀ =
      fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ H) z₀ - μ • fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ F) z₀ := by
    have hev : fderiv ℝ L =ᶠ[𝓝 z₀] fun y => fderiv ℝ H y - μ • fderiv ℝ F y :=
      Filter.eventually_of_mem hUz (fun y hy => hLder y hy)
    rw [hev.fderiv_eq]
    exact ((hd2 H hH z₀ hz₀).hasFDerivAt.sub
      ((hd2 F hF z₀ hz₀).hasFDerivAt.const_smul μ)).fderiv
  have hQ : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j *
        (partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j H) z₀ - μ * partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j F) z₀) =
      fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) z₀ V V := by
    rw [hL2, quad]
    simp only [key2 H hH, key2 F hF, ContinuousLinearMap.sub_apply,
      ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
  
  have htan : ∀ ε : ℝ, 0 < ε → ∀ δ : ℝ, 0 < δ → ∃ t : ℝ, 0 < t ∧ t < δ ∧
      ∃ z ∈ U, F z = 0 ∧ ‖z - (z₀ + t • V)‖ ≤ ε * t := by
    intro ε hε δ hδ
    obtain ⟨u, hu⟩ : ∃ u, fderiv ℝ F z₀ u ≠ 0 := by
      by_contra hcon
      push_neg at hcon
      exact hdF (ContinuousLinearMap.ext hcon)
    obtain ⟨W, hW⟩ : ∃ W : E3, fderiv ℝ F z₀ W = 1 :=
      ⟨(fderiv ℝ F z₀ u)⁻¹ • u, by rw [map_smul, smul_eq_mul, inv_mul_cancel₀ hu]⟩
    obtain ⟨β, hβ⟩ : ∃ β : ℝ, β = ‖W‖ := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hβ0 : 0 ≤ β := hβ ▸ norm_nonneg _
    have hcW : ContinuousAt (fun y => fderiv ℝ F y W) z₀ :=
      ((hF.continuousOn_fderiv_of_isOpen hU (by simp)).continuousAt hUz).clm_apply
        continuousAt_const
    have hevW : ∀ᶠ y in 𝓝 z₀, y ∈ U ∧ (1 / 2 : ℝ) < fderiv ℝ F y W :=
      Filter.Eventually.and hUz
        (hcW.eventually (lt_mem_nhds (by show (1 / 2 : ℝ) < fderiv ℝ F z₀ W; rw [hW]; norm_num)))
    obtain ⟨ρ, hρ, hρp⟩ := Metric.eventually_nhds_iff.mp hevW
    have hgd : HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => F (z₀ + s • V)) 0 0 := by
      have h1 : HasFDerivAt F (fderiv ℝ F z₀) (z₀ + (0 : ℝ) • V) := by
        simpa using (hFd z₀ hz₀).hasFDerivAt
      have h2 : HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => z₀ + s • V) V 0 := by
        simpa using ((hasDerivAt_id' (0 : ℝ)).smul_const V).const_add z₀
      have h3 := h1.comp_hasDerivAt (0 : ℝ) h2
      rw [hVker] at h3
      exact h3
    obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ : ∃ c : ℝ, c = ε / (2 * (β + 1)) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hc0 : 0 < c := by rw [hc]; exact div_pos hε (by linarith)
    have hcε : c * (2 * (β + 1)) = ε := by
      rw [hc]; field_simp
    have hlo := (hasDerivAt_iff_isLittleO_nhds_zero.mp hgd).def hc0
    obtain ⟨σ, hσ⟩ : ∃ σ : ℝ, σ = ρ / (2 * (β + 1)) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hσ0 : 0 < σ := by rw [hσ]; exact div_pos hρ (by linarith)
    have hσβ : σ * (2 * (β + 1)) = ρ := by
      rw [hσ]; field_simp
    have hev2 : ∀ᶠ s in 𝓝 (0 : ℝ), s * ‖V‖ < ρ / 2 :=
      ContinuousAt.eventually_lt (f := fun s : ℝ => s * ‖V‖) (g := fun _ => ρ / 2)
        (by fun_prop) continuousAt_const (by show (0 : ℝ) * ‖V‖ < ρ / 2; rw [zero_mul]; linarith)
    have hev3 : ∀ᶠ s in 𝓝 (0 : ℝ), 2 * c * s < σ :=
      ContinuousAt.eventually_lt (f := fun s : ℝ => 2 * c * s) (g := fun _ => σ)
        (by fun_prop) continuousAt_const (by show 2 * c * 0 < σ; rw [mul_zero]; exact hσ0)
    have hev4 : ∀ᶠ s in 𝓝 (0 : ℝ), s < δ :=
      ContinuousAt.eventually_lt (f := fun s : ℝ => s) (g := fun _ => δ)
        continuousAt_id continuousAt_const hδ
    have hall : ∀ᶠ s in 𝓝[>] (0 : ℝ),
        (‖F (z₀ + (0 + s) • V) - F (z₀ + (0 : ℝ) • V) - s • (0 : ℝ)‖ ≤ c * ‖s‖ ∧
          s * ‖V‖ < ρ / 2 ∧ 2 * c * s < σ ∧ s < δ) ∧ 0 < s :=
      ((hlo.and (hev2.and (hev3.and hev4))).filter_mono nhdsWithin_le_nhds).and
        self_mem_nhdsWithin
    obtain ⟨t, ⟨hlt, h2, h3, h4⟩, ht⟩ := hall.exists
    simp only [zero_add, zero_smul, add_zero, hF0, sub_zero, smul_zero, Real.norm_eq_abs,
      abs_of_pos ht] at hlt
    obtain ⟨P, hP⟩ : ∃ P : E3, P = z₀ + t • V := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have ha : |F P| ≤ c * t := by rw [hP]; exact hlt
    have h2a : 2 * |F P| ≤ σ := by linarith
    have hball : ∀ s : ℝ, |s| ≤ σ → P + s • W ∈ U ∧ (1 / 2 : ℝ) < fderiv ℝ F (P + s • W) W := by
      intro s hs
      apply hρp
      rw [dist_eq_norm]
      have hsβ : |s| * β ≤ σ * β := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hs hβ0
      rw [mul_add, mul_one] at hσβ
      calc ‖P + s • W - z₀‖ = ‖t • V + s • W‖ := by rw [hP]; congr 1; abel
        _ ≤ ‖t • V‖ + ‖s • W‖ := norm_add_le _ _
        _ = t * ‖V‖ + |s| * β := by
          rw [norm_smul, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_pos ht, hβ]
        _ < ρ := by nlinarith
    have hq : ∀ s : ℝ, |s| ≤ σ →
        HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => F (P + s • W)) (fderiv ℝ F (P + s • W) W) s := by
      intro s hs
      have hl : HasDerivAt (fun s : ℝ => P + s • W) W s := by
        simpa using ((hasDerivAt_id' s).smul_const W).const_add P
      exact (hFd _ (hball s hs).1).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt s hl
    have hmvt : ∀ s₁ s₂ : ℝ, -σ ≤ s₁ → s₁ < s₂ → s₂ ≤ σ →
        (s₂ - s₁) / 2 ≤ F (P + s₂ • W) - F (P + s₁ • W) := by
      intro s₁ s₂ h1 h12 h2
      have hin : ∀ s ∈ Set.Icc s₁ s₂, |s| ≤ σ := fun s hs =>
        abs_le.mpr ⟨by linarith [hs.1], by linarith [hs.2]⟩
      obtain ⟨c', hc', hc'eq⟩ := exists_hasDerivAt_eq_slope (fun s : ℝ => F (P + s • W))
        (fun s => fderiv ℝ F (P + s • W) W) h12
        (fun s hs => (hq s (hin s hs)).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt)
        (fun s hs => hq s (hin s (Set.Ioo_subset_Icc_self hs)))
      have hpos := (hball c' (hin c' (Set.Ioo_subset_Icc_self hc'))).2
      dsimp only at hc'eq
      rw [hc'eq, lt_div_iff₀ (by linarith)] at hpos
      linarith
    have hroot : ∃ s : ℝ, |s| ≤ 2 * |F P| ∧ F (P + s • W) = 0 := by
      by_cases hz : F P = 0
      · exact ⟨0, by simp, by simpa using hz⟩
      · have ha0 : 0 < |F P| := abs_pos.mpr hz
        have hup := hmvt 0 (2 * |F P|) (by linarith) (by linarith) h2a
        have hdn := hmvt (-(2 * |F P|)) 0 (by linarith) (by linarith) (by linarith)
        simp only [zero_smul, add_zero] at hup hdn
        have hle := le_abs_self (F P)
        have hge := neg_abs_le (F P)
        have hmem : (0 : ℝ) ∈ Set.Icc ((fun s : ℝ => F (P + s • W)) (-(2 * |F P|)))
            ((fun s : ℝ => F (P + s • W)) (2 * |F P|)) := by
          show F (P + (-(2 * |F P|)) • W) ≤ 0 ∧ 0 ≤ F (P + (2 * |F P|) • W)
          constructor <;> linarith
        obtain ⟨s, hs, hs0⟩ := intermediate_value_Icc (f := fun s : ℝ => F (P + s • W))
          (show -(2 * |F P|) ≤ 2 * |F P| by linarith)
          (fun s hs => (hq s (abs_le.mpr ⟨by linarith [hs.1], by linarith [hs.2]⟩)).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt)
          hmem
        exact ⟨s, abs_le.mpr ⟨hs.1, hs.2⟩, hs0⟩
    obtain ⟨s, hs, hs0⟩ := hroot
    have hsσ : |s| ≤ σ := by linarith
    refine ⟨t, ht, h4, P + s • W, (hball s hsσ).1, hs0, ?_⟩
    rw [← hP, add_sub_cancel_left, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, ← hβ]
    have hε' : ε * t = 2 * c * t * β + 2 * c * t := by rw [← hcε]; ring
    have hct : 0 < c * t := mul_pos hc0 ht
    calc |s| * β ≤ (2 * |F P|) * β := mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right hs hβ0
      _ ≤ 2 * (c * t) * β := by nlinarith
      _ ≤ ε * t := by nlinarith
  
  rw [hQ]
  by_contra hneg
  have hpos : 0 < fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) z₀ V V := lt_of_not_ge hneg
  
  have hBc : ContinuousAt (fun y => fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) y) z₀ := (hcontB L hLs).continuousAt hUz
  have hΨ : ContinuousAt (fun p : E3 × E3 => fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) p.1 p.2 p.2) (z₀, V) := by
    have h1 : ContinuousAt (fun p : E3 × E3 => fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) p.1) (z₀, V) :=
      ContinuousAt.comp (x := (z₀, V)) (f := Prod.fst) hBc continuousAt_fst
    exact (h1.clm_apply continuousAt_snd).clm_apply continuousAt_snd
  have hev : ∀ᶠ p : E3 × E3 in 𝓝 (z₀, V), p.1 ∈ U ∧ 0 < fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) p.1 p.2 p.2 :=
    (continuousAt_fst.eventually_mem hUz).and (hΨ.eventually (lt_mem_nhds hpos))
  obtain ⟨η, hη, hηp⟩ := Metric.eventually_nhds_iff.mp hev
  have hηp' : ∀ y h : E3, ‖y - z₀‖ < η → ‖h - V‖ < η →
      y ∈ U ∧ 0 < fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) y h h := by
    intro y h hy hh
    have hd : dist (y, h) (z₀, V) < η := by
      rw [Prod.dist_eq, dist_eq_norm, dist_eq_norm]; exact max_lt hy hh
    exact hηp hd
  have hgrow : ∀ t : ℝ, 0 < t → t < η / (2 * (‖V‖ + η)) → ∀ z : E3,
      ‖z - (z₀ + t • V)‖ ≤ η / 2 * t → L z₀ < L z := by
    intro t ht htδ z hz
    obtain ⟨h, hhdef⟩ : ∃ h : E3, h = t⁻¹ • (z - z₀) := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hzh : z = z₀ + t • h := by
      rw [hhdef, smul_smul, mul_inv_cancel₀ ht.ne', one_smul]; abel
    have hhV : ‖h - V‖ ≤ η / 2 := by
      have e1 : h - V = t⁻¹ • (z - (z₀ + t • V)) := by
        simp only [hhdef, smul_sub, smul_add, smul_smul, inv_mul_cancel₀ ht.ne', one_smul]
        abel
      rw [e1, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_inv, abs_of_pos ht]
      calc t⁻¹ * ‖z - (z₀ + t • V)‖ ≤ t⁻¹ * (η / 2 * t) :=
            mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_left hz (inv_nonneg.mpr ht.le)
        _ = η / 2 := by field_simp
    have hhn : ‖h‖ ≤ ‖V‖ + η / 2 := by
      have := norm_sub_norm_le h V
      linarith
    have hpt : ∀ r ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) t,
        z₀ + r • h ∈ U ∧ 0 < fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) (z₀ + r • h) h h := by
      intro r hr
      apply hηp'
      · rw [add_sub_cancel_left, norm_smul, Real.norm_eq_abs, abs_of_nonneg hr.1]
        have h1 : t * (2 * (‖V‖ + η)) < η :=
          (lt_div_iff₀ (by positivity)).mp htδ
        have h2 : r * ‖h‖ ≤ t * (‖V‖ + η) :=
          mul_le_mul hr.2 (by linarith) (norm_nonneg _) ht.le
        nlinarith
      · linarith
    have hline : ∀ r : ℝ, HasDerivAt (fun r : ℝ => z₀ + r • h) h r := by
      intro r
      simpa using ((hasDerivAt_id' r).smul_const h).const_add z₀
    have hφ : ∀ r ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) t,
        HasDerivAt (fun r : ℝ => L (z₀ + r • h)) (fderiv ℝ L (z₀ + r • h) h) r := by
      intro r hr
      exact (hLd1 _ (hpt r hr).1).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt r (hline r)
    have hφ₁ : ∀ r ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) t,
        HasDerivAt (fun r : ℝ => fderiv ℝ L (z₀ + r • h) h)
          (fderiv ℝ (fderiv ℝ L) (z₀ + r • h) h h) r := by
      intro r hr
      have h1 := (hLd2 _ (hpt r hr).1).hasFDerivAt.comp_hasDerivAt r (hline r)
      have h2 := h1.clm_apply (hasDerivAt_const r h)
      simpa using h2
    have hmv : ∀ (f f' : ℝ → ℝ), (∀ r ∈ Set.Icc (0 : ℝ) t, HasDerivAt f (f' r) r) →
        ∀ b : ℝ, 0 < b → b ≤ t → ∃ c ∈ Set.Ioo 0 b, f' c = (f b - f 0) / (b - 0) := by
      intro f f' hf b hb hbt
      exact exists_hasDerivAt_eq_slope f f' hb
        (fun r hr => (hf r ⟨hr.1, hr.2.trans hbt⟩).continuousAt.continuousWithinAt)
        (fun r hr => hf r ⟨hr.1.le, hr.2.le.trans hbt⟩)
    obtain ⟨c, hc, hc'⟩ := hmv _ _ hφ t ht le_rfl
    obtain ⟨d, hd, hd'⟩ := hmv _ _ hφ₁ c hc.1 hc.2.le
    have hφ₂ := (hpt d ⟨hd.1.le, hd.2.le.trans hc.2.le⟩).2
    simp only [zero_smul, add_zero, sub_zero, hdL, ContinuousLinearMap.zero_apply] at hc' hd'
    rw [hd'] at hφ₂
    have h1' : 0 < fderiv ℝ L (z₀ + c • h) h := (div_pos_iff_of_pos_right hc.1).mp hφ₂
    rw [hc'] at h1'
    have h3 := (div_pos_iff_of_pos_right ht).mp h1'
    have hLz : L z = L (z₀ + t • h) := congrArg L hzh
    linarith
  obtain ⟨t, ht0, htδ, z, hzU, hFz, hzc⟩ :=
    htan (η / 2) (by positivity) (η / (2 * (‖V‖ + η))) (by positivity)
  have hlt := hgrow t ht0 htδ z hzc
  have hle := hmax z hzU hFz
  rw [hLdef] at hlt
  simp only [hF0, hFz, mul_zero, sub_zero] at hlt
  linarith

theorem levelset_trace_contradiction (Gm : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (hG : Gm.PosDef)
    (ξ : Fin 3 → ℝ) (hξ : ξ ≠ 0) (A B D : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (μ : ℝ)
    (hBAD : ∀ i j : Fin 3, B i j - μ * A i j = D i j)
    (hD : ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * v k = 0 →
      ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * D i j ≤ 0)
    (hB : ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, v ≠ 0 → 0 < ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * B i j)
    (hH : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * A i j) /
        Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j) -
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * ξ b) * A i j) /
        Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j) ^ 3 = 0) :
    False :=
by
  have hsym : ∀ i j : Fin 3, Gm j i = Gm i j := by
    intro i j
    have h := hG.isHermitian.apply i j
    simpa using h
  have hdet : IsUnit Gm.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hG.det_pos.ne'
  have hquad : ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, v ≠ 0 → 0 < ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * Gm i j * v j := by
    intro v hv
    have h := hG.dotProduct_mulVec_pos hv
    convert h using 1
    simp only [star_trivial, dotProduct, Matrix.mulVec, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  have hbsym : ∀ u v : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, u i * Gm i j * v j =
      ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * Gm i j * u j := by
    intro u v
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    rw [hsym 0 1, hsym 0 2, hsym 1 2]
    ring
  
  obtain ⟨n, hn⟩ : ∃ n : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∀ i, n i = ∑ a : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a :=
    ⟨fun i => ∑ a : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a, fun i => rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨s, hs⟩ : ∃ s : ℝ, (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j) = s :=
    ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have hspos : 0 < s := by
    rw [← hs]
    have h := hG.inv.dotProduct_mulVec_pos hξ
    convert h using 1
    simp only [star_trivial, dotProduct, Matrix.mulVec, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  have hGn : ∀ i : Fin 3, Gm i 0 * n 0 + Gm i 1 * n 1 + Gm i 2 * n 2 = ξ i := by
    intro i
    have h : Gm.mulVec (Gm⁻¹.mulVec ξ) = ξ := by
      rw [Matrix.mulVec_mulVec, Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv _ hdet, Matrix.one_mulVec]
    have h2 := congrFun h i
    simp only [Matrix.mulVec, dotProduct, Fin.sum_univ_three] at h2
    simp only [hn, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    linarith
  have hbn : ∀ u : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, u i * Gm i j * n j =
      ∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * u k := by
    intro u
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    linear_combination u 0 * hGn 0 + u 1 * hGn 1 + u 2 * hGn 2
  have hnb : ∀ u : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, n i * Gm i j * u j =
      ∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * u k := by
    intro u
    rw [hbsym, hbn]
  have hnn : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, n i * Gm i j * n j = s := by
    rw [hbn, ← hs]
    simp only [hn, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  
  obtain ⟨v1, hv1ne, hv1ξ⟩ : ∃ v1 : Fin 3 → ℝ, v1 ≠ 0 ∧ ∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * v1 k = 0 := by
    by_cases h0 : ξ 0 = 0
    · refine ⟨![1, 0, 0], ?_, ?_⟩
      · intro h
        have := congrFun h 0
        simp at this
      · simp [Fin.sum_univ_three, h0]
    · refine ⟨![-ξ 1, ξ 0, 0], ?_, ?_⟩
      · intro h
        have := congrFun h 1
        simp at this
        exact h0 this
      · simp [Fin.sum_univ_three]
        ring
  obtain ⟨w, hw⟩ : ∃ w : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∀ j, w j = ∑ i : Fin 3, v1 i * Gm i j :=
    ⟨fun j => ∑ i : Fin 3, v1 i * Gm i j, fun j => rfl⟩
  obtain ⟨v2, hv20, hv21, hv22⟩ : ∃ v2 : Fin 3 → ℝ, v2 0 = ξ 1 * w 2 - ξ 2 * w 1 ∧
      v2 1 = ξ 2 * w 0 - ξ 0 * w 2 ∧ v2 2 = ξ 0 * w 1 - ξ 1 * w 0 :=
    ⟨![ξ 1 * w 2 - ξ 2 * w 1, ξ 2 * w 0 - ξ 0 * w 2, ξ 0 * w 1 - ξ 1 * w 0], rfl, rfl, rfl⟩
  have hv2ξ : ∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * v2 k = 0 := by
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three, hv20, hv21, hv22]
    ring
  have hw' : ∀ j, w j = v1 0 * Gm 0 j + v1 1 * Gm 1 j + v1 2 * Gm 2 j := by
    intro j
    rw [hw, Fin.sum_univ_three]
  have hb12 : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v1 i * Gm i j * v2 j = 0 := by
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three, hv20, hv21, hv22, hw']
    ring
  have hb21 : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v2 i * Gm i j * v1 j = 0 := by
    rw [hbsym, hb12]
  obtain ⟨a1, ha1⟩ : ∃ a1 : ℝ, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v1 i * Gm i j * v1 j = a1 := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have ha1pos : 0 < a1 := by rw [← ha1]; exact hquad v1 hv1ne
  have hv2ne : v2 ≠ 0 := by
    intro h
    have c0 : v2 0 = 0 := by rw [h]; rfl
    have c1 : v2 1 = 0 := by rw [h]; rfl
    have c2 : v2 2 = 0 := by rw [h]; rfl
    have hvw : v1 0 * w 0 + v1 1 * w 1 + v1 2 * w 2 = a1 := by
      rw [← ha1, hw', hw', hw']
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    have hξ' : ∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * v1 k = 0 := hv1ξ
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three] at hξ'
    have e0 : ξ 0 * a1 = 0 := by
      rw [← hvw]
      linear_combination v1 1 * c2 - v1 2 * c1 + w 0 * hξ' - v1 1 * hv22 + v1 2 * hv21
    have e1 : ξ 1 * a1 = 0 := by
      rw [← hvw]
      linear_combination v1 2 * c0 - v1 0 * c2 + w 1 * hξ' - v1 2 * hv20 + v1 0 * hv22
    have e2 : ξ 2 * a1 = 0 := by
      rw [← hvw]
      linear_combination v1 0 * c1 - v1 1 * c0 + w 2 * hξ' - v1 0 * hv21 + v1 1 * hv20
    apply hξ
    funext k
    fin_cases k
    · exact (mul_eq_zero.mp e0).resolve_right ha1pos.ne'
    · exact (mul_eq_zero.mp e1).resolve_right ha1pos.ne'
    · exact (mul_eq_zero.mp e2).resolve_right ha1pos.ne'
  obtain ⟨a2, ha2⟩ : ∃ a2 : ℝ, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v2 i * Gm i j * v2 j = a2 := ⟨_, rfl⟩
  have ha2pos : 0 < a2 := by rw [← ha2]; exact hquad v2 hv2ne
  
  set vecs : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ := ![v1, v2, n] with hvecs
  set d : Fin 3 → ℝ := ![a1, a2, s] with hd
  set E : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ := Matrix.of fun i k => vecs k i with hE
  set F : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
    Matrix.of fun k j => (∑ i : Fin 3, vecs k i * Gm i j) / d k with hF
  set W : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
    Matrix.of fun i j => ∑ k : Fin 3, vecs k i * vecs k j / d k with hW
  have hFE_entry : ∀ k l : Fin 3, (F * E) k l =
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, vecs k i * Gm i j * vecs l j) / d k := by
    intro k l
    simp only [hF, hE, Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.of_apply, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  have hFE : F * E = 1 := by
    ext k l
    rw [hFE_entry]
    fin_cases k <;> fin_cases l <;>
      simp [hvecs, hd, ha1, ha2, hb12, hb21, hnn, hbn, hnb, hv1ξ, hv2ξ,
        ha1pos.ne', ha2pos.ne', hspos.ne']
  have hEF : E * F = 1 := mul_eq_one_comm.mp hFE
  have hWG : W * Gm = 1 := by
    rw [← hEF]
    ext i j
    simp only [hF, hE, hW, Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.of_apply, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  have hinv : Gm⁻¹ = W := Matrix.inv_eq_left_inv hWG
  have hframe : ∀ i j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j =
      v1 i * v1 j / a1 + v2 i * v2 j / a2 + n i * n j / s := by
    intro i j
    rw [hinv]
    simp [hW, hvecs, hd, Fin.sum_univ_three]
  
  have hY : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * ξ b) * A i j) =
      ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, n i * n j * A i j := by
    simp only [hn, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  have hX : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * A i j) =
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v1 i * v1 j * A i j) / a1 +
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v2 i * v2 j * A i j) / a2 +
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, n i * n j * A i j) / s := by
    simp only [hframe, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  rw [hY, hs, hX] at hH
  set Q1 := ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v1 i * v1 j * A i j with hQ1
  set Q2 := ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v2 i * v2 j * A i j with hQ2
  set Qn := ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, n i * n j * A i j with hQn
  have hr : 0 < Real.sqrt s := Real.sqrt_pos.mpr hspos
  have hr2 : Real.sqrt s ^ 2 = s := Real.sq_sqrt hspos.le
  have hsum : Q1 / a1 + Q2 / a2 = 0 := by
    have h1 : Q1 / a1 + Q2 / a2 = Real.sqrt s *
        ((Q1 / a1 + Q2 / a2 + Qn / s) / Real.sqrt s - Qn / Real.sqrt s ^ 3) := by
      set r := Real.sqrt s with hrdef
      clear_value r
      subst hr2
      have hrne : r ≠ 0 := hr.ne'
      field_simp
      ring
    rw [h1, hH, mul_zero]
  
  have hmuQ : ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, v ≠ 0 → ∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * v k = 0 →
      0 < μ * ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * A i j := by
    intro v hv hvξ
    have h1 := hD v hvξ
    have h2 := hB v hv
    have h3 : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * D i j =
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * B i j -
          μ * ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * A i j := by
      simp only [← hBAD, Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    linarith
  have hm1 := hmuQ v1 hv1ne hv1ξ
  have hm2 := hmuQ v2 hv2ne hv2ξ
  have hp1 : 0 < μ * Q1 / a1 := div_pos hm1 ha1pos
  have hp2 : 0 < μ * Q2 / a2 := div_pos hm2 ha2pos
  have hfin : μ * (Q1 / a1 + Q2 / a2) = μ * Q1 / a1 + μ * Q2 / a2 := by ring
  rw [hsum, mul_zero] at hfin
  linarith

theorem minimal_sets_avoid_far [T2Space M] [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M)
    (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) :
    ∃ r₀ : ℝ, 2 ≤ r₀ ∧ ∀ S : Set M, IsCompact S → IsMinimalSurfaceSet g S →
      ∀ (l : Fin hAF.numEnds) (y : E3), r₀ < ‖y‖ → (hAF.ends l).Φ y ∉ S :=
by
  
  have hu : ∀ u : E3, u = ∑ d : Fin 3, u d • e d := by
    intro u
    conv_lhs => rw [← (EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin 3) ℝ).sum_repr u]
    simp [EuclideanSpace.basisFun_apply]
  have quad_alg : ∀ (A : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (B : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (u : Fin 3 → ℝ),
      ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, u i * u j * (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * A b j * B a b) =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          (∑ i : Fin 3, A a i * u i) * (∑ j : Fin 3, A b j * u j) * B a b := by
    intro A B u
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  have hessLoc_congr : ∀ (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (u v : E3 → ℝ) (y : E3),
      u =ᶠ[𝓝 y] v → ∀ i j : Fin 3, hessLoc G u i j y = hessLoc G v i j y := by
    intro G u v y huv i j
    have h1 : ∀ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k u y = partialDeriv k v y := by
      intro k
      show fderiv ℝ u y (e k) = fderiv ℝ v y (e k)
      rw [huv.fderiv_eq]
    have h2 : partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j u) y = partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j v) y := by
      have hev : partialDeriv j u =ᶠ[𝓝 y] partialDeriv j v := by
        filter_upwards [huv.eventuallyEq_nhds] with z hz
        show fderiv ℝ u z (e j) = fderiv ℝ v z (e j)
        rw [hz.fderiv_eq]
      show fderiv ℝ (partialDeriv j u) y (e i) = fderiv ℝ (partialDeriv j v) y (e i)
      rw [hev.fderiv_eq]
    simp only [hessLoc, h1, h2]
  
  obtain ⟨r₀, hr₀2, hpos⟩ := far_hess_pos_end g hAF
  refine ⟨r₀, hr₀2, ?_⟩
  intro S hSc hSm l y₀ hy₀ hy₀S
  have hsrc : (hAF.ends l).Φ.source = {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := (hAF.ends l).source_eq
  have hposl := hpos l
  
  obtain ⟨y₁, hy₁₀, hy₁S, hy₁max⟩ :=
    far_max_point_exists g hAF l S hSc y₀ (by linarith) hy₀S
  have hy₁r : r₀ < ‖y₁‖ := lt_of_lt_of_le hy₀ hy₁₀
  set Φ := (hAF.ends l).Φ with hΦ
  have hlinv : ∀ y ∈ Φ.source, Φ.invFun (Φ y) = y := fun y hy => Φ.left_inv' hy
  have hrinv : ∀ q ∈ Φ.target, Φ (Φ.invFun q) = q := fun q hq => Φ.right_inv' hq
  have hmapt : ∀ q ∈ Φ.target, Φ.invFun q ∈ Φ.source := fun q hq => Φ.map_target' hq
  have hmaps : ∀ y ∈ Φ.source, Φ y ∈ Φ.target := fun y hy => Φ.map_source' hy
  have hy₁src : y₁ ∈ Φ.source := by
    rw [hsrc]
    show (1 : ℝ) < ‖y₁‖
    linarith
  have hpT : Φ y₁ ∈ Φ.target := hmaps y₁ hy₁src
  obtain ⟨V, f, hVO, hVo, hpV, hf, hdf, hVS, hHf, -, -⟩ :=
    hSm.2 (Φ y₁) hy₁S Φ.target (Φ.open_target.mem_nhds hpT)
  have hfp : f (Φ y₁) = 0 := by
    have h : Φ y₁ ∈ V ∩ S := ⟨hpV, hy₁S⟩
    rw [hVS] at h
    exact h.2
  
  set κ := chartAt E3 (Φ y₁) with hκ
  have hpκ : Φ y₁ ∈ κ.source := mem_chart_source E3 (Φ y₁)
  set z₀ := κ (Φ y₁) with hz₀def
  set U : Set E3 := κ.target ∩ κ.symm ⁻¹' V with hUdef
  have hUo : IsOpen U := κ.isOpen_inter_preimage_symm hVo
  have hz₀U : z₀ ∈ U := by
    refine ⟨κ.map_source hpκ, ?_⟩
    show κ.symm (κ (Φ y₁)) ∈ V
    rw [κ.left_inv hpκ]
    exact hpV
  set F : E3 → ℝ := fun z => f (κ.symm z) with hFdef
  set hM : M → ℝ := fun q => ‖Φ.invFun q‖ ^ 2 with hMdef
  set H : E3 → ℝ := fun z => hM (κ.symm z) with hHdef
  have hκsymm : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ κ.symm U :=
    contMDiffOn_chart_symm.mono Set.inter_subset_left
  have hFs : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F U :=
    contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp (hf.comp_contMDiffOn hκsymm)
  have hhM : ContMDiffOn 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ hM Φ.target :=
    (contDiff_norm_sq ℝ).contMDiff.comp_contMDiffOn Φ.contMDiffOn_invFun
  have hHs : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ H U :=
    contMDiffOn_iff_contDiffOn.mp (hhM.comp hκsymm (fun z hz => hVO hz.2))
  have hF0 : F z₀ = 0 := by
    show f (κ.symm (κ (Φ y₁))) = 0
    rw [κ.left_inv hpκ]
    exact hfp
  have hdF : fderiv ℝ F z₀ ≠ 0 := by
    have hmd : MDifferentiableAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f (Φ y₁) := hf.mdifferentiableAt (by simp)
    have heq : mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f (Φ y₁) = fderiv ℝ F z₀ := by
      rw [hmd.mfderiv]
      simp [writtenInExtChartAt]
      rfl
    rw [← heq]
    exact hdf _ hpV
  have hmax : ∀ z ∈ U, F z = 0 → H z ≤ H z₀ := by
    intro z hz hFz
    have hqV : κ.symm z ∈ V := hz.2
    have hqS : κ.symm z ∈ S := by
      have h : κ.symm z ∈ V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} := ⟨hqV, hFz⟩
      rw [← hVS] at h
      exact h.2
    have hqT : κ.symm z ∈ Φ.target := hVO hqV
    have hys := hmapt _ hqT
    have hy1 : 1 < ‖Φ.invFun (κ.symm z)‖ := by
      rw [hsrc] at hys
      exact hys
    have hle := hy₁max (Φ.invFun (κ.symm z)) hy1 (by rw [hrinv _ hqT]; exact hqS)
    have hHz₀ : H z₀ = ‖y₁‖ ^ 2 := by
      show ‖Φ.invFun (κ.symm (κ (Φ y₁)))‖ ^ 2 = ‖y₁‖ ^ 2
      rw [κ.left_inv hpκ, hlinv y₁ hy₁src]
    rw [hHz₀]
    show ‖Φ.invFun (κ.symm z)‖ ^ 2 ≤ ‖y₁‖ ^ 2
    exact pow_le_pow_left₀ (norm_nonneg _) hle 2
  
  obtain ⟨μ, hμ⟩ := lagrange_point_multiplier F H U hUo z₀ hz₀U hFs hHs hF0 hdF hmax
  have hD := constrained_second_order F H U hUo z₀ hz₀U hFs hHs hF0 hdF hmax μ hμ
  
  have hinv := hessLoc_chart_invariant g Φ hM Φ.target Φ.open_target hhM y₁ hy₁src hpT
  set A : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ :=
    Matrix.of fun a i : Fin 3 => partialDeriv i (fun w => κ (Φ w) a) y₁ with hAdef
  have hdetA : A.det ≠ 0 := hinv.1
  have hT : ∀ i j : Fin 3, hessLoc (g.coeff Φ) (hM ∘ Φ) i j y₁ =
      ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * A b j * hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) H a b z₀ := hinv.2
  have hcongr_end : ∀ i j : Fin 3, hessLoc (g.coeff Φ) (hM ∘ Φ) i j y₁ =
      hessLoc (g.coeff Φ) (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖ ^ 2) i j y₁ := by
    apply hessLoc_congr
    filter_upwards [Φ.open_source.mem_nhds hy₁src] with z hz
    show ‖Φ.invFun (Φ z)‖ ^ 2 = ‖z‖ ^ 2
    rw [hlinv z hz]
  have hBpos : ∀ w : Fin 3 → ℝ, w ≠ 0 →
      0 < ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, w a * w b * hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) H a b z₀ := by
    intro w hw
    have hAu : IsUnit A.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hdetA
    set u : Fin 3 → ℝ := Matrix.mulVec A⁻¹ w with hudef
    have hAw : Matrix.mulVec A u = w := by
      rw [hudef, Matrix.mulVec_mulVec, Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv A hAu, Matrix.one_mulVec]
    have hu0 : u ≠ 0 := by
      intro h
      apply hw
      rw [← hAw, h, Matrix.mulVec_zero]
    have hwa : ∀ a, w a = ∑ i : Fin 3, A a i * u i := by
      intro a
      rw [← hAw]
      rfl
    have h0 := hposl y₁ hy₁r u hu0
    calc (0 : ℝ) < _ := h0
      _ = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, u i * u j *
            (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * A b j * hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) H a b z₀) := by
          apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
          intro i _
          apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
          intro j _
          rw [← hT i j, hcongr_end i j]
      _ = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3, A a i * u i) *
            (∑ j : Fin 3, A b j * u j) * hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) H a b z₀ :=
          quad_alg A (fun a b => hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) H a b z₀) u
      _ = _ := by simp only [← hwa]
  
  have hH : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
        (g.coeff κ.symm z₀)⁻¹ i j * hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) F i j z₀) /
        Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (g.coeff κ.symm z₀)⁻¹ i j * partialDeriv i F z₀ * partialDeriv j F z₀) -
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        (g.coeff κ.symm z₀)⁻¹ i a * partialDeriv a F z₀ *
          ((g.coeff κ.symm z₀)⁻¹ j b * partialDeriv b F z₀) *
          hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) F i j z₀) /
        Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3,
          (g.coeff κ.symm z₀)⁻¹ i j * partialDeriv i F z₀ * partialDeriv j F z₀) ^ 3 = 0 :=
    hHf (Φ y₁) hpV hfp
  
  have hG : (g.coeff κ.symm z₀).PosDef :=
    coeff_chart_symm_posDef g (Φ y₁) z₀ (mem_chart_target E3 (Φ y₁))
  have hξ : (fun k : Fin 3 => partialDeriv k F z₀) ≠ 0 := by
    intro h
    apply hdF
    refine ContinuousLinearMap.ext fun v => ?_
    rw [ContinuousLinearMap.zero_apply, hu v, map_sum]
    refine Finset.sum_eq_zero fun d _ => ?_
    rw [map_smul, smul_eq_mul]
    have hd : partialDeriv d F z₀ = 0 := congrFun h d
    rw [show fderiv ℝ F z₀ (e d) = partialDeriv d F z₀ from rfl, hd, mul_zero]
  have hBAD : ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) H i j z₀ - μ * hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) F i j z₀ =
        partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j H) z₀ - μ * partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j F) z₀ := by
    intro i j
    simp only [hessLoc, hμ, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    ring
  exact levelset_trace_contradiction (g.coeff κ.symm z₀) hG (fun k => partialDeriv k F z₀) hξ
    (fun i j => hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) F i j z₀) (fun i j => hessLoc (g.coeff κ.symm) H i j z₀)
    (fun i j => partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j H) z₀ - μ * partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j F) z₀)
    μ hBAD hD hBpos hH

theorem frontier_minimal_of_minimal_cover [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M)
    (U Smin : Set M) (hU : IsOpen U) (hS : IsMinimalSurfaceSet g Smin)
    (hdisj : Disjoint Smin U) (hfr : frontier U ⊆ Smin) :
    IsMinimalSurfaceSet g (frontier U) :=
by
  refine ⟨isClosed_frontier, fun p hp O hO => ?_⟩
  obtain ⟨V, f, hVO, hVo, hpV, hf, hdf, hVS, hH, hP, hN⟩ := hS.2 p (hfr hp) O hO
  have hSm : ∀ x ∈ V, x ∈ Smin ↔ f x = 0 := by
    intro x hx
    constructor
    · intro h
      have h' : x ∈ V ∩ Smin := ⟨hx, h⟩
      rw [hVS] at h'
      exact h'.2
    · intro h
      have h' : x ∈ V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} := ⟨hx, h⟩
      rw [← hVS] at h'
      exact h'.2
  have hnotU : ∀ x ∈ Smin, x ∉ U := fun x hx hxU => Set.disjoint_left.1 hdisj hx hxU
  have hsplit : ∀ A : Set M, A ⊆ V → (∀ x ∈ A, f x ≠ 0) → IsPreconnected A →
      A ⊆ U ∨ A ⊆ (closure U)ᶜ := by
    intro A hAV hA0 hAc
    refine hAc.subset_or_subset hU isClosed_closure.isOpen_compl ?_ ?_
    · exact Disjoint.mono_left subset_closure disjoint_compl_right
    · intro x hx
      by_cases hxU : x ∈ U
      · exact Or.inl hxU
      · right
        intro hxc
        have hxf : x ∈ frontier U := by
          rw [hU.frontier_eq]
          exact ⟨hxc, hxU⟩
        exact hA0 x hx ((hSm x (hAV hx)).1 (hfr hxf))
  have hpos := hsplit (V ∩ {x | 0 < f x}) Set.inter_subset_left
    (fun x hx => ne_of_gt hx.2) hP
  have hneg := hsplit (V ∩ {x | f x < 0}) Set.inter_subset_left
    (fun x hx => ne_of_lt hx.2) hN
  have hone : V ∩ {x | 0 < f x} ⊆ U ∨ V ∩ {x | f x < 0} ⊆ U := by
    have hpcl : p ∈ closure U := frontier_subset_closure hp
    obtain ⟨x0, hx0V, hx0U⟩ : (V ∩ U).Nonempty := mem_closure_iff.1 hpcl V hVo hpV
    have hx0 : f x0 ≠ 0 := fun h0 => hnotU x0 ((hSm x0 hx0V).2 h0) hx0U
    rcases lt_or_gt_of_ne hx0 with h | h
    · right
      rcases hneg with hneg | hneg
      · exact hneg
      · exact absurd (subset_closure hx0U) (hneg ⟨hx0V, h⟩)
    · left
      rcases hpos with hpos | hpos
      · exact hpos
      · exact absurd (subset_closure hx0U) (hpos ⟨hx0V, h⟩)
  have hcrit : ∀ x ∈ V, IsLocalMax f x ∨ IsLocalMin f x → False := by
    intro x hx hext
    apply hdf x hx
    have hmd : MDifferentiableAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) f x := hf.mdifferentiable (by simp) x
    have hcont : ContinuousAt (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x).symm (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x x) :=
      continuousAt_extChartAt_symm x
    have hinv : (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x).symm (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x x) = x :=
      extChartAt_to_inv x
    have hT : Tendsto (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x).symm (𝓝 (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x x)) (𝓝 x) := by
      have := hcont.tendsto
      rwa [hinv] at this
    have hF : fderiv ℝ (f ∘ (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x).symm) (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x x) = 0 := by
      rcases hext with h | h
      · apply IsLocalMax.fderiv_eq_zero
        show ∀ᶠ y in 𝓝 (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x x), f ((extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x).symm y) ≤
          f ((extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x).symm (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x x))
        rw [hinv]
        exact hT.eventually h
      · apply IsLocalMin.fderiv_eq_zero
        show ∀ᶠ y in 𝓝 (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x x),
          f ((extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x).symm (extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x x)) ≤
            f ((extChartAt 𝓘(ℝ, E3) x).symm y)
        rw [hinv]
        exact hT.eventually h
    rw [hmd.mfderiv]
    simp only [writtenInExtChartAt, extChartAt_model_space_eq_id, PartialEquiv.refl_coe,
      Function.id_comp, modelWithCornersSelf_coe, Set.range_id, fderivWithin_univ]
    exact hF
  have hsides : ∀ x ∈ V, f x = 0 →
      x ∈ closure (V ∩ {x | 0 < f x}) ∧ x ∈ closure (V ∩ {x | f x < 0}) := by
    intro x hx hx0
    constructor
    · by_contra hc
      rw [mem_closure_iff_nhds] at hc
      push_neg at hc
      obtain ⟨t, ht, hts⟩ := hc
      refine hcrit x hx (Or.inl ?_)
      filter_upwards [ht, hVo.mem_nhds hx] with y hy hyV
      rw [hx0]
      by_contra hlt
      push_neg at hlt
      have hmem : y ∈ t ∩ (V ∩ {x | 0 < f x}) := ⟨hy, hyV, hlt⟩
      rw [hts] at hmem
      exact hmem
    · by_contra hc
      rw [mem_closure_iff_nhds] at hc
      push_neg at hc
      obtain ⟨t, ht, hts⟩ := hc
      refine hcrit x hx (Or.inr ?_)
      filter_upwards [ht, hVo.mem_nhds hx] with y hy hyV
      rw [hx0]
      by_contra hlt
      push_neg at hlt
      have hmem : y ∈ t ∩ (V ∩ {x | f x < 0}) := ⟨hy, hyV, hlt⟩
      rw [hts] at hmem
      exact hmem
  have heq : V ∩ frontier U = V ∩ f ⁻¹' {0} := by
    apply Set.Subset.antisymm
    · rintro x ⟨hxV, hxf⟩
      exact ⟨hxV, (hSm x hxV).1 (hfr hxf)⟩
    · rintro x ⟨hxV, hx0⟩
      have hx0' : f x = 0 := hx0
      refine ⟨hxV, ?_⟩
      rw [hU.frontier_eq]
      refine ⟨?_, hnotU x ((hSm x hxV).2 hx0')⟩
      obtain ⟨c1, c2⟩ := hsides x hxV hx0'
      rcases hone with h | h
      · exact closure_mono h c1
      · exact closure_mono h c2
  exact ⟨V, f, hVO, hVo, hpV, hf, hdf, heq, hH, hP, hN⟩

theorem trappedSet_eq_closure_iUnion [T2Space M] [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) :
    ∃ S : ℕ → Set M, (∀ n, IsCompact (S n) ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g (S n)) ∧
      trappedSet g = closure (⋃ n, S n) :=
by
  classical
  have hSC : SigmaCompactSpace M := by
    have hB : IsSigmaCompact {x : E3 | 2 ≤ ‖x‖} :=
      IsSigmaCompact.of_isClosed_subset isSigmaCompact_univ
        (isClosed_le continuous_const continuous_norm) (Set.subset_univ _)
    have hI : IsSigmaCompact (⋃ k, (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | 2 ≤ ‖x‖}) := by
      refine isSigmaCompact_iUnion _ (fun k => ?_)
      have hcont : ContinuousOn ((hAF.ends k).Φ : E3 → M) (hAF.ends k).Φ.source :=
        (hAF.ends k).Φ.contMDiffOn_toFun.continuousOn
      have hsub : {x : E3 | 2 ≤ ‖x‖} ⊆ (hAF.ends k).Φ.source := by
        intro y hy
        rw [(hAF.ends k).source_eq]
        show (1 : ℝ) < ‖y‖
        have : (2 : ℝ) ≤ ‖y‖ := hy
        linarith
      exact hB.image_of_continuousOn (hcont.mono hsub)
    have hK : IsSigmaCompact (⋃ k, (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖})ᶜ :=
      hAF.isCompact_core.isSigmaCompact
    have hU : IsSigmaCompact ((⋃ k, (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖})ᶜ ∪
        ⋃ k, (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | 2 ≤ ‖x‖}) := by
      rw [Set.union_eq_iUnion]
      refine isSigmaCompact_iUnion _ (fun b => ?_)
      cases b
      · simpa using hI
      · simpa using hK
    have huniv : ((⋃ k, (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖})ᶜ ∪
        ⋃ k, (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | 2 ≤ ‖x‖}) = Set.univ := by
      refine Set.eq_univ_of_forall (fun x => ?_)
      by_cases h : x ∈ ⋃ k, (hAF.ends k).Φ '' {x : E3 | 2 < ‖x‖}
      · right
        obtain ⟨k, y, hy, rfl⟩ := Set.mem_iUnion.1 h
        exact Set.mem_iUnion.2 ⟨k, y, (show (2 : ℝ) ≤ ‖y‖ from le_of_lt hy), rfl⟩
      · left
        exact h
    rw [huniv] at hU
    exact isSigmaCompact_univ_iff.mp hU
  haveI := hSC
  haveI : SecondCountableTopology M := ChartedSpace.secondCountable_of_sigmaCompact E3 M
  have h0 : (∅ : Set M) ∈ {S : Set M | IsCompact S ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g S} :=
    ⟨isCompact_empty, isClosed_empty, fun p hp => absurd hp (Set.notMem_empty p)⟩
  have hT : trappedSet g = closure (⋃₀ {S : Set M | IsCompact S ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g S}) :=
    rfl
  rw [hT]
  rcases Set.eq_empty_or_nonempty (⋃₀ {S : Set M | IsCompact S ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g S})
    with hA | hA
  · refine ⟨fun _ => ∅, fun _ => h0, ?_⟩
    rw [hA, Set.iUnion_empty]
  · haveI : Nonempty (⋃₀ {S : Set M | IsCompact S ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g S}) :=
      Set.nonempty_coe_sort.mpr hA
    let d := TopologicalSpace.denseSeq (⋃₀ {S : Set M | IsCompact S ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g S})
    choose S hSF hdS using fun n => Set.mem_sUnion.1 (d n).2
    refine ⟨S, hSF, ?_⟩
    apply Set.Subset.antisymm
    · refine closure_minimal ?_ isClosed_closure
      have h1 : ⋃₀ {S : Set M | IsCompact S ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g S} ⊆
          closure (Subtype.val '' Set.range d) :=
        Subtype.dense_iff.mp (TopologicalSpace.denseRange_denseSeq _)
      refine h1.trans (closure_mono ?_)
      rintro _ ⟨_, ⟨n, rfl⟩, rfl⟩
      exact Set.mem_iUnion.2 ⟨n, hdS n⟩
    · exact closure_mono (Set.iUnion_subset fun n => Set.subset_sUnion_of_mem (hSF n))

theorem frontier_subset_of_hull_limit [T2Space M] [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (x₀ : M) (S : ℕ → Set M)
    (hS : ∀ n, IsCompact (S n) ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g (S n))
    (hT : trappedSet g = closure (⋃ n, S n)) (Sig : ℕ → Set M) (Sinf : Set M) (ψ : ℕ → ℕ)
    (hψ : StrictMono ψ) (hSig : ∀ N, IsCompact (Sig N) ∧ IsMinimalSurfaceSet g (Sig N))
    (hfrN : ∀ N, frontier (connectedComponentIn
      ((⋃ n ∈ Finset.range (ψ N), S n) ∪ Sig N)ᶜ x₀) ⊆ Sig N)
    (hlim : ∀ q : M, q ∉ Sinf → ∃ O ∈ 𝓝 q, ∀ᶠ N in Filter.atTop, Disjoint O (Sig N)) :
    frontier (connectedComponentIn (trappedSet g)ᶜ x₀) ⊆ Sinf :=
by
  haveI : LocallyConnectedSpace M := ChartedSpace.locallyConnectedSpace E3 M
  intro q hq
  by_contra hqS
  have hqcl : q ∈ closure (connectedComponentIn (trappedSet g)ᶜ x₀) := hq.1
  have hqint : q ∉ interior (connectedComponentIn (trappedSet g)ᶜ x₀) := hq.2
  
  have hAcl : ∀ N, IsClosed ((⋃ n ∈ Finset.range (ψ N), S n) ∪ Sig N) := fun N =>
    (isClosed_biUnion_finset (fun n _ => (hS n).2.1)).union (hSig N).2.1
  have hWo : ∀ N, IsOpen (connectedComponentIn
      ((⋃ n ∈ Finset.range (ψ N), S n) ∪ Sig N)ᶜ x₀) := fun N =>
    (hAcl N).isOpen_compl.connectedComponentIn
  
  have hSnT : ∀ n, S n ⊆ trappedSet g := by
    intro n x hx
    rw [hT]
    exact subset_closure (Set.mem_iUnion.2 ⟨n, hx⟩)
  have hSigT : ∀ N, Sig N ⊆ trappedSet g := fun N x hx =>
    subset_closure (Set.mem_sUnion.2 ⟨Sig N, hSig N, hx⟩)
  have hAT : ∀ N, (⋃ n ∈ Finset.range (ψ N), S n) ∪ Sig N ⊆ trappedSet g := by
    intro N x hx
    rcases hx with hx | hx
    · obtain ⟨n, _, hxn⟩ := Set.mem_iUnion₂.1 hx
      exact hSnT n hxn
    · exact hSigT N hx
  have hCW : ∀ N, connectedComponentIn (trappedSet g)ᶜ x₀ ⊆
      connectedComponentIn ((⋃ n ∈ Finset.range (ψ N), S n) ∪ Sig N)ᶜ x₀ := fun N =>
    connectedComponentIn_mono x₀ (Set.compl_subset_compl.mpr (hAT N))
  
  obtain ⟨O, hO, hev⟩ := hlim q hqS
  obtain ⟨N₀, hN₀⟩ := Filter.eventually_atTop.mp hev
  have hqO : q ∈ interior O := mem_interior_iff_mem_nhds.mpr hO
  set B := connectedComponentIn (interior O) q with hBdef
  have hqB : q ∈ B := mem_connectedComponentIn hqO
  have hBo : IsOpen B := isOpen_interior.connectedComponentIn
  have hBpre : IsPreconnected B := isPreconnected_connectedComponentIn
  have hBO : B ⊆ O := (connectedComponentIn_subset _ _).trans interior_subset
  
  obtain ⟨y, hyB, hyC⟩ := mem_closure_iff.mp hqcl B hBo hqB
  
  have hBW : ∀ N, N₀ ≤ N → B ⊆ connectedComponentIn
      ((⋃ n ∈ Finset.range (ψ N), S n) ∪ Sig N)ᶜ x₀ := by
    intro N hN
    refine hBpre.subset_of_closure_inter_subset (hWo N) ⟨y, hyB, hCW N hyC⟩ ?_
    rintro x ⟨hxcl, hxB⟩
    by_contra hxW
    have hxfr : x ∈ frontier (connectedComponentIn
        ((⋃ n ∈ Finset.range (ψ N), S n) ∪ Sig N)ᶜ x₀) := by
      rw [(hWo N).frontier_eq]
      exact ⟨hxcl, hxW⟩
    exact Set.disjoint_left.mp (hN₀ N hN) (hBO hxB) (hfrN N hxfr)
  
  have hBS : Disjoint B (⋃ n, S n) := by
    rw [Set.disjoint_left]
    intro x hxB hxU
    obtain ⟨n, hxn⟩ := Set.mem_iUnion.1 hxU
    have hN : N₀ ≤ max N₀ (n + 1) := le_max_left _ _
    have hnN : n + 1 ≤ max N₀ (n + 1) := le_max_right _ _
    have hNψ : max N₀ (n + 1) ≤ ψ (max N₀ (n + 1)) := hψ.id_le _
    have hnr : n ∈ Finset.range (ψ (max N₀ (n + 1))) := Finset.mem_range.2 (by omega)
    have hxA : x ∈ (⋃ m ∈ Finset.range (ψ (max N₀ (n + 1))), S m) ∪ Sig (max N₀ (n + 1)) :=
      Or.inl (Set.mem_iUnion₂.2 ⟨n, hnr, hxn⟩)
    exact (connectedComponentIn_subset _ _ (hBW _ hN hxB)) hxA
  
  have hBT : B ⊆ (trappedSet g)ᶜ := by
    have h := hBS.closure_right hBo
    rw [← hT] at h
    exact Set.disjoint_left.mp h
  
  have hBC : B ⊆ connectedComponentIn (trappedSet g)ᶜ x₀ := by
    rw [connectedComponentIn_eq hyC]
    exact hBpre.subset_connectedComponentIn hyB hBT
  exact hqint (interior_maximal hBC hBo hqB)

theorem far_spheres_mean_convex [T2Space M] [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M]
    (g : RiemannianMetric3 M) (hAF : AsymptoticallyFlat g) :
    ∃ R : ℝ, 2 ≤ R ∧ ∀ (l : Fin hAF.numEnds) (y : E3), R ≤ ‖y‖ →
      0 < levelMeanCurvCoord (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) (fun z => ‖z‖) y :=
by
  
  have hN : ∀ z : E3, z ≠ 0 → ∃ N' : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ,
      HasFDerivAt (fun x : E3 => ‖x‖) N' z ∧ ∀ k : Fin 3, N' (e k) = z k / ‖z‖ := by
    intro z hz
    have hz' : ‖z‖ ≠ 0 := norm_ne_zero_iff.mpr hz
    have h1 := (hasStrictFDerivAt_norm_sq z).hasFDerivAt
    have h2 := h1.sqrt (pow_ne_zero 2 hz')
    have heq : (fun x : E3 => Real.sqrt (‖x‖ ^ 2)) = fun x => ‖x‖ :=
      funext fun x => Real.sqrt_sq (norm_nonneg x)
    rw [heq] at h2
    refine ⟨_, h2, fun k => ?_⟩
    rw [Real.sqrt_sq (norm_nonneg z)]
    simp [EuclideanSpace.inner_single_right]
    field_simp
  have hpd1 : ∀ z : E3, z ≠ 0 → ∀ k : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv k (fun x : E3 => ‖x‖) z = z k / ‖z‖ := by
    intro z hz k
    obtain ⟨N', hN', hN'e⟩ := hN z hz
    simp only [partialDeriv]
    rw [hN'.fderiv]
    exact hN'e k
  
  have hpd2 : ∀ y : E3, y ≠ 0 → ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j (fun x : E3 => ‖x‖)) y =
        (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) / ‖y‖ - y i * y j / ‖y‖ ^ 3 := by
    intro y hy i j
    have hy' : ‖y‖ ≠ 0 := norm_ne_zero_iff.mpr hy
    obtain ⟨N', hN', hN'e⟩ := hN y hy
    have hev : partialDeriv j (fun x : E3 => ‖x‖) =ᶠ[𝓝 y] fun z => z j * ‖z‖⁻¹ := by
      filter_upwards [eventually_ne_nhds hy] with z hz
      rw [hpd1 z hz j, div_eq_mul_inv]
    have hc : HasFDerivAt (fun z : E3 => z j) (EuclideanSpace.proj j : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) y :=
      (EuclideanSpace.proj j : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).hasFDerivAt
    have hd : HasFDerivAt (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖⁻¹) ((-(‖y‖ ^ 2)⁻¹) • N') y :=
      (hasDerivAt_inv hy').comp_hasFDerivAt y hN'
    have hm : HasFDerivAt (fun z : E3 => z j * ‖z‖⁻¹)
        (y j • ((-(‖y‖ ^ 2)⁻¹) • N') + ‖y‖⁻¹ • (EuclideanSpace.proj j : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ)) y :=
      hc.mul hd
    simp only [partialDeriv]
    rw [hev.fderiv_eq, hm.fderiv]
    simp only [ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
    rw [hN'e i]
    by_cases h : i = j
    · subst h
      simp
      field_simp
      try ring
    · simp [h, Ne.symm h]
      field_simp
      try ring
  
  have hsq1 : ∀ k : Fin 3, partialDeriv k (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖ ^ 2) = fun z => 2 * z k := by
    intro k
    funext z
    simp only [partialDeriv]
    rw [fderiv_norm_sq_apply]
    simp [EuclideanSpace.inner_single_right]
  have hsq2 : ∀ (i j : Fin 3) (y : E3),
      partialDeriv i (fun z : E3 => 2 * z j) y = 2 * (if i = j then (1 : ℝ) else 0) := by
    intro i j y
    simp only [partialDeriv]
    have hd : HasFDerivAt (fun z : E3 => 2 * z j)
        ((2 : ℝ) • (EuclideanSpace.proj j : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ)) y :=
      ((EuclideanSpace.proj j : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ).hasFDerivAt (x := y)).const_mul 2
    rw [hd.fderiv]
    by_cases h : i = j
    · subst h
      simp
    · simp [h, Ne.symm h]
  
  have hid : ∀ (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (y : E3), y ≠ 0 → ∀ i j : Fin 3,
      hessLoc G (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖ ^ 2) i j y - 2 * ‖y‖ * hessLoc G (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖) i j y
        = 2 * partialDeriv i (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖) y * partialDeriv j (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖) y := by
    intro G y hy i j
    have hy' : ‖y‖ ≠ 0 := norm_ne_zero_iff.mpr hy
    simp only [hessLoc, hsq1, hsq2, hpd2 y hy, hpd1 y hy, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    field_simp
    ring
  
  have hposdef : ∀ (Gm : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (β : E3 →L[ℝ] E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) (u : Fin 3 → E3),
      (∀ v w, β v w = β w v) → (∀ v, v ≠ 0 → 0 < β v v) →
      (∀ i j, Gm i j = β (u i) (u j)) → Gm.det ≠ 0 → Gm.PosDef := by
    intro Gm β u hsym hpos hGm hdet
    rw [Matrix.posDef_iff_dotProduct_mulVec]
    refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩
    · ext i j
      simp only [Matrix.conjTranspose_apply, star_trivial, hGm]
      exact hsym _ _
    · intro v hv
      have hq : star v ⬝ᵥ Gm.mulVec v = β (v 0 • u 0 + v 1 • u 1 + v 2 • u 2)
          (v 0 • u 0 + v 1 • u 1 + v 2 • u 2) := by
        simp only [star_trivial, dotProduct, Matrix.mulVec, hGm, Fin.sum_univ_three, map_add,
          map_smul, ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply, ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
        ring
      rw [hq]
      by_cases hw0 : v 0 • u 0 + v 1 • u 1 + v 2 • u 2 = 0
      · exfalso
        apply hdet
        rw [← Matrix.exists_mulVec_eq_zero_iff]
        refine ⟨v, hv, ?_⟩
        funext i
        have h0 : β (u i) (v 0 • u 0 + v 1 • u 1 + v 2 • u 2) = 0 := by
          rw [hw0]; exact map_zero _
        simp only [map_add, map_smul, smul_eq_mul] at h0
        simp only [Matrix.mulVec, dotProduct, hGm, Fin.sum_univ_three, Pi.zero_apply]
        linear_combination h0
      · exact hpos _ hw0
  
  have hq0 : 0 < hAF.q := lt_trans (by norm_num) hAF.q_gt
  have hendpd : ∀ l : Fin hAF.numEnds, ∃ r : ℝ, 2 ≤ r ∧ ∀ y : E3, r ≤ ‖y‖ →
      (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ y).PosDef := by
    intro l
    have hsmooth : ∀ i j : Fin 3,
        ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun x => g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ x i j) {x : E3 | 1 < ‖x‖} := by
      intro i j
      rw [← (hAF.ends l).source_eq]
      exact coeff_contDiffOn_source g (hAF.ends l).Φ i j
    obtain ⟨R, C, hR1, hC0, hb⟩ :=
      metric_coeff_bounds (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) hAF.q hq0 hsmooth (hAF.decay l)
    refine ⟨max 2 R + 1, by linarith [le_max_left 2 R], fun y hy => ?_⟩
    have hRy : R < ‖y‖ := by linarith [le_max_right 2 R]
    have hdet := (hb y hRy).1
    exact hposdef _ (g.g ((hAF.ends l).Φ y))
      (fun i => mfderiv 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) (hAF.ends l).Φ y (e i))
      (g.symm _) (g.posDef _) (fun i j => rfl) (ne_of_gt (by linarith))
  
  have hform : ∀ (Gm : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ), Gm.PosDef → ∀ (ξ : Fin 3 → ℝ), ξ ≠ 0 →
      ∀ (A B : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (μ : ℝ), 0 < μ →
      (∀ i j : Fin 3, B i j - μ * A i j = 2 * ξ i * ξ j) →
      (∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, v ≠ 0 → 0 < ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * B i j) →
      0 < (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * A i j) /
            Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j) -
          (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
            Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * ξ b) * A i j) /
            Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j) ^ 3 := by
    intro Gm hG ξ hξ A B μ hμ hBA hB
    have hsym : ∀ i j : Fin 3, Gm j i = Gm i j := by
      intro i j
      have h := hG.isHermitian.apply i j
      simpa using h
    have hdet : IsUnit Gm.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hG.det_pos.ne'
    obtain ⟨s, hs⟩ : ∃ s : ℝ, (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j) = s :=
      ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hspos : 0 < s := by
      rw [← hs]
      have h := hG.inv.dotProduct_mulVec_pos hξ
      convert h using 1
      simp only [star_trivial, dotProduct, Matrix.mulVec, Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    
    have hS1 : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * Gm i j = 3 := by
      have h := Matrix.nonsing_inv_mul Gm hdet
      have h00 := congrFun (congrFun h 0) 0
      have h11 := congrFun (congrFun h 1) 1
      have h22 := congrFun (congrFun h 2) 2
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_three, Matrix.one_apply_eq] at h00 h11 h22
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      linear_combination h00 + h11 + h22 - Gm⁻¹ 0 1 * hsym 0 1 - Gm⁻¹ 0 2 * hsym 0 2
        - Gm⁻¹ 1 0 * hsym 1 0 - Gm⁻¹ 1 2 * hsym 1 2 - Gm⁻¹ 2 0 * hsym 2 0
        - Gm⁻¹ 2 1 * hsym 2 1
    
    obtain ⟨n, hn⟩ : ∃ n : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∀ i, n i = ∑ a : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a :=
      ⟨fun i => ∑ a : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a, fun i => rfl⟩
    have hGn : ∀ i : Fin 3, Gm i 0 * n 0 + Gm i 1 * n 1 + Gm i 2 * n 2 = ξ i := by
      intro i
      have h : Gm.mulVec (Gm⁻¹.mulVec ξ) = ξ := by
        rw [Matrix.mulVec_mulVec, Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv _ hdet, Matrix.one_mulVec]
      have h2 := congrFun h i
      simp only [Matrix.mulVec, dotProduct, Fin.sum_univ_three] at h2
      simp only [hn, Fin.sum_univ_three]
      linarith
    have hS2 : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * ξ b) * Gm i j) = s := by
      rw [← hs]
      have e1 : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * ξ b) * Gm i j) =
          ∑ i : Fin 3, n i * (Gm i 0 * n 0 + Gm i 1 * n 1 + Gm i 2 * n 2) := by
        simp only [hn, Fin.sum_univ_three]
        ring
      rw [e1]
      simp only [hGn]
      simp only [hn, Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    obtain ⟨P1, hP1⟩ : ∃ P : ℝ, (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * A i j) = P := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    obtain ⟨P2, hP2⟩ : ∃ P : ℝ, (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * ξ b) * A i j) = P := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    rw [hP1, hP2, hs]
    obtain ⟨N, hNdef⟩ : ∃ N : ℝ, Real.sqrt s = N := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hN : 0 < N := hNdef ▸ Real.sqrt_pos.mpr hspos
    have hN0 : N ≠ 0 := hN.ne'
    have hN2 : N ^ 2 = s := hNdef ▸ Real.sq_sqrt hspos.le
    rw [hNdef]
    by_contra hcon
    push_neg at hcon
    obtain ⟨c, hc⟩ : ∃ c : ℝ, c = -(P1 / N - P2 / N ^ 3) * N / 2 := ⟨_, rfl⟩
    have hc0 : 0 ≤ c := by
      rw [hc]
      exact div_nonneg (mul_nonneg (neg_nonneg.mpr hcon) hN.le) (by norm_num)
    have hS1' : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * (A i j + c * Gm i j) = P1 + c * 3 := by
      rw [← hP1]
      have h := hS1
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three] at h ⊢
      linear_combination c * h
    have hS2' : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * ξ b) * (A i j + c * Gm i j)) = P2 + c * s := by
      rw [← hP2]
      have h := hS2
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three] at h ⊢
      linear_combination c * h
    have hH : (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * (A i j + c * Gm i j)) /
          Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j) -
        (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          Gm⁻¹ i a * ξ a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * ξ b) * (A i j + c * Gm i j)) /
          Real.sqrt (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * ξ i * ξ j) ^ 3 = 0 := by
      rw [hS1', hS2', hs, hNdef, ← hN2, hc]
      field_simp
      ring
    have hD : ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * v k = 0 →
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * (B i j - μ * (A i j + c * Gm i j)) ≤ 0 := by
      intro v hv
      have hQ : 0 ≤ ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * Gm i j := by
        by_cases hv0 : v = 0
        · subst hv0
          simp
        · have h := hG.dotProduct_mulVec_pos hv0
          have e2 : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * Gm i j = star v ⬝ᵥ Gm.mulVec v := by
            simp only [star_trivial, dotProduct, Matrix.mulVec, Fin.sum_univ_three]
            ring
          rw [e2]
          exact h.le
      have hB' : ∀ i j : Fin 3, B i j = 2 * ξ i * ξ j + μ * A i j := by
        intro i j
        linarith [hBA i j]
      have e1 : ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * (B i j - μ * (A i j + c * Gm i j)) =
          2 * (∑ k : Fin 3, ξ k * v k) ^ 2 - μ * c * ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, v i * v j * Gm i j := by
        simp only [hB', Fin.sum_univ_three]
        ring
      rw [e1, hv]
      have := mul_nonneg (mul_nonneg hμ.le hc0) hQ
      nlinarith
    exact levelset_trace_contradiction Gm hG ξ hξ (fun i j => A i j + c * Gm i j) B
      (fun i j => B i j - μ * (A i j + c * Gm i j)) μ (fun i j => rfl) hD hB hH
  
  obtain ⟨r₀, hr₀, hBpos⟩ := far_hess_pos_end g hAF
  choose rf hrf2 hrf using hendpd
  refine ⟨max (r₀ + 1) (2 + ∑ l, rf l), by linarith [le_max_left (r₀ + 1) (2 + ∑ l, rf l)], ?_⟩
  intro l y hy
  have hy1 : r₀ + 1 ≤ ‖y‖ := le_trans (le_max_left _ _) hy
  have hy2 : 2 + ∑ l, rf l ≤ ‖y‖ := le_trans (le_max_right _ _) hy
  have hle : rf l ≤ ∑ l', rf l' :=
    Finset.single_le_sum (fun l' _ => by linarith [hrf2 l']) (Finset.mem_univ l)
  have hsum0 : 0 ≤ ∑ l', rf l' := Finset.sum_nonneg fun l' _ => by linarith [hrf2 l']
  have hpd := hrf l y (by linarith)
  have hy0 : y ≠ 0 := by
    intro h
    rw [h, norm_zero] at hy1
    linarith
  have hy' : ‖y‖ ≠ 0 := norm_ne_zero_iff.mpr hy0
  have hξ : (fun k : Fin 3 => partialDeriv k (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖) y) ≠ 0 := by
    intro h
    apply hy0
    ext k
    have h1 := congrFun h k
    simp only [hpd1 y hy0, Pi.zero_apply] at h1
    rcases div_eq_zero_iff.mp h1 with h2 | h2
    · simpa using h2
    · exact absurd h2 hy'
  have key := hform (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ y) hpd
    (fun k => partialDeriv k (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖) y) hξ
    (fun i j => hessLoc (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖) i j y)
    (fun i j => hessLoc (g.coeff (hAF.ends l).Φ) (fun z : E3 => ‖z‖ ^ 2) i j y)
    (2 * ‖y‖) (by linarith) (fun i j => hid _ y hy0 i j) (hBpos l y (by linarith))
  exact key

theorem levelMeanCurv_eq_coord [IsManifold 𝓘(ℝ, E3) ∞ M] (g : RiemannianMetric3 M)
    (Φ : PartialDiffeomorph 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, E3) E3 M ∞) (f : M → ℝ) (h : E3 → ℝ)
    (hf : ContMDiff 𝓘(ℝ, E3) 𝓘(ℝ, ℝ) ∞ f) (x : E3) (hx : x ∈ Φ.source)
    (hfh : ∀ᶠ z in 𝓝 x, f (Φ z) = h z) :
    g.levelMeanCurv f (Φ x) = levelMeanCurvCoord (g.coeff Φ) h x :=
by
  
  have hu : ∀ u : E3, u = ∑ d : Fin 3, u d • e d := by
    intro u
    conv_lhs => rw [← (EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin 3) ℝ).sum_repr u]
    simp [EuclideanSpace.basisFun_apply]
  have hcomp_e : ∀ v : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∀ a : Fin 3, (∑ i : Fin 3, v i • e i) a = v a := by
    intro v a
    simp [Pi.single_apply]
  have hcompo : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z → ∀ l d : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z = (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)) d := by
    intro ψ z hψ l d
    have hfun : (fun v => ψ v d) = (EuclideanSpace.proj d : E3 →L[ℝ] ℝ) ∘ ψ := by
      funext v; simp
    rw [partialDeriv, hfun, fderiv_comp z (EuclideanSpace.proj d).differentiableAt hψ,
      ContinuousLinearMap.fderiv]
    simp
  have dmul : ∀ (f g : E3 → ℝ) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ f z → DifferentiableAt ℝ g z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => f w * g w) z := fun f g z hf hg => hf.mul hg
  have pd_mul : ∀ (f g : E3 → ℝ) (z : E3) (l : Fin 3), DifferentiableAt ℝ f z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ g z →
      partialDeriv l (fun w => f w * g w) z = partialDeriv l f z * g z + f z * partialDeriv l g z := by
    intro f g z l hf hg
    simp only [partialDeriv, fderiv_fun_mul hf hg, ContinuousLinearMap.add_apply,
      ContinuousLinearMap.smul_apply, smul_eq_mul]
    ring
  have pd_sum : ∀ (f : Fin 3 → E3 → ℝ) (z : E3) (l : Fin 3), (∀ a, DifferentiableAt ℝ (f a) z) →
      partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, f a w) z = ∑ a : Fin 3, partialDeriv l (f a) z := by
    intro f z l hf
    simp only [partialDeriv, fderiv_fun_sum (fun a _ => hf a), ContinuousLinearMap.sum_apply]
  have pd_comp : ∀ (F : E3 → ℝ) (ψ : E3 → E3) (z : E3), DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z →
      DifferentiableAt ℝ F (ψ z) → ∀ l : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun w => F (ψ w)) z
        = ∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d F (ψ z) * partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z := by
    intro F ψ z hψ hF l
    have h1 : partialDeriv l (fun w => F (ψ w)) z = fderiv ℝ F (ψ z) (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)) := by
      show fderiv ℝ (F ∘ ψ) z (e l) = _
      rw [fderiv_comp z hF hψ]
      rfl
    rw [h1, hu (fderiv ℝ ψ z (e l)), map_sum]
    simp only [map_smul, smul_eq_mul, hcompo ψ z hψ]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro d _
    rw [mul_comm]
    rfl
  have hpdU : ∀ (U : Set E3), IsOpen U → ∀ f : E3 → ℝ, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f U → ∀ i,
      ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (partialDeriv i f) U := by
    intro U hU f hf i
    have h1 : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => fderiv ℝ f y) U := hf.fderiv_of_isOpen hU (by simp)
    exact h1.clm_apply contDiffOn_const
  
  have pullback_partialDeriv : ∀ (ψ : E3 → E3) (G : E3 → Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (U V : Set E3),
      IsOpen U → IsOpen V → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ ψ U → (∀ z ∈ U, ψ z ∈ V) →
      (∀ a b : Fin 3, ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (fun y => G y a b) V) → ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ l i j : Fin 3,
      partialDeriv l (fun w => ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w * G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) z =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          (partialDeriv l (partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a)) z * G (ψ z) a b *
              partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z +
            partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z *
              (∑ d : Fin 3, partialDeriv d (fun y => G y a b) (ψ z) *
                partialDeriv l (fun v => ψ v d) z) * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) z +
            partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) z * G (ψ z) a b *
              partialDeriv l (partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b)) z) := by
    intro ψ G U V hU hV hψ hmaps hG z hz l i j
    have hψd : DifferentiableAt ℝ ψ z :=
      (hψ.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hJd : ∀ a k : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (partialDeriv k (fun v => ψ v a)) z := by
      intro a k
      exact ((hpdU U hU _ (contDiffOn_euclidean.mp hψ a) k).contDiffAt
        (hU.mem_nhds hz)).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hGd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun y => G y a b) (ψ z) := fun a b =>
      ((hG a b).contDiffAt (hV.mem_nhds (hmaps z hz))).differentiableAt (by simp)
    have hGψd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => G (ψ w) a b) z :=
      fun a b => (hGd a b).comp z hψd
    have htd : ∀ a b : Fin 3, DifferentiableAt ℝ (fun w => partialDeriv i (fun v => ψ v a) w *
        G (ψ w) a b * partialDeriv j (fun v => ψ v b) w) z :=
      fun a b => dmul _ _ _ (dmul _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b)) (hJd b j)
    rw [pd_sum _ _ _ (fun a => DifferentiableAt.fun_sum (fun b _ => htd a b))]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro a _
    rw [pd_sum _ _ _ (fun b => htd a b)]
    apply Finset.sum_congr rfl
    intro b _
    rw [pd_mul _ _ _ _ (dmul _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b)) (hJd b j),
      pd_mul _ _ _ _ (hJd a i) (hGψd a b), pd_comp (fun y => G y a b) ψ z hψd (hGd a b) l]
    ring
  
  have christoffel_pullback_algebra : ∀ (A G Gt : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
      (dG H dGt : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ),
      A.det ≠ 0 → G.det ≠ 0 → (∀ a b, G a b = G b a) → (∀ c i j, H c i j = H c j i) →
      (∀ i j, Gt i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * G a b * A b j) →
      (∀ l i j, dGt l i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
        (H a l i * G a b * A b j + A a i * (∑ d : Fin 3, dG d a b * A d l) * A b j
          + A a i * G a b * H b l j)) →
      ∀ c i j : Fin 3, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ k l *
          (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j)) =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c l *
          (dG a b l + dG b a l - dG l a b)) * A a i * A b j + H c i j := by
    intro A G Gt dG H dGt hA hG hGs hH hGt hdGt c i j
    have hAu : IsUnit A.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hA
    have hGu : IsUnit G.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hG
    have hGt' : Gt = Matrix.transpose A * G * A := by
      ext i j
      rw [hGt]
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply, Finset.sum_mul]
      rw [Finset.sum_comm]
    have hAB : A * A⁻¹ = 1 := Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv A hAu
    have hGiG : G⁻¹ * G = 1 := Matrix.nonsing_inv_mul G hGu
    have hGtinv : Gt⁻¹ = A⁻¹ * G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGt', Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.transpose_nonsing_inv]
      exact (mul_assoc _ _ _).symm
    have hα : A * Gt⁻¹ = G⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGtinv, ← Matrix.mul_assoc, ← Matrix.mul_assoc, hAB, Matrix.one_mul]
    have hα' : ∀ l, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Gt⁻¹ k l = ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * A⁻¹ l b := by
      intro l
      have h1 := congrFun (congrFun hα c) l
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply] at h1
      exact h1
    have hβ : ∀ l, dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j = ∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l *
        (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β)
          + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j) := by
      intro l
      rw [hdGt, hdGt, hdGt]
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three, hH _ j i, hH _ l i, hH _ l j]
      simp only [hGs 1 0, hGs 2 0, hGs 2 1]
      ring
    have eAB : ∀ γ b : Fin 3, A γ 0 * A⁻¹ 0 b + A γ 1 * A⁻¹ 1 b + A γ 2 * A⁻¹ 2 b
        = if γ = b then 1 else 0 := by
      intro γ b
      rw [← Matrix.one_apply, ← hAB, Matrix.mul_apply, Fin.sum_univ_three]
    have hcontr : ∀ (u W : Fin 3 → ℝ), ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, u b * A⁻¹ l b) *
        (∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l * W γ) = ∑ b : Fin 3, u b * W b := by
      intro u W
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      linear_combination
        (u 0 * W 0) * (eAB 0 0).trans (if_pos rfl)
        + (u 1 * W 0) * (eAB 0 1).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 2 * W 0) * (eAB 0 2).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 0 * W 1) * (eAB 1 0).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 1 * W 1) * (eAB 1 1).trans (if_pos rfl)
        + (u 2 * W 1) * (eAB 1 2).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 0 * W 2) * (eAB 2 0).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 1 * W 2) * (eAB 2 1).trans (if_neg (by decide))
        + (u 2 * W 2) * (eAB 2 2).trans (if_pos rfl)
    have hGG : ∑ a : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * G a b) * H a i j = H c i j := by
      have h2 : ∀ a, ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * G a b = (1 : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) c a := by
        intro a
        rw [← hGiG, Matrix.mul_apply]
        exact Finset.sum_congr rfl (fun b _ => by rw [hGs a b])
      simp only [h2, Matrix.one_apply, ite_mul, one_mul, zero_mul, Finset.sum_ite_eq,
        Finset.mem_univ, if_true]
    calc ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * ((1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ k l *
            (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j))
        = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Gt⁻¹ k l) *
            (dGt i j l + dGt j i l - dGt l i j) := by
          simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
          ring
      _ = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ l : Fin 3, (∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b * A⁻¹ l b) * (∑ γ : Fin 3, A γ l *
            (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β)
              + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j)) := by
          simp only [hα', hβ]
      _ = (1 / 2 : ℝ) * ∑ b : Fin 3, G⁻¹ c b *
            (∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3, A α i * A β j * (dG α β b + dG β α b - dG b α β)
              + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a b * H a i j) := by
          rw [hcontr (fun b => G⁻¹ c b) (fun γ => ∑ α : Fin 3, ∑ β : Fin 3,
            A α i * A β j * (dG α β γ + dG β α γ - dG γ α β) + 2 * ∑ a : Fin 3, G a γ * H a i j)]
      _ = _ := by
          rw [← hGG]
          simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
          ring
  
  have hbr_alg : ∀ (A : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ)
      (Γt Γ H : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ) (P : Fin 3 → ℝ) (Q : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ),
      (∀ c i j, ∑ k : Fin 3, A c k * Γt k i j =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, Γ c a b * A a i * A b j + H c i j) →
      ∀ i j, ((∑ d : Fin 3, (∑ e : Fin 3, Q e d * A e i) * A d j
          + ∑ d : Fin 3, P d * H d i j)
            - ∑ k : Fin 3, Γt k i j * (∑ d : Fin 3, P d * A d k)) =
        ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * A b j * (Q a b - ∑ k : Fin 3, Γ k a b * P k) := by
    intro A Γt Γ H P Q hT1 i j
    have h0 := hT1 0 i j
    have h1 := hT1 1 i j
    have h2 := hT1 2 i j
    simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three] at h0 h1 h2 ⊢
    linear_combination (-(P 0)) * h0 + (-(P 1)) * h1 + (-(P 2)) * h2
  
  have lmc_alg : ∀ (A Gm Gt : Matrix (Fin 3) (Fin 3) ℝ) (P Pt : Fin 3 → ℝ)
      (H Ht : Fin 3 → Fin 3 → ℝ), A.det ≠ 0 →
      (∀ i j, Gt i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * Gm a b * A b j) →
      (∀ i, Pt i = ∑ a : Fin 3, P a * A a i) →
      (∀ i j, Ht i j = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * A b j * H a b) →
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ i j * Pt i * Pt j =
          ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * P i * P j) ∧
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ i j * Ht i j =
          ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ i j * H i j) ∧
      (∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          Gt⁻¹ i a * Pt a * (Gt⁻¹ j b * Pt b) * Ht i j =
        ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
          Gm⁻¹ i a * P a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * P b) * H i j) := by
    intro A Gm Gt P Pt H Ht hA hGt hPt hHt
    have hAu : IsUnit A.det := isUnit_iff_ne_zero.mpr hA
    have hGt' : Gt = Matrix.transpose A * Gm * A := by
      ext i j
      rw [hGt]
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply, Finset.sum_mul]
      rw [Finset.sum_comm]
    have hAB : A * A⁻¹ = 1 := Matrix.mul_nonsing_inv A hAu
    have hGtinv : Gt⁻¹ = A⁻¹ * Gm⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGt', Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.mul_inv_rev, Matrix.transpose_nonsing_inv]
      exact (mul_assoc _ _ _).symm
    have hM : A * Gt⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A = Gm⁻¹ := by
      rw [hGtinv]
      calc A * (A⁻¹ * Gm⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A⁻¹) * Matrix.transpose A
          = (A * A⁻¹) * Gm⁻¹ * (Matrix.transpose A⁻¹ * Matrix.transpose A) := by
            simp only [Matrix.mul_assoc]
        _ = Gm⁻¹ := by
            rw [hAB, ← Matrix.transpose_mul, hAB, Matrix.transpose_one, Matrix.one_mul,
              Matrix.mul_one]
    have hM' : ∀ a b, ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, A a i * Gt⁻¹ i j * A b j = Gm⁻¹ a b := by
      intro a b
      rw [← hM]
      simp only [Matrix.mul_apply, Matrix.transpose_apply, Finset.sum_mul]
      rw [Finset.sum_comm]
    refine ⟨?_, ?_, ?_⟩
    · simp only [hPt, ← hM']
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    · simp only [hHt, ← hM']
      simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
      ring
    · obtain ⟨νt, hνt⟩ : ∃ νt : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∀ i, νt i = ∑ a : Fin 3, Gt⁻¹ i a * Pt a :=
        ⟨_, fun _ => rfl⟩
      obtain ⟨ν, hν⟩ : ∃ ν : Fin 3 → ℝ, ∀ d, ν d = ∑ a : Fin 3, Gm⁻¹ d a * P a :=
        ⟨_, fun _ => rfl⟩
      have K : ∀ d, ∑ i : Fin 3, A d i * νt i = ν d := by
        intro d
        simp only [hν, hνt, hPt, ← hM']
        simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
        ring
      calc ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
            Gt⁻¹ i a * Pt a * (Gt⁻¹ j b * Pt b) * Ht i j
          = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, νt i * νt j * Ht i j := by
            simp only [hνt, Fin.sum_univ_three]
            ring
        _ = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, νt i * νt j *
              (∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, A a i * A b j * H a b) := by
            simp only [hHt]
        _ = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
              (∑ i : Fin 3, A a i * νt i) * (∑ j : Fin 3, A b j * νt j) * H a b := by
            simp only [Fin.sum_univ_three]
            ring
        _ = ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3, ν a * ν b * H a b := by
            simp only [K]
        _ = ∑ i : Fin 3, ∑ j : Fin 3, ∑ a : Fin 3, ∑ b : Fin 3,
              Gm⁻¹ i a * P a * (Gm⁻¹ j b * P b) * H i j := by
            simp only [hν, Fin.sum_univ_three]
            ring
  
  have partialDeriv_comm : ∀ (f : E3 → ℝ) (U : Set E3), IsOpen U → ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ f U →
      ∀ z ∈ U, ∀ i j : Fin 3,
        partialDeriv i (partialDeriv j f) z = partialDeriv j (partialDeriv i f) z := by
    intro f U hU hf z hz i j
    have hfz : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ f z := hf.contDiffAt (hU.mem_nhds hz)
    have hsymm : IsSymmSndFDerivAt ℝ f z :=
      hfz.isSymmSndFDerivAt (by simpa using (WithTop.coe_le_coe.mpr le_top : (2 : WithTop ℕ∞) ≤ ∞))
    have hd : DifferentiableAt ℝ (fderiv ℝ f) z :=
